window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3401,"title":"Chapter 3401 - Trouble","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang did not care about the interspatial ring, but the bloodline of the divine ancestor was different.","The Heavenly Dao was divided into nine sects. Because there were many sects, there were not many of them. Especially at this time, the bloodline of the blood ancestor needed sufficient resources, what Jian Wushuang brought was the interspatial ring left by Xue Bei.","It was a lifetime collection of treasures by an expert of the five void realms. It was definitely a timely help to the blood ancestor bloodline.","Indeed, after Jian Wushuang took out the interspatial ring, Master Ancient Wheel immediately took it. When he saw that the seal left by Xue Bei was still intact, he was even more delighted. When he broke the seal on the interspatial ring...after checking the things left inside, the smile on Master Ancient","Wheel’s face completely appeared.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, I’ve troubled you this time. On behalf of the entire blood ancestor’s bloodline, I’m extremely grateful to you, Mr. Heavenly Marquis!” The Master Ancient Wheel said with some excitement.","“There’s no need to thank me.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “If you really want to thank me, Xue Bei has helped me a lot. If it weren’t for him, my growth wouldn’t have been so fast. As for bringing this interspatial ring to the blood ancestor’s bloodline, it’s just a piece of cake for me.”","“That’s true. But without you, I’m afraid that the blood ancestor’s bloodline would never have been able to get what Xue Bei left behind,” said Master Ancient Wheel.","“Let’s not talk about this.” Jian Wushuang changed the topic. “Master Ancient Wheel, apart from handing this interspatial ring to your blood ancestor’s bloodline, I also have a favor to ask.”","“Please feel free to tell me.” Master Ancient Wheel appeared to be quite enthusiastic.","“Well, I have a very important matter to ask for the help of spirit ancestor from the Heaven Ancestor Daoist Sect. But I heard that spirit ancestor is a reclusive person and it’s very difficult for me to see her, let alone ask for her help. If I ask for her help directly, I’m afraid she might not respond to me.","Therefore, I’d like to ask Master Ancient Wheel to take a trip for me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Mr, Heavenly Marquis, do you want the blood ancestor’s branch to invite spirit ancestor?” Master Ancient Wheel looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Master Ancient Wheel frowned, and the Principles Masters of the blood ancestor’s branch looked at each other in dismay. From their expressions, it was obvious that they were in a difficult position.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, since you know that spirit ancestor is a reclusive person who doesn’t care about worldly affairs, and she doesn’t have much contact with the blood ancestor’s branch, and she has never owed the blood ancestor’s branch anything, I’m afraid it’s difficult to ask her to do a favor for the","blood ancestor’s branch,” Master Ancient Wheel said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes.","“Of course, whether or not spirit ancestor does it for the sake of the blood ancestor’s bloodline, I’ll send a message to her personally to give it a try. But I can’t guarantee the result,” said Master Ancient Wheel.","“Thank you very much.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","He knew that even if the blood ancestor’s bloodline made an appearance, spirit ancestor might not necessarily do it for the sake of face. But in any case, it was better for the blood ancestor’s bloodline to make an appearance than for him to directly ask for an audience.","“Wait a moment, I’ll send a message to ask for you now,” Master Ancient Wheel began to send a message in the hall.","However, Master Ancient Wheel was not the blood ancestor after all, so he did not have a message token to contact spirit ancestor directly. He could only contact a maid who was with spirit ancestor.","“T’ve sent a message to the maid of spirit ancestor. She will report to spirit ancestor now, but we have to wait for a while,” Master Ancient Wheel said.","“It’s okay. I’ll wait here,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, it’s rare for you to come to the blood ancestor’s bloodline. Why don’t you have a seat?” Master Ancient Wheel said with a smile. “Someone, take a look at the tea!”","Soon, the tea was served. Jian Wushuang sat in the hall with the many Principles Masters of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. They would occasionally exchange a few words while drinking tea.","During this process, Jian Wushuang discovered one thing. The Principles Masters of the blood ancestor’s bloodline looked somewhat worried.","“Master Ancient Wheel, did something happen in the blood ancestor’s bloodline recently? Why do you all look worried?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Well...” Master Ancient Wheel hesitated for a moment and then said, “To tell you the truth, sir, the blood ancestor’s lineage has encountered a lot of trouble recently.”","“Oh? Tell me about it.” Jian Wushuang was interested.","“Sir, I think you know the internal structure of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. Although it’s one of the three Freedom Alliances, there are many factions in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. There are a total of nine factions, Although these factions have been competing with the outside world, they are","constantly competing with each other. Their goal is to get more resources so that they can become stronger!” Master Ancient Wheel began to explain.","“And among these nine factions, four of them have always been the strongest. My blood ancestor lineage is one of the four strongest factions. Not only do we have the blood ancestor standing at the very top, who has already reached the peak of the sixth level of the Void, but the Principles Masters under","us are also extremely powerful. Although there isn’t a second expert of the sixth level of the void, there are a total of three experts of the fifth level of the Voi","“Because the higher-ups are so powerful, our blood ancestor lineage has always been very powerful among the nine lineages. We have also occupied a lot of resources. However, an accident happened not long ago!”","“First, one of the three void five level experts, Xue Bei, died. This made our blood ancestor lineage a great fighting force. Not long after, when the other void five level expert of our blood ancestor lineage was adventuring in the universe battlefield, he encountered a sudden crisis and died in the universe","battlefield. This was equivalent to two of the three void five level experts of our blood ancestor lineage dying, leaving only me alive.”","He sighed, Master Ancient Wheel continued, “Even if these two died, as long as the blood ancestor is still alive, our blood ancestor bloodline is still very powerful. However, the blood ancestor has been wandering in the universe battlefield. Not long ago, he encountered some trouble while wandering in a","special dangerous land and was temporarily trapped there. He could not escape for a short period of time, so naturally, he could not come back from the universe battlefield...”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, and he suddenly understood.","The various sects in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect were fighting for resources. At this time, the blood ancestor bloodline, which was originally very powerful, had suddenly lost two experts of the fifth void realm. Even the blood ancestor, its pillar, was trapped in the universe battlefield, they could not","escape for the time being, At this time, the blood ancestor bloodline only had the support of Master Ancient Wheel.","And how could the other factions of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect give up this rare opportunity?"]},{"number":3402,"title":"Chapter 3402 - Spirit Ancestor","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Without two experts of the fifth level of the void, the blood ancestor is temporarily unable to return to the Divine Beginning Realm. With just me supporting him, the position of my blood ancestor’s lineage will naturally be shaken. The three great factions that were on equal footing with my blood","ancestor’s lineage also took the opportunity to make trouble. During this period of time, my blood ancestor’s lineage has been at a disadvantage in many battles against these three great factions.","“Up until now, many of the resources that we occupied were territories, and we have been forced to give up quite a few of them. However, this is not the end. During this period of time, the nether ancestor lineage of the four strongest factions has secretly schemed against the blood ancestor lineage. They","want to compete with the blood ancestor lineage for an extremely important territory. The blood ancestor lineage is currently thinking of how to deal with it,” Master Ancient Wheel said, from his words, Jian Wushuang could tell that he had no solution.","Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart.","Sure enough, there were all kinds of conflicts of interest in any major force, which could not be avoided. The root of all these interests was one’s own strength. Only when one’s strength was strong enough...could one earn more resources.","“Mr, Heavenly Marquis, it’s all thanks to you that Xue Bei’s interspatial ring has returned. The treasures in the interspatial ring are of great use to my blood ancestor’s bloodline now. It can be considered to have solved our urgent problem,” Master Ancient Wheel said.","“You’re too kind, Master Ancient Wheel.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but he began to ponder in his heart, “Senior Xue Bei was a great benefactor to me. Without the opportunity he gave me back then, I’m afraid I wouldn’t have been able to get to where I am today in such a short period of time. Back then,","senior Xue Bei said that if I saw that the blood ancestor’s bloodline was in trouble, I would help if I could...”","Jian Wushuang did not have much of a relationship with the blood ancestor’s bloodline, but Xue Bei had indeed helped him a lot back then. Moreover, he had obtained Xue Bei’s mantle. In fact, he could be considered Xue Bei’s successor, now that the blood ancestor’s bloodline was in trouble, Jian","‘Wushuang did not mind helping them if he could.","Of course, this was only if he could really help them.","After chatting for a while, Master Ancient Wheel suddenly smiled and said, “Mr. Heavenly Marquis, it seems that you’re quite a big man.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang looked at Master Ancient Wheel and asked, “Has spirit ancestor replied?”","“Yes, the maid of spirit ancestor has sent a message. She said that spirit ancestor is willing to see you and wants me to take you there now,” Master Ancient Wheel said.","“Then let’s not waste any time. I’ll ask Master Ancient Wheel to lead the way.” Jian Wushuang stood up with joy on his face.","He had known that spirit ancestor was cold and aloof and might not meet him. He had been worried because if spirit ancestor was unwilling to meet him, he would have to think of other ways, but now it seemed that he was lucky that spirit ancestor was willing to meet him.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, come with me.”","Ancient wheel master led Jian Wushuang to the place where spirit ancestor lived.","Spirit ancestor was cold and aloof. Although she was an ancestor of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect and a member of a big faction, she did not have any experts under her command, the place where she lived was not as grand as the blood ancestor’s. She only lived in a bamboo forest near the edge.","Deep in the bamboo forest, the river was very quiet. Except for spirit ancestor and her handmaidens, no one would come here normally.","But today, Master Ancient Wheel brought Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo to the outside of the bamboo forest.","As soon as they arrived, a green-robed woman came up to them.","“Miss Lu ‘er, I have brought the Heavenly Sword Marquis here,” Master Ancient Wheel introduced with a smile.","“You are Heavenly Sword Marquis?” The green-robed woman looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes, I am.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a humble expression.","He could see that although the green-robed woman was only a maid under spirit ancestor’s command, her cultivation had reached the level of Principles Master. Moreover, judging from the vague pressure coming from her body...the woman’s strength was at least at the fourth realm of the void, and it","was possible that she had reached the fifth realm.","“How dare a Principles Master with such great strength be willing to be a servant of spirit ancestor?” Jian Wushuang’s expression was rather strange.","“Master has instructed that Heavenly Sword Marquis is alone. The others can leave first, or wait outside the bamboo forest,” the green-robed woman said.","“Mr, Heavenly Marquis, there are still some things that we have to deal with in the blood ancestor lineage, so we’ll go back first,” Master Ancient Wheel said and left.","Naturally, Chenhuo stayed outside the bamboo forest to wait for Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was led by the green-robed woman into the bamboo forest and soon arrived at the center of the bamboo forest.","In the center of the bamboo forest, there was a clear and bottomless immortal lake. In the middle of the lake, there was a small island with a simple courtyard and a bamboo house. In front of the bamboo house, a black-robed woman was sitting there calmly, her eyes were staring at the lake in front of","her without blinking as if she had fallen into deep thought.","Even if Jian Wushuang and the green-clothed woman walked closer, the black-clothed woman did not react at all.","“Master, Heavenly Sword Marquis is here,” the green-clothed woman said softly.","Upon hearing this, the black-clothed woman slowly turned her head to look at Jian Wushuang.","Her delicate appearance was not absolutely beautiful, but it had a unique flavor. The black-clothed woman’s eyes were like a pool of stagnant water, without the slightest ripple.","“She is the spirit ancestor?” Jian Wushuang looked at the black-clothed woman in front of him. The moment his eyes met the black-clothed woman’s, Jian Wushuang felt a burst of astonishment in the depths of his soul, it was as if he had fallen into an extremely wonderful filling.","“The spirit ancestor’s attainments in the soul are extraordinary. Her every move can easily erode a person’s soul.” Jian Wushuang was secretly shocked.","If it were any other cultivator, even if they were stronger than Jian Wushuang, they would have to be careful when facing the spirit ancestor because the soul attack was silent and did not allow for the slightest reaction, if they were not careful, their souls might be destroyed or they would no longer","belong to them.","However, Jian Wushuang was different. Because of his different physique, the thing that Jian Wushuang was most afraid of was the soul attack.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, greetings to spirit ancestor.” Jian Wushuang bowed humbly.","“A saint dares to look directly into my eyes without any fear. You are quite capable,” the black-clothed woman said softly.","“You flatter me, spirit ancestor,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Tell me, why did you come to me?” Spirit ancestor had already averted her eyes from Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":3403,"title":"Chapter 3403 - Conditions","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“To tell you the truth, I have a favor to ask of you, spirit ancestor,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“Tell me.” Spirit ancestor did not refuse at once.","Jian Wushuang told her about his wife’s soul stripping.","Spirit ancestor raised her head slightly and asked, “Are you going to do the soul stripping for your wife?”","“Yes, but the soul stripping is not a trivial matter. If I’m not careful, my wife’s soul might be hurt. Therefore, I have to ask an expert like you, who has a higher attainment in soul manipulation, to do it personally,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You’re right. The soul stripping is not a trivial matter, especially since the person is your wife. You must be careful. If I do it personally, with the help of the old Valley Master of Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, I don’t dare to say that I won’t hurt your wife’s soul, but I’m at least 99% sure,” spirit","ancestor said.","“That’s why I came to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect and asked you to help me. Of course, if you have any conditions, just say the word,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Haha, just say the word? Young man, you sure talk big.” Spirit ancestor sneered, “I do have something that has troubled me for countless years, but can you do it?”","“spirit ancestor, you can tell me,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Thave an enemy who won’t stop until he’s dead. I’ve wanted to cut him into a thousand pieces for a long time, but I haven’t been able to do it. If you have the ability, can you kill him for me?” Spirit ancestor glanced at Jian Wushuang.","“An enemy?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","He knew very well that spirit ancestor was a very powerful expert of the six void realms who was good at the soul. He was also one of the highest-ranking people in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect and had the title of ‘Ancestor’. He was the enemy of such an expert, moreover, for so many years, spirit","ancestor had been unable to do anything to him. How could he be an ordinary character?","Although he knew that the other party’s identity and strength were definitely not ordinary, Jian Wushuang still asked, “But I wonder who the person spirit ancestor is talking about is?”","“His name is northern borer. As for his identity, you can ask someone from your Temporal Temple,” spirit ancestor said.","Jian Wushuang immediately sent a message to Temple Master Bai Xing, and he received an answer in just a moment.","“Northern borer...one of the four divine clans, the clan leader of the blood clan?” A trace of shock flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","Although he knew that his identity was extraordinary, he did not expect him to have such a great background.","In the Divine Beginning Realm, apart from the three Freedom Alliances, the four divine clans in the Third Heaven were the strongest among the overlords of the three Saint Realms!","Each of the four divine races was extremely ancient. It was said that they had existed since the birth of the Divine Realm.","Because they were a special race, each of the four divine races was very talented. Although they could not be compared to the special life forms, they were very rare in the Divine Realm, Jian Wushuang had only met two or three of them, but the four divine races were a huge race.","Among the four great divine clans, the nine-tailed clan was the one that Jian Wushuang had really interacted with. The Nine-tailed Clan had sent experts to kill him, and there were more than a dozen Principles Masters in the clan. From this, one could see how powerful the Nine-tailed Clan was.","However, according to what Jian Wushuang knew, the Nine-tailed Clan seemed to be at the bottom of the four great divine clans. It could even be said that they were the weakest clan. The ancient clan and the blood ancestor were the two strongest divine clans, their overall strength was much more","terrifying than that of the Nine-tailed Clan.","“Blood clan...in my previous life, the one who caused the huge waves in the 10,000 chaotic worlds was one of the blood emperors of the blood clan!” Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold.","From his previous life, he knew that the blood clan was very strong!","But now, the person whom spirit ancestor said he wanted to kill was actually the clan leader of the blood clan?","‘The clan leader was not something that a mere blood emperor could compare to. He was one of the pillars of the blood clan.","First of all, to be able to become the clan leader of the blood clan, that northern borer had to be at least a super expert of the six states of the Void. He had even reached the peak of the six states of the void. Just like the Chenhuo, he was not far from the limit.","Such a super expert, even if a Saint Realm Master personally made a move, he might not have absolute confidence in being able to kill him, right?","If he was alone, what more the powerful and powerful blood clan behind him?","“Why? Are you frightened by my name?” Spirit ancestor looked at Jian Wushuang mockingly.","“It’s not that I’m frightened, but as the clan leader of the blood clan, it’s not easy to kill northern borer unless a master of the Saint Realm or a master-level expert is involved,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Humph, if it were that easy to kill, I would have done it long ago. Why would I need you?” Spirit ancestor snorted, he continued, “In short, I’ve given you the conditions. As long as you kill the northern borer, I’m willing to follow you and be your slave, not to mention stripping your wife’s soul!","“I don’t care about any other conditions!”","Jian Wushuang’s frown deepened.","He could tell that spirit ancestor and the northern borer had a deep-seated hatred. Otherwise, spirit ancestor would not have so much killing intent toward him.","He even said that he was willing to be a slave.","Asa mighty spirit ancestor, an expert of the six void realms, he was willing to be a slave only to kill the northern borer. One could imagine how much hatred he had.","However, this condition was indeed too harsh in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“You can leave now. When you can kill the northern borer, you can come to me. Otherwise, you can find other experts in the six realms of void who are good at soul. At the very least, you can find some inferior experts. Experts in the five realms of void might be able to do soul peeling, but the risk is","slightly higher.” Spirit ancestor smiled faintly.","Jian Wushuang’s heart tightened.","Find another expert?","Although the Divine Beginning Realm was huge, there were only a few experts in the six void realms. Among them, there were only two experts who specialized in the soul. One was the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, and the other was spirit ancestor, the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan could not","help him. If spirit ancestor did not help him, how could he find a third expert?","As for spirit ancestor’s suggestion of finding a weaker expert of the fifth void realm who was good at soul, it was even more impossible!","Although it was possible, the risks involved were too great.","Even if a few experts of the fifth void realm who were good at soul helped him, there was only an 80% chance that his wife’s soul would not be damaged at all. Although it seemed to be a very good chance, what if it was a one-in-a-million chance?","After all, it was his wife who had to undergo the soul stripping, and not anyone else. Although there was only a 20% risk, Jian Wushuang did not dare to take it!"]},{"number":3404,"title":"Chapter 3404 - Scheming","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Understood, goodbye!”","Jian Wushuang bowed and left.","After Jian Wushuang left, the green-robed woman who had brought him into the bamboo forest spoke, “Master, as you guessed, Heavenly Sword Marquis must have come to ask you for help because of his soul.","“Hmph, Iam in this bamboo forest and do not care about worldly affairs. I have almost no contact with the outside world, and I have nothing to do with this Heavenly Sword Marquis. He came to me naturally because he has something to ask of me.”","“And with his status, if it was a normal matter, he could easily solve it. Even if it was a void six realm expert, he should be able to invite him. But since he came to me, it means that the problem he wants me to help solve is something that ordinary void six realm experts can’t solve. Then naturally, it can","only be a matter of the soul.” Spirit Ancestor sneered.","“What master said is extremely true. However, can the conditions set by master be achieved by the Heavenly Sword Marquis? No matter what, he is only a saint, right?” The green-robed woman said.","“It is true that he is a saint, but don’t forget that when he was on the Saha Island, he was only at the saint level when he single-handedly injured the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God. Of course, he used some special methods, but it still can explain a lot of problems,” Spirit Ancestor said calmly.","“Tve always been very accurate in judging people. This Heavenly Sword Marquis was able to make such a big name in the Divine Beginning Realm as a Saint, so he’s definitely not ordinary. His background, his talent, and his potential in the future are simply not what we can imagine. Especially just now,","when he faced me directly, he even dared to look directly into my eyes. During that time, I didn’t feel the slightest bit of fear from him!","“I know that I’m best at the soul, and I can silently annihilate a cultivator’s soul, but this Heavenly Sword Marquis doesn’t seem to be worried at all. It’s as if even if I secretly attack him, I won’t be able to cause him any harm. This confidence and boldness is something that even many powerful void fifth","stage experts don’t possess!”","“Other than that, there’s also the most important point...”","“Which point?” The green-robed woman looked over.","“I’s the three great Saint Realms. They really place too much importance on him.” A rare smile actually appeared on the Spirit Ancestor’s face. “The three great Saint Realms are such high and mighty existences. Yet, in order to kill a little fellow at the level of a saint, they actually went to such great","lengths. Even the three great Saint Masters and even the Sorcerer God made a move. How much importance do they place on him?","“To be able to make the three great Saint Realms disregard everything, it can only mean one thing. The three great Saint Realms sensed an incomparably great threat from this little fellow. This threat is something that no one can compare to. Even our Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect and the other two great","Freedom Alliances are far from being able to force the three great Saint Realms to make such a big move.”","“Even the three great Saint Realms are like this. That northem borer is only the blood clan’s grandmaster. In front of the three great Saint Realms, what is he?”","“Is that so?” The green-robed woman nodded heavily. She clearly understood in her heart.","“Northern borer... wish I could tear him into pieces. Unfortunately, his strength and identity are all there. If I wanted to kill him, it would be too difficult. I can’t ask a ruler-level expert to help. However, Heavenly Sword Marquis can be said to be my last chance!”","“I don’t hope that Sword Heavenly Marquis can rush to the blood clan and kill northern borer right now, but since he wants me to help him strip his wife’s soul, then for his wife’s sake, he will definitely work hard. As long as he has enough strength, he will definitely help.” Spirit Ancestor smiled faintly.","“But master, what if that Heavenly Sword Marquis invites another void sixth stage expert who specializes in the soul?” The green-robed woman asked with a frown.","“Haha, how can it be that easy?” Spirit Ancestor’s smile grew even wider. “To strip a cultivator of his soul without harming his soul in the slightest, to allow him to have the foundation to completely recover, the ability to control his soul is extremely high. The slightest carelessness will only result in the","annihilation of his soul. The person that Heavenly Sword Marquis wants to strip his soul is his wife. He absolutely does not dare to take the slightest risk. He must have absolute confidence before taking action!","“Although I don’t care about the affairs of the world, I have a deep understanding of the experts in the Divine Beginning Realm. In the Divine Beginning Realm, there are only two people who have absolute confidence in doing this. One of them is me, and the other is the grandmaster of the Nine-tailed","Clan. However, the Heavenly Sword Marquis has a grudge with the grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan for killing his daughter. The grandmaster can’t help him, so I’m the only one left!","“That is to say, apart from me, he can’t find anyone else who can help his wife complete the soul stripping without taking any risks!","“If he wants to hire me, he must first kill the northern borer!”","Hearing the words of Spirit Ancestor, the green-robed woman was also stunned.","She did not expect that her master, who usually did not care about the affairs of the world, was actually very good at scheming.","‘When Jian Wushuang came to visit the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect, her master had already planned everything.","Even Jian Wushuang had to find a way to fulfill her master’s conditions for his wife!","Outside the bamboo forest, Jian Wushuang walked out, but his expression was not very good.","“What’s wrong? Did the discussion with Spirit Ancestor not go well?” Demon Master Chenhuo came over to greet him.","“It’s not that it didn’t go well. Spirit Ancestor agreed to help, but her conditions were a little too harsh.” Jian Wushuang frowned and then briefly recounted his conversation with Spirit Ancestor.","“Kill the blood clan grandmaster?”","When he heard the conditions set by Spirit Ancestor, Demon Master Chenhuo could not help but be stunned, “This Spirit Ancestor is really daring. The blood clan patriarch’s strength is probably not inferior to mine. Moreover, he has the entire blood clan behind him. Even a Saint Realm Master would not","have absolute confidence in killing him.”","“That’s right, but that’s Spirit Ancestor’s only condition. It seems that there must be a great hatred between him and the clan leader of the blood clan. Let me ask Temple Master Bai Xing first.” Jian Wushuang immediately sent a message to Temple Master Bai Xing.","Soon, he received the result from Temple Master Bai Xing.","“No wonder Spirit Ancestor wanted to kill northern borer. It turns out that the clan leader of the blood clan once killed Spirit Ancestor’s Dao partner.” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","According to Temple Master Bai Xing, Spirit Ancestor once had a Dao partner and they were very loving. However, during an experiential learning together, they encountered the northern borer, who had not yet become the blood clan grandmaster at that time, in order to fight for the treasure, their","husband was killed by the northern borer.","Spirit Ancestor was almost mad because of this!"]},{"number":3405,"title":"Chapter 3405 - Hundred Battle Platform","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was reported that after the incident, the spirit ancestor had carried out a crazy revenge on the northern borer and even the blood clan, killing many of the blood clan’s experts. However, the northern borer had been living well, and in the end, the northern borer had become the blood clan’s grandmaster,","although the spirit ancestor’s strength had increased greatly at this time, and he had become the first ancestor in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect, he still could not kill the northern borer and avenge the husband.","Even after so many years, the hatred that spirit ancestor had for the northern borer had not weakened at all.","“Now we’re in trouble,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice. “According to Temple Master Bai Xing, among the experts in the six void realms known to the Temporal Temple, only the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan is good at souls. If even the Temporal Temple only knows about these two people, I’m","afraid that only these two people in the Divine Beginning Realm can satisfy my requirements.”","“The grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan can’t help me. Spirit ancestor can help me, but the conditions...”","Jian Wushuang also felt that this matter was very tricky.","If he wanted to ask spirit ancestor to help him, he had to kill the northern borer.","But the northem borer was obviously not easy to kill.","“There’s no need to rush. Senior Hemp Yi and I have already made an agreement. The soul stripping will definitely be carried out, but it will take some time. After all, I can’t kill the northern borer now. However, if I can’t kill it now, it doesn’t mean that I won’t have a chance in the future. As long as I","improve my strength or break through to become a rule master, then I can join hands with Chenhuo and design a plan to kill it.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","He could only wait until he was stronger. It was obviously impossible to kill the northern borer now.","“The blood clan...one of the four divine clans, the blood clan!”","“The lair of the blood clan is in the third heaven. It seems that I have to go to the third heaven as soon as possible after I understand the situation here,” Jian Wushuang thought.","The Third Heaven was not only the lair of the blood clan, but also the four divine clans and the three Saint Realms.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had many misgivings about that place and did not dare to enter it easily. But now, although he still had some misgivings, he was not as timid as before.","Moreover, his parents and relatives in this life were in the Third Heaven. Miss Xiao’er, whom he had encountered and formed an alliance with, was also in the Third Heaven. He had always been curious about the identity of Miss Xiao’er, naturally, he needed to know more about this matter.","“Chenhuo, let’s go,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Where are we going?” Demon Master Chenhuo asked.","“We’ll go to the blood ancestor’s bloodline first and greet them,” Jian Wushuang said, and the two flew directly toward the mountain range where the blood ancestor’s bloodline lived.","However, as soon as they arrived at the range of the mountain range, they saw a large number of people gathering in the void in front of them.","“There are so many people, and there are many rule masters. More than half of them are not from the blood ancestor’s bloodline. What’s going on?” Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at the void in front of him, there were obviously three groups of people.","One of them was naturally from the blood ancestor’s bloodline. With ancient wheel master as the leader, many Principles Masters had shown up.","The other group consisted of ten Principles Masters. Two of them were in the lead. Judging from the aura and power they emitted, they seemed to have reached the level of the fifth void realm.","The two groups stood in the center, above the blood ancestor’s residence, in the void. It was obvious that they were fighting each other.","The last group of people stood on both sides, talking and laughing, They were obviously neutral spectators.","Among these spectators, Jian Wushuang also saw the existence of Bai Jue.","“Mr. Bai Jue.” Jian Wushuang immediately sent a message to Bai Jue.","After a while, Bai Jue had arrived in front of Jian Wushuang.","“My young friend, you came out from the spirit ancestor?” Bai Jue still looked quite humble.","“I just came out. I wanted to say hello to the blood ancestor and leave, but I didn’t expect to see this scene. Mr. Bai Jue, what’s going on?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“What else could it be? It’s just two factions fighting for each other’s interests. Besides the blood ancestor’s faction, the other faction is from the nether ancestor’s faction. During this period, the blood ancestor’s faction and the nether ancestor’s faction have been fighting over a territory. Both sides know","their limits. But today, the nether ancestor’s faction actually came knocking on our door,” Bai Jue said.","“Knock on the door?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“I’s not a rare thing. There are many sects in the bloodline of the divine ancestor. There are often conflicts and fights among the major sects. It’s normal for them to fight each other, but as long as they know their limits and don’t make a big mess, it’s fine. It’s also common for one sect to block the door of","another, but the one being knocked on the door is, after all, the bloodline of the blood ancestor.” Bai Jue sighed.","“The bloodline of the blood ancestor is one of the four major sects of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. All along, he was the only one who fought at the gate of other sects. who dares to come to the residence of the bloodline of the blood ancestor?","“Unfortunately, the bloodline of the blood ancestor has lost several top experts in recent years. Even the blood ancestor is trapped in the universe battlefield and can’t come back for the time being. The bloodline of the blood ancestor is not as powerful as before. That’s why the bloodline of the nether","ancestor dares to do this.”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","He had heard about the trouble the blood ancestor’s bloodline had encountered recently. However, he did not expect the trouble to be so big that the other sects had directly attacked them.","Jian Wushuang was listening to Bai Jue’s narration. At this moment, the leader of the nether ancestor’s faction, an expert of the five realms of the void, let out a low roar, “Ancient Wheel, since you and I have different opinions and can’t come to a conclusion, there’s no need to continue arguing. Let’s go to","the hundred battle platforms!”","“Yes, let’s go to the hundred battle platforms!”","The experts of the nether ancestor faction also echoed.","But when they heard the words, “Hundred battle platforms!” The Principles Masters of the blood ancestor faction, including Master Ancient Wheel, had ugly expressions and fell silent for a moment.","“Mr. Bai Jue, what is this hundred battle arena?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The hundred battle arena is a battlefield in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect for experts to spar with each other. Under normal circumstances, if the factions in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect can’t come to a conclusion due to a verbal dispute, they will go to the hundred battle arena and rely on their","strength to solve the problem!”","“If the two factions go to the hundred battles platform, they will each choose three experts to fight in three matches. Two out of three wins, and the one that wins will naturally get the victory,” Bai Jue explained.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang understood."]},{"number":3406,"title":"Chapter 3406 - The Successor of the Xue Bei","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“No wonder the experts of the blood ancestor’s bloodline kept silent when they heard about the hundred battle arena,” Jian Wushuang said softly.","“There’s nothing we can do about it. In the past, the blood ancestor’s bloodline would never be afraid of fighting the ghost ancestor’s bloodline even if they went to the hundred battle arena. However, over the years,","the blood ancestor’s bloodline has lost a lot of its top-notch battle strength. Now, among the remaining experts of the blood ancestor’s bloodline, only the Master Ancient Wheel, who is in the fifth realm of the void, can","fight on the hundred battle arena. On the other hand, the ghost ancestor’s bloodline alone has two experts in the fifth realm of the void, and there are also experts at the peak of the fourth realm of the void. Not to","mention the ghost ancestor, who has reached the sixth realm!”","“It can be said that the blood ancestor’s bloodline has almost no chance of winning if they fight on the 100 battle platforms,” Bai Jue said.","“No chance of winning? That’s not necessarily true.” Jian Wushuang smiled and then rushed forward with Demon Master Chenhuo.","In the void, most of the experts of the nether ancestor’s bloodline sneered and spoke aggressively.","“What, Ancient Wheel doesn’t dare to go up to the hundred battle platforms?”","“Haha, as a member of the blood ancestor’s lineage, could it be that he doesn’t even have the courage to go up to the hundred battle platforms?”","“No matter how much you say, it’s useless. If you have the ability, go up to the hundred battle platforms and fight it out!”","Low shouts entered the ears of Master Ancient Wheel, and his body trembled slightly. He was also very angry.","However, no matter how angry he was, he did not dare to agree to a hundred battle platforms with the nether ancestor.","At this moment...","“Master Ancient Wheel, isn’t it just a hundred battle platforms? Just agree to them.” A hearty laughter rang out beside Master Ancient Wheel, and Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo appeared beside him.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis?” Master Ancient Wheel looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","The experts of the nether ancestor’s lineage naturally saw the appearance of Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo.","Among the two leading experts of the five void realms, one of them, a golden-haired burly man, who was more than two meters tall, swept his gaze over and said, “Who are you? I’m talking to Ancient Wheel. You don’t","have the right to interrupt. Get out!”","As the golden-haired burly man let out a low growl, the aura and pressure of an expert of the five void realms came directly toward Jian Wushuang.","The golden-haired man could tell at a glance that Jian Wushuang was just an Immortal Saint, so he did not take him seriously at all. Moreover, he was talking to Ancient Wheel now, even some weaker Principles","Masters were not qualified to speak, but Jian Wushuang came to interrupt him. Of course, he did not want to berate and oppress him directly.","However, he did not expect that the pressure of the fifth void realm pressed down on the Immortal Saint in front of him, but the latter still looked calm as if he was not affected at all.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang turned around and glanced at the blond man. “My name is Heavenly Sword Marquis, but who are you?”","Jian Wushuang said it casually. However, when he said his name, the Principles Masters of the nether ancestor’s bloodline and the surrounding cultivators who were watching were shocked, the entire void was in an","uproar.","“Xuan Master, you just came back from the void battleground. Maybe you don’t know that Heavenly Sword Marquis...” The other expert of the nether ancestor’s bloodline whispered something to the blond man.","The blond man was also shocked when he heard it. He looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","Jian Wushuang also learned the identity and name of the blond man from the Master Ancient Wheel.","“Xuan Master of the nether ancestor’s bloodline, right? You just said that I have no right to interrupt your conversation with the Master Ancient Wheel, and you want me to get lost?","“Haha, Your Xuan Master is really arrogant. Now that I’m still standing in front of you, do you dare to repeat what you just said?” Jian Wushuang still had a smile on his face, however, his cold gaze had already landed on","the blonde-haired, muscular Xuan Master, causing a chill to run down his spine.","Xuan Master already knew of Jian Wushuang’s fame in the Divine Beginning Realm and his incredible battle achievements. Therefore, even though Jian Wushuang was only an Immortal Saint, Xuan Master could not be","as fearless as before.","Xuan Master’s face darkened slightly when she heard Jian Wushuang’s words, then she said in a low voice, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, you have great talent and unlimited potential. Now that you’re an inspector of the","Temporal Temple, you’re naturally qualified to stand in front of me. However, today’s matter is between the bloodline of the nether ancestor and the bloodline of the blood ancestor. You can also say that it’s an internal","matter of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. It shouldn’t have anything to do with you, right?”","“Not necessarily.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “To tell you the truth, when I was just a Divine Master, I entered the secret realm of heaven and earth left by the Master of Xue Bei by chance and received Xue Bei’s legacy","there. Xue Bei is one of the top experts of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. Since I’m his successor, I’m more or less a member of the blood ancestor’s bloodline.”","“You are the descendant of the Xue Bei?” Xuan Master looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“What? You don’t believe me?","“Don’t you know that I came to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect to hand over the things left by Xue Bei to the blood ancestor’s bloodline? Many experts of the blood ancestor’s bloodline know this. Although the Master","of hundred talents is not an expert of the blood ancestor’s bloodline, he was there to testify,” Jian Wushuang said.","Hearing this, the master of hundred talents stepped forward and said with a smile, “Xuan Master, the Heavenly Sword Marquis is right. He did return the things left by Master Xue Bei. I saw it clearly.”","“If you don’t believe the testimony of the Master of hundred talents, it’s easy for me to prove it. Xuan Master, look at this.” With a thought, a figure suddenly appeared beside Jian Wushuang.","Although this figure looked slightly different from Jian Wushuang, the divine power aura it emitted was exactly the same.","“This is...the emperor’s life avatar?”","The experts of the nether ancestor’s bloodline immediately recognized this figure.","The emperor’s life avatar was one of the unique secret skills of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. It was very impressive. Even among the Principles Masters of the blood ancestor’s bloodline, very few were qualified to","cultivate it. However, Master Xue Bei, who had an extremely high position in the blood ancestor’s bloodline...naturally, he had cultivated it.","Since Jian Wushuang had cultivated the emperor’s order doppelganger, there was no doubt that he had inherited the mantle of the Xue Bei.","The Xuan Master had nothing to say.","Since he was the successor of Master Xue Bei, Jian Wushuang could be considered as a member of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. Therefore, he had the right to speak up and even stand up for the blood ancestor’s","bloodline.","“Master Ancient Wheel, didn’t the Xuan Master just ask for more than 100 battle platforms? Then let’s go. I want to see how powerful the bloodline of the nether ancestor is.” Jian Wushuang said with a smile."]},{"number":3407,"title":"Chapter 3407 - Opponents","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Master Ancient Wheel still had some misgivings, but he still nodded and said, “Okay, let’s fight in the hundred-battle arena!”","“Haha, in that case, at this time tomorrow, the nether ancestor’s bloodline will be waiting on the hundred-battle arena for the arrival of the blood ancestor’s bloodline.” Xuan Master laughed loudly, then, he turned","around and left with the experts of the nether ancestor’s bloodline.","As soon as the experts of the nether ancestor’s bloodline left, the onlookers around them naturally dispersed. However, when they left, most of them glanced at Jian Wushuang with strange expressions.","They had known that Jian Wushuang was a member of the Temporal Temple and had a certain relationship with the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. They had not expected that Heavenly Sword Marquis was also involved in","the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect.","They were also looking forward to the clash between the blood ancestor and the nether ancestor on the hundred-battle arena tomorrow.","In the Grand Hall of the blood ancestor’s lineage, Master Ancient Wheel sat at the head of the table while Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo sat at the side.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, on behalf of the entire blood ancestor’s lineage, | thank you for today’s matter.” Master Ancient Wheel stood up and thanked him.","“You’re welcome, Master Ancient Wheel. As I said before, I am the successor of Master Xue Bei, so I can be considered as a member of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. Now that the blood ancestor’s bloodline is in","trouble, I should naturally do my part,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile, “But I wonder if Master Ancient Wheel has any plans for tomorrow’s battle on the hundred battle arena?”","“Well...” Master Ancient Wheel glanced at the Principles Masters of the blood ancestor’s bloodline beside him and could not help but sigh, “Mr. Heavenly Marquis, as you know, the blood ancestor’s bloodline has lost","two experts of the five void realms over the years, and the blood ancestor is trapped in the universe battlefield. He can’t be compared to the ghost ancestor’s bloodline in terms of top experts. I’m afraid the blood","ancestor’s bloodline won’t be able to win the hundred-battle arena tomorrow.”","“The battle hasn’t started yet. Master Ancient Wheel is too pessimistic.” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Master Ancient Wheel, let me ask you first. If you fight personally, can you win one of the three battles?”","“This...” Master Ancient Wheel pondered for a moment, then he said in a low voice, “The nether ancestor is much stronger than the blood ancestor in terms of top experts. Not to mention the nether ancestor behind","them, just the two experts of the five void realms who are here today are not easy to deal with.”","“First is Xuan Master. Although he is slightly weaker than Master Xue Bei, he is not much weaker. Moreover, he has been wandering in the universe battlefield for the past few years. He just came back recently and may","have made some progress in his strength. I’m not sure if I can defeat him.”","“What about the other one?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“The other expert is Master Flame Mountain. He rarely goes to the universe battlefield and has been staying in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. He has come into contact with me many times. I know his strength very","well. I have fought with him before. Although he is strong, I have a 70% chance of winning against him!” Master Ancient Wheel said confidently.","Although he was also an expert of the fifth void realm, he was not confident in fighting Xuan Master. However, he was confident in fighting Master Flame Mountain.","“That’s enough.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Master Ancient Wheel, your opponent will be Master Flame Mountain in the three battles tomorrow. All you have to do is to defeat him in the battles.”","“But there are three battles in the hundred battle arena. Even if I can win one, the blood ancestor’s bloodline has no chance of winning the remaining 20% .” Master Ancient Wheel frowned and said.","“Not necessarily.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, what do you mean?” Master Ancient Wheel was puzzled.","“You don’t need to know about Master Ancient Wheel for now. Anyway, as long as you win Master Flame Mountain tomorrow, leave the remaining two battles to me. I have a way to let the blood ancestor’s bloodline","win,” Jian Wushuang said confidently.","Master Ancient Wheel and the Principles Masters of the blood ancestor’s bloodline looked at each other in dismay. They did not understand what Jian Wushuang was up to, but in their current situation, they had no","choice but to trust Jian Wushuang, there was nothing else they could do, so they could only nod in agreement.","Master Ancient Wheel and the other Principles Masters knew, but Demon Master Chenhuo knew very well.","Therefore, after Jian Wushuang finished speaking, Demon Master Chenhuo secretly sent a message to him, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, do you want me to defeat Xuan Master in the hundred-battle arena tomorrow?”","Demon Master Chenhuo said it casually.","It was true that Xuan Master might be very strong, but he was nothing in front of him.","If he attacked, he could easily defeat Xuan Master.","“No, that’s not my real plan.” Jian Wushuang smiled mysteriously.","“What do you mean? Are you going to fight Xuan Master yourself?” Demon Master Chenhuo looked at him.","“Yes, that’s what I think.” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “In the Samsara Heaven Realm, | got a lot of opportunities and my strength improved greatly. Now, I won’t have any problem fighting an expert of the fifth void","realm. Even if Xuan Master is strong among the five void realms, I’m confident that I can fight him. As for the outcome, it’s hard to say.”","“Since the outcome is hard to predict, why don’t I just defeat him? Wouldn’t it be much easier?” Demon Master Chenhuo rolled his eyes at Jian Wushuang.","“No, no. First of all, I’m just a descendant of the Xue Bei. I haven’t joined the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect yet. It’s already quite difficult for me to represent the blood ancestor’s lineage. You’re just my guard, so it doesn’t","make sense in terms of identity.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Also, most importantly, my strength has just improved greatly. Right now, I’m looking for a few experts at the fifth level of the Void to spar with. That Master Flame Mountain’s strength is too weak, and I don’t think","much of him. As for this revolving lord, he can be my opponent, allowing me to temper myself!”","“Of course, if I win this battle with him, it will naturally be good. Then, there is no need for me to engage in a third battle. However, even if I lose this battle, it doesn’t matter. For the next third battle, it won’t be too late","for you to make your move.”","“In any case, the people of the nether ancestor’s lineage don’t know your identity or your actual strength. They will only treat you as a formidable master of laws. The opponent they sent to fight with you is at most an","expert at the pinnacle of the void four realms. It will be the same if you defeat him easily.”","“Hmph, this old man hopes that the so-called nether ancestor can make his move personally. It would be too boring if it was just against an expert at the pinnacle of the void four realms.” Demon Master Chenhuo","curled his lips and did not say anything else."]},{"number":3408,"title":"Chapter 3408 - On the Hundred Battle Arena","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The next day, on the hundred battle arena.","The hundred battle arena of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect was located in a special space-time zone. It was enormous and boundless, allowing people to wantonly engage in fierce battles inside without affecting the","outside world.","This was because the news of the experts of the blood ancestor’s bloodline and Xuan Master and the others of the nether ancestor’s bloodline engaging in a battle in the void yesterday had long spread throughout the","entire Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect.","The blood ancestor’s bloodline and the dark ancestor’s bloodline were both large sects of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. Naturally, their battle attracted many experts.","Countless experts gathered around the hundred battle platform. There were experts from various sects, as well as many genius cultivators from the Dao Palace. At a glance, there were no less than several thousand","people.","Experts from the blood ancestor lineage and the nether ancestor lineage had also arrived.","“Haha, Ancient Wheel, I didn’t expect that your blood ancestor lineage would have the courage to compete with my nether ancestor lineage on the hundred-battle arena.” Xuan Master’s somewhat wanton laughter","reverberated throughout the entire void. “I know that your blood ancestor lineage has lost quite a bit of its peak combat strength over the years. In order to prevent others from saying that my nether ancestor lineage","is bullying you, I might as well tell you the names and order of the three people that my nether ancestor lineage will send out.”","“There are three battles on the blood battle platform. In the first battle, my nether ancestor lineage will send out Master Flame Mountain!”","“In the second battle, I will personally take action.”","“As for the third battle, it will be taken out by my nether ancestor lineage’s master. Your blood ancestor lineage can decide on your own battle order based on the names of the people that my nether ancestor lineage","will send out to battle.”","Xuan Master’s tone was very arrogant. He had no intention of putting the blood ancestor clan in his eyes at all.","This was very normal. After all, in the current blood ancestor clan, other than Master Ancient Wheel, there was really no one else that he could care about.","After hearing Xuan Master’s words, Master Ancient Wheel’s expression sank slightly.","Of the three experts sent by the dark ancestor clan, Xuan Master and Master Flame Mountain were already within everyone’s expectations. As for the third battle, the Leaf Master was also an expert who had long","reached the pinnacle of the four void realms, among the void four realms, he was almost invincible. On the side of the blood ancestor’s branch, there was no one else who could contend with him except for Master","Ancient Wheel himself.","In other words, in these three matches, only Master Ancient Wheel was confident of winning one match against Master Flame Mountain or Master Leaf. But in the remaining two matches, there was almost no chance","of winning.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis.” Master Ancient Wheel could only look at Jian Wushuang.","“Master Ancient Wheel, don’t worry so much. You just need to defeat Master Flame Mountain according to what you said yesterday. Now that the nether ancestor bloodline has taken the initiative to announce the","number of experts they will send and the order of the battle, it’s even more convenient. You’ll be the one to fight in the first match,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Alright.” Ancient Wheel Master nodded slightly. He did not hesitate too much. He directly raised his head and looked at Xuan Master and the others with his sharp eyes. “Xuan Master, there’s no need to say any more","nonsense. Since our blood ancestor lineage has come to this hundred battle platform, we won’t be afraid of you. Let’s begin the first battle.”","“Very good.” Xuan Master smiled and glanced at Master Flame Mountain. “Flame Mountain, go.”","Master Flame Mountain smiled coldly, and his body flashed into the hundred-battle arena.","On the side of the blood ancestor, Master Ancient Wheel also entered the hundred-battle arena.","Seeing the blood ancestor send out Master Ancient Wheel in the first battle, the dark ancestor and the surrounding experts all looked surprised, but soon everyone laughed.","“Looks like the blood ancestor’s bloodline wants to rely on the Master Ancient Wheel to win one match first!”","“The only person the blood ancestor’s bloodline can bring out right now is this Master Ancient Wheel. And now, the first to be sent out is Master Ancient Wheel. If they win one match first, even if they lose the next two","matches, they won’t lose too badly.”","“That’s right. As long as the Master Ancient Wheel doesn’t fight against the Topspin Master, he should have a great chance of winning against the other two people. And that Leaf Master is in the third match. If Master","Ancient Wheel chooses him as his opponent and waits until the third city, he probably won’t even have the chance to make a move. This is because the blood ancestor’s bloodline has already lost the first two matches.”","The experts who were watching the battle were casually chatting and laughing.","n the hundred battle platform, Master Ancient Wheel and Flame Mountain Master did not waste any more words. The moment they met, they immediately attacked.","Hong! Hong!","Two majestic auras erupted from the hundred battle platform almost at the same time.","egardless of whether it was the Master Ancient Wheel or Master Flame Mountain, they were all experts at the fifth level of the Void. If this level was placed in the Divine Beginning Realm, it would be the strongest","combat strength of some great powers and great sects. When such experts fought fiercely...the commotion was also shocking.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","Ear-splitting booming sounds rang out one after another. On the hundred battle platform, many spatial cracks spread out like a spider web. The entire hundred battle platform was filled with an aura that could destroy","the world.","At this moment, these two people were already engaged in an incomparably violent and fierce battle. The two of them were madly clashing and killing each other.","Master Ancient Wheel grasped the three great laws of darkness, earth, and lightning at the same time. The two great principles of darkness and lightning had already perfectly fused together. That attack was","incomparably violent. Along with the battle saber in his hand, he slashed out time and time again.","Each slash seemed to be able to destroy the world.","As for Master Flame Mountain, he grasped the three great principles of life and death, wind, and fire at the same time. Within them, the two great principles of wind and fire were compatible with each other. Fire","borrowed the power of the wind, and its power soared explosively. With a casual wave of his hand, a sea of fire filled the sky. He wore a scarlet red glove in his hand, with a casual palm strike, a huge sea of fire attacked","Master Ancient Wheel.","Each palm strike seemed to be able to melt the world.","The attacks of these two people were incomparably wild and violent. The two of them specialized in head-on confrontations. Since this was the case, the two of them did their best to display their techniques to the","fullest on the hundred battle platform.","As the head-on confrontations occurred time and time again, the frightening might of the collision also caused the experts watching from outside the hundred battle arena to secretly suck in a breath of cold air.","However, in this battle, those with discerning eyes could tell that in this head-on collision, Master Ancient Wheel had a slight advantage. Although this advantage was very small, as long as one had an advantage...it","would be magnified in every head-on collision.","As expected, as the number of head-on collisions increased, the subtle gap between the two sides had gradually widened. Master Flame Mountain gradually fell into a disadvantage, and even began to be suppressed by","Master Ancient Wheel.","“Master Flame Mountain is going to lose.”","Jian Wushuang looked calmly at everything in the hundred-battle arena.","Not long after Jian Wushuang said this, a shocking boom was heard in the center of the hundred-battle arena, and Master Flame Mountain’s somewhat miserable figure also retreated.."]},{"number":3409,"title":"Chapter 3409 - Participants","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Master Flame Mountain, thank you for letting me win.” Master Ancient Wheel stopped and said.","“Hmph, you’re not as good as me, so there’s nothing to be proud of.” Master Flame Mountain snorted. He was very clear that he had indeed done his best, but in terms of strength, he was indeed slightly weaker than","the Master Ancient Wheel.","“Ancient Wheel, don’t be complacent. Although you have defeated me and won one battle, your blood ancestor lineage has no hope of winning the remaining two battles.” After Master Flame Mountain finished","speaking, his body flashed and he left the hundred battle arena, he rushed toward the place where the experts of the serene ancestor lineage gathered.","Master Ancient Wheel opened his mouth and wanted to say something, but he did not say anything. He also turned around and left the hundred battle arena.","When the surrounding experts saw this scene, they all sighed.","“As expected, the blood ancestor’s bloodline won this match.”","“It’s normal to win. In terms of strength, Master Ancient Wheel is slightly stronger than Master Flame Mountain.”","“Unfortunately, the hundred battle arena has three matches and two out of three wins. Even if the blood ancestor’s bloodline relied on Master Ancient Wheel to win one match, there’s no chance of winning the","remaining two matches. The nether ancestor’s bloodline knows this, which is why they brazenly told the blood ancestor’s bloodline about the name list and the order of the experts to fight.”","“Just wait and see. The blood ancestor’s bloodline won’t stand a chance in the next two matches. I hope they don’t lose too badly.”","Everyone chatted and laughed. Even though the blood ancestor’s bloodline had already won one match, none of them were optimistic about the blood ancestor’s bloodline.","The Xuan Master also laughed coldly and directly rushed toward the hundred battle arena.","“Ancient Wheel, just send anyone to fight with me.” Master Xuan sneered.","The spectating experts also looked in the direction of the blood ancestor lineage with interest.","“In this second battle, who will the blood ancestor lineage send? Will they send Master Stabbing Heart?”","“It shouldn’t be. Among the Principles Masters of the blood ancestor lineage, besides Master Ancient Wheel, Master Stabbing Heart is the strongest. At the very least, he has reached the pinnacle of the void fourth","stage. If Ancient Wheel is a little smarter, he can send anyone to fight with Master Xuan in this second battle. Even if he loses, it doesn’t matter. As for Master Stabbing Heart, it’s best to stay in the third battle and fight","with Leaf Master!”","“That’s right. Although Master Stabbing Heart’s strength is a little weaker than that of Leaf Master, as long as he performs well, he can definitely fight with Leaf Master. There might even be a chance for him to win.","However, if he were to send any other Principles Master onto the battlefield, he would not be a match for Leaf Master.”","The surrounding experts who were watching the battle discussed animatedly.","They had even started to choose experts for the blood ancestor’s bloodline. In the end, most of them thought that it was best to choose a random Principles Master to fight against the Xuan Master in the second","match, so as to deliberately lose one match, then, they would put the victory of this match on Master Stabbing Heart in the third match.","However, these people were going to miscalculate in the end.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, the second match...” Master Ancient Wheel looked at Jian Wushuang.","“T’ll do it this time.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. Then, under the astonished gaze of Master Ancient Wheel, he directly rushed into the hundred-battle arena.","When Jian Wushuang appeared in the hundred-battle arena, not only Master Ancient Wheel was shocked, but also the experts from the nether ancestor’s bloodline and the surrounding spectators were completely","stunned.","“A Saint?”","“In the second battle, the blood ancestor’s bloodline sent an Immortal Saint to fight Xuan Master?”","“Even if they want to give up this battle, they should send a Principles Master, right? Sending an Immortal Saint to fight, isn’t that humiliating Xuan Master?”","Many people had strange expressions.","But some people recognized Jian Wushuang the moment they saw him.","“This man...is Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","“He is Heavenly Sword Marquis. He said yesterday that he is the descendant of the Xue Bei and a member of the blood ancestor’s bloodline.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis is going to fight and challenge Xuan Master?”","“Is Heavenly Sword Marquis courting death? Although I know he is talented, he is just a Saint.”","Those who knew Jian Wushuang’s identity were stunned.","Even Master Ancient Wheel was suspicious of Jian Wushuang.","“Sir, what is your plan?” Master Ancient Wheel looked at Demon Master Chenhuo, trying to get some information from him.","However, Chenhuo said coldly, “Don’t worry, just watch.”","Hearing this, Master Ancient Wheel could only shake his head helplessly. He turned his eyes and looked at the hundred-battle arena again.","Jian Wushuang stood in front of Xuan Master in the hundred-battle arena. They were only a few hundred meters apart and were facing each other.","Xuan Master frowned when he saw the person in front of him was Jian Wushuang. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, what do you mean?”","“Haha, Xuan Master, can’t you see it?”","“Since I’m here, I’m here to fight you on behalf of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. I proved yesterday that I’m qualified to fight on behalf of the blood ancestor’s bloodline, don’t you think so?” Jian Wushuang said with a","smile.","“That’s true, but you’re just an Immortal Saint. If I can’t control my power well and accidentally kill you, what should I do?” Xuan Master said in a low voice.","“Haha, you can rest assured. More than 400 years ago, even the three masters of the Saint Realm couldn’t kill me. It would be too ridiculous for you to kill me,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Xuan Master was stunned.","“Xuan Master, you don’t have to worry about anything. I also want to remind you to use all of your strength at the beginning. Otherwise, you might be defeated by me, and then your Xuan Master will lose face,” Jian","Wushuang said.","“Humph, I, the Xuan Master, have reached the peak of the five realms of the Void Realm. How could I be defeated by you, an Immortal Saint? What a joke!” Xuan Master snorted with disdain.","“Let’s try it first.”","Jian Wushuang smiled, but his eyes suddenly became cold.","As the Blood Mountain Sword appeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand, a chill spread in the surrounding area.","Jian Wushuang moved!","His body fluttered like a leaf swaying in the wind, but his speed was astonishing. In the blink of an eye, he had appeared in front of the Xuan Master. Then, the Blood Mountain Sword slashed directly!","This sword seemed to be light and casual, but the moment the sword light slashed out, the power of the three wills that Jian Wushuang had grasped burst out instantly. Together with the life divine power, it","immediately revolved, making the power of this sword...it instantly increased by an unknown number of times!"]},{"number":3410,"title":"Chapter 3410 - Fight Xuan Master","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Humph!”","Xuan Master snorted when he saw the sword coming toward him. He did not care about it. He did not even take out his weapon, he threw a punch toward the huge sword light.","Bang!","The sound of metal colliding rang out. Jian Wushuang’s strength had reached the Xuan Master’s level, and his divine body was as strong as a magic weapon. His fist was more stiff than an ordinary holy treasure, but it","was still inferior to a true treasure, however, it was still inferior to a true treasure.","Jian Wushuang’s Blood Mountain Sword was his original magic weapon. As his strength increased, it continued to evolve and had reached the level of a true treasure. The sword hit the Xuan Master’s fist, the first burst","of astonishing power almost instantly shattered the bones in Xuan Master’s arm. The enormous power spread through his arm and into his entire divine body.","A hint of surprise flashed in Xuan Master’s eyes. His body suddenly jerked for a moment, and then he immediately retreated.","He retreated to the edge of the hundred-battle arena, and only then did Xuan Master stand steadily.","“This power...has reached the peak of the void fourth realm, and is not far from the void fifth realm. How is this kid possible?” Xuan Master stared at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","The experts outside the hundred-battle arena also widened their eyes when they saw this scene.","“How could it be?”","“What did I see? Xuan Master was actually repelled by Heavenly Sword Marquis’ sword?”","“Even if Xuan Master didn’t use his full strength just now, even if it was just a casual attack, an ordinary Principles Master wouldn’t be able to withstand it. However, Heavenly Sword Marquis not only could withstand it,","but his sword was also able to completely suppress Xuan Master’s attack?”","“You must be joking, right?”","The spectators were all stunned.","“This...” Master Ancient Wheel and many experts from the blood ancestor’s lineage were also stunned.","In the hundred battle platform, Xuan Master’s face was still filled with shock, but gradually, this shock was replaced by endless anger.","“As expected of the number one genius in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm. A mere Saint Realm, but the power that burst out in an instant has reached the peak of the void four realms. Heavenly Sword","Marquis, I admit that I have underestimated you, but it ends here.”","As soon as he finished his words, the Xuan Master let out a fierce shout and stomped his foot.","The void under the Xuan Master’s feet immediately exploded. The power of his foot caused a small black hole to appear in the hundred-battle arena.","The Xuan Master rushed toward Jian Wushuang like a bolt of lightning. His aura surged, and a long spear appeared in his hand. The power of the five void realms surged toward the long spear.","It was obvious that Xuan Master had used his full strength.","“Haha, good timing.”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang burst into laughter. His eyes flickered with a fierce light that made people’s hearts tremble. He moved, and just as he was about to make direct contact with Xuan Master...the supreme","life-level pressure on his body burst out to the extreme.","He used the heaven-cleaving skill in an instant.","“Peerless Sword technique, Xi Xiang!”","Jian Wushuang raised his sword with both hands. With the help of the heaven-cleaving skill, a scarlet sword light that filled more than half of the hundred-battle arena slashed out ferociously, crushing everything in its","path.","“Divine destruction!”","The Xuan Master held the spear with one hand. The spear was filled with three types of rule power, two of which were perfectly combined, turning the spear into a dark purple color. The dark purple spear was like a","dark purple flood dragon, it suddenly whistled out and annihilated everything.","Bang!","The world suddenly shook, and soon after, countless spatial cracks appeared on the hundred battle platform. Each of these spatial cracks was over a hundred meters long, and they were constantly tearing space apart","and reassembling...it was a scene that could destroy the world.","However, this scene did not last for long. As a figure retreated explosively, the power that could destroy the world also began to slowly quieten down.","“Haha, Xuan Zhu, your strength is just so-so.”","A hearty laughter reverberated throughout the hundred battle arena. At the same time, it was also transmitted from the hundred battle arena, ringing in the ears of every expert watching the battle.","The many experts watching the battle were completely stunned when they saw the scene in the hundred battle arena.","“The first collision was Xuan Zhu underestimating the enemy and did not use all of his strength. Even if he was forced back, it was still acceptable. But now, Xuan Zhu has clearly used all of his strength. But in the end,","he is still at a disadvantage in a head-on collision?”","“He is indeed at a disadvantage. I saw it clearly.”","“How could it be? How could the attack power of Heavenly Sword Marquis be so strong?”","Everyone felt incredulous.","Even the Xuan Master himself could not believe his eyes at this moment.","Indeed, he had used all of his strength in the second collision, but he was still at a slight disadvantage in the collision. He could not accept the result for a moment.","Only Jian Wushuang himself was not surprised by the result.","“Although I am only an Immortal Saint, because of my perfect life level, my basic divine power is not weaker than the ordinary Principles Masters, and it is even slightly stronger. Now I have mastered three parts of the","power of will. With the life divine power, it is equivalent to four parts of the power of will. As for the heaven-cleaving skill...”","“Although I haven’t mastered the most powerful secret skill created by my master, at my current level, the superimposed power is much more than the power of one will. In total, | have mastered more than five wills!”","“My basic divine power is a little stronger than the Xuan Master, and the power of my will is also a lot stronger. In total, the power that I can unleash in an instant is much stronger than the Xuan Master, who is in the","void five realms. The only regret is that the level of the absolute art created by me is a little lower.”","In terms of absolute art, Jian Wushuang’s unparalleled sword manual had seven sword moves that had reached the level of Principles Master. However, as Principles Masters, there were differences in the level of their","absolute art, the seven sword moves that Jian Wushuang had created were at most equivalent to the absolute art created by an expert in the third realm of the void. In terms of level, they could only be considered as","advanced absolute art among Principles Masters.","As for Xuan Master, he had reached the fifth realm of the void for many years, so the absolute arts created by him were naturally very powerful. For example, the spear move that Xuan Master had just displayed was","definitely the pinnacle absolute art of the Principles Masters, which was much more powerful than Jian Wushuang’s Xi Xiang move, it was much more powerful.","However, even if the absolute arts were slightly inferior, with the advantage in power and power, he still had the upper hand in this collision!."]},{"number":3411,"title":"Chapter 3411 - Binding","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Impossible!”","“I can’t believe that you, an Immortal Saint, can be more powerful than me!”","“Fight!”","Xuan Master’s eyes were bloodshot, and he was full of fighting spirit. His low voice echoed throughout the hundred-battle arena. At this moment, he was like a furious beast, charging out directly. Wherever he passed,","his evil spirit soared to the sky.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes darkened, and he immediately went up to meet him.","The two once again engaged in fierce battle in the hundred battle arena.","This time, both of them displayed their respective skills.","Xuan Master held his spear with one hand. The dark purple spear let out a terrifying whistling sound, piercing through heaven and earth. The cold tip of the spear casually slashed out, easily tearing the space apart like","a battle saber. The successive spikes were like numerous stars, it illuminated the void...","Xuan Master had been adventuring in the universe battlefield for many years and had experienced countless fierce battles and massacres. During these countless fierce battles and massacres, his spear skills had also","been trained to be very terrifying, just like Jian Wushuang, Xuan Master had also created a complete set of spear skills that encompassed all aspects.","This spear skill allowed him to be like a fish in water in face-to-face close combat.","Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish! Swish!","The dark purple spear attacked Jian Wushuang again and again. Jian Wushuang also brandished his Blood Mountain Sword to fight or block. His swordsmanship was fully displayed at this moment.","However, in such a fierce face-to-face confrontation, Jian Wushuang was gradually suppressed by the Xuan Master.","It was not because Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship was inferior to the Xuan Master’s spear technique, but because there was a certain gap in power.","“Haha, I see, I see!”","Xuan Master saw some problems during the fierce battle and immediately burst into laughter, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, I thought your power had really surpassed mine. It turns out that it is not so. Although your","power is not weak, it is only at the pinnacle of the void four realms. At most, it can only reach the level of the void five realms. The reason why you were able to fight me head-on was because you used a special method","or secret skill!”","“However, that secret technique shouldn’t be able to last forever. Instead, it can only allow you to instantly burst out with even stronger power!","“In other words, you can only burst out with power that surpasses mine in an instant in an occasional head-on collision. However, in a head-on battle like this, you can’t possibly allow your every sword strike to","contain that level of power!","“As long as you don’t activate that secret skill, your power won’t be as powerful as mine, and you’ll be crushed by me. Hahahaha.”","Xuan Master laughed wantonly, while Jian Wushuang’s face darkened slightly.","He knew very well that the Xuan Master was right. Once he used the Heaven-cleaving skill, he could indeed make his power surpass the Xuan Master’s in an instant. However, the Heaven-cleaving skill was not a","continuous secret skill, but a secret skill that could only be used once, it could only be used once.","n other words, after he used the Heaven-cleaving skill once, the next move would not have the power of the Heaven-cleaving skill unless he used it again.","As the strongest secret skill created by his master, the Heaven-cleaving skill was not completely mastered by Jian Wushuang. Even with his current ability, he could only use the Heaven-cleaving skill regardless of the","consequences, at most, he could only use it about ten times.","tt was equivalent to a big battle. He could only use it about ten times before he overpowered the Xuan Master’s swordsmanship.","However, after a fierce battle, how could he only use the Heaven-cleaving skill ten times?","Like now, he could not use the Heaven-cleaving skill every time he clashed with the Xuan Master.","ff he did not use the Heaven-cleaving skill, he would be suppressed by the Xuan Master.","Clang!","Another head-on collision. The strong recoil made Jian Wushuang stagger. Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes. He knew that he could not continue fighting with the Xuan Master.","With a thought, a golden light extended from his body and instantly merged with the surrounding world.","This golden light was the top-grade treasure of the universe, the Mountain River Map!","“Thousand treasures great world, space-time world!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice, and instantly, the entire arena began to change.","The world transformed, and a space-time world filled with the power of space-time principles appeared in front of everyone.","“Change the world?”","“It’s the Mountain River Map. Legend has it that it’s a top-tier treasure owned by the Ancient Seven Star Mysterious Sect!”","“This is the Mountain River Map?”","The spectators all sighed.","During the battle on Saha Island, Jian Wushuang had used the Mountain River Map. At that time, the map had helped Jian Wushuang a lot. In the end, he had even severely injured the Flame Saint Master and the","Sorcerer God by relying on the secret skill of the map, the mirror image of the battle had long been spread in the Divine Beginning Realm, so it was no secret that Jian Wushuang had the map.","Now that Jian Wushuang had taken out the map, everyone sighed, but they were not too surprised.","“Humph, the map is a good treasure. The space-time world is also very mysterious. It is indeed helpful to an expert like you who has mastered the principles of space-time. But can a space-time world change","anything?” Xuan Master looked at Jian Wushuang mockingly.","“Don’t worry, it’s still early.” Jian Wushuang just smiled. Then, he suddenly stretched out his hand and made a strange cut in the void in front of him.","“One finger painting the sky, space-time prison!”","Buzz! With that simple cut, the power of the space-time principles condensed in Jian Wushuang’s body instantly surged up and swept out in all directions like a sea wave. In just a moment, it covered the entire battle","platform.","“This is...”","Seeing the power of the spacetime principles in the surroundings, the Xuan Master’s pupils suddenly shrank. “Spacetime imprisonment!”","“How is this possible? You’ve only mastered the spacetime principles for a short time. How could you master the spacetime imprisonment so quickly?”","“There are many things you don’t know.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. Of course, he could not tell the Xuan Master that he had the golden sky-painting banner. However, as the spacetime imprisonment took shape, he","waved his big hand.","“Space-time restriction!”","Buzz! Buzz! The vast power of the space-time principles covered the surrounding area and instantly covered the Xuan Master.","“What is this?” Xuan Master’s face darkened. He could feel the pressure and restriction from the surrounding power of the space-time principles.","This kind of restriction was like a domain, but it was more strange and difficult to resist.","This was the pressure of natural laws, especially in the spacetime world, where the power of spacetime principles was everywhere. This spacetime restriction became even more tyrannical. Even someone as strong as","the revolving host could not break free, and under the spacetime restriction...his movements were greatly hindered."]},{"number":3412,"title":"Chapter 3412 - Grievance","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Humph, how can a mere space-time binding do anything to me?” Xuan Master’s voice was cold.","“Space-time binding can’t do anything to you, but it can greatly limit your speed.” Jian Wushuang chuckled and disappeared from this world.","“The shadowless escape art of the Blood Blade Master?” Xuan Master’s pupils shrank. He had once fought with the Blood Blade Master, so he naturally understood the shadowless escape art.","However, Jian Wushuang’s mastery of the shadowless escape art was obviously not as high as that of the Blood Blade Master. Now that he had used it, although his body had disappeared, Xuan Master’s strength could","still be detected, however, he could clearly sense Jian Wushuang’s location.","In his perception, as soon as Jian Wushuang disappeared, he rushed toward him from the side. His speed was incredible with the support of the surrounding space-time world.","Whoosh!","His figure flashed, and a sword light came directly toward the neck of the Xuan Master.","It was the Peerless Sword Manual, Star Dream!","“Get lost!”","The Xuan Master had long sensed Jian Wushuang’s position, so he could easily deal with it. He blocked Jian Wushuang’s sword with a casual spear. However, when the Xuan Master waved the long spear in his hand, he","found that the speed of his spear was obviously slower than before.","And that was only the speed of his spear. Under the restriction of time and space, his speed was much slower.","“This kid wants to win by relying on his speed?” Xuan Master’s face darkened.","He was right. In the previous fight, Jian Wushuang knew that he would be suppressed by Xuan Master. Therefore, he directly used the Mountain River Map and the Heavenly Golden Banner to greatly increase his","speed, at the same time, he also crazily suppressed the Xuan Master’s speed.","In terms of speed, it was obvious that the Xuan Master could not keep up with Jian Wushuang.","“Xuan Master, you can’t keep up with my speed at all. You can’t even touch me. Just be my target.” Jian Wushuang sneered and moved around the Xuan Master Like a ghost, he waved his Blood Mountain Sword one","after another.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The sword lights were incredibly fast as they rushed toward Xuan Master.","Although Xuan Master was bound by time and space and his speed was weakened, his reaction speed was not affected at all. When Jian Wushuang attacked, he could also immediately swing his spear to block, no","matter how hard Jian Wushuang attacked, Xuan Master could block them all.","However, he could only block them, but he could not counterattack at all.","There was nothing he could do. Jian Wushuang’s speed was much faster than his current speed. Moreover, Jian Wushuang did not fight head-on with him. Instead, he trembled from the surroundings and performed a","sword attack. After being blocked by the Xuan Master, he immediately retreated, he performed a second sword attack and did not give him a chance to counterattack.","Just as Jian Wushuang said, the Xuan Master was now like a living target. He could only block Jian Wushuang’s attacks time and time again, but he could not fight back at all.","“Too fast! Heavenly Sword Marquis’ speed is really too fast!”","“The speed that Heavenly Sword Marquis burst out with now, with the support of the surrounding space-time world, may not have reached the level of the sixth void realm, but it may have already reached the peak of","the fifth void realm. Originally, although this level of speed was faster than the Xuan Master, the Xuan Master could more or less keep up. Unfortunately, the Xuan Master was restrained by space-time and his speed","was greatly reduced. With this addition and subtraction, their speed was pulled apart.”","“I feel like the Xuan Master is like a target.”","The audience outside the hundred-battle arena sighed at the scene.","Although he was stronger than his opponent, he could only defend passively and had no chance to fight back. Xuan Master felt very aggrieved.","Such an aggrieved fight, especially when his opponent was only an immortal saint, made the Xuan Master more and more furious while blocking Jian Wushuang’s attack.","Finally, his anger completely exploded.","“Bastard!”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’re going too far!”","Xuan Master roared. A large amount of Blood Qi surged from his body, and his aura suddenly soared. His eyes were scarlet, and a huge phantom beast appeared out of thin air behind him, it was as if it had just crawled","out of Hell.","This scene shocked all the experts watching the battle on the hundred battle platform.","“Xuan Master is using his ultimate move!”","“This move is Xuan Master’s strongest ultimate move, and can also be considered one of Xuan Master’s trump cards. It is said that even if Xuan Master used this move, it wouldn’t be easy. Unless it was necessary, he","wouldn’t use it so easily.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis actually forced Xuan Master to this extent?”","The experts outside the hundred-battle arena were shocked by Xuan Master’s violent aura.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","Xuan Master’s eyes were as wide as copper bells. His eyes were bloodshot. With a roar, he managed to break free from the space-time constraints and reached the peak of his speed again, he was even faster than his","peak speed. He caught up with Jian Wushuang in an instant and even slightly exceeded the speed that Jian Wushuang had burst out.","Xuan Master also appeared directly in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Yin ultimate move, kill!”","Xuan Master held the spear with both hands. The dark purple spear burst out with a monstrous light, and the entire body of the spear was enlarged instantly. A shocking destructive aura burst out from the spear, and","then it pierced out directly!","Boom!","The space was directly pierced through, and a huge dark tunnel appeared. A large number of spatial cracks spread wantonly.","Jian Wushuang stood at the end of the spear and watched the spear attack. The terrifying pressure contained in the spear made Jian Wushuang’s heart jump, but he was not afraid at all, when the spear tip was about to","appear in front of him, the supreme life-level pressure on his body burst out again.","The Heaven-cleaving skill was also used again.","“Peerless sword technique, Xi Xiang!”","t was also the most powerful move of Xi Xiang. Although Jian Wushuang knew that his sword was not as powerful as the spear technique of the Xuan Master, once he used the heaven-cleaving skill, his attack power","would reach a whole new level.","The scarlet sword light collided with the world-destroying spear!","tt was a head-on collision!","Two waves of power suddenly exploded.","Boom!","The sky collapsed and the earth cracked. The space around the hundred battle platform was on the verge of collapse as if it could not withstand the two waves of power. Fortunately, the two waves of power did not last","long, the hundred battle platform was able to withstand the two waves of power in the end.","n the hundred battle platform, the overwhelming power began to slowly dissipate. When the power completely dissipated, everyone immediately saw the scene inside.","On both ends of the hundred-battle arena, Jian Wushuang and Xuan Zhu were still standing steadily, with a faint smile on Jian Wushuang’s face.."]},{"number":3413,"title":"Chapter 3413 - Draw","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Xuan Master, your attack just now was really powerful. Not only did it defeat my swordsmanship, but some of the power also spread to my divine body, slightly damaging it. It’s really impressive,” Jian Wushuang said","with a smile.","Jian Wushuang said it casually, but Xuan Master’s face turned a little ugly after hearing it. “I used nearly 20% of my divine power to perform my strongest move, but it only slightly damaged his divine body?”","Slightly damaged was not even a large amount of damage, not to mention that his divine body directly collapsed.","Under normal circumstances, the opponent’s divine body directly collapsed before he lost the battle on the hundred-battle arena. Obviously, he was far from reaching that level.","“Xuan Master, I’m very curious. How many more times can you use that move?” Jian Wushuang smiled strangely, but his figure appeared again.","With the support of the space-time world, Jian Wushuang’s speed was displayed again.","“Damn it!”","Xuan Master cursed in his heart. Facing Jian Wushuang’s speed, he could only become Jian Wushuang’s living target again under the restriction of space-time.","The previous scene quickly appeared again.","Outside the hundred-battle arena, the experts watching the battle looked at each other in dismay. They could see the shock in each other’s eyes.","“This Heavenly Sword Marquis actually forcefully withstood Xuan Master’s strongest move, and he wasn’t injured at all?”","“My soul senses are very clear. In order to execute that move, Xuan Master used nearly 20% of his divine power. However, after the collision, that Heavenly Sword Marquis’ divine body was only slightly damaged, but","his divine power aura didn’t weaken at all.”","“This is insane! Heavenly Sword Marquis is too insane!”","“Even Xuan Master’s strongest move could not defeat Heavenly Sword Marquis. Then this battle...”","Everyone stared at the scene in the hundred-battle arena.","Xuan Master had already used his strongest move, but it did not cause any harm to Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang still relied on his speed to crazily attack Xuan Master. Xuan Master could only passively defend, he had","become a living target.","However, although the Xuan Master could not fight back, he could still block Jian Wushuang’s attack.","Time continued to pass. During this period, the Xuan Master was angry and once again used his strongest move. However, the result was the same. Jian Wushuang could completely block his strongest move with his","Heaven-cleaving skill, then he continued to suppress him.","He used his strongest move twice in a row, but it did not cause any harm to Jian Wushuang. Xuan Master lost his temper.","“Master Ancient Master, it’s been 15 minutes,” Master Ku said.","“15 minutes?” Master Ancient Wheel was overjoyed. In the next moment, he rushed toward the hundred battle platform. The experts around him, including the nether ancestor’s bloodline, did not stop him.","“That’s it, you two.” Master Ancient Wheel appeared in the center of the hundred battle arena. A burst of divine power separated the two in the fierce battle.","“Master Ancient Wheel, what’s wrong? What are you doing here?” Jian Wushuang looked at Master Ancient Wheel in surprise. He was a little displeased.","After entering the Samsara Heaven Realm, his strength had greatly increased. He was looking for a decent opponent to fight. Xuan Master had just become his opponent. He was also excited about the fierce battle","between him and Xuan Master, Jian Wushuang was naturally unhappy that Master Ancient Wheel had stepped in to stop their battle.","It was as if he had read Jian Wushuang’s mind, Master Ancient Wheel said with a wry smile, “Mr. Heavenly Marquis, the hundred-battle arena has long made a rule that if the two sides fight for more than 15 minutes and","there is no winner, then the battle will be considered a draw.”","“A draw?” Jian Wushuang was stunned. Then he looked at the Xuan Master in front of him and found that the Xuan Master was looking at him with a gloomy face and gnashing his teeth, however, the Xuan Master had","already put his precious spear back into his interspatial ring. Obviously, he did not intend to continue the fierce battle with Jian Wushuang.","He was not stupid. He knew that if he continued to fight, he would be suppressed by Jian Wushuang’s speed. Naturally, he did not want to continue to be so sullen.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang felt helpless.","ff he could, he wanted to continue fighting with the Xuan Master, but apparently, the latter did not have such an idea.","“Forget it, let’s call it a draw.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and was ready to rush out of the hundred battle arena.","But Master Ancient Wheel was already overjoyed.","n this battle of the hundred battle arena, if it was just the strength of his blood ancestor’s bloodline, he had almost no chance of winning against the spirit ancestor’s bloodline. Except for him, who had won one battle,","the remaining two battles were almost certain to be lost. But now...because of Jian Wushuang, the second battle ended in a draw. This meant that even if the blood ancestor’s bloodline lost the third battle, the Battle of","the hundred-battle arena would be one win, one loss, and one draw, both sides drew.","Master Ancient Wheel and the experts of the blood ancestor’s bloodline were already very happy to be able to draw with the ghost ancestor’s bloodline.","Outside the hundred-battle arena, many experts were sighing. No one had expected that the second battle would end in a draw.","Moreover, Xuan Master, an extremely powerful expert of the five void realms, could not win against Heavenly Sword Marquis, who was only at the Immortal Saint Realm. Moreover, he had been suppressed by Jian","Wushuang almost the entire time, Jian Wushuang’s strength completely shocked them and refreshed their understanding of the Immortal Saint.","In particular, many of the spectators were Immortal Saint existences. A huge wave of emotions rose in their hearts. They had never thought that the Immortal Saint could be so strong.","Amidst the exclamations, the battle had to continue. After all, it was only 20% of the fierce battle.","“Xuan Master, the third battle has begun.” Ancient Wheel Master smiled. The second battle had ended in a draw. No matter what, this battle had to end in a draw. This made Master Ancient Wheel feel extremely","confident.","On the other hand, the expressions of the experts from the nether ancestor’s lineage were not very good.","Hearing Master Ancient Wheel’s words, Xuan Master took a deep breath and looked at someone beside him. “Leaf Master, go.”","“Okay.”","Wearing a dark red robe, the bewitching Leaf Master appeared in the hundred battle arena. His bewitching eyes swept over the experts of the blood ancestor’s bloodline. “Who will you send to fight me in the third","battle?”","Hearing this, the Principles Masters of the blood ancestor’s bloodline looked at each other in dismay. Among them, except for Master Ancient Wheel and Jian Wushuang, no one was a match for Leaf Master, Master","Stabbing Heart, the only one whose strength was close to Leaf Master, moved and said, “Ancient Wheel, let me fight.”"]},{"number":3414,"title":"Chapter 3414 - Was Defeated in an Instant","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Okay.” Master Ancient Wheel nodded slightly. “There’s no need for too much pressure. Just use all your strength. It’s best if you can defeat Leaf Master. Even if you lose, it’s not a big deal. Anyway, in this battle, the","blood ancestor lineage can at least tie with serene ancestor.”","“I understand.” Stabbing Heart Master understood and was about to go forward, but Jian Wushuang waved his hand and stopped him.","“Stabbing Heart Master, I won’t bother you to fight in the third battle.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Stabbing Heart Master was stunned.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis?” Master Ancient Wheel also looked over in confusion.","“I want the blood ancestor’s bloodline to win this battle. It’s not as simple as a draw.” Jian Wushuang smiled and then glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo. “Chenhuo, you go.”","Demon Master Chenhuo raised his eyebrows and appeared in the hundred battle arena.","His appearance immediately attracted many curious gazes. Although there were many experts present, no one could recognize Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Who are you?” Leaf Master also looked at Demon Master Chenhuo with a frown.","“Ancient Wheel, who is this person? Is he an expert under the blood ancestor’s bloodline?” Xuan Master asked directly.","“He is my personal guard. He has nothing to do with the Temporal Temple. He is a member of the blood ancestor’s bloodline since he follows me. It shouldn’t be a problem for me to send him to fight,” Jian Wushuang","said with a smile.","“Guard?” Xuan Master narrowed his eyes.","If he was really Jian Wushuang’s guard and had nothing to do with other sects, then he could be considered a member of the blood ancestor’s bloodline.","“Humph, although I don’t know who he is, it’s impossible for the blood ancestor’s faction to defeat Leaf Master with him.” Xuan Master snorted, he said in a low voice, “Leaf, don’t hold back. Try to be as clean as","possible.”","“I know.” Leaf Master nodded slightly. As soon as he finished his words, a surging aura swept out from his body.","This aura was incomparably powerful. In an instant, it had completely exceeded the limits of a void fourth level expert, directly reaching the level of the void fifth level!","“Void fifth level!”","“This, this is the aura pressure that only void fifth level experts have!”","“Even though Leaf Master has long reached the pinnacle of the void fourth level and rarely has an opponent among the void fourth level, it is impossible for him to display this level of aura. unless...he broke through!”","“Heavens, Leaf Master has actually broken through to the fifth level of the void!”","Outside the hundred battle platform, the many experts watching the battle were all greatly shocked.","The fourth level of the void and the fifth level of the void were only one step apart, but during this period of time, an entire portion of the power of will had appeared.","“This Leaf Master has actually broken through?” Master Stabbing Heart’s eyes were wide open, and his face was filled with shock.","He knew very well that if Leaf Master was only at the pinnacle of the void four realms, he might have a chance to fight with his strength. But now that Leaf Master had made a breakthrough...he had no chance to fight","back.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, this...” Master Ancient Wheel looked at Jian Wushuang.","“It’s not a big deal. Don’t worry about it.” Jian Wushuang just smiled faintly.","Since Jian Wushuang had said so, Master Ancient Wheel naturally had nothing to say.","In the hundred battle platform, the majestic divine power aura of Leaf Master had completely suppressed Demon Master Chenhuo. However, in the face of this divine power aura’s suppression, he still appeared as calm","as a breeze, it was as if he was not affected in the slightest.","And the truth was as such. A mere void fifth level aura pressure was nothing to him. It was only because his method of concealing his aura was too brilliant that the people around him did not know his actual strength,","if people knew that he was a peak void sixth level expert, then they would not be surprised by his current expression.","“Master Ancient Wheel has instructed me to be more efficient. Hence, I’m sorry.” After Leaf Master spoke, large amounts of dark clouds rose up from his body, his body also completely turned into darkness.","Weng!","The huge dark clouds covered the sky and earth, directly extending toward Demon Master Chenhuo. The dark clouds contained an astonishing might. No matter who it was, as long as they were covered by the dark","clouds...they would all face the storm of attacks from Leaf Master.","However, just as the dark cloud appeared in front of Demon Master Chenhuo and was about to cover him, Demon Master Chenhuo slowly raised his hand.","He simply raised his hand and casually slapped the dark cloud, as if he was swatting a fly.","Pa!","The dark cloud directly shattered, revealing Leaf Master’s figure. At this moment, Leaf Master’s expression changed drastically. His divine body was being suppressed by a terrifying power. He did not have the ability to","resist...he fell to the ground.","In just a moment, his body was slammed onto the ground of the hundred battle platform, and a huge hole appeared on the ground.","Silence!","The entire hundred battle platform, both inside and outside, was extremely quiet.","Except for Jian Wushuang, everyone looked at the scene in front of them in a daze.","Leaf Master had already reached the peak of the four void realms. His battle strength was so strong that he could even fight with an expert of the five void realms. Now that he had broken through to the five void","realms, his battle strength was even more amazing, to a certain extent, he had already surpassed Xuan Master!","That was right. In terms of strength, the current Leaf Master was actually slightly stronger than Xuan Master. It was precisely because of this that the nether ancestor lineage had arranged for him to be in the final","battle just to be safe.","However, it was precisely because of this formidable strength that Leaf Master fought with this person who appeared out of nowhere and acted as a guard by the side of Heavenly Sword Marquis. In the end, everyone","was unable to react in time, Leaf Master had already been defeated.","A crushing defeat!","He was utterly defeated. There was no room for struggle.","The difference in strength between the two sides was too great!","“Void, void six realms!” Master Ancient Wheel was the first to exclaim.","As his voice rang out, the entire hundred battle platform was instantly in an uproar.","“Void six realms. The person sent by the blood ancestor’s lineage is a peak expert of the void six realms!”","“Yes, it’s the sixth level of the void. Only existences at the sixth level of the void can defeat the Leaf Master with a single move!”","“The sixth level of the void. This is the same level as the blood ancestor and the serene ancestor. But in the end, his identity is only that of the Heavenly Sword Marquis’ guard?”","“The sixth level of the void can be a guard?”","Everyone felt their minds go blank.."]},{"number":3415,"title":"Chapter 3415 - Serene Ancestor","paragraphs":["In the hundred battle platform, Leaf Master had risen up again. However, at this moment, his face was extremely unsightly. He looked at Demon Master Chenhuo with a hint of fear.","He was very clear about what he had encountered in that instant. He had been forcefully crushed by his opponent’s power. His divine body was instantly damaged by more than 80%. That kind of absolute crushing power...he had only experienced it in the hands of his master.","“I only used less than 70% of the power of that slap just now,” Demon Master Chenhuo said coldly.","“70% of the power?” Leaf Master’s body trembled.","He had only used less than 70% of the power to destroy his ultimate move with a single slap. At the same time, it had damaged more than 80% of his divine body. If the other party had used all of his power, would not he be able to directly destroy his divine body with a single slap?","“The six realms of the void, and I’m afraid that they are very powerful among the six realms of the void. I’m afraid that they are not much weaker than my master.” Leaf Master exclaimed in his heart. At the same time, he also understood that he had been completely defeated in this battle, he was completely defeated.","Leaf Master did not feel dissatisfied or unsatisfied. He bowed slightly to Demon Master Chenhuo, then walked out of the hundred battle arena and returned to Xuan Master and the others.","“Xuan Master, the result of the third battle is obvious. The bloodline of the blood ancestor should have won the battle in the hundred-battle arena, right?” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","Xuan Master’s face was extremely ugly. He had never expected that the guard of Heavenly Sword Marquis was such a powerful expert of the sixth realm of the void. They had thought that they would win the third battle, but they had lost.","And now that the three battles had ended, the blood ancestor’s lineage had won two and drawn one. Naturally, they had won.","Although Xuan Master was unwilling, he could no longer change this solution.","But just as Xuan Master was about to open his mouth and admit that the blood ancestor’s lineage had won... “Hold on.” A grand voice suddenly transmitted over from the void not far away.","This voice seemed to contain a special magic power. As soon as it was transmitted to the hundred battle arena, it caused the hearts of many experts on the hundred battle arena to move. Subsequently, all gazes turned toward the source of the voice.","Over there, a middle-aged man dressed in black tight clothes, short hair, and stubble slowly walked over.","His footsteps were very light and very strange. Every step he took caused a black vortex to appear in the void below him.","As the black vortexes appeared one after another, this middle-aged man’s figure finally arrived on the hundred battle platform.","Upon seeing him, the many powerful warriors of the nether ancestor’s lineage revealed a look of pleasant surprise.","“Lord nether ancestor!”","Xuan Master, Master Flame Mountain, and the other Principles Masters of the nether ancestor’s lineage all bowed and greeted him with extremely respectful voices.","“Master.” Leaf Master also called out respectfully.","As for the surrounding powerful warriors who were watching the battle, when they saw him, they all revealed looks of reverence. Almost all of them also bowed to show their respect.","Serene Ancestor was one of the nine ancestors of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. Furthermore, he was one of the top three strongest experts among the nine ancestors. The Serene Ancestor lineage he established was also one of the four great sects of the heavenly ancestor lineage, it was named after the blood ancestor lineage at its peak.","And Serene Ancestor had another identity. He was Leaf Master.","For example, when Leaf Master fought with Demon Master Chenhua on the hundred battle arena, the first technique he used was taught by Serene Ancestor.","“Leaf Master, I saw your battle just now.” Serene Ancestor spoke.","“Master, it’s my fault for being useless.” Leaf Master could not help but lower his head.","“It’s not that I’m useless. It’s true that the opponent is too strong. For experts at the sixth level of the void, not only did they gain an additional portion of their will, they also fused three different types of law energy at the same time. You have to know that when the principles energy is fused, the power unleashed by fusing two different types of principles energy and three different types of law energy are worlds apart.” Serene Ancestor calmly spoke.","“Naturally, if you are able to comprehend the secret art that this seat imparted to you to a deeper level, reaching the third level, you would still be defeated when facing him. However, you wouldn’t be defeated in such a miserable manner.”","“Your disciple is enlightened.” Leaf Master respectfully acknowledged, not daring to refute.","“You can leave first.” Serene Ancestor waved his hand.","Leaf Master and the experts from Serene Ancestor’s lineage immediately retreated to the side. Serene Ancestor’s eyes turned towards deepfire devil master, who had already exited the hundred-battle arena.","“It’s one thing for a peak expert at the sixth level of the void to be willing to serve as a guard for an Immortal Saint, but you even intentionally concealed your strength to bully a fifth level of the void. Sir, aren’t you a little too careless with your status?” The nether ancestor spoke, however, his voice was ice-cold.","Upon hearing the nether ancestor’s words, the surrounding people felt their hearts turning cold.","“This Serene Ancestor is indeed just like the rumors say. He is truly protective of his own shortcomings!”","“His own disciple was defeated by a sixth level void martial artist who concealed his strength. It’s normal for Serene Ancestor to feel indignant. It’s normal for him to be protective of his own shortcomings!”","“Now, let’s see how the blood ancestor lineage, Heavenly Sword Marquis, and his guards will deal with Serene Ancestor.”","Many people were already discussing this matter in secret.","In the face of Serene Ancestor’s somewhat cold gaze, Demon Master Chenhuo’s expression did not change in the slightest, he said indifferently, “This old man will serve as the guard of Heavenly Sword Marquis. That is something that we are willing to do. It has nothing to do with you, Serene Ancestor. As for saying that this old man deliberately concealed his strength to bully your disciple... perhaps I do not pay attention to my status, but it is still much better than a fifth level void realm expert of your Serene Ancestor lineage fighting with an Immortal Saint and ending in a draw, right?”","“You really know how to do it, but I don’t know if your strength is as good as your mouth,” Serene Ancestor said coldly.","“You can try. It’s been a long time since I’ve loosened my muscles and bones,” said Demon Master Chenhuo calmly without any fear.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang only smiled faintly.","Although Serene Ancestor was very famous and powerful, Demon Master Chenhuo was even more powerful!","You should know that you ancestor had reached the peak of the six void realms and was very close to the level of Elder Dark Bone. In Jian Wushuang’s opinion, if Serene Ancestor really fought, he would be asking for humiliation.","As expected, what happened next proved Jian Wushuang’s guess.","In the void, the two sides did not even enter the hundred-battle arena, but Serene Ancestor and Demon Master Chenhuo had already fought.","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","Serene Ancestor’s body shook, and a large amount of dark clouds rose up. Serene Ancestor’s body also turned into darkness and merged into the dark clouds.","It was exactly the same as the skill of Leaf Master. However, when Serene Ancestor used the dark clouds, the color and thickness of the dark clouds were obviously much denser, and the area covered by the dark clouds was much wider. In terms of power...this dark cloud was at least dozens of times stronger."]},{"number":3416,"title":"Chapter 3416 - He Was Ashamed of His Inferiority","paragraphs":["–","–","The dark clouds completely covered the void, causing the entire world to become heavy.","“This is the true power of this move.” Leaf Master looked at the dark clouds in front of him and compared it to the one he had used previously. He was astonished in his heart, and his gaze was incomparably hot.","This move originated from his master and was one of his master’s ultimate moves. Now that it was being used by his master, Serene Ancestor, its power was naturally world-shaking.","Faced with this move, even Demon Master Chenhuo did not dare to casually block it like before. Instead, he wore a pair of golden-red gloves that emitted a majestic destructive aura, with a clench of his hands, a world-shaking might instantly gathered in his palms. Following that...","Boom!","A brutal punch directly smashed out. Like a bolt of golden lightning, it instantly collided with the dark clouds. The dark clouds slightly lasted for a moment, and the middle part immediately dissipated. However, the dark clouds did not completely disperse.","However, at this moment, a large amount of gray light surged out from Demon Master Chenhuo’s body. This gray light was vast and mighty, like a vast gray ocean, spreading out, in the blink of an eye, it collided with the dark cloud.","Hualala! Two earth-shattering powers charged madly. Regardless of whether it was Demon Master Chenhuo or serene ancestor, their figures had already completely merged into these two powers.","The spectators around had long retreated. They watched the scene in the center from a distance and felt the two powers that made them feel suffocated.","However, the impact of the two waves of terrifying power did not last long. One of the waves of power had already begun to retreat.","The one who was retreating was naturally serene ancestor!","The huge dark cloud that covered Serene Ancestor was already retreating under the impact of the gray light. The entire world was gradually covered by the gray ocean. As for that dark cloud...it could barely maintain a very small area. Moreover, it was maintaining it with great difficulty, as if it was in danger of being completely annihilated at any moment.","At this point, the outcome of the battle between the two had clearly been decided.","Sou! Sou!","The power that filled the sky dissipated, and the figures of Demon Master Chenhuo and Serene Ancestor reappeared in front of everyone.","“He actually used the god power of three principles to such an extent. He even faintly added fourth principles energy... impressive!” Serene Ancestor’s expression was solemn as he stared at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“This seat has roamed the Divine Beginning Realm and even roamed the universe battlefield for a very long time. I have encountered countless experts, but among these experts, if we were to compare them with the level of the six void realms, there are absolutely no more than ten who can match you. and within the Divine Beginning Realm, there are no more than three who can match you at the six void realms!”","There was indeed a hint of surprise in Serene Ancestor’s words.","One had to know that he was a supreme existence who had lived for a very long time. His knowledge was also very vast. He had roamed the universe battlefield for a very long time and had encountered countless experts, however, the fact that Demon Master Chenhuo could be ranked in the top ten among the six void realm experts he had met was already very impressive.","As for what he said at the end, there were no more than three six void realm experts in the Divine Beginning Realm that could match fiend master sinking fire. This was also a fact. After all, Demon Master Chenhuo had indeed walked very far at the level of the six void realm, he was only a tiny bit away from the pinnacle.","“Your Excellency’s strength is monstrous, but I wonder how should I address you?” Serene Ancestor looked over.","“Chenhuo.” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Chenhuo? Could it be that genius elder from the Amethyst Demon Sect from 200 million years ago?” Serene Ancestor’s expression changed. He had also heard of Demon Master Chenhuo’s name back then.","“It’s me.” Demon Master Chenhuo did not deny it.","“Haha, that’s true.” Serene Ancestor laughed, “It has been nearly 200 million years since the Amethyst Demon Sect was destroyed. And you have also disappeared for so many years. I never expected that your strength would reach such a level after your appearance. You are truly impressive. You are indeed worthy of being called a genius elder.”","“You are not bad either. Among the six void realms, you can be considered at the peak level. Ordinary six void realms are not your match.”","Serene Ancestor raised his brows, following that, he said grandly, “The Serene Ancestor faction has lost the battle on the hundred battle arena. Our Serene Ancestor faction will not have any complaints. and according to the rules, the victor is the king. The competition between our Serene Ancestor faction and the blood ancestor faction will be decided by the blood ancestor faction. The experts under our Serene Ancestor faction are not allowed to have any disputes with the blood ancestor faction because of this territory.”","“Yes.”","“As you command, Lord Serene Ancestor!”","Many experts from Serene Ancestor’s lineage immediately respectfully received the order.","“Demon Master Chenhuo.” Serene Ancestor looked at Demon Master Chenhuo again. “Although I didn’t feel lucky after the battle with you today, I have gained quite a bit. Furthermore, it’s rare for me to meet an expert like you. Why don’t we go to my Serene Cloud Pavilion and have a good exchange?”","In the face of Demon Master Chenhuo, Serene Ancestor no longer had any airs. Now, he even looked forward to interacting with Demon Master Chenhuo and felt his heart ache.","However, Demon Master Chenhuo pondered for a moment before shaking his head. “No need. I am now Heavenly Sword Marquis’ guard. I will go wherever Heavenly Sword Marquis goes.”","Serene Ancestor was stunned. Only then did he recall the identity of Demon Master Chenhuo and could not help but sigh, “Demon Master Chenhuo, for a peak expert like you to be willing to be a guard for a little fellow at the level of a saint, this truly makes me feel incredulous. Even though this little fellow has great potential, it is not to the extent of letting you be like this?”","“This is a private agreement between me and Heavenly Sword Marquis. It has nothing to do with you, Serene Ancestor,” Demon Master Chenhuo said directly.","Serene Ancestor shrugged when he heard this and did not say anything else.","“Since that’s the case, I’ll have another chance to chat with you next time.”","With that said, Serene Ancestor turned around and left. The experts of Serene Ancestor’s lineage naturally left as well.","With the departure of the members of Serene Ancestor’s lineage, the battle on the hundred battle platform came to an end.","However, although the battle had ended, the experts who took the battle seriously could not calm their hearts for a long time.","Most of them were still filled with shock and shock.","This shock naturally came from Heavenly Sword Marquis and Demon Master Chenhuo.","First of all, Jian Wushuang had defeated Xuan Master with his Saint Realm cultivation, which was already unbelievable to them. Then, the appearance of Demon Master Chenhuo, a top expert, actually made even Serene Ancestor feel inferior. More importantly...how could such a super expert, who had reached the peak of the sixth realm of the Void Realm, be just a guard by Jian Wushuang’s side?","This fact was really hard to accept."]},{"number":3417,"title":"Chapter 3417 - Third Heaven","paragraphs":["Within the grand hall of the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline.","“Lord Heavenly Marquis, Lord Chenhuo, it’s all thanks to the two of you that our Blood Ancestor’s bloodline was able to win in the hundred battle arena. We even took back the territory that originally belonged to our Blood Ancestor’s bloodline from the hands of the dark ancestor’s bloodline. I, Ancient Wheel, represent the entire blood ancestor’s bloodline here. Thank you both!","“Thank you!”","The other Principles Masters of the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline were also extremely grateful.","“Master Ancient Wheel, and everyone else, you’re too kind.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “As I said before, I’m the descendant of the Xue Bei, so I can barely be considered as a member of the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline. If the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline is in trouble, I’ll naturally help them if I can.”","“In any case, you have indeed helped the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline a great deal this time. It’s a pity that the Blood Ancestor has been trapped in the universe battlefield all these years. The Blood Ancestor’s bloodline is not in a good situation now. I’m afraid that there’s nothing I can repay you for now. I can only wait for the opportunity to repay you in the future,” Master Ancient Wheel continued.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could only shake his head and smile, then he said seriously, “After the battle on the hundred battle arena, the nether ancestor’s bloodline was also defeated by the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline. Moreover, I have already said that we are on the same side as the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline. With the presence of Chenhuo, I believe that the other sects of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect won’t dare to challenge the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline as recklessly as before.”","“Of course.” Master Ancient Wheel also smiled. “After this battle, Mr. Heavenly Marquis, you and Lord Chenhuo are all on the side of the Blood Ancestor lineage. In terms of top-tier combat power, even the Serene Ancestor lineage can only retreat when facing the Blood Ancestor lineage. How would the other factions dare to attack?","“Moreover, Lord Blood Ancestor is only trapped in the universe battlefield, not fallen. The other factions already have a lot of scruples!”","“After this battle, I dare say that the Blood Ancestor lineage will be able to regain its former dominance.”","“That’s good. Then I can leave in peace,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Mr. Marquis, are you leaving?” Master Ancient Wheel immediately looked over. “Yes, I came to the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect to meet your spirit ancestor, in addition to fulfilling Xue Bei’s task. Now that I’ve met the spirit ancestor and obtained the answer, I’ve also completed Xue Bei’s task. Naturally, I have to leave,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Seeing this, Master Ancient Wheel and the others felt a little regretful, but they could not persuade him to stay. “Mr. Heavenly Marquis, this is my message token. Since you’ve said yourself that you’re a member of the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline, if you encounter any trouble in the future, you can ask for it. The Blood Ancestor’s bloodline will do its best.” Master Ancient Wheel handed his message token to Jian Wushuang.","“Alright, if that happens, I won’t stand on ceremony.” Jian Wushuang smiled and took the token. Then, he left with Chenhuo.","Soon, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo left the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect.","Although he had solved a lot of trouble for the Blood Ancestor’s bloodline before he left and did not go against Xue Bei’s request, Jian Wushuang’s heart was still heavy.","After all, he did not get what he wanted from Spirit Ancestor.","If he wanted Spirit Ancestor to help him, he had to think of a way to kill the grandmaster of the blood clan!","This matter was very tricky for him now.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, where do you plan to go next?” Demon Master Chenhuo looked at him.","“To the third heaven,” Jian Wushuang said directly. He was now Jian Wushuang’s guard, so he naturally had to follow Jian Wushuang wherever he went.","“The Third Heaven? That’s the nest of the three Saint Realms, and it’s the place with the strongest power of the will of Heavenly Dao...” Demon Master Chenhuo frowned.","“Why? Are you afraid?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo with interest.","“You’re a saint, and you don’t even fear the three Saint Realms. I’m just one step away from the pinnacle of the six void realms, so why should I be afraid?” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“That’s it. Let’s go.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and soon left with Demon Master Chenhuo for the Third Heaven.","The core of the Divine Beginning Realm, the Third Heaven, was the Third Heaven and Earth!","The quality of the experts in the Third Heaven and Earth was getting higher and higher, regardless of whether it was the cultivation environment or the quality of the experts.","For example, in the First Heaven, Peak Saints and Invincible Saints could almost do whatever they wanted, and Principles Masters were super existences who could establish sects. For example, some of the most powerful forces in the First Heaven...many of them did not have Principles Masters now, and only had the heaven and earth secret realms.","However, in the Second Heaven, although Peak Saints and Invincible Saints were also top-tier experts, they were far from the level where they could do whatever they wanted. After all, there were quite a few Principles Masters in the Second Heaven.","For the major factions in the second heaven like Xiaoyao Mansion, Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, and Samsara Heaven Sect, which one of them did not have a dozen or so Principles Masters? Some of them were even as powerful as Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, and there were even six void realm experts...even the old Valley Master, who was feared by the Masters of the Saint Realm and the Masters of the Ruler Realm, existed.","It could be said that the level of cultivators at the Second Heaven was already very high.","However, the Second Heaven still could not be compared to the Third Heaven. In fact, the gap between them was even greater than usual.","The Third Heaven was where the core experts of the Divine Beginning Realm gathered. It was also where some of the top overlords of the Divine Beginning Realm gathered.","For example, the three supreme Saint Realms of the Divine Beginning Realm were in the Third Heaven.","In addition, there were the four great divine races and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, which had an extremely deep foundation. All of them were the top experts of the Divine Beginning Realm.","Just take the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, which was at the lowest level. Even though it was only at the lowest level in the Third Heaven, its strength and foundation were even stronger than the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley if it was not for that old Valley Master, as for the four divine clans and the three Saint Realms, they were even stronger.","This was the gathering place of experts and a paradise for them.","After coming out of the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect, Jian Wushuang teleported to the Third Heaven with Demon Master Chenhuo at the fastest speed.","As soon as he reached the Third Heaven and stepped into the Third Heaven, Jian Wushuang immediately had a special feeling.","This feeling did not come from the surrounding environment, but from the will.","“The power of the will of heaven!”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the sky above.","Although he knew that there was the power of the will of heaven in the First Heaven and the Second Heaven, his feeling was very vague. But when he reached the Third Heaven, the feeling was very clear.","Not only could he sense the existence of the will of the Heavenly Dao, the will of the Heavenly Dao could also sense him!"]},{"number":3418,"title":"Chapter 3418 - Heavenly Sword Marquis Arrived","paragraphs":["–","–","Just as Jian Wushuang had expected, when he clearly sensed the existence of the will of heaven, the will of heaven had also discovered his existence and immediately informed the three Saint Masters of the news.","In the primal chaos void at the core of the three Saint Realms, the consciousness avatars of the three Saint Masters had been condensed there, and their expressions were quite grave.","“That Heavenly Sword Marquis is really bold. He clearly knows that the Third Heaven is the base of our three great Saint Realms, and the power of the Heavenly Dao will here is the densest. As long as he steps into the Third Heaven, under the power of the Heavenly Dao will, he will have nowhere to hide. But even so, he still dares to come!” Destruction Saint Master growled. “He has nothing to fear.” Life and Death Saint Master’s expression was solemn, “In the battle on Saha Island, our three great Saint Realms couldn’t kill him even after setting up an inescapable net. After losing that battle, it’s almost impossible for us three Saint Realms to attack him again. Not to mention the fact that the Temporal Temple Master must have prepared a life-saving trump card for him, just his own technique of time-space teleportation is already giving us a headache.”","“The Heavenly Sword Marquis knows that the three great Saint Realms are already unable to do anything to him. That’s why he dares to come here unscrupulously.” Flame Saint Master’s voice was low. “There’s nothing we can do. With the strength of the three great Saint Realms, it’s indeed very difficult to kill him. Even if we attack now, it probably won’t have any effect. On the contrary, it will make the Heavenly Sword Marquis even more vigilant. At the same time, it will also stimulate him to cultivate even harder and increase his strength!”","“In other words, if we attack him now, it will only encourage him and temper him. To us, this is not worth the loss. It’s better for us to just sit quietly and do nothing and wait for the day to come.”","“You’re right. We shouldn’t change anything. Back when Xuan Yi rose up, our three great Saint Realms did the same thing. We let Xuan Yi grow on his own. We won’t provoke him anymore, and we won’t give him the chance to use us as an opponent to temper himself. When that day comes, won’t Xuan Yi die?” Destruction Saint Master’s voice was cold.","“Although Heavenly Sword Marquis has shown incredible talent, he might not be able to reach the level of his Master Xuan Yi when the day comes. Even if he does, he will still die!”","“In that case, it’s decided.”","The three masters of the Saint Realm quickly reached a consensus. Even though they knew that Jian Wushuang had stepped into the Third Heaven, they still did not plan to attack him.","After reaching this consensus, the three masters of the Saint Realm immediately gave orders to restrain the experts under the command of the three Saint Realms. During this period of time, if they encountered Jian Wushuang, they should avoid him as much as possible. If they encountered any mysterious experts...they should also try not to provoke him.","In short, the three masters of the Saint Realm’s intention was very clear. They did not want to provoke Jian Wushuang now. No matter where Jian Wushuang was, as long as Jian Wushuang did not take the initiative to attack the three Saint Realms, they would let him go, Jian Wushuang could do whatever he wanted.","Countless years ago, when Xuan Yi rose to power, the three Saint Realms tried to suppress him. However, when they realized that they could not suppress him and could not do anything to him, they made the same decision.","Jian Wushuang naturally did not know what the three Saint Realms were thinking. However, just as the three Saint Realms had expected, he was indeed fearless now.","He knew that with his life-saving skills and trump cards, the three Saint Realms would not be able to kill him unless a master-level expert came.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had obtained a detailed map of the star field of the Third Heaven from Temple Master Bai Xing.","“We are now in the Bone Flood Domain of the northwest 19 domains of the Third Heaven.” Jian Wushuang looked at the star map and had determined his location.","The Third Heaven was very big, much bigger than the First Heaven and Second Heaven, and there were countless experts.","There were two overlords in the northwestern region of the Third Heaven. They were the Illusionary Moon Sect and the Burning Heart Sect of the Eight Directions Celestial Sect, there were a total of 18 regions under the control of the two Celestial Sects, each of which occupied nine territories. The remaining region was sandwiched between the two Celestial Sects.","Bone Flood Domain was a domain under the control of the Illusory Moon Sect. Although it was only a domain, it was still extremely vast. There were countless forces and clans, big and small, with the Principles Masters among them, there were more than a dozen forces that had given birth to Principles Masters.","“The Illusory Moon Sect?”","Jian Wushuang looked at the domain marked with the words ‘Illusory Moon Sect’ on the star map in front of him, and his expression became strange.","He had interacted with the Illusory Moon Sect, one of the Eight Directions Celestial Sect.","In the Blood Wave Realm, he had fought with Di Hao, Qian Hongzi, Duan Lang, and others from the Destruction Saint Realm as soon as they entered the Blood Wave Realm. After that, the Destruction Saint Realm immediately retaliated against them. In the process, the Destruction Saint Realm had invited people from the Illusory Moon Sect to help them.","Although the Destruction Saint Realm did not succeed and the Illusory Moon Sect suffered a loss at Jian Wushuang’s hands, it was the Illusory Moon Sect who provoked him. However, nothing happened after that, now that Jian Wushuang had just arrived at the Third Heaven, it happened to be a territory controlled by the Illusory Moon Sect. What a coincidence.","“The Illusory Moon Sect joined hands with the Destruction Saint Realm in the Blood Wave Realm and tried to kill me. It’s obvious that the Illusory Moon Sect has always followed the lead of the three Saint Realms. The Illusory Moon Sect probably contributed a lot to the destruction of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. If there’s a chance, I’ll teach them a lesson,” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","After finding out where he was, Jian Wushuang looked at the other territories in the Third Heaven.","In the Third Heaven, all the overlords gathered. The three most powerful Saint Realms were in the center of the Third Heaven and controlled the three territories at the core of the Third Heaven.","As for the four divine races, although their territories were not as powerful as the three Saint Realms, they were not much weaker. Moreover, because the four divine races gathered there, there were many special races in the Divine Beginning Realm, this included the existence of many strange beasts and fierce beasts. Hence, that territory was also known as the Demon Realm!","The three great Saint Realms and the Demon Realm occupied the territories with the best cultivation conditions in the Third Heaven. The remaining territories were occupied by the Eight Directions Heavenly Sect and other large factions with similar foundations."]},{"number":3419,"title":"Chapter 3419 - Naturally Terminated Meridians","paragraphs":["“Miss Xiao’er has an inexplicable relationship with the Nine-tailed Clan, one of the four divine clans. If I’m not mistaken, Miss Xiao’er and my relatives in this life should be in the Demon Realm, but...” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","He had the communication token of Miss Xiao’er. He could have sent a message to Miss Xiao’er and asked her to tell him the exact location of his relatives, and then he would go there to meet her. However, Jian Wushuang...did not intend to do so.","It was not because he did not want to see his relatives in this life, but because he still had a lot of doubts about Miss Xiao’er.","Up until now, he still did not know Miss Xiao’er’s specific identity and background did not know what relationship she had with the Nine-tailed Clan, and did not know what her motive was. Even if he were to go over and see Miss Xiao’er...he would probably only be able to learn a little from Miss Xiao’er’s own mouth.","But who could guarantee that what Miss Xiao’er said was true?","Who could guarantee that Miss Xiao’er did not have any intention of scheming against him?","At the very least, Jian Wushuang could not completely trust Miss Xiao’er at the moment. He had always been on guard.","Since he had come to the Third Heaven, he naturally wanted to clear up all these doubts. However, these doubts could not be solely based on Miss Xiao’er’s words. Jian Wushuang had to find a way to clear them up himself.","“Although I know about the power of the will of Heaven, I’m afraid that only the three masters of the Saint Realm will know about my arrival in the Third Heaven. However, no one else should know about it, including Miss Xiao’er. In that case...” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, following that, the muscles on his face began to squirm. In the blink of an eye, his appearance had undergone an earth-shaking change.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what are you doing?” Demon Master Chenhuo could not help asking when he saw the change in Jian Wushuang.","“I don’t intend to expose my identity easily in the Third Heaven,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","He was very famous in the Divine Beginning Realm. Moreover, almost all the high-level experts in the Divine Beginning Realm had seen his fierce battle on the Saha Island, so they naturally remembered his appearance. As long as he showed up, he would be easily recognized, of course, he had to disguise himself.","After changing his appearance, Jian Wushuang immediately set off.","He did not dare to use teleportation to go to the Demon Realm. Instead, he slowly moved forward.","Half a day later...","“According to the instructions in the star field, there is a large city not far ahead. The prosperity of this city is among the top five in the entire Bone Flood Domain. Chenhuo, when we pass by the city later, we won’t be in a hurry to continue our journey. Let’s Find a tavern in the city and have a drink first,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Yes,” Demon Master Chenhuo answered, but he suddenly stopped in the void.","“What’s wrong?” Jian Wushuang immediately stopped and looked at Demon Master Chenhuo. He found that Demon Master Chenhuo was looking down at his feet with surprise in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang also followed Demon Master Chenhuo’s gaze and immediately saw a naked upper body on a mountain at the bottom, a young man with tanned skin was carrying a huge rock that weighed at least tens of thousands of pounds. He was running rapidly on the mountain.","The young man looked to be only 15 or 16 years old, but his facial features were very firm. His forehead and body were soaked in sweat, and he looked very tired, however, his eyes were unusually sharp and firm. The huge rock weighed tens of thousands of pounds on his body, but he was still running desperately.","Originally, it should have been easy for a cultivator in the Divine Beginning Realm to carry a huge rock weighing tens of thousands of pounds, or even effortless. However, this was also because the cultivator had the divine power backing him up, however, at this moment, there was no divine power fluctuation on the body of the young man who was running wildly with the huge rock on his shoulder.","Yes, there was no divine power fluctuation at all.","Even Jian Wushuang and the perception ability of the Demon Master Chenhuo could not sense any divine power from the body of the young man. This meant that the young man indeed did not have any divine power, he was purely relying on his physical body and his brute strength to run wildly against the giant rock.","It was obvious that he was crazily refining his body!","“That’s not right. He was born in the Divine Beginning Realm and in the Third Heaven, which is a perfect cultivation environment. Logically speaking, no matter how stupid he is, he should be able to easily condense divine power in his body and become a cultivator. But this little guy... how come he doesn’t have any divine power at this age?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“It’s a naturally terminated meridians,” Demon Master Chenhuo suddenly said.","“Naturally terminated meridians?” Jian Wushuang immediately looked over.","“This is a unique constitution born from heaven and earth. Once this Constitution is formed, all his meridians will be completely blocked. There won’t be any heaven and earth spiritual Qi entering his body. If he can’t even absorb the heaven and earth spiritual Qi, he naturally won’t be able to condense divine power and become a cultivator!” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Born from heaven and earth? Isn’t he a born trash?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","“Yes, he is a born trash. However, the reason why his meridians are blocked is not because he is not talented. On the contrary, it is because his talent is too high and he is restricted by heaven and earth. That’s why his meridians are formed,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Another restriction from heaven and earth?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. He had thought that the restrictions of the Heavenly Dao should only be applied to special life forms. He did not expect that there would be some inherent restrictions on some extremely talented people.","“Of course, although the Heavenly Dao has some restrictions on those with high aptitude, the restrictions are still far from being comparable to those of special life forms. Take the naturally terminated meridians as an example. Although they are unable to condense divine power or become cultivators, no matter how hard they try, they are unable to do so.”","“But if one day, by chance, he meets a powerful rule master who is willing to pay a great price to reconstruct your meridians, then his terminated meridians will be completely opened, and he will soar to the sky and become an insufferably proud son of heaven. Moreover, his talent and potential are so great that not many people in the Divine Beginning Realm can compare to him,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Chenhuo, you seem to know a lot about the naturally terminated meridians.” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo in surprise.","“Of course I do, because...I used to have naturally terminated meridians too!” Demon Master Chenhuo said seriously.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was surprised to hear this.","Demon Master Chenhuo used to have naturally terminated meridians too?"]},{"number":3420,"title":"Chapter 3420 - The Youth Zhao Mang","paragraphs":["—","–","“I was indeed born with no meridians. From the moment I was born, I was just like that little fellow beneath my feet. I was unable to condense divine power at all, so naturally, I was unable to truly become a cultivator. Because of this, my parents tried everything for me, but unfortunately, they were unable to improve. Later on, as I grew older and older, I also knew that the most important thing in this world was strength.","“Without power, I’m nothing. Even though I know I can’t gather divine power, I still try my best to cultivate. If I can’t cultivate divine power, then I’ll refine my body. I’ve worked so hard just to change everything one day...”","Demon Master Chenhuo’s face became misty.","Apparently, when he was young, he suffered a lot because of his naturally terminated meridians.","Otherwise, the fact that the Demon Master Chenhuo could dominate the Divine Beginning Realm meant that his situation had changed.","Pausing for a while...the Demon Master Chenhuo continued, “No matter who it is, as long as they are willing to persevere and work hard, they will be rewarded. My hard work has indeed been rewarded. Or perhaps, I was lucky enough to meet my master!","“My master was already one of the elders of the Amethyst Demon Sect at that time. He was also a Principles Master of the three void realms. He saw me and saw my naturally terminated meridians at a glance. Perhaps because of my hard work, he personally accepted me as his personal disciple and spent a great price to reconstruct my meridians. He also took me to the Amethyst Demon Sect. From then on, my fate changed dramatically.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang understood.","It was no wonder that Demon Master Chenhuo was so loyal to the Amethyst Demon Sect and his master. It turned out that his fate had changed only when he met his master.","If he had not met his master, he would not have achieved so much in the future.","“This little guy in front of me is also born with terminated meridians. Like me, he knew that he could not condense divine power, but he still refused to admit defeat and tried his best to temper his body. I see him now as if I saw myself in the past.” Demon Master Chenhuo kept staring at the young man below, his eyes were filled with melancholy.","“Hmm? This young man seems to be planning to go back,” Jian Wushuang suddenly said.","He had noticed that the young man who was carrying a giant rock and running between the mountains below had put down the giant rock on his body and was walking toward the nearby city.","“It seems that he lives in the city. He just went to this secluded place outside the city to cultivate,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile, “Chenhuo, since you said that he is the same as you were when you were young and he is going to Wu Xin City, why don’t you and I follow him?”","After a moment of hesitation, Demon Master Chenhuo nodded slightly and said, “Okay.”","Both of them set off, but they slowed down and followed the young man to the giant city.","They watched the young man enter the city and soon entered a huge courtyard.","“This courtyard seems to belong to a family. It seems that this little guy is a family disciple,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“It’s fine if he is the son of an ordinary cultivator. Even if he has naturally terminated meridians, it has nothing to do with other people. But a family disciple...the competition within the family is very fierce. This little guy doesn’t even have a trace of divine power. He must have suffered a lot growing up in this family environment,” Demon Master Chenhuo said with a frown.","“There’s a tavern across the street from this family. Let’s go there for a drink and ask about this little guy.” Jian Wushuang smiled and headed straight for the tavern.","When they arrived at the tavern, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo sat by the window. Through the window, they could see the huge courtyard across the street.","“My Lords, what can I do for you?” A black-clothed attendant appeared in front of Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo.","Jian Wushuang casually waved his hand and took out an interspatial ring. The interspatial ring did not recognize its owner. The black-clothed attendant scanned it with his consciousness and immediately sensed the dense accumulation of saint elixirs. There were at least 100,000 saint elixirs!","“I want to ask you some questions. Answer honestly. If I’m satisfied, the interspatial ring will be yours,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Please ask, my Lord. I’ll tell you everything I know.” The black-clothed attendant’s eyes were burning with passion.","He was just a waiter in the tavern. Although he had just reached the level of the immortal saint, he was at the bottom of the immortal saint ranks. 100,000 saint elixirs was already a huge fortune for him, of course, he would cherish the opportunity in front of him.","“Let me ask you, where is the huge courtyard across the street?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Sir, that is the mansion of the Zhao family, one of the five families in the Wu Xin City. Although the Zhao family is not a big family in the Bone Flood Domain, the Wu Xin City is one of the most prosperous cities in the Bone Flood Domain. To be able to occupy a place in the Wu Xin City, the Zhao family’s heritage is not weak. There are rumors that the Zhao family once had a Peak Saint, but I don’t know if they still have one now,” the black-clothed waiter said truthfully.","W","“Do you know of a young man in the Zhao family who is unable to condense divine power?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course, I know of him. Zhao Mang, the third young master of the Zhao family, is a good-for-nothing young master in the Wu Xin City. He is quite famous in the Wu Xin City,” the black-clothed attendant said with a smile.","“It is said that Zhao Mang has been unable to absorb spiritual Qi and condense divine power since he was born. He is already 16 years old, but he is still unable to become a cultivator. Many people in the Wu Xin City regard him as a joke.” “Even his father, the current patriarch of the Zhao family, has always regarded Zhao Mang as a disgrace. His two brothers have long drawn a line between them and have no contact with him. If it weren’t for the fact that he is more or less of the bloodline of the Zhao family and that his sister, the fourth young miss of the Zhao family, has been protecting him, Zhao Mang would have been expelled from the Zhao family.”","“Even his father and elder brother regard him as a disgrace?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“This is a family. In such a competitive environment like the Third Heaven, these people no longer have any kinship in their eyes, only strength and self-interest.” Demon Master Chenhuo’s face was cold. “However, there is still his sister in the Zhao family who stands up for him. It can’t be considered a complete betrayal.”","“Indeed, at least one person is sincere for his good.” Jian Wushuang also smiled."]},{"number":3421,"title":"Chapter 3421 - Saint Qingyan","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo asked some more questions about the Zhao family and Zhao Mang before handing the interspatial ring to the black-clothed attendant and sending him away.","“Chenhuo, according to what the attendant said, this little guy named Zhao Mang is indeed quite pitiful, and it’s very similar to what happened to you. It’s just that you met your master by chance, but this Zhao Mang... Chenhuo, don’t you want to learn from your master and save this little guy from suffering?” Jian Wushuang said casually.","He knew very well that given Chenhuo’s character, he was already moved by the fact that he was willing to sit here and listen to Zhao Mang.","Jian Wushuang guessed that Demon Master Chenhuo must have the same thoughts as his master, but he had yet to take action.","“There’s no rush. Let’s wait and see.” Demon Master Chenhuo picked up the wine bowl in his hand and drank a cup, then began to ponder. Jian Wushuang just smiled and did not say anything.","In the next few days, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo did not go anywhere. They just stayed in the tavern.","e",".","Although they stayed in the tavern, their soul perception had long spread out and could completely cover the entire city. Naturally, Zhao Mang’s every move could not escape their eyes, they watched Zhao Mang run out of the city every day and cultivate alone.","His cultivation method was very crude. Obviously, he did not have any expert’s guidance. It was purely a blind trial and error. For example, he had developed the cultivation method that could improve his body by carrying boulders and running between mountains, this cultivation method was very painful, but Zhao Mang gritted his teeth and persevered without the slightest hesitation.","“This little guy, at least in terms of perseverance, is very impressive.”","After a few days of observation, Jian Wushuang was also secretly amazed. As for the Demon Master Chenhuo, he did not make a statement.","Until the tenth day that Jian Wushuang and the Demon Master Chenhuo were in the Wu Xin City.","On this day, the Wu Xin City became lively. The reason for this was that a big figure had come to the Wu Xin City.","This ‘big shot’ was a core disciple of the Illusory Moon Sky Sect, and he had already reached the Peak Saint Realm, Qing Yan.","Saint Qing Yan was a very famous Peak Saint in the entire northwest nineteen regions. It was said that he was very close to becoming an Invincible Saint, and he was a core disciple of the Illusory Moon Sky Sect, his master was an elder of the Illusory Moon Sky Sect who had reached the void fourth stage. Whether it was his own strength or his background, it was enough to scare people to death in Wu Xin City.","For example, the five great families in Wu Xin City usually only came into contact with Peak Saints. However, there were not many of them whose strength could be compared to the Green Hate Saint, not to mention the Green Hate Saint’s background. One had to know...the Bone Flood Dragon Realm was within the control of the Illusionary Moon Sky Sect.","The Illusionary Moon Sky Sect was like the sky in the Bone Flood Dragon Realm. With a slight stomp of their feet, they could trample a large number of small families like the Zhao family to death.","Because of this, when Saint Qingyan came to Wu Xin City, the five family heads of Wu Xin City immediately welcomed him in person. But in the end, for some unknown reason, Saint Qingyan was welcomed into the Zhao family.","In the tavern, Jian Wushuang and demon master sinking fire were still drinking. As for the arrival of the so-called Saint Qingyan, it did not attract their attention at all.","Even his master, who had reached the fourth realm of the void realm, would not be taken seriously by Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo, let alone a mere Saint Qingyan.","However, while Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo were talking, Jian Wushuang’s expression suddenly changed.","“Chenhuo, the little guy you like seems to be in trouble, and I’m afraid it’s not a small trouble.” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo with interest.","Sure enough, Demon Master Chenhuo frowned slightly at this moment.","Their soul power had been covering the entire Zhao family. They had seen everything that happened in the Zhao family, including their every move.","At this moment, they saw a ‘special’ thing happening in the meeting hall of the Zhao family.","“Haha, Grandmaster Zhao, are you really willing to give your daughter to my maidservant?” Saint Qingyan, who had an evil expression on his face, let out an evil smile at this moment.","“Of course. It’s rare for Saint Qingyan to think highly of my daughter. It’s my fortune in my previous life to be able to be your maidservant.” The grandmaster of the Zhao clan also smiled and appeared to be extremely enthusiastic. Meanwhile, the elders of the Zhao clan...all of them agreed one after another, completely ignoring the terrified expression of the peerless beauty below.","This peerless beauty was the daughter of the head of the Zhao family, also known as Zhao Mang’s younger sister. Her name was Zhao Ling. In the Zhao family, only this Zhao Ling had always used her status and status to protect Zhao Mang, however, she did not expect that her father, the head of the Zhao family, would actually promise her on the spot to be the Saint Qingyan’s maidservant?","Servant? Furthermore, the other party was the notorious saint’s servant in the entire Bone Flood Dragon Realm. Zhao Ling felt as if she had fallen into Hell in an instant.","He looked at the head of the Zhao family with longing and those elders of the Zhao family. In the end, no one was willing to pay attention to her. Her heart was close to despair.","However, at this moment...","“Hold on!”","A low cry suddenly sounded within the large hall.","The expressions of the members of the Zhao clan, who were originally welcoming Saint Qingyan, changed. Immediately, many pairs of eyes looked towards the entrance of the large hall.","A young man had already crossed the door and was walking over.","This person was surprisingly Zhao Mang!","“Zhao Mang, what are you doing here? This place is also something that you can come to. Hurry up and scram!” Upon seeing Zhao Mang, the Zhao Clan’s grandmaster expression sunk as he immediately reprimanded.","“Humph, if I did not come, fourth younger sister’s life would have been completely ruined by you as a bargaining chip.” Zhao Mang’s eyes were cold. Although his body was not considered too tall, and he did not possess the slightest divine power aura...but at this moment, the coldness in his eyes was enough to cause the backs of everyone present to light up.","“Zhao Yong.” Zhao Mang raised his head and looked directly at the head of the Zhao family, who was also his father. “No matter how you want to curry favor with Saint Qingyan, it has nothing to do with me. You can do whatever you want, but you can not sacrifice fourth younger sister, and you can not hand fourth younger sister over to this bastard!”","“Beast?”","Zhao Mang’s words caused the expressions of all the members of the Zhao clan in the hall to change drastically.","Even the figure of the Zhao clan head trembled violently. His heart was greatly shocked.","As for Saint Qingyan, his expression had already turned dark and cold."]},{"number":3422,"title":"Chapter 3422 - Execution","paragraphs":["“Zhao Mang, what nonsense are you talking about? Hurry up and scram!” The head of the Zhao family was extremely shocked and furious.","He had finally found an opportunity to curry favor with this green hate saint and use it to benefit the Zhao family. Yet, at this moment, Zhao Mang actually came out to cause trouble and even directly cursed the Saint Qingyan and Beast in front of everyone, how could the patriarch of the Zhao family not be angry?","However, Zhao Mang coldly snorted, he said, “Isn’t it so? In the entire Bone Flood Dragon Realm, who doesn’t know that this Saint Qingyan is a beast with a human face? Just in the past hundred years, who knows how many women have died in his hands and were tortured to death by him. If fourth younger sister falls into his hands, I’m afraid her fate will not be any better.”","Zhao Mang’s words caused Zhao Ling, who was in the middle of the hall, to tremble.","It was because she had heard of Saint Qingyan’s infamous name that she was so frightened when the head of the Zhao family wanted to gift her to Saint Qingyan as a maidservant.","If it was anyone else, even if she was unwilling, she would not be so frightened.","“Head of the Zhao family, it seems that your Zhao family doesn’t really want to hand Zhao Ling over to me?” Saint Qingyan had a bewitching smile on her face as she looked at Zhao Yong, the head of the Zhao family.","Being looked at by Saint Qingyan, Zhao Yong’s heart trembled, however, he forced a smile and said, “Saint Qingyan, you’ve misunderstood. The entire Zhao family respects you greatly and is willing to gift Zhao Ling to you as a maidservant. As for this Zhao Mang that you see now, although he still has my bloodline, I’ve already severed my relationship with him. Furthermore, my Zhao family has already decided to completely expel him from the family. Therefore, his words can not represent my Zhao family at","all.”","“Is that so?” Saint Qingyan raised his eyebrows.","“Yes, yes.” A handsome man beside him echoed, “Lord Qingyan, it’s not just father. As his older brother, I haven’t acknowledged him as my younger brother for a long time. Our Zhao family doesn’t have a trash like him.”","This person was one of Zhao Mang’s two older brothers, the eldest son of the Zhao family.","“Right, right, he’s not a member of our Zhao family!”","“Hmph, although our Zhao family isn’t considered a big family, we still have some prestige in Wu Xin City. How could we allow a useless existence like him, who can’t even gather divine power, to exist? We should have chased him out of the family a long time ago.” “It’s fine if he’s a useless person, but he actually dares to speak shamelessly and insult the green hate saint. He really deserves to die. Grandmaster, I suggest that we directly execute Zhao Mang.”","Voices continuously sounded in the hall. No one was on Zhao Mang’s side at all. They all said that they wanted to expel Zhao Mang from the family. There were even a few who suggested that Zhao Mang be directly executed.","“Directly execute him?” Zhao Yong frowned slightly.","“Why? Is Grandmaster Zhao unwilling to part with him?” Saint Qingyan looked over at this moment.","Zhao Yong immediately reacted. At the same time, he also saw Saint Qingyan’s intention, immediately, he coldly said, “That’s right. This Zhao Mang has always been disrespectful toward his elders. Today, he even insulted Saint Qingyan in front of everyone. This is simply disrespectful. What is the point of keeping such a person in this world?","“He should be directly executed so that the hatred in Saint Qingyan’s heart can be appeased.”","Zhao Mang’s body trembled when he heard these words. However, he still clenched his teeth tightly and stared at Zhao Yong with his scarlet eyes. Zhao Ling also looked at Zhao Yong with a face full of disbelief.","As the saying goes, a vicious tiger would not eat its own son. However, for the sake of the clan’s interests, Zhao Yong had first planned to sacrifice his daughter, Zhao Ling, to curry favor with Saint Qingyan. Now, in order to dispel Saint Qingyan’s anger...he had actually made the decision to kill Zhao Mang!","“Grandmaster Zhao, since you want to execute him, I wonder who should do it?” Saint Qingyan casually asked.","“Although this Zhao Mang has offended you, Saint Qingyan, if you were to do it yourself, it would be a loss of status. Therefore, I won’t trouble you with this matter. Let me, the value of the Zhao Clan, do it myself.” Zhao Yong’s expression was cold, his gaze toward Zhao Mang no longer had a trace of kinship.","“Zhao Yong, you’re really ruthless!” Zhao Mang gritted his teeth, however, he then burst into laughter, “Haha, kill me If you want to. After all, I’m not of much use in this world. Being able to die by your hands can be considered as repaying the favor of your bloodline. Zhao Yong, remember this. From now on, I, Zhao Mang, will no longer owe you anything!”","“And all of you!”","Zhao Mang’s eyes were bloodshot. He looked as if he was madly looking at the powerful warriors of the Zhao family around him. These powerful warriors looked at him with extremely cold gazes.","“Haha, a group of heartless people. No wonder the Zhao family could only stay in this small Wu Xin City for so long. With you people around, I’m afraid that it won’t be long before the Zhao family will completely cease to exist!”","“Just wait. All of you just wait. This day will come sooner or later!”","“The Zhao family is destined to be destroyed. They are destined to walk on the path of strangers!”","“Zhao Mang, you still dare to boast shamelessly when death is at hand!” Zhao Yong shouted angrily.","“You shut up!” Zhao Mang coldly glanced at Zhao Yong. The coldness in his eyes caused even Zhao Yong, a rank seven True Saint, to tremble. “Zhao Yong, I only hate myself for being born into such a filthy family like the Zhao family. I hate myself for being too weak and unable to bring my fourth sister away safely. But let me tell you, even if I die and become a malicious ghost after I die, I will forever haunt the Zhao family and make them restless until the day I see you die and the day the Zhao family is completely destroyed!”","“Impudent!”","Zhao Yong’s gaze turned cold, and he did not allow Zhao Mang to continue speaking. His figure flashed, and he transformed into a sharp ray of light that charged toward Zhao Mang.","Everyone in the hall saw this ray of light that was filled with killing intent, and no one stepped forward to stop it.","As for Zhao Mang, he was still laughing maniacally, and it looked as if he was about to be shattered by that ray of light.","However, suddenly...","Buzz!","A wave of power erupted in the middle of the hall without any warning.","The figure that Zhao Yong was charging towards was immediately struck by this wave of power. In an instant, he was blasted away like a cannonball and smashed heavily into the wall of the hall. The wall instantly exploded, however, the entire room did not collapse.","This sudden scene caused everyone in the hall, including Saint Qingyan, to jump in shock. Soon after, they immediately noticed the two figures that appeared out of thin air in the middle of the hall.","One of these two figures was a young man in a golden robe, while the other was a sloppy old man in grey robes who stood beside the golden-robed man like a guard. After the two of them appeared in the middle of the hall...the casual sounds of conversation also slowly echoed in the hall."]},{"number":3423,"title":"Chapter 3423 - Was Like Squashing an Ant","paragraphs":["“You have good willpower, hard work, and a strong sense of loyalty. Unfortunately, you acted too rashly and recklessly,” Demon Master Chenhuo said calmly.","“After all, you are just a little boy who is not even 16 years old. Although you have grown up in such an environment and your temperament has improved, you have not really experienced much training. It is normal for you to act rashly and recklessly.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","The two of them had stayed in the dark and knew everything that happened in the hall of the Zhao family like the back of their hands.","They could see that Zhao Mang was indeed a little reckless.","Although he was helping his fourth sister, Zhao Ling, he had to act according to his ability. Even if he showed up, he could not change anything. On the contrary, he had put his life at risk.","Of course, Jian Wushuang could understand if he took into account the environment he had been in these years and the fact that he was only 16 years old.","After all, who did not have the time to be young and reckless?","Moreover, anyone would lose their sense of propriety when they saw that their only family member was about to be in danger.","Originally, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo did not show up at first. It was not until Zhao Yong personally tried to kill Zhao Mang that Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo showed up and repelled Zhao Yong.","However, although they understood what they said, the surrounding people were confused when they heard their conversation.","“Who are you?” An elder of the Zhao family immediately shouted.","“You’re good at the Zhao family’s meeting hall, and you even attacked our family master. How dare you!”","The experts of the Zhao family also glared at them angrily.","Zhao Yong slowly stood up and looked up at the two people in front of him. Although his expression was a bit ugly, he still tried hard to suppress his anger, he asked, “Who are you, and why are you here?”","“We just happened to pass by here. We saw that Zhao Mang seemed to be a good guy, so we came out.” Jian Wushuang smiled, then he continued, “Zhao Yong, the master of the Zhao family, right? Do you have a problem with us taking him away?” “What?” Zhao Yong’s face darkened, then he said in surprise and anger, “You don’t take the Zhao family seriously. Zhao Mang is a traitor. The Zhao family is planning to execute him on the spot. How could we let you take him away?”","“Traitor?”","“Haha, I didn’t see you being a traitor. I saw you as a father. You are a beast who would kill your son for your own benefit and the family’s.” Jian Wushuang sneered, “A man like you is not worthy of being a father!”","“Humph, I’m afraid it has nothing to do with you. But you are now in my family, and my family doesn’t welcome you. So you’d better leave quickly and mind your own business,” Zhao Yong said coldly.","Of course, although he wanted Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo to leave, he did not dare to force them too hard. Because he had already seen the strength of the two people in front of him in the fight just now.","Not only him, but Saint Qingyan also saw it.","“I’m Qingyan, a disciple of Blacklight Master of the Skymoon Sect. May I know your names?” Saint Qingyan was modest at first.","“Saint Qingyan, I know you. You’re quite famous in the Bone Flood Dragon Realm.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “As for us, you don’t know","us.”","“It’s easy to deal with you now that you know my words. This boy named Zhao Mang is not only disrespectful, but he also offended and even insulted me in front of everyone. Although I’m not as high and mighty as my master, I’m not someone who can be offended and insulted. Since he has already offended me, there’s only death. Don’t you agree?” Saint Qingyan still had a wicked smile on his face.","He believed that since he had revealed his identity and his master, Blacklight Master, Chu Mang would be more or less apprehensive. Chu Mang was not related to them at all, chu Mang was also a good-for-nothing who could not even condense divine power. These two mysterious experts should not have offended him for the sake of such a good-for-nothing.","However, it was clear that Saint Qingyan had underestimated Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo.","After hearing Saint Qingyan’s words, Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Saint Qingyan, no one can touch Zhao Mang now. As for you, I advise you to leave quietly.”","“Are you really not giving me face?” Saint Qingyan’s face darkened.","“Hahahaha!” Hearing this, he laughed, and his smile was full of mockery. “Saint Qingyan, you think too highly of yourself. Even if your master, the Blacklight Master, is here, he is not qualified for us to give you face. What are","you?”","“How dare you!” Saint Qingyan was furious.","“You’re the one who’s being presumptuous.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly turned cold. “Chenhuo, kill him!”","Demon Master Chenhuo narrowed his eyes slightly. Originally, he would have disdained to attack the saint. However, perhaps because of Zhao Mang, Demon Master Chenhuo attacked him directly.","With a casual wave of his hand, a majestic power that terrified everyone present, except Jian Wushuang, descended. This power was dozens or hundreds of times stronger than the one that had repelled Zhao Yong!","“Principles Master!” Saint Qingyan’s eyes widened, and his heart was filled with terror.","“No, please spare my life, my lords!”","“I’m a personal disciple of the Blacklight Master, and I’m from the Illusionary Moon Sect!”","Saint Qingyan let out a shrill cry and brought out the Blacklight Master and the Illusionary Moon Sect behind him again, trying to stop the Demon Master Chenhuo.","However, the Demon Master Chenhuo did not stop at all.","Buzz!","The power swept over and Saint Qingyan’s divine body was instantly shattered. He did not even have a chance to struggle and died in the blink of an eye.","It was as easy as crushing an ant!","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang just smiled coldly, “A mere Peak Saint, an ant-like thing, really thinks highly of himself. He even brought out the Blacklight Master and the Illusionary Moon Sect to threaten us? What a joke!”","Jian Wushuang really looked down on Saint Qingyan.","Not to mention Saint Qingyan, even the Blacklight Master behind him and the entire Illusionary Moon Sect were no longer in his eyes.","Saint Qingyan had deliberately brought out the Blacklight Master and the Illusory Moon Sect to threaten him before he died. This was indeed extremely laughable."]},{"number":3424,"title":"Chapter 3424 - In-Name Disciple","paragraphs":["Killing Saint Qingyan was a trivial matter to Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo, but in the eyes of the Zhao family, it was completely different. “Qingyan, Saint Qingyan is dead?” “These two killed Saint Qingyan?”","“It’s over, it’s over. Saint Qingyan actually died in our Zhao family. Our Zhao family is finished this time!”","The entire Zhao family had sunk into an unprecedented state of fear.","Their fear stemmed from the terrifying strength of the Demon Master Chenhuo, casually killing Saint Qingyan with a wave of his hand. This was clearly the Principles Master, the high and mighty Principles Master, he was the supreme existence that the entire Zhao family looked up to. On the other hand, they were afraid that Saint Qingyan had died in their Zhao family. The Zhao family would not be able to get away from the revenge of the Illusionary Moon Sect.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo did not care about this. After killing Saint Qingyan, Demon Master Chenhuo turned to look at Zhao Mang, who was already in shock.","“Young man, I’m sinking fire. If you’re willing, you’ll be my in-name disciple from today on,” Demon Master Chenhuo said directly.","“In-name disciple?” Zhao Mang was a little confused.","He knew very well that Demon Master Chenhuo could kill Saint Qingyan with a flip of his hand. This was clearly an existence at the level of a Principles Master. Such an existence was too far away and unattainable for him. But now...such an expert actually took the initiative to appear in front of him and wanted to take him in as an in-name disciple?","To him, this was simply like a pie falling from the sky. For a moment, he was struck by this pie until his head was dizzy.","“What, you aren’t willing?” Demon Master Chenhuo said indifferently.","“No, no.” Zhao Mang hurriedly shook his head. Following that, he took a deep breath, he said solemnly, “Senior, you may not know this, but my meridians have been blocked since birth. I have no way of absorbing the spiritual Qi of heaven and earth. Over the past 16 years, I have put in a lot of effort, but I have never been able to become a true cultivator...”","Before Zhao Mang could finish his sentence...the Demon Master Chenhuo interrupted him, “I have long seen through your physique. However, since I have made an appearance, I naturally have a way to improve your physique and allow you to become a true cultivator. Now, you only need to answer me, are you willing to become my in-name disciple?”","“Yes, of course, I am!”","Zhao Mang was overjoyed when he heard Demon Master Chenhuo say that he had a way to change his physique. He immediately knelt down and kowtowed three times to Demon Master Chenhuo respectfully, he shouted, “Disciple Zhao Mang greets master.”","“Get up.” Demon Master Chenhuo waved his hand and Zhao Mang could not help but stand up.","Jian wushuang, who was standing next to him, smiled and said, “Chenhuo, congratulations on taking in a good disciple.”","A smile appeared on his face. To be honest, after a few days of observation, he liked Zhao Mang’s temperament and personality very much. Apart from his lack of training and his lack of experience, he was very good in other aspects.","In addition, Zhao Mang was the same as him. He had naturally terminated his meridians, which was why the Demon Master wanted to take him in as a disciple. As for why he was only an in-name disciple and not a personal disciple...that was only to give Zhao Mang more training.","ore","However, the surrounding experts of the Zhao family could not figure it out.","“This mysterious expert in front of us actually took this trash, Zhao Mang, as his disciple?”","“This Zhao Mang is basically a born trash, but he actually lost to the Principles Master?”","“Could it be that this Principles Master is blind? There are so many disciples in our Zhao family, and any one of them is stronger than this Zhao Mang, but he actually chose Zhao Mang as his disciple?”","Everyone in the Zhao Clan was discussing.","Of course, they were all secretly communicating, so they naturally did not dare to say it out loud.","“Zhao Mang, you shouldn’t have any lingering feelings for the Zhao Clan right now, right?” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","Zhao Mang glanced at the surrounding Zhao Clan members, then said resolutely and decisively, “Not good.”","“That’s good. Make some preparations and leave with me now,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“There’s no need to prepare anything. I can leave at any time. However, before I leave, I have a presumptuous request,” said Zhao Mang respectfully. “Your presumptuous request is for your younger sister, right?” Demon Master Chenhuo glanced at Zhao Ling beside him.","“Yes.” Zhao Mang nodded solemnly. “Master, since I was born and was unable to cultivate, I was completely useless in the Zhao Clan. No one took me seriously. Only my fourth sister, Zhao Ling, was the only one who was concerned about the relationship between brother and sister. She has been very helpful to me over the years. If it weren’t for you, master, she would have almost become a sacrifice of the Zhao Clan. Therefore, I am somewhat worried about her.”","“I understand.” The Demon Master Chenhuo nodded slightly. “However, I still have some important matters to deal with when I come to the Third Heaven this time. It’s enough for me to bring you alone. I can’t bring another person with me. However, I can promise you that before I leave, I will give your sister a safe and sound life.”","“Thank you, master.” Zhao Mang was overjoyed. When Zhao Ling heard this, she revealed a look of pleasant surprise. She immediately knelt down and said respectfully, “Zhao Ling, thank you for your great kindness, senior.” “Get up. You child, you have a good heart. It’s a pity that the clan you belong to is a little too dirty.” The Demon Master Chenhuo said indifferently.","Zhao Ling stood up and stood beside Zhao Mang. Just like Zhao Mang, she no longer had any feelings for the people of the Zhao Clan around her. Her eyes were filled with coldness and disgust. Even her father, Zhao Yong, felt the same way.","“Alright, the two of you can leave with me now,” said the Demon Master Chenhuo as he prepared to leave with Zhao Mang and Zhao Ling.","However, at this moment...","“Wait!” A low shout suddenly rang out in the hall.","Everyone looked over when they heard the shout, only to find that Zhao Yong’s face was extremely ashen, he said with a trembling voice, “You killed Saint Qingyan. He is a core disciple of the Illusionary Moon Sect, and a personal disciple of the Blacklight Master. You can’t leave!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled.","However, Demon Master Chenhuo’s face turned cold. “Zhao Yong, do you know why I didn’t kill you just now?” Zhao Yong was stunned.","That’s right, the Demon Master Chenhuo had just attacked twice. The first time, he had forced him back, and the second time, he had killed Saint Qingyan instantly.","Since the Demon Master Chenhuo could kill Saint Qingyan instantly with a flip of his hand, he naturally could also kill him instantly. However, the Demon Master Chenhuo did not do so.","“The reason why I spared your life and allowed your Zhao family to remain in this world is that I want to wait for Zhao Mang to grow up before I return and resolve this matter by myself. However, if you dare to say another word now, I will completely wipe out your Zhao family right now!”"]},{"number":3425,"title":"Chapter 3425 - Came Knocking on the Door","paragraphs":["A cold voice filled with killing intent resounded throughout the hall.","The figures of the Zhao family members in the hall trembled. Zhao Yong’s expression also changed greatly. Only now did he remember that the person in front of him was a Principles Master, and his exact strength was unknown. The Zhao family could not afford to offend the Illusionary Moon Sect, but they could not afford to offend the Principles Master. If the person in front of them really attacked now, it would be very easy to destroy the Zhao family.","“Zhao Mang, let’s go.”","Demon Master Chenhuo did not bother to say anything more. He left the Zhao family with Jian Wushuang and Zhao Mang and Zhao Ling.","After they left, the entire Zhao family was in an uproar. The news that Saint Qingyan had died in the Zhao family spread quickly and caused a huge wave in the Wu Xin City.","Two days later, they were still in a tavern in the Wu Xin City. Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo sat at a table while Zhao Mang and Zhao Ling stood respectfully by the side.","“Wu Xin city hasn’t been very quiet these two days,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile. “It seems that your killing of Saint Qingyan has caused quite a stir.”","“Humph, it’s just killing an ant,” Demon Master Chenhuo said disdainfully.","“Master,” Zhao Mang said at this time, “After all, Saint Qingyan is a core disciple of the Illusionary Moon Sect. It’s said that his master, Blacklight Master, has great power in the sect. If master kills Saint Qingyan, Blacklight Master is likely to find us. Should we avoid him for now?”","Zhao Mang was worried for his master, Demon Master Chenhuo.","After all, he was born in Wu Xin City and was only sixteen years old. He did not have much experience. In his eyes, the Illusionary Moon Sect could be said to be an invincible existence.","Anyone would have to lower their heads in front of the Illusionary Moon Sect.","And although he could tell that his master was powerful, he did not want Chenhuo to clash with the Illusionary Moon Sect for his sake.","“Avoid? The Illusionary Moon Sect alone is not qualified to make me retreat,” Demon Master Chenhuo said indifferently. “Haha, little guy, you underestimate your master too much. Just wait and see. If the Illusionary Moon Sect doesn’t come, it’ll be fine. But if they come, it’ll be just as your master wants,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Zhao Mang frowned and was full of doubts. However, he saw that Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo did not care about it, so he did not say anything more.","Not long after, just as Zhao Mang said, the experts of the Illusory Moon Sect arrived. “My lords, they are right there!”","A low voice suddenly resounded in the sky. Then, several figures appeared in the void outside the tavern at a very fast speed.","Besides Zhao Yong, the master of the Zhao family, and several elders of the Zhao family, there were three other people who appeared.","There were two men and one woman. As soon as they appeared, three majestic auras swept out and covered the entire Wu Xin City in the blink of an eye.","“Principles Masters! And there are three of them!”","Countless cultivators in the Wu Xin City felt the three auras and were terrified from the bottom of their hearts.","The five families in the Wu Xin City were trembling in front of the three Principles Masters.","“It’s quite a big lineup. There are three Principles Masters, one at the peak of the third realm of the Void Realm, and two at the fourth realm of the Void Realm.” Jian Wushuang drank leisurely and said with a faint smile.","Hearing this, Zhao Mang looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","In their eyes, there were three Principles Masters, and they were all powerful Principles Masters. The three of them came together, but the young man beside his master, whose name he did not know at the moment, was so relaxed, he was actually so relaxed as if he did not take the other party seriously at all.","“What is this person’s identity? He doesn’t seem to be very strong, but he seems to be on equal footing with master?” Zhao Mang was curious in his heart.","In the void outside the tavern, the people of the Zhao family and the three Principles Masters stood side by side.","“My lords, after the death of Saint Qingyan, I have been keeping an eye on these people. They are now in this tavern,” Zhao Yong said.","“I already know,” A cold-looking middle-aged man dressed in a black robe said coldly. This cold-looking middle-aged man was the Master of Saint Qingyan, Blacklight Master.","As soon as he received the news of the Saint Qingyan’s death, he immediately invited two experts of the fourth level of the Void Realm from the Illusionary Moon Sect to rush over. Their purpose was naturally to avenge the Saint Qingyan. And from the looks of it, the murderer who killed Saint Qingyan...he was not in a hurry to leave, so he naturally had the chance to avenge his disciple.","“Those inside, get out!”","Blacklight Master’s voice was ice-cold, like thunder exploding in the sky. His voice carried a terrifying pressure that directly pressed down on the tavern.","The power of the Principles Master could shake heaven and earth when he was angry. If the pressure of Blacklight Master swept out and affected the ordinary cultivators in the tavern, none of them would be able to survive, fortunately, when the pressure of the Blacklight Master came, Demon Master Chenhuo had already attacked and blocked all the power, so that the pressure did not affect the other people in the tavern.","“Chenhuo, you killed him. I Won’t get involved in this matter.” Jian Wushuang still sat there and leisurely drank.","“Zhao Mang, you wait here,” Demon Master Chenhuo said and directly rushed out of the tavern.","“Master!” Zhao Mang was very nervous and worried.","But at this time, Jian Wushuang spoke again, “Little guy, don’t worry. The three people outside are nothing in front of your master.” “The three powerful Principles Masters are nothing?” Zhao Mang was stunned.","Outside the tavern, Demon Master Chenhuo had already appeared in front of Blacklight Master and the other two.","“It was you who killed my disciple?” Blacklight Master’s gaze was cold as he stared at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“I merely crushed an ant to death. As for whether he is your disciple, I don’t know.” Demon Master Chenhuo said coldly with his hands behind his back.","“Very good. Even though I don’t know who you are, since you have already agreed to kill my disciple, then pay with your life for my disciple.” Blacklight Master’s expression was gloomy. “The two of us, let’s attack together and kill him!”","“Alright.” The two void fourth level experts beside him nodded.","Although they could not see the actual strength of the Demon Master Chenhuo, it was clear that he was a Principles Master, and it was very likely that he was above the void third level to deal with such a Principles Master...they definitely could not kill him alone, but if the three of them worked together, there was a great chance."]},{"number":3426,"title":"Chapter 3426 - Defeated with a Flip of the Hand","paragraphs":["—","—","“Die!”","Blacklight Master roared, and the three Principles Masters instantly attacked.","The three terrifying auras instantly reached their limits. Blacklight Master took the lead, and his body was covered in endless darkness. It was as if his entire body had merged into the darkness, this endless darkness transformed into a gigantic dark beast that crazily devoured everything. The two people beside him were experts at the fourth level of the void, and they were even stronger than the Blacklight Master!","The eyes of the beautiful woman with snow-white long hair suddenly turned ghastly white. She gently raised her jade-like hand, and a devilish purple soft sword appeared in her hand. Then, she simply slashed out, the space was sliced apart like a piece of paper. In an instant, a chill swept through the sky, and the entire world turned into a world of ice and snow.","In this world of ice and snow, a cold sword shadow directly slashed toward the Demon Master Chenhuo.","The last person was originally over three meters tall, but at this moment, his body expanded once again, instantly reaching a height of thirty meters. The hair on his body expanded explosively as if he had turned into a true ancient fierce beast...the ancient ferocious beast roared and waved a huge axe in its hand.","The axe shadow descended majestically as if it could smash all obstacles in front of it into pieces.","The three Principles Masters did not make a move, but when they did, the terrifying power and movements caused the entire Wu Xin City to instantly sink into terror.","“Too strong, this is the Principles Master!”","“Three Principles Masters attacking at the same time. This scene is too terrifying.”","“I feel like this day is about to be defeated by these three Principles Masters. Even though I’m standing very far away, I still feel like I’m going to be killed at any moment. The Principles Masters are indeed extraordinary.” Countless cultivators were discussing in Wu Xin city.","Although there were many more experts in the Third Heaven than in other places, those who had reached the level of Principles Masters were still considered top-notch experts in the Third Heaven. and for a small Wu Xin City...the Principles Masters were legendary existences that were rarely seen on normal days.","But now, not only did they see the Principles Masters, but they also saw three law masters attacking at the same time. This was the first time for many cultivators in Wu Xin City to see such a scene.","“Haha, three Principles Masters attacking at the same time, and one of them is at the third level of the Void Realm and two at the fourth level of the Void Realm. With such a lineup...I want to see what this person can use to block it.” Zhao Yong stood at the edge of the battlefield, looking at the scene in front of him, his expression was extremely excited.","“Is this the true strength of the Principles Masters? They are too terrifying.” In the tavern, Zhao Mang and Zhao Ling were also amazed. Zhao Mang was more worried than amazed. “These three Principles Masters are so terrifying. can master withstand them?”","Zhao Mang was worried about Demon Master Chenhuo, but Jian Wushuang, who was sitting next to him, was still leisurely drinking wine. His expression did not change at all, as if the power of the three Principles Masters outside the tavern burst out in an instant, it was as if he did not care about them at all.","And it was true.","Not only did he not care about the three Principles Masters, but Demon Master Chenhuo was even more disdainful.","Sure enough, after the three Principles Masters made their moves, Demon Master Chenhuo also made his move directly.","There was no need for Demon Master Chenhuo to use his full strength to deal with a mere void third realm and two void fourth realm experts. He did not even use a divine weapon or true treasure. He just waved his hand and then flipped his palm. With a flip of his hand, a power that suffocated everyone present suddenly erupted.","Hong!","The world trembled, and this power instantly charged at the attacks of the three Principles Masters.","The expressions of the three Principles Masters changed drastically at this moment.","“This is...” Blacklight Master’s eyes widened.","“Be careful!” The beautiful woman with long snow-white hair immediately let out a fierce shout and immediately unleashed her strongest power.","However, even so...","Rumble ~~~","The three Principles Masters’ attacks instantly collapsed.","The darkness around the Blacklight Master was scattered and retreated. His entire body flew backward like a kite with a broken string. While he was retreating, his divine body had already begun to collapse.","The snow-white long-haired beauty had also disappeared. The ice and snow around her had also disappeared. Her sword shadow had also been destroyed. At the moment the power swept over, she immediately spat out blood, more than half of her divine body was instantly destroyed.","Finally, the middle-aged man who had turned into a thirty-meter-tall ancient beast let out crackling sounds. All the bones and muscles in his body exploded, and his divine body also quickly collapsed.","In the blink of an eye, two of the three Principles Masters’ divine bodies collapsed on the spot, and the other one’s body had also collapsed by more than half!","And this was completed with just a flip of the Demon Master’s hand.","Silence!","The entire world had fallen completely silent. It was completely silent!","In Wu Xin City, countless cultivators widened their eyes and watched everything with incredulous expressions.","In the tavern, Zhao Mang and Zhao Ling also had incredulous expressions.","Of the three Principles Masters of the Illusionary Moon Sect, one was at the third level of the Void Realm, while the other two were at the fourth level of the Void Realm. With such a powerful lineup attacking at the same time, the terrifying might earlier had frightened everyone, previously, everyone had been amazed at how powerful these three Principles Masters were.","However, in the blink of an eye, these three Principles Masters had been completely defeated.","They had been defeated with a flip of their hands, and it was a miserable defeat!","Everyone was shocked by this scene, and it took them a long time to calm down.","If there was one person who was not surprised by this scene, it was Jian Wushuang. He knew the strength of Demon Master Chenhuo very well. To be honest, the three Principles Masters of the Illusionary Moon Sect...even he did not care about them, let alone Demon Master Chenhuo.","In the void at the center of Wu Xin City, the three Principles Masters of the Illusionary Moon Sect had gathered together again.","The three of them stood side by side, staring at Demon Master Chenhuo with unprecedented fear and shock in their eyes.","“Just now, I lost more than 50% of my divine power!” Blacklight Master said in a low voice.","“I’m still fine. I only lost 30%,” the three-meter-tall middle-aged man said. “I lost a little more than 10%,” the snow-white long-haired beauty also said.","The three of them looked at each other. Huge waves had already been stirred up in their hearts.","With a flip of his hand, he had defeated the three of them and caused them to lose so much of their godly power. The other party’s strength..."]},{"number":3427,"title":"Chapter 3427 - Forgiveness","paragraphs":["“The sixth level of the Void!”","“It’s definitely the sixth level of the Void, a super expert comparable to the Sect Master!”","The snow-white long-haired woman and the three-meter-tall middle-aged man’s figures started to tremble slightly, the three-meter-tall middle-aged man directly shouted in a low voice, “Hei Yao, what that disciple of yours has done, he actually dared to provoke a super expert of the sixth level of the Void!”","“I, I don’t know either.” Master Hei Yao was also extremely shocked and furious at this moment. “Although I know that Qingyan is usually a little reckless, I still know his limits. Who knew that he actually provoked such an existence?”","Master Hei Yao also had some bitterness that he could not say at this moment.","When he learned that Saint Qingyan had been killed by Demon Master Chenhuo, he immediately invited these two fourth level of the Void to take revenge. Moreover, he was mentally prepared at the beginning because in his opinion, no matter what Saint Qingyan said...he was only a Saint. How strong could the experts he could provoke be? Therefore, the Blacklight Master’s previous guess was that the Demon Master Chenhuo was probably only at the void three realms, at most at the void four realms. If that was the case, with their lineup, it would be very difficult to kill the other party, however, they could teach the other party a lesson, which could be considered as giving him face back.","As for the void fifth level...the Blacklight Master had just thought about it.","He thought that if the Demon Master Chenhuo was an expert of the void fifth level, then the three of them might not be the other party’s match. However, the three of them were not too afraid when they joined forces. Moreover, the other party would more or less give some face to the Illusory Moon Sect, they would not continue fighting. In this way, they would only suffer a slight loss.","In short, regardless of whether it was experts at the third, fourth, or even the fifth level of the void, they were still within the scope of the three of them.","But now, the person in front of them had revealed his strength and actually reached the sixth level of the Void?","“Heavens, the sixth level of the void, how many are there in the entire Divine Beginning Realm? What ability does that disciple of mine have to actually provoke such a super expert?” The Blacklight Master roared in his heart.","“Even within my Illusory Moon Sect, there is only Sect Master alone among the six Void Realms’ super experts. Moreover, Sect Master has repeatedly warned us that we must not provoke experts at this level. This is because as long as we reach the six void realms, we will be able to do whatever we want within the Divine Beginning Realm. Even a Saint Realm Master might not be able to kill some of the slightly stronger six void realms!”","“That’s why even the three great Saint Realms wouldn’t dare to provoke such an expert. But now, we’ve actually provoked one?” The snow-white long-haired beauty’s expression was extremely solemn.","“It’s too late to talk about this now. Let’s first think about how to reconcile with the other party. If we really provoke such a great enemy for the sect this time, then we’ll very likely become the sect’s sinners,” The three-meter-tall middle-aged man said solemnly.","Offending a void six realm expert for no reason was something that even the three great Saint Realms were unwilling to do, let alone the Illusory Moon Sect.","The three of them were also very clear that offending a mysterious void six realm expert would be a great disaster for the Illusory Moon Sect.","There was no need for the other party to come knocking on their door. The other party only needed to encounter experts from the Illusory Moon Sect in the Divine Beginning Realm in the future and kill every single one of them. That would be a disaster for the Illusory Moon Sect...because the experts of the six states of the void could easily kill the Principles Masters of the Illusory Moon Sect.","On the other hand, on the Illusory Moon Sect’s side, even if they used the entire sect’s strength, they would not be able to kill a person of the six states of the void.","“Hei Yao, this matter was caused by your precious disciple. You can speak of this matter yourself,” the snow-white long-haired beauty said.","Master Hei Yao’s expression sank. Although he was extremely unwilling, he still forcefully suppressed the fear in his heart and slowly walked to the front of Demon Master Chenhuo.","“This...this lord.” The Blacklight Master opened his mouth and his voice was clearly filled with respect.","Once these words were said, the countless cultivators in Wu Xin City immediately went into an uproar. However, they could understand. Clearly, the three Principles Masters of the Illusionary Moon Sect had kicked an iron plate this time.","The person in front of them was an existence that the three of them and even the entire Illusionary Moon Sect could not afford to offend.","“What do you want to say?” Demon Master Chenhuo’s expression was cold as he looked down at Blacklight Master.","“Sir, this matter is purely because that disciple of mine did not know the immensity of heaven and earth. He actually offended you. He deserved to be killed by you, sir. The three of us did not know your strength, so we offended you just now. We hope that you can forgive us, sir.” Blacklight Master’s attitude was extremely low, he no longer had the airs of a law master. He had even asked for mercy from Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Mercy?” Demon Master Chenhuo snickered, “You weren’t acting like this just now. Now that you see that I’m strong and you can’t afford to offend me, you’re asking for mercy? If I didn’t have the strength, wouldn’t I have already been killed by the three of you?”","“This...” Blacklight Master’s expression changed, but he did not know what to say. They were indeed in the wrong in this matter.","“Sir.” The beautiful woman with snow-white long hair walked up, she said respectfully, “This matter is indeed the fault of the three of us. We have offended you. Sir, no matter how you want to punish the three of us, the three of us will admit it. However, sir, please don’t blame our Illusionary Moon Sect. After all, this matter is purely a private matter of my dark light. It has nothing to do with the Illusionary Moon Sect. The three of us only acted on behalf of ourselves this time. We didn’t represent the Illusionary Moon Sect.”","“Oh?” The Demon Master Chenhuo raised his eyebrows and glanced at the snow-white long-haired woman before he immediately smiled, “You are quite clever. Although you say that it has nothing to do with the Illusory Moon Sect, you are actually using the Illusory Moon Sect to make this old man have some misgivings. Moreover, you even said that the three of you are willing to accept the punishment. This can be considered giving this old man a way out. Haha, you are really very clever.”","The snow-white long-haired woman’s expression changed slightly. That was indeed what she meant, but she was directly pointed out by the Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Girl, don’t think of using the Illusionary Moon Sect behind you to threaten this old man. To be honest, a mere Illusionary Moon Sect is really nothing to this old man,” said the Demon Master Chenhuo directly.","“That is only natural. Lord’s strength is monstrous. Even if Lord Sect Master were to come personally, my Illusionary Moon Sect might not be a match for you. How would I dare to use the sect to threaten you?” Said the snow-white long-haired woman.","“Hehe, your words are quite pleasant to hear. In that case, this old man can ignore this matter. However, this old man has one condition.”"]},{"number":3428,"title":"Chapter 3428 - Settling Down","paragraphs":["“Please speak, my lord.” The snow-white long-haired woman said as she heaved a sigh of relief in her heart.","She was truly worried that the Demon Master Chenhuo in front of her was unwilling to reconcile. If that was the case, a powerful enemy at the sixth level of the Void could definitely give the Illusionary Moon Sect a headache.","But now, even though the Demon Master Chenhuo had conditions, as long as he was willing to reconcile, it was enough for them to rejoice.","“Zhao Mang, Zhao Ling, come out.” The Demon Master glanced at the tavern behind and shouted.","Zhao Mang and Zhao Ling, who were in the tavern, immediately walked out.","“Master.” Zhao Mang greeted respectfully.","“Master?” The snow-white long-haired woman, Master of Black Light, and the three-meter-tall middle-aged man all looked at Zhao Mang in astonishment.","They knew very well that the Demon Master was a terrifying existence, and his disciple should also be extremely formidable. However, when they looked over, it was obvious that Zhao Mang did not even have any divine power, he did not seem to be a cultivator.","“This little fellow is actually the disciple of this lord?” The snow-white long-haired woman exclaimed inwardly.","“He’s from the Illusionary Moon Sect,” Demon Master Chenhuo said, “my conditions are actually very simple. This is my disciple, and he will naturally follow me to roam the Third Heaven. However, this little fellow has a younger sister, and I can’t take the little girl beside him with me. Therefore, I want to leave this little girl in your Illusionary Moon Sect.” “This condition should be very easy for all of you to fulfill.” “Lord, don’t worry. My Illusionary Moon Sect will definitely take good care of this girl. Furthermore, if she doesn’t mind, I can take her in as a personal disciple and do my best to nurture her,” said the snow-white-haired woman immediately.","She had thought that the conditions set by the Demon Master Chenhuo would be harsh, but she never expected that it would only be for them to take in a girl doll. It was indeed a little too easy for them.","“Take in a disciple?” The Demon Master Chenhuo’s expression changed. “If you think that this girl doll’s aptitude is alright, you can take her in as a disciple. You can also let her join the Illusionary Moon Sect. However, there is one thing that you have to take good care of her. After a period of time, when my disciple’s strength grows, he will personally head to your Illusionary Moon Sect.”","“Yes.” The snow-white-haired woman immediately agreed. “Zhao Mang, are you and your sister satisfied with your master’s arrangements?” Demon Master Chenhuo looked over.","“Of course I’m satisfied.” Zhao Mang nodded repeatedly. At the same time, he looked over at Zhao Ling.","“Many thanks, senior.” Zhao Ling immediately knelt down and kowtowed to Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Get up.” Demon Master Chenhuo waved his hand. “In that case, you can follow the three people from the Illusionary Moon Sect.”","Zhao Ling stood up and immediately rushed towards the snow-white-haired woman. “Zhao Ling greets senior.”","“What an obedient little girl. Furthermore, her aptitude seems pretty good.” The snow-white-haired woman looked at Zhao Ling and revealed a smile. “My name is Bi Lu. From today onward, you will stay with me in the Illusionary Moon Sect. After returning to the sect, I will personally arrange some tests for you. If you can pass the tests, I will accept you as my personal disciple. And even if you can’t pass the tests, I will let you cultivate properly in the Illusionary Moon Sect. I won’t let anyone bully you.”","“Yes.” Zhao Ling nodded obediently.","“Sir, the three of us will take our leave first.” The snow-white long-haired woman bowed to the Demon Master Chenhuo before turning around and leaving with the Blacklight Master and the three-meter-tall middle-aged man.","After the three Principles Masters of the Illusionary Moon Sect left, Wu Xin City finally calmed down.","Demon Master Chenhuo narrowed his eyes and looked in one direction. Zhao Yong and the others from the Zhao family were trembling. When they noticed the gaze of the Demon Master Chenhuo, their hearts trembled, without any hesitation, they knelt down.","“Spare me, my lord, spare me!”","Zhao Yong screamed shrilly. He did not put on any airs as the head of the family.","Seeing this scene, Demon Master Chenhuo felt disdain in his heart. “With just you guys, you don’t have the right to make this old man personally take action. Furthermore, this old man has already said that I will leave your Zhao family to my disciple to take care of it himself. Naturally, I will keep my word.”","With that, Demon Master Chenhuo returned to the tavern.","Zhao Mang glanced at Zhao Yong and the others with disgust and followed Demon Master Chenhuo back to the tavern.","In the tavern...","Jian Wushuang looked at Zhao Mang, he said, “I’ve just checked the information on Master Jade Deer. She’s a good person, has always been good to her disciple, and is very protective of her shortcomings. Your sister followed her to the Illusionary Moon Sect. I don’t think she’ll suffer any grievances in the future.”","“Besides, your sister was entrusted to the Illusionary Moon Sect by Chenhuo. Even if the Illusionary Moon Sect doesn’t treat her like an ancestor, at least no one dares to bully her. So, you can leave with us without worry.”","“Okay.” Zhao Mang nodded heavily and felt relieved","“No rush.” Demon Master Chenhuo waved his hand. “Although I have accepted this little guy as my disciple, his naturally terminated meridians are still there. I have to find a place to solve his naturally terminated meridians first, otherwise, he will still be unable to cultivate.”","“Chenhuo, you were also born with naturally terminated meridians, so you know this kind of physique the best. With your means, it should be very easy for you to solve this little guy’s problem, right?” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“Easy?” Demon Master Chenhuo shook his head.","“Although I know how to solve his naturally terminated meridians, it’s not easy to complete this step, but the price to pay is also very high. In order to solve my naturally terminated meridians, my master went through a lot of trouble. Not only did he use a lot of resources from the Amethyst Demon Sect, but he also invited several Principles Masters to help him. Although I’m much stronger than my master now and have a lot of resources at hand, it’s still not easy to solve this little guy’s naturally terminated meridians.","“After all, the naturally terminated meridians are destined by the heavens and are restricted by the heavenly axiom. It can be said that the heavenly axiom has restricted the little guy’s fate. Now, I’m going to change his terminated meridians, which means that I’m going to change his fate!”","“Change his fate?”","“Change his fate?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then asked, “What do you want to do? Is there anything I can help you with?”","“I can complete the heaven-defying fate-changing process by myself, but to complete it, I need a large number of natural treasures, some of which are extremely precious. I can use almost all of them, but I’m missing one,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","“What is it?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Purple void divine water,” said Demon Master Chenhuo."]},{"number":3429,"title":"Chapter 3429 - Nine Volumes of Annihilation","paragraphs":["“Purple void divine water? What’s that? Is it very precious?” Jian Wushuang asked with a frown.","In his opinion, Demon Master Chenhuo was a genius expert left behind by the Amethyst Demon Sect. All the treasures accumulated over the years in the sect were in his hands, including a large number of natural treasures, as long as there were high-end treasures in the Divine Beginning Realm, Demon Master Chenhuo should have all of them.","If even Demon Master Chenhuo could not come up with a treasure, it would be the rarest and most difficult to obtain in the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","“No, the purple void divine water is not an overly precious treasure,” Demon Master Chenhuo said calmly, “Although the purple void divine water is not very precious, it is one of the most important treasures needed to help this little guy rebuild his meridians and change his fate. Moreover, the amount required is very huge, a total of 100 million drops!”","“100 million drops?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Although he did not know about the purple void divine water, even if it was just ordinary river water, 100 million drops together could become a river.","“It’s because I need too much that I don’t have so much,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Since the purple void divine water is not expensive, it’s not difficult to get 100 million drops. Just leave it to me,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Well, with your power in the Temporal Temple, it’s indeed easy for you to get 100 million drops of purple void divine water,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","However, what Demon Master Chenhuo did not know was that Jian Wushuang did not want to get so much purple void divine water from the Temporal Temple. Instead, he immediately thought of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance!","The Heaven-cleaving Alliance was the number one alliance among the three Freedom Alliances in the Divine Beginning Realm. Its power spread across every corner of the Divine Beginning Realm. Naturally, there were many secret nests of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance in the Third Heaven.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang brought Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang to one of the secret lairs of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance in the northwest nineteen regions.","“Chenhuo, wait for me here with this little guy. I’ll get the purple void divine water for you,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Demon Master Chenhuo nodded slightly.","Jian Wushuang entered the secret lairs alone. Jian Wushuang had not been to the secret lair of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance for a long time. He should still be a heaven-level member, although his strength...had long surpassed heaven-level or even emperor-level members.","n","After entering the secret lair, Jian Wushuang went straight to the treasure pavilion. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, long time no see.” An indifferent voice sounded.","“Sir Tian Suo, long time no see.” Jian Wushuang also smiled at the figure who appeared in front of him.","The treasure spirit of the treasure pavilion, Tian Suo, could be found in any treasure pavilion of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance.","“What do you need?” Tian Suo asked directly.","“Purple void divine water,” Jian Wushuang said.","“One drop of purple void divine water, 1,000 saint elixirs. How much do you want?” Tian Suo was still calm. “100 million drops!” Jian Wushuang said. “That much?” Tian Suo did not look surprised and said directly, “Purple void divine water can only be exchanged for 100,000 drops with the authority of a heaven-grade member, but...”","“But what?” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“With your authority, you can exchange for 100 million drops with so many saint elixirs,” Tian Suo said.","“Why?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“You may not know this, but your authority in the Heaven-cleaving Alliance has been upgraded to the original level,” Tian Suo said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","He clearly remembered that he was only a heaven-level member before. When did he become an original level member of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance?","As far as he knew, an original level member was the true core of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance. His authority was also very high. He did not even go to the core level test and did not even complete the emperor level test, how did he become an original level member all of a sudden?","as","“Your authority was raised by the three palace masters of the Heaven-cleaving Palace,” Tian Suo said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was speechless.","Although he had never met the three Palace Masters of the Heaven-cleaving Palace, they had given him a lot of benefits. From the beginning, they let him enter the Heaven-cleaving Mystic Realm, and later, they gave him life-saving items, and now, without his knowledge, he had upgraded his authority in the Heaven-cleaving Alliance to the primitive level.","“The three Palace Masters are too nice to me. What are their intentions?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled, but he did not think too much about","it.","After all, he had not really dealt with the three Palace Masters. When he did, he would naturally know their intentions.","“Since I have the authority to exchange for it, it’s easy. One thousand saint elixirs and one drop of purple void divine water, one hundred million drops would be one hundred billion saint elixirs. However, I don’t have so many saint elixirs, so I’ll use divine power instead,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Tian Suo nodded. “What else do you need?” “I also need something that can be very helpful for comprehending the destruction principles,” Jian Wushuang said.","“I have too many treasures that can help you to comprehend the destruction principles. However, based on your current authority and strength, I can eliminate most of the lower-level treasures for you and make a list of the treasures that are of high level and can be of real use to you,” Tian Suo said, with a wave of his hand, a dense information appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Although this list had been selected by the heaven shuttle and 99% of the treasures had been eliminated, there were still tens of thousands of treasures left, which were very helpful for comprehending the destruction principles, of course, the exchange price and authority were also very high, and many ordinary heaven and emperor level members could not exchange for them.","Jian Wushuang carefully read the list.","After looking through it for more than half a day, Jian Wushuang finally made a decision. “Sir Tian Suo, I want to exchange for the complete nine volumes of the firmament extermination and the most advanced Blizzard Divine Palace, as well as 100 destruction divine fruits and 10 heaven-exterminating elixirs,” Jian Wushuang said. “Oh?” Tian Suo’s expression changed. “That’s generous. Let’s not talk about the Blizzard Divine Palace, destruction divine fruits and heaven-exterminating elixirs, but the nine volumes of the firmament extermination were left by an expert at the peak of the sixth void realm in the Divine Beginning Realm who had studied the destruction principles to the extreme. It contains his life-long comprehension and the use of the destruction principles. Every bit of it is extremely complete. It can be said that the entire destruction principles is included in it!” “This can be said to be the best supplementary treasure for comprehending the principles of destruction. In the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, many people who comprehend the principles of destruction want to exchange for the nine volumes of the obliteration azure. However, most of them only exchange for one volume at a time. Yet, you want to exchange for all nine volumes at once?”"]},{"number":3430,"title":"Chapter 3430 - Changing Fate","paragraphs":["“Lord Tenshou, just tell me how much divine power you need to exchange for these items,” Jian Wushuang said.","WA","He knew that the items he had exchanged for were of great value. For example, if he had only exchanged for the first few volumes of the nine books, it would not have been a big deal. However, if he had exchanged for all nine volumes...the price he would have to pay...it would probably be much higher than the entire wealth of an ordinary Principles Master.","However, the nine volumes of obliteration were indeed very useful to him.","It must be noted that he had already mastered two rules and fused them together. The next step was naturally to find a way to master the third principle.","Jian Wushuang had already planned to comprehend the third principle by comprehending the destruction principles. After all, he had the highest affinity for the destruction principles, which was no weaker than his affinity for the space-time principles.","The speed of comprehending the destruction principles would be much slower if he just blindly comprehended it. The nine volumes of Vastheaven included everything from the entry to perfect mastery of the destruction principles to the use of it after perfect mastery, it was extremely detailed, which was indeed very useful to him.","As for the Blizzard Divine Palace, it was a test method to test the destruction principles.","The Blizzard Divine Palace was divided into 33 levels, which corresponded to different levels of comprehension of the destruction principles. Jian Wushuang also wanted to go to the Blizzard Divine Palace to temper himself while comprehending the destruction principles, it would promote his comprehension.","Although the Blizzard Divine Palace was not as expensive as the nine volumes of Vastheaven extermination, it was almost as valuable as a supreme treasure.","The last two divine destruction fruits and the heaven-destroying elixir were supplementary treasures that were very helpful in comprehending the destruction principles. With the help of the divine destruction fruits and the heaven-destroying elixir, Jian Wushuang would be able to comprehend the principles more quickly.","It could be said that these things were what he needed.","As long as they were really useful, Jian Wushuang would not care about the value of these treasures.","“I’ve calculated it for you. The treasures you want together are worth 30,000 drops of divine power. If you add the 100 million drops of purple void divine water you asked for, it’s a total of 32,000 drops of divine power,” Tian Suo said.","“32,000 drops?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. As far as he knew, the average Principles Master of the three void realms only had about 10,000 drops of divine power. 32,000 drops of divine power...that was more than the total wealth of many experts of the void three realms.","ause","“The reason why the price is so high is because the value of the nine exterminating cang scrolls is too high. In total, the treasure pavilion usually exchanges 25,000 drops of divine power for the nine scrolls. However, because you are an original level member of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance, I gave you a discount. It’s only 20,000 drops of divine power,” Tian Suo said. “No problem. This is 32,000 drops of divine power. You can count it.” Jian Wushuang took out an interspatial ring. Tian Suo glanced at it and nodded slightly. “Not bad, Heavenly Sword Marquis. I didn’t know you were so rich.” “Eh.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Although he was only an Immortal Saint and could not condense divine power, his strength was far above that of ordinary Principles Masters. Moreover, during the battle on Saha Island, he had been blessed by the Blood Wave Realm, he had killed several Principles Masters with one sword attack. Among them, the nether master and the four divine flame guards were experts at the peak of the void five realms.","Jian Wushuang had killed them with one sword attack. Naturally, he had also taken their interspatial rings, so his value had skyrocketed.","32,000 drops of divine power was not a big number for him at the moment.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, just wait here. The Heaven-cleaving Alliance will send you what you want in a few days,” Tian Suo said.","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Jian Wushuang waited in the secret lair. Only three days later, someone from the Heaven-cleaving Alliance handed him the items he had exchanged for.","After the items were in his hands, Jian Wushuang met up with Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang.","“Chenhuo, this is the purple void divine water you need. Take a look and see if it’s enough.” Jian Wushuang handed the interspatial ring filled with purple void divine water to Demon Master Chenhuo.","Demon Master Chenhuo took it and glanced at it before nodding. “It’s enough. With this purple void divine water, I can definitely help this little guy change his fate. But before that, I have to find a quiet place. After all, it takes a long time to complete the change. Even if I do it myself, it will take at least three months.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you’d better protect us. Don’t let anyone disturb us.”","“No problem,” Jian Wushuang agreed readily.","Three days later... “This is it.”","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo stopped in a remote mountain range.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, I’ll change this little guy’s fate here. Although this place is remote, during the process of changing my fate, people will inevitably be attracted to me. I’ll have to rely on you to keep them out,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Chenhuo, from your words, it seems that many people will be attracted to you once you change your fate?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo in surprise.","“You’ll find out later. However, there shouldn’t be any great experts around this territory. With your strength, you can handle everything,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","“I’ll try my best.” Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes. “Zhao Mang, come with me.” Demon Master Chenhuo led Zhao Mang into the depths of the mountains and immediately opened a cave mansion, ready to change his fate.","As for Jian Wushuang, he sat down in a nearby mountain and took out a black scroll.","This black scroll was the first scroll of the nine exterminating firmament scrolls!","Although Jian Wushuang had a high affinity for the destruction principles, which was no less than his affinity for the space-time principles, he had not really entered the rudiments of the destruction principles because he had not tried to comprehend them before, now that he wanted to comprehend them, he naturally had to start from the most basic level.","The first scroll he took out was also aimed at the rudiments of the destruction principles from the beginning to the end.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the mountain and soon began to comprehend the principles of destruction. Gradually, a large amount of power of the principles of destruction began to gather around him.","Time passed. For the first ten days, the mountain was very quiet. Jian Wushuang was still meditating on the principles of destruction. Deep in the mountain, Demon Master Chenhuo had already begun to help Zhao Mang change his fate, but at first, there was no movement, and the surrounding territory was very quiet. No other experts passed by.","Until a month after the beginning of the change, there was finally a change."]},{"number":3431,"title":"Chapter 3431 - The Power of the Will of the Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["Buzz — the world shook violently.","Then, a strange wave spread out in the cave mansion where Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang were.","“Is this wave fate?” Jian Wushuang stopped comprehending the destruction principles and looked at the cave mansion.","The strange fluctuation swept in all directions, causing the entire heaven and earth to change. At the same time, vast power of the will began to condense at an astonishing speed in the sky.","“Oh, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao?” Jian Wushuang raised his head and sensed the existence of the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao from the void. Moreover, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao continued to condense and increase at an astonishing speed.","“It seems that the power of the will of heaven is also unacceptable to the will of heaven. If Chenhuo wants to successfully change the fate of the little guy, he has to face the power of the will of heaven. However, this is the Third Heaven after all, where the power of the will of heaven is the strongest.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","He could sense that the power of the will of heaven was rapidly condensing. Soon, the power of the will of heaven had already surpassed the Principles Master of the four Void Realms, and it was still increasing.","After a while, the power of the will of heaven had surpassed the five void realms and reached the level of the six void realms.","At this point, the power of the will of heaven finally stopped condensing.","“It’s equivalent to the level of the six void realms...tsk-tsk, the power of the will of heaven in the Third Heaven is indeed not weak.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, but he did not care at all.","When the power of the will was condensed, it naturally sensed his existence. However, the power of the will did not have any intention of attacking Jian Wushuang, instead, it concentrated all its power on the heads of Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang.","When the power of the will of heaven was condensed to the maximum, boom!","The world-destroying divine thunder suddenly descended.","The world-annihilating divine thunder carried the full power of the will of the Heavenly Dao. It instantly streaked across the sky and struck toward the cave abode where Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang were.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang did not react at all.","He knew very well that although the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao represented the will of the Heavenly Dao, it was not omnipotent in the Divine Beginning Realm. Instead, it had to abide by certain principles, which also determined the power it could gather, now that Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang were defying the heavens and changing their fate, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao could only be mobilized as much as the power of the six void realms in the Third Heaven.","However, if Jian Wushuang interfered at this time, it would give the will of the Heavenly Dao a chance to mobilize more power than the power of the six void realms. The loss outweighed the gain.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang also knew that the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao, which was comparable to the power of the six void realms, was far from enough to deal with Demon Master Chenhuo.","Sure enough, the Demon Master of the cave mansion attacked directly. A majestic power suddenly rose, which was extremely powerful and instantly destroyed the world-destroying divine thunder that fell from the sky, it did not affect the power of the divine thunder in the cave mansion at all.","The first world-destroying divine thunder was directly destroyed, but the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao did not stop at all.","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","One after another, incomparably huge bolts of world-destroying divine lightning descended.","Any one of these world-destroying divine lightning was comparable to an attack of a void sixth realm expert. However, at this moment, the densely packed world-destroying divine lightning was continuously attacking. If it were to meet with a weaker Principles Master...it would be very easy for it to be shattered into pieces. Even if they were similarly experts of the void sixth realm, they had to simultaneously block these divine lightning and destroy all of them at the same time, not allowing the divine lightning to have even the slightest bit of power within the cave abode...he was afraid that he would not be able to do so.","However, Demon Master Chenhuo had already reached the peak of the six realms of the void and was only one step away from the peak. His strength far exceeded that of an ordinary expert of the six realms of the void. If he wanted to destroy all the divine thunder...he could do it.","“Tsk, tsk. The power that the will of heaven can mobilize in the Third Heaven is indeed extraordinary.” Jian Wushuang was secretly amazed.","In fact, Demon Master Chenhuo could have brought Zhao Mang to the Second Heaven or changed his fate in the First Heaven. In that case, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao would not be as powerful as it was now, it would have been easier for him to resist.","For example, Demon Master Chenhuo’s master had changed his fate in the Amethyst Demon Sect in the Second Heaven. At that time, not only his master had helped him, but also the many strong warriors of the Amethyst Demon Sect and the sect-protecting formation, even though the Heavenly Dao’s will had mobilized an extremely powerful force, it was unable to annihilate the Demon Master Chenhuo in the","end.","But now, the Demon Master Chenhuo alone was enough to withstand the power of the Heavenly Dao’s will.","In the sky above, the Heavenly Dao’s will continued to pour down world-destroying divine thunder and bombard the cave abodes below. Perhaps the Heavenly Dao’s will had already understood that it was unable to do anything to the Demon Master Chenhuo, but to the Heavenly Dao’s will...even if it only affected the Demon Master Chenhuo to a certain extent, making it impossible for him to continue changing Zhao Mang’s fate, it was already worth it.","Unfortunately, no matter how much the will of the Heavenly Dao attacked, it was easily blocked by the Demon Master Chenhuo. The heaven-defying change of fate in the cave abode did not stop at all and continued.","In a flash, two hours had passed. The power of the will of the Heavenly Dao had finally been exhausted, and the will of the Heavenly Dao could only retreat helplessly.","With the departure of the will of the Heavenly Dao, the world became calm again.","“Is it over?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, but then he shook his head. “No, Chenhuo said that it would take at least three months to complete the heaven-defying change of fate. It’s only been one month.”","As expected, not long after the will of the Heavenly Dao retreated, the earth suddenly began to rumble, and the entire sky seemed to tremble.","A unique aura suddenly spread out from the cave mansion in the middle of the mountain range, and it swept in all directions in an instant.","This scene was very similar to the birth of some special treasures.","Moreover, the noise was shocking.","“This noise is really big. Within the range of my soul perception, the whole world is shaking crazily. Such a huge noise...no wonder Chenhuo said before that during the process of changing fate, many experts will be attracted.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","He knew very well that the commotion was very shocking. The scene was like the birth of a treasure, so it naturally attracted attention.","Although they had chosen a secluded place to change fate, such a huge commotion could still attract some of the experts nearby. For these experts, Demon Master Chenhuo probably did not have time to deal with them, naturally, he could only leave it to Jian Wushuang, who was guarding the side."]},{"number":3432,"title":"Chapter 3432 - Yu Hua Sect","paragraphs":["The Third Heaven, the Dragon Fire Domain of the 19 northwest territories!","This Dragon Fire Domain was the most unique existence among the 19 northwest territories. This was because the other 18 territories were under the control of the Illusionary Moon Sky Sect and the Burning Heart Sky Sect.","Only this Dragon Fire Domain was not under the control of the two great sky sects. However, it was sandwiched between the territories of the two great sky sects. The situation was naturally quite delicate.","However, it was also because the Dragon Fire Domain was not under the control of the two great celestial sects that many experts from the surrounding territories had come here. Some of them had established their own forces and sects here, therefore, there were many more experts in the Dragon Fire Domain than in the other territories.","There were many large and small forces in the Dragon Fire Domain. Among them, the strongest ones were the three great sects. These three great sects were the Azure Demon Divine Hall, the Yu Palace. Among the three great sects, the Azure Demon Divine Hall was the strongest, the other two great sects were second, and each of these three great sects had several Principles Masters overseeing them.","At this moment, within one of the three great sects, the Yu Hua Sect.","Within the grand ceremony, the three Principles Masters of the Yu Hua Sect gathered here. Their expressions were extremely unsightly.","“The news has already been confirmed. The Azure Demon Divine Hall was indeed the one who destroyed the Crimson Water Island. Moreover, they were able to destroy the island with ease. After destroying the Crimson Water Island, the Azure Demon Divine Hall still has the intention to attack the surrounding sects,” A middle-aged man with long green hair said in a low voice. “The Azure Demon Divine Hall...is finally unable to hold back anymore.” Sect Master Yu Hua clenched his hands tightly, his expression cold.","“This is within expectations. The Azure Demon Divine Hall’s strength is already much stronger than the other factions in the Dragon Fire Domain. Even our Yu Palace is still quite a distance away from them. Not long ago, there was news that the Azure Demon Divine Hall had obtained a fortuitous encounter, and his strength has increased by another step, reaching the fifth level of the Void Realm...”","“The fifth level of the Void Realm. This is already one of the top experts. No one in our Dragon Fire Domain can contend against him. The azure demon Divine Hall naturally doesn’t have to worry about anything. They will directly start to annex the other sects and factions around them,” the white-robed woman said in a deep voice.","“The Azure Demon Divine Hall has only destroyed one Crimson Water Island. It Won’t be long before the Azure Demon Divine Hall acts against the other sects and factions. In the end, they will naturally not let us, the Yu Palace and the ascendance sect off. With our current strength, we have no chance of winning against the Azure Demon Divine Hall.” When they heard this, both Sect Master Yu Hua and the middle-aged man with long green hair fell silent.","Indeed, although the Yu Hua Sect was one of the three great sects in the Dragon Fire Domain, their strength was far inferior to that of the Azure Demon Divine Hall. Usually, the strongest azure demon of the Azure Demon Divine Hall was only at the peak of the void fourth stage, although it was much stronger than the peak of the void third stage of Sect Master Yu Hua, Azure Demon was not confident that he could kill the Sect Master Yu Hua. Hence, the Azure Demon Divine Hall had been restraining itself.","However, now that Azure Demon had reached the void fifth stage, his strength had soared. If they were to fight head-on, Azure Demon had a chance to kill Sect Master Yu Hua.","After all, there was a gap of two levels between the void third stage and the void fifth stage. “What about the Great Yu Palace? They should have also noticed the movements of the Azure Demon Divine Hall, right?” Sect Master Yu Hua asked.","“Of course they have. However, when I sent a message to ask, the Great Yu Palace still appeared rather calm,” the middle-aged man with long green hair said.","“Hmph, of course, they are calm. After all, the palace master of the Great Yu Palace has already reached the fourth stage of the Void Realm. Furthermore, he has an extremely powerful supreme treasure in his hands. Even if that Azure Demon has already reached the fifth stage of the void realm, he still can’t do anything to the Palace Master of the Great Yu Palace. Hence, the Azure Demon Divine Hall will more or less have some misgivings toward the Great Yu Palace. The Great Yu Palace knows this as well,” Sect Master Yu Hua said with a cold snort.","“But if the Azure Demon Divine Hall succeeds and annihilates all the other sects in the dragon fire domain, including my Yu Hua Sect, then only Yu Palace will remain. Sooner or later, it will be swallowed by the Azure Demon Divine Hall,” the white-robed woman said.","“Who knows what that old fellow from Yu Palace is thinking?” Sect Master Yu Hua said in a low voice.","The three Principles Masters of Yu Hua were all very worried about the Azure Demon Divine Hall at this moment but at this moment...weng!","A unique aura suddenly swept over. The three Principles Masters immediately sensed this aura, and at the same time, they discovered that the surrounding void began to faintly tremble.","“What’s going on?” Sect Master Yu Hua immediately raised his head.","“This aura came from that direction, and it seems to be very far away,” the white-robed woman said.","“What a huge commotion!” The green-haired middle-aged man looked surprised. “It’s still coming from within Yu Hua despite being so far away?” “Such a huge commotion. Could it be that a universe true treasure has been born?” Sect Master Yu Hua’s eyes immediately lit up.","“This aura does seem to be coming from the birth of a true treasure,” said the white-robed woman.","“If it is a true treasure,” said the middle-aged man with long green hair. “Then it must be an extraordinary true treasure. It might be a top-tier true treasure.”","“Haha, the heavens are really on our side. We were worried that we wouldn’t be able to face Green Demon Godly Palace. Now, a top-tier true treasure is attacking us. If I can get my hands on that top-tier true treasure, I might be able to raise my combat power to the next level, which is comparable to the four levels of the void space. I won’t be too afraid even if Green Demon attacks me personally,” said Sect Master Yu Hua, he immediately gave the order.","“Let’s go, we’ll rush over immediately!”","Without any hesitation, the three Principles Masters of the Yu Hua immediately rushed toward the source of the disturbance.","The three of them pushed their speed to the limit, afraid that others would get there first. As they flew at high speed, the three Principles Masters of Yu Hua still used nearly 15 minutes to get close to the source of that unique aura.","“This place is so remote!” The green-haired middle-aged man looked around.","“The more remote the place is, the more likely it is that a true treasure will be born. And from the looks of it, the three of us should be the first to arrive here. That true treasure is ours.” Yu Hua Sect Master looked eager. “The true treasure is in that mountain range, in that direction.” The white-robed woman pointed in a direction of the mountain range in front of them. The three of them were ready to rush there.","But before they could get close to the mountain range...","“Stop, you three!”","A voice suddenly sounded in their ears, and then a figure appeared in front of the three Principles Masters.","This person was carrying a longsword on his back, and the muscles on his face were wriggling. It was obvious that he had changed his appearance.","This person was naturally Jian Wushuang, who was staying around the mountain range to protect Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang."]},{"number":3433,"title":"Chapter 3433 - People Who Block the Way","paragraphs":["–","–","“Huh?”","The three people who were excited immediately stopped. When they saw Jian Wushuang in front of them, their pupils constricted.","“Who are you?” Sect Master Yu Hua asked in a low voice.","“It doesn’t matter who I am. The important thing is that you must have been attracted by the noise coming from the center of the mountain range, right? If I’m not mistaken, you must have thought that a supreme treasure was born here, right?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“Yes.” Sect Master Yu Hua nodded.","“In that case, please go back. The noise was not caused by the birth of the supreme treasure. It was caused by a friend of mine who was in closed-door cultivation in the mountain range,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Nonsense!” Sect Master Yu Hua shouted, “This aura is so unique. It must be caused by the birth of the supreme treasure. How could it be caused by a cultivator in closed-door cultivation?”","“Also, did you just say that it was your friend who was in seclusion?”","“But this aura spread so widely and created such a big commotion. To create such a big commotion, the person in seclusion must be at least a top expert of the fourth or even the fifth realm of the void. You, a mere saint, are not qualified to be friends with such an expert. You are clearly lying!”","“Your Excellency...” Jian Wushuang was about to explain.","“Shut up!” The middle-aged man with long green hair shouted, “A mere saint dares to block our way. He’s really courting death!”","As soon as he finished his words, the middle-aged man with long green hair trembled, and an aura of the third realm of the void instantly burst out.","The three Principles Masters of the Yu Hua Sect were all quite strong. Among them, the Yu Hua Sect Master was already at the peak of the third realm of the void, and the middle-aged man with long green hair had just reached the third realm of the void. Only the white-robed woman was slightly weaker, however, she was also at the peak of the second realm of the void realm.","Now, as soon as the middle-aged man with long green hair revealed his aura, he immediately transformed into a fierce beast and rushed toward Jian Wushuang, intending to kill him.","“It seems that I can’t let them leave just by talking. In that case, I’ll have to beat them back!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold, and he suddenly rushed forward, in an instant, he was in front of the green-haired middle-aged man. At the same time, the long sword behind him had been unsheathed.","An Immortal Saint and a Principles Master of the third realm of the void collided in an instant.","“Peerless Sword technique, Xi Xiang!”","Blood Mountain Sword slashed out ferociously. In an instant, a scarlet sword light, like a blood-red lightning, easily tore through space and slashed toward the green-haired middle-aged man with a shocking power.","The green-haired middle-aged man had originally intended to kill Jian Wushuang, so he did not hold back because Jian Wushuang was just an Immortal Saint. He waved his saber, which also turned into dazzling golden light, it was extremely gorgeous.","The two suddenly collided.","Clang!","A crisp sound of collision rang out, and the surrounding space directly cracked. It should be known that Jian Wushuang had already activated his life divine power. Although he had not used the Heaven-cleaving skill, he could control three parts of the power of his will, with the life divine power and the Xi Xiang move, the power of the explosion was definitely not weaker than that of an expert at the peak of the fourth void realm.","The cyan-haired middle-aged man had just reached the third void realm. At the moment of the collision, the cyan-haired middle-aged man’s saber was instantly slashed in a different direction by the terrifying power contained in the blood-red sword light, however, the blood-red sword light did not lose its momentum and directly hit his divine body.","Bang!","The sword light swept over, and the terrifying power instantly smashed the god body of the middle-aged man with long green hair into pieces. The divine body of the middle-aged man with long green hair also immediately collapsed and turned into a sky full of divine power.","This divine power rapidly gathered in the void. After a moment, it gathered again, and the figure of the middle-aged man with long green hair appeared again. However, at this moment, his face was filled with astonishment.","Behind him, Sect Master Yu Hua and the white-robed woman also widened their eyes in disbelief.","A void third level Principles Master was fighting head-on with an Immortal Saint. Moreover, they were fighting head-on. In the end, in an instant, this void third level divine body was smashed into pieces? What kind of situation was this?","“Could this person be an extremely terrifying Principles Master? is he intentionally concealing his aura?” Sect Master Yu Hua could not help but ask. “That’s not right. If he really is the Principles Master who intentionally concealed his aura, then no matter how well he concealed his aura, once he attacked, that divine power aura wouldn’t be able to be concealed. However, the divine power aura on his body is indeed at the level of an Immortal Saint. Even when he waved his sword, it was still the same. However, he’s just an Immortal Saint,” the white-robed woman said. “There’s only one Immortal Saint in the Divine Beginning Realm!” The white-robed woman suddenly raised her head.","oman","“Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","“He’s Heavenly Sword Marquis!”","Sect Master Yu Hua, the white-robed woman, and the middle-aged man with long green hair, who had just been defeated by his divine body, all stared at Jian Wushuang.","Seeing that the three of them had already said his name, Jian Wushuang felt helpless. He had come to the Third Heaven because he did not want to be too ostentatious, so he deliberately changed his appearance. Even if someone provoked him...he usually did not make a move and let Demon Master Chenhuo deal with them.","But now, Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang were in the cave mansion in the mountain range. He had to protect them and deal with the three Principles Masters. Once he made a move, his identity would naturally be exposed.","“Three of you, I have no intention of making an enemy of you. However, it is true that a good friend of mine is in seclusion in the cave mansion. I am guarding him outside. During his seclusion, no one is allowed to disturb him. So, the three of you should leave,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","The three Principles Masters of the Yu Hua Sect had gathered together, but at the moment, their expressions were very serious. At the same time, they were secretly discussing.","“I didn’t expect that the Immortal Saint was Heavenly Sword Marquis. and his strength is indeed as terrifying as the rumors say. No, he should be stronger than the rumors say!” The green-haired middle-aged man said in a low voice, “I had already used all my strength to attack just now, but in a head-on clash with him, I was completely crushed by him in terms of power. Moreover, my divine body was instantly destroyed!” “I’m sure that the power that the Heavenly Sword Marquis’ sword just released in an instant has already surpassed most of the experts of the void fourth realm. It has even reached the peak of the void fourth realm. With such strength, even if the three of us attacked at the same time, we might not be able to contend against him!” “The strength of Heavenly Sword Marquis is obvious. If the three of us choose to fight him head-on, it would definitely be irrational,” the white-robed woman added."]},{"number":3434,"title":"Chapter 3434 - One Man Against a Wall","paragraphs":["–","–","In the vast void space, the three Principles Masters of Yu Hua Sect were gathered there, and the one standing in front of them was only an Immortal Saint. However, the three Principles Masters still felt tremendous pressure.","“Two of you, do you think what Heavenly Sword Marquis said is true?” Sect Master Yu Hua looked at the two people around him.","“Of course, it must be false. Such a commotion is obviously caused by the birth of a supreme treasure. How could it be caused by a powerful warrior in seclusion?” The middle-aged man with long green hair said. “I think so too. Heavenly Sword Marquis must have sensed the birth of a supreme treasure just like us and rushed here. He was just one step ahead of us. Because the supreme treasure hasn’t been fully born yet, he came out to ask us to leave,” the white-robed woman said.","“We all think that Heavenly Sword Marquis is lying, but his strength is obvious. It won’t be easy for us to get the supreme treasure from him.” The green-haired middle-aged man frowned.","With the strength that Jian Wushuang had just displayed, even if the three of them attacked together, they would probably be defeated by Jian Wushuang. “There’s no rush. The appearance of this supreme treasure is so big that the entire Dragon Fire Domain will probably be alarmed. We, the Yu Hua Sect, are the first to arrive because we are close to this place. However, as expected, many experts from the other two sects and the Dragon Fire Domain should have also arrived. Heavenly Sword Marquis can block us, but I’m afraid it will be difficult for him to block all the experts from the Dragon Fire Domain,” Sect Master Yu Hua said.","“But if we wait for the other experts from the Dragon Fire Domain, the Yu Palace and the Green Demon Divine Palace to arrive, then we won’t have the advantage of fighting for the supreme treasure,” the white-robed woman said in a low voice.","“There’s nothing we can do about it. We’ll think of a solution when the time comes. Let’s retreat to the side for now.”","After Sect Master Yu Hua made his decision, the three of them flew directly to the side.","Jian Wushuang had been paying attention to the movements of the three of them, so he naturally saw their movements.","“Although the three of them have retreated, they didn’t go too far. Instead, they just stayed around. It seems that they don’t believe what I said and still want to wait for an opportunity.” Jian Wushuang shook his head secretly, he felt quite helpless in his heart.","He knew very well that the commotion caused by Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang was like the birth of a top-tier treasure. Although he had explained to the three of them, it was still too difficult for them to believe him.","Now, the three of them had retreated to the side temporarily because they were afraid of his strength. However, it was clear that they had no intention of leaving. Instead, they were waiting for an opportunity and for other experts to arrive.","As expected, not long after, another expert was attracted by the unique aura and rushed to this mountain range.","This time, it was only a solitary expert with the strength of the third realm of the void. After arriving, this solitary Principles Master, like the Yu Hua Sect, attempted to enter the cave mansion that emitted the aura to investigate, of course, he was immediately stopped by Jian Wushuang","A solitary expert of the third realm of the Void was easily crushed by Jian Wushuang. He had no choice but to retreat to the side, but he did not leave either.","As time passed, more and more experts were attracted by the unique aura.","Apart from Yu Hua Sect, most of the Principles Masters who stood at the top of the Dragon Fire Domain were attracted. However, most of them were solitary Principles Masters. There were not many of them, so they came one by one, they were all easily blocked by Jian Wushuang.","In the blink of an eye, two hours had passed since the commotion in the cave mansion. At this moment, there were already eight Principles Masters gathered around the cave mansion. In addition, there were many Immortal Saints, after these Immortal Saints arrived and saw the situation in front of them, they knew that they had no ability to compete. However, they did not intend to leave. Instead, they stayed to watch the show.","“More and more experts are coming.”","Jian Wushuang stood in the void in front of the cave mansion and spread his soul power, watching all the experts around him.","“There are eight Principles Masters here. Although most of them are not strong, they can cause me some trouble if they join hands. Moreover, there are still experts coming. It Won’t be long before all the experts in the Dragon Fire Domain come here. This is not small trouble.” Jian Wushuang sighed.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang noticed that there were four Principles Masters in the void in front of him.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and immediately went up to meet them.","Bang!","With a violent boom, a five-meter-wide spatial black hole appeared in the void, crazily devouring everything. The four Principles Masters had also stopped.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, Yu Palace doesn’t want to be your enemy. However, the supreme treasure in the middle of the mountain range is not something you can occupy alone. Get out of the way, or don’t blame me for being rude.” A burly red-browed elder stared at Jian Wushuang, he stared at Jian Wushuang.","The red-browed elder was the palace master of Yu Palace, an expert who had reached the fourth realm of the void. “Palace Master Yu, I’ve told you that there are no supreme treasures in this mountain range. You’ve made a mistake, so I advise you to leave as soon as possible,” Jian Wushuang said coldly. “Humph, you’re too stubborn!” Palace Master Yu obviously did not believe Jian Wushuang’s words. He snorted and a large amount of red flames burst out from his body, causing the entire world to sink into a sea of red flames, Palace Master Yu’s figure suddenly flashed, and the scarlet hammer in his hand fiercely smashed toward Jian Wushuang as if it could split the heaven and earth apart.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold, and he immediately attacked.","Clang! Clang! Bang!","In the blink of an eye, Jian Wushuang and Palace Master Yu collided three times in the void.","The three collisions were head-on and head-on.","In the first collision, palace master Yu’s body trembled and he immediately sank.","In the second collision, the scarlet hammer in Palace Master Yu’s hand was thrown away.","In the third collision, Jian Wushuang’s blood mountain sword was not hindered at all. It directly struck Palace Master Yu’s divine body, causing it to collapse by more than half, he also retreated in a sorry state.","In the blink of an eye, the battle between the two had been decided. Palace Master Yu was completely defeated!","The terrifying strength Jian Wushuang displayed in this battle also frightened the people from the palace and the surrounding spectators. In the end, the four people from the palace had no choice but to retreat to the side temporarily.","“Yu the Great!”","Just as they retreated to the edge, the three Principles Masters of the Yu Hua Sect walked over."]},{"number":3435,"title":"Chapter 3435 - Azure Demon Divine Hall","paragraphs":["“Sect Master Yu Hua, how long have you been here?” Palace Master Yu Da looked at the three people from Yu Hua Sect who had arrived.","“It has already been more than two hours. Other than Heavenly Sword Marquis, our Yu Hua Sect was the first to arrive. However, after we arrived, we were blocked by Heavenly Sword Marquis, so we had no way to come into contact with the cave abode,” Sect Master Yu Hua said. “In other words, you don’t know what’s inside the cave abode?” Palace Master Yu Da asked. “We don’t. Among all the people present, Heavenly Sword Marquis is probably the only one who knows. However, Heavenly Sword Marquis said that a good friend of his was in seclusion inside the cave abode. The movements in the surroundings were also sent by that good friend of his. I don’t really believe this reason,” said Sect Master Yu Hua.","“I don’t believe it either.” Palace Master Yu Da also said solemnly, “But as you can see, this heavenly Marquis Jian is terrifyingly strong. He defeated me with just three strikes. His strength is probably comparable to an expert at the fifth level of the void. With him blocking the outside, it won’t be easy for us to force our way in.”","“Yes,” said Sect Master Yu Hua. “Not only is Heavenly Sword Marquis powerful, but he also has many techniques. Rumor has it that he is also good at the shadowless escape technique of Blood Blade Master. Once he uses the shadowless escape technique, his speed is also incredibly fast. Even if we join forces with all the great beings present, we might not be able to do anything to him. Most importantly, the strange phenomenon in the cave abode is still continuing. This means that the true treasures in there should not have been completely born yet.”","“If he has already appeared, then it will be easy. At most, all of us will rush forward together. Even if the Heavenly Sword Marquis is extremely powerful, he will not be able to stop all of us at once. There will always be people who will seize the opportunity to enter the cave abode and leave with the supreme treasure. However, since he has not appeared...without the supreme treasure that has completely appeared, there is no way to directly take it away,” Palace Master Yu Da said.","“Let’s wait and see. When this phenomenon disappears and that supreme treasure is fully born, we will swarm forward together. At that time, Heavenly Sword Marquis won’t be able to stop us,” Sect Master Yu Hua said. “I’m not worried about Heavenly Sword Marquis. I’m worried about the Azure Demon Divine Hall!” Palace Master Yu Da’s expression was solemn. “The appearance of this supreme treasure has caused such a huge commotion. Not only our Yu Da Palace and your Yu Hua Sect, but the Azure Demon Divine Hall must have noticed it as well. If I’m not mistaken, the experts from the Azure Demon Divine Hall are also rushing over. I’m afraid that they will arrive here soon.”","“Azure Demon Divine Hall...” Sect Master Yu Hua’s face darkened. Among all the forces in the Dragon Fire Domain, the Azure Demon Divine Hall was the one that Yu Hua Sect feared the most.","“Let’s wait and see. Even if the Azure Demon Divine Hall arrives, our two families might be able to compete with it even if we join hands,” Sect Master Yu Hua said.","“Okay.” Palace Master Yu Da nodded slightly.","Obviously, Yu Palace was willing to join hands with Yu Hua Sect when they faced the Azure Demon Divine Hall.","re","As time passed, more and more experts gathered around, but no one was able to break into the cave mansion because of Jian Wushuang’s obstruction.","At this moment...in the void not far away, several figures flew over side by side. The leader was a middle-aged man in a cyan suit.","Even the middle-aged man’s eyes were suffused with a single cyan light, making him look very evil.","When they saw the person who had arrived, the hearts of the many experts who had gathered in this area tensed up.","“Azure Demon Divine Hall!”","“The people from Azure Demon Divine Hall have finally arrived.”","“Then the person in the lead should be Azure Demon, right? It’s said that Azure Demon had obtained an opportunity not too long ago and had already broken through to the fifth stage of the Void!”","“The fifth stage of the Void is unrivaled within the Dragon Fire Domain!”","One after another, respectful voices rang out.","Even the Principles Masters from Yu Da Palace and Yu Hua Sect could not help but feel apprehensive when they saw the arrival of the Azure Demon Divine Hall’s people, especially when they saw the leader, Azure Demon.","In the blink of an eye, the group of four from the Azure Demon Divine Hall had already arrived at the center of the mountain. The leader of the group, Azure Demon, looked around and had already noticed the many experts gathered around him.","“Why aren’t these people entering the cave abode? What are they doing outside?” Azure Demon revealed a puzzled expression.","“Who knows? They probably haven’t started fighting over the treasure yet because it hasn’t fully emerged yet.” A Principles Master from the Azure Demon Divine Hall beside him said.","“Hmph, let’s ignore them. Since our Azure Demon Divine Hall has already arrived, this supreme treasure is ours.” Azure Demon coldly snorted, “Come, let’s go in!”","The four people from the Azure Demon Divine Hall, led by Azure Demon, rushed toward the cave abode that was emitting a strange sound.","When they saw this scene, the surrounding experts did not have any intention of stopping them. Instead, they revealed strange expressions. “The people from the Azure Demon Divine Hall are heading toward that cave abode.” “Hehe, that cave abode is guarded by the Heavenly Sword Marquis. We have seen his strength. He is probably not much weaker than the five void realms. Although Azure Demon is also extremely strong, it is not certain who will win against the Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","“Let’s see. Even if it is Azure Demon, it won’t be so easy to pass the Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","The surrounding experts were all looking forward to it.","Even the Yu Palace and the Yu Hua Sect were looking forward to the Azure Demon Divine Hall and the Heavenly Sword Marquis.","After all, the Azure Demon Divine Hall could be said to be the dominant force in the Dragon Fire Domain. Although the Yu Palace and the Yu Hua Sect were also one of the three major forces, their overall strength was much weaker than the Azure Demon Divine Hall, neither of them had the ability to fight against the Azure Demon Divine Hall, but Heavenly Sword Marquis, who was blocking them, had the ability to challenge the Azure Demon Divine Hall.","Sure enough, just as the four people of the Azure Demon Divine Hall were about to approach the cave mansion, Jian Wushuang came up to them.","“Please go back,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Who are you? You are just an Immortal Saint, how dare you block our way?” A Principles Master of the Azure Demon Divine Hall immediately shouted.","“My name is Heavenly Sword Marquis.” Jian Wushuang remained calm.","In any case, his identity had been recognized by others. Fortunately, he had no intention of concealing his identity, so he announced his name.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","Hearing this name, the four Principles Masters of the Azure Demon Divine Hall, including Azure Demon, were shocked. It could not be helped. Heavenly Sword Marquis’ name was too big in the Divine Beginning Realm.","“He is Heavenly Sword Marquis? The most terrifying Immortal Saint in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm?” A brown-haired elder looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“He is blocking our way and wants us to leave. Could it be that the people around us, including Yu Palace and Yu Hua Sect, are unable to enter the cave mansion because they are blocked by him?” Another blood-haired youth frowned and said.","They thought that the experts from Yu Palace and Yu Hua Sect did not enter the cave mansion because the treasure had not been born yet. However, Jian Wushuang’s appearance changed their minds."]},{"number":3436,"title":"Chapter 3436 - Azure Demon","paragraphs":["“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what are you doing here?” Azure Demon stared at Jian Wushuang.","A man’s name was like the shadow of a tree.","Jian Wushuang was so famous in the Divine Beginning Realm that even though Azure Demon had reached the level of the fifth void realm, he did not dare to underestimate him.","“It seems that the four of you are here for the supreme treasure in the cave mansion. But I have to tell you that there is no supreme treasure in the cave mansion. It is just a good friend of mine who is in seclusion there. He is also the one who caused the disturbance in the surroundings. Therefore, the four of you should go back,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“Your good friend is in seclusion?” Azure Demon sneered in his heart, then he said, “It seems that the reason why the people of Yu Palace and Yu Hua Sect haven’t been able to enter the cave mansion is because of you. Although I don’t know why you are able to keep them out, I have to tell you that the Azure Demon Divine Hall is different from Yu Palace and Yu Hua. You’d better make way now. Otherwise, I don’t mind teaching you a lesson on behalf of the people of the Temporal Temple.”","“Teach me a lesson?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. “Azure Demon, I’m afraid you’re not qualified to teach me a lesson.”","“How dare you!” Azure Demon’s voice turned cold, and his body suddenly moved. The moment Jian Wushuang saw Azure Demon move, he also attacked.","“Buzz, buzz, buzz!” Jian Wushuang activated his life divine power. In an instant, he exerted his power to the maximum. The Blood Mountain Sword in his hand turned into blood-red lightning and suddenly slashed out.","It was the peerless sword technique, Xi Xiang!","The space was instantly cut open. This huge sword shadow could tear everything apart.","Many experts standing in the nearby void, especially the Principles Masters of Yu Palace and Yu Hua Sect, could not help but be frightened when they saw this sword move. Previously, Jian Wushuang had used this sword move to block all of them. Whether it was Sect Master Yu Hua or Palace Master Yu, who had already reached the fourth realm of the void, they could only be crushed by that sword move.","But now, Jian Wushuang was facing Azure Demon, who was already at the fifth realm of the Void Realm.","“Humph!”","Azure Demon snorted, and his power suddenly increased. Rumble! Endless cyan air waves swept out like a vast cyan ocean. In this cyan ocean, Azure Demon waved his hand, and a cyan stone staff suddenly expanded and stabbed toward the blood-red sword light.","Boom!","The two collided, and a terrifying power instantly erupted.","The void was like a piece of paper, exploding under the two powers. Huge space cracks filled the sky.","At the center of the two shocking powers, the blood-red sword light could not withstand the opponent’s terrifying power and collapsed. Jian Wushuang immediately retreated and finally regained his balance.","This scene made the onlookers’ pupils shrink, but they were not too surprised.","“As expected, Azure Demon is stronger!”","“It’s normal. After all, Azure Demon is an expert of the fifth void realm, and Heavenly Sword Marquis, although he is extremely powerful, his battle strength is probably at the peak of the fourth void realm.”","“An Immortal Saint has the battle strength of the peak of the fourth void realm. This is already incredible. If he is any stronger, it would be unjustifiable.”","Many experts began to discuss among themselves.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, no wonder you were able to stop the people of Yu Palace and Yu Hua Sect by yourself. You were able to fight me head-on. You are indeed very strong. Moreover, you are just an Immortal Saint. Unfortunately, your strength is not as good as mine. If I want to enter the cave mansion, you can’t stop me.” Azure Demon’s eyes were cold, he stared at Jian Wushuang.","“Haha, Azure Demon, it’s too early for you to be happy.” Jian Wushuang laughed and said, “That was only the first time we fought. I was just testing your strength. Now, let’s fight again!”","Hearing this, Azure Demon narrowed his eyes and said, “You’re boasting!”","Whoosh!","Azure Demon moved and attacked again.","Similarly, the green air currents that filled the sky formed an enormous green ocean, and Azure Demon was the absolute ruler of this green ocean. He held the staff in one hand, and the green stone staff in his hand magnified endlessly, then stirred the entire ocean, he suddenly smashed out.","It must be known that in the first collision just now, Azure Demon had only used the long staff to stab out.","But now, he had used the long stick to smash him!","The power of the long stick must have been stronger.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang was not afraid at all. A faint smile even appeared on his face. Just as the long stick was about to hit him, Jian Wushuang’s body shook, and he suddenly used the Heaven-cleaving skill!","Once the Heaven-cleaving skill was used, Jian Wushuang’s power instantly soared to a whole new level.","“Peerless Sword manual, Xi Xiang!”","The same sword move!","The same blood-red sword light smashed down like lightning, no different from the sword move that had collided with Azure Demon just now.","However, the power of the same sword move was completely different at this moment.","In the blink of an eye, the blood-red sword light collided with the enlarged cyan stone stick again.","Boom!","The commotion caused by this clash was much greater than the previous one.","When the surrounding spectators saw the two terrifying auras coming into direct contact, they even felt that the world around them was trembling crazily.","That shocking aura caused everyone around to tremble in fear.","However, this time, the head-on clash did not end in a stalemate like the previous one. Instead, the victor was determined in just an instant.","The green ocean that covered Azure Demon’s body was swept away by the power of the sword light in an instant. The entire green ocean disappeared, and the green stone staff in Azure Demon’s hand...was also slightly changed by the power of the sword light. The terrifying power caused Azure Demon to stagger and almost fall.","“How is this possible?!”","Azure Demon’s eyes were wide open in disbelief.","He really could not believe that Jian Wushuang was suppressed by him in the collision just now. However, the power of his stone stick was even stronger now. In the end, he was completely crushed by Jian Wushuang’s sword.","However, before Azure Demon could be shocked, his heart was shocked because Jian Wushuang had already attacked again after repelling him with his sword.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang moved like a ghost and appeared beside Azure Demon at an extremely fast speed. At the same time, he slashed out with his Blood Mountain Sword.","Wushuang Sword Manual, Star Dream!","Among the seven sword moves of the Wushuang Sword Manual, the sword move that focused on cutting and tearing was the most important.","Jian Wushuang also used the Heaven-cleaving skill while using his full strength!","The Heaven-cleaving skill made the sword move extremely terrifying!"]},{"number":3437,"title":"Chapter 3437 - 7 Plan","paragraphs":["“Not good!”","Seeing the star dream first style attacking him, even Azure Demon’s face changed.","At such a close distance, Azure Demon could clearly sense how terrifying this sword was. If he could block it, it would be fine. But if he could not, the terrifying cutting power of this sword style could cut through his divine body, it could probably cut through his protective armor and cut through his divine body.","“Get lost!”","Azure Demon suddenly shouted. The cyan stone stick in his hand blocked in front of him at the fastest speed, and the terrifying sword light also cut into his stone stick. However, Azure Demon’s power was not as strong as Jian Wushuang’s, moreover, this was a hasty defense. The terrifying power contained in the sword light immediately knocked the cyan stone stick aside, and it still had a lot of power left to cut into Azure Demon’s divine body.","The sword light cut through Azure Demon’s protective armor, and sparks flew in all directions. Azure Demon felt a burning pain, but when he looked over, he took a deep breath.","A deep white mark appeared on his protective armor, and a sword mark appeared on his divine body. Obviously...although Jian Wushuang’s sword attack did not directly tear his protective armor, it had reached the limit of his protective armor. Moreover, the tearing power contained in the sword...it still penetrated his protective armor and injured his divine body.","Whoosh!","Azure Demon suddenly retreated and immediately pulled away from Jian Wushuang.","After he regained his balance, Azure Demon could not help but feel a chill in his heart.","The tearing power contained in Jian Wushuang’s sword was too terrifying. As an expert of the fifth void realm and protected by the supreme treasure armor, he almost could not withstand it.","‘Fortunately, I used the stone stick to block most of the power of this sword. Otherwise, this sword might still be able to break my divine body through my supreme treasure level armor,’ Azure Demon thought to himself, at the same time, he looked at the longsword in Jian Wushuang’s hand. “That sword is so sharp!”","This was Azure Demon’s understanding of the Blood Mountain Sword.","He knew very well that although Jian Wushuang’s sword was powerful and the tearing force was strong, without the help of a divine sword that was good at cutting, it could not penetrate his supreme treasure armor and damage his divine body. In fact, Jian Wushuang’s Blood Mountain Sword was his original divine weapon. It had been growing under his nourishment and increasing its power. Jian Wushuang even used his own blood essence to nurture the Blood Mountain Sword, when Jian Wushuang came out of the Blood Wave Realm and had the battle strength of a Principles Master, the Blood Mountain Sword had already transformed into a supreme treasure. Over the years, as Jian Wushuang’s strength continued to increase, the level of the Blood Mountain Sword had also increased. It should have reached the level of an advanced supreme treasure by now.","It was an advanced supreme treasure, and the most terrifying thing about the Blood Mountain Sword was its sharpness.","Such a sword treasure, coupled with the star dream first move, instantly exploded with a tearing force. Of course, it was terrifyingly powerful.","“Azure Demon, how about it? Do you want to fight again?” Jian Wushuang stood in front of Azure Demon and looked at him with a sneer.","Azure Demon’s face had become extremely unsightly.","He had already seen that Jian Wushuang was indeed stronger than him in the fight just now. Especially that extremely sharp sword strike, it made him feel a lingering fear. If he was alone...he really did not want to fight with Jian Wushuang anymore.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, even if you are very strong, I’m afraid it won’t be so easy for you to occupy the supreme treasure in your cave mansion by yourself,” Azure Demon said.","“I’ve already told you that there are no treasures in the cave mansion. You just don’t want to believe it,” Jian Wushuang said with a bitter smile, “How about this? You can wait here quietly like the others. It won’t take long. In one or two months at most, my good friend will come out of the cave mansion. Then you’ll know whether this is true or not. Of course, before that, I can promise that I won’t step into the cave mansion. How about it?” “Humph.” Azure Demon snorted and did not answer. However, he turned around and walked toward the experts of Yu Palace and Yu Hua Sect.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly. “I’m afraid Azure Demon doesn’t believe me.”","Indeed, Azure Demon did not believe Jian Wushuang’s words. He was afraid of Jian Wushuang’s strength, so he gave in temporarily.","However, he and the others from the Azure Demon Divine Hall had already arrived in front of the Principles Masters of Yu Palace and Yu Hua Sect.","“Yu Da, Sect Master Yu Hua, what do you think?” Azure Demon asked in a low voice. “What else can we do? Even you can’t pass the trial of Heavenly Sword Marquis. What can we do?” Sect Master Yu Hua said directly.","In fact, they were the most shocked when they saw Jian Wushuang forcing Azure Demon back and damaging his divine body.","They could not imagine that Jian Wushuang, a mere Immortal Saint, could be so powerful.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis is indeed very strong. I think his battle strength is close to the peak of the void fifth realm, and I’m no match for him in a one-on-one fight. However, he is only one person, and we can’t do anything to him in a one-on-one fight. However, if we attack him together, Heavenly Sword Marquis can’t stop all of us alone. At that time, we can ignore him and fight for the supreme treasure in the cave mansion,” Azure Demon said.","“That’s true, but the problem is that the true treasure in the cave mansion hasn’t been fully born yet. It’s not wise to fight for it now. However, if we wait until the true treasure is fully born before we fight for it, Heavenly Sword Marquis will be the closest to the cave mansion, and his specialty is speed. When the true treasure is fully born, he will enter the cave mansion immediately and get the true treasure. At that time, we can only watch helplessly. After all, even three great Saint Realm Masters can’t kill Heavenly Sword Marquis. If we want to kill him and then snatch the true treasure from his hands, it’s just a pipe dream,” Palace Master Yu Da said.","“In that case, we can only wait for that ultimate treasure to be born before we make our move. We will wait for the unusual sound that is emitted from within the cave mansion to begin to weaken before we charge forward together.” Azure Demon said.","When an ordinary ultimate treasure was born, the unusual phenomenon that was emitted would begin to weaken. At this moment, it was most suitable for them to make their move.","“In that case, let’s do it this way. However, that Heavenly Sword Marquis is so powerful that it is a problem for all of us. Among all of us present, only you, Azure Demon, are able to fight him. Therefore, I am afraid that you will have to deal with him when the time comes.” Sect Master Yu Hua suddenly said.","“Humph, the fight for the supreme treasure relies on luck. At that time, we will just have to fight evenly.” Azure Demon coldly snorted."]},{"number":3438,"title":"Chapter 3438 - Swarmed Forward","paragraphs":["Time continued to pass, and the surrounding experts were waiting patiently.","They were all waiting for an opportunity. Jian Wushuang naturally knew this, but he could do nothing about it.","After another half a day, the huge heaven and earth phenomenon that erupted from the cave mansion finally began to weaken.","This weakening was immediately sensed by the many great beings who were patiently waiting in the void space.","“The heaven and earth phenomenon is beginning to weaken.”","“That true treasure is finally about to be born!”","“After waiting for so long, it’s finally here.” The gazes of the great beings in the surroundings became fiery. And then...","“Attack!”","“Attack together!”","“Quick, seize the supreme treasure!”","The experts who were waiting here all attacked at the same time.","There were dozens of experts, including more than ten Principles Masters and many powerful Immortal Saints. They all attacked at the same time and rushed toward the cave mansion.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed at this scene.","“Damn it, everyone is rushing toward me like crazy. Although I’m strong, I can’t stop everyone at once.” Jian Wushuang frowned. In the next moment, he made up his mind.","“I have no choice but to stop as many people as possible.”","In the void, Jian Wushuang made his move.","“One finger painting the sky, space-time prison!”","Buzz. With a simple stroke of his finger, the power of space-time principles gathered in his body suddenly surged up and swept out in all directions like a sea wave. In just a moment, it covered the entire mountain range.","The space-time restriction had already taken shape.","Then...","“Draw the Earth as a prison, space-time restriction!”","Buzz! Buzz! The vast power of the space-time principles that covered the surrounding heaven and earth instantly swept toward the many experts rushing forward. Space-time restriction, this move, with Jian Wushuang’s current strength, could even have a great binding effect on experts at the peak of the fifth void realm. The strongest among them, Qing Mo, was only at the threshold of the fifth realm of the void. The others were even weaker. Under the space-time binding, their speed was greatly reduced, their bodies were also greatly restricted.","Jian Wushuang’s speed completely burst out.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang’s figure was like a ghost, appearing in front of the experts one after another. The Blood Mountain Sword in his hand also swept out. Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The cold sword light attacked, forcing the experts to stop in order to block Jian Wushuang’s swordsmanship.","In that instant, Jian Wushuang actually blocked more than half of the people who rushed over. Among them, the strength of Qing Mo and Palace Master Yu were also blocked by Jian Wushuang","However, there were also some people who went around them.","There were only about a dozen of them, but Jian Wushuang could not stop them.","There was nothing he could do. No matter how powerful he was, he was only one person. He could not split his body, so it was already his limit to be able to stop so many people in an instant.","Those who were lucky enough to not be stopped by Jian Wushuang rushed toward the cave mansion at the fastest speed. The most conspicuous one was Sect Master Yu Hua!","Sect Master Yu Hua was indeed lucky. To be exact, he was smart enough.","While everyone was rushing toward the cave mansion, Sect Master Yu Hua was indeed at the back. Moreover, he was rushing toward the cave mansion from the edge, deliberately keeping a distance from Qing Mo and Palace Master Da Yu.","Jian Wushuang stopped Qing Mo and Palace Master Da Yu at once, but he could not divert his attention to stop Sect Master Yu Hua.","After Qing Mo and Palace Master Yu, Yu Hua was the strongest. Although there were more than a dozen people who could still make their way to the cave mansion, none of them were qualified to compete with Yu Hua for the supreme treasure in the cave mansion. “Haha, this supreme treasure belongs to the Yu Hua Sect. No one can compete with me anymore!”","The eyes of the Sect Master were filled with fanaticism. His face was also filled with ecstasy as he rushed toward the cave abode at his fastest speed.","As for the people around him, they had already been left behind by him. Now, no one could stop him. He was getting closer and closer to the cave abode.","Finally, he arrived at the entrance of the cave abode.","At this moment, the heaven and earth phenomenon transmitted from the cave abode had completely disappeared.","If the phenomenon had completely disappeared, then under normal circumstances, it meant that the true treasure had completely emerged.","“The timing is just right.” Sect Master Yu Hua was ecstatic, and he prepared to rush into the cave abode.","But at that moment... Sect Master Yu Hua suddenly noticed that in the cave abode, in front of him, a figure had appeared out of nowhere.","“This is...” Before Sect Master Yu Hua could react, the figure in front of him had already attacked.","In the void outside the cave mansion, Jian Wushuang was still trying to block the other experts, while those experts who were looking for an opportunity to bypass Jian Wushuang were still rushing toward the cave mansion at their fastest speed.","But at this moment...","Boom!","Heaven and earth shook violently, and a shocking power suddenly erupted.","The moment this power was created, everyone in the void could not help but stop what they were doing.","Everyone looked at the cave mansion in astonishment.","They immediately saw a huge gray hand grabbing the divine body of Sect Master Yu Hua like it was grabbing a chicken.","The leader of the Yu Hua Sect was a peak third level void realm Principles Master. In terms of strength, he could be ranked in the top three in the entire Dragon Fire Domain. However, such an expert was grabbed by the huge gray hand, no matter how hard he tried, he could not break free.","Then, the huge gray hand flipped and placed the leader of the Yu Hua Sect in its palm. Then, it clenched.","“No!”","The leader of the Yu Hua Sect let out a hysterical roar. However, his body was already completely submerged by the huge grey hand. Furthermore, the terrifying power contained within the huge grey hand had almost instantly shattered the leader of Yu Hua Sect’s divine body, furthermore, the divine power within his entire body was annihilated inch by inch until there was not a single bit left.","In just a short moment, the leader of the Yu Hua Sect had already died!","“This, this is...”","“Sect Master Yu Hua is dead?”","“A peak third stage void realm expert just casually clenched his hand and died so easily?”","The many experts in the void, including the Azure Demon Divine Hall and the Great Yu Palace’s Principles Masters, were all looking at this scene in horror. Their bodies were all trembling as if they could not accept the scene before them."]},{"number":3439,"title":"Chapter 3439 - New Life","paragraphs":["Sect Master Yu Hua, a rule master at the peak of the void realm, was killed like a chicken.","This scene really shocked everyone present.","Even the powerful Qing Mo and Palace Master Yu were shocked.","Only Jian Wushuang...he casually smiled and said, “I told you that there was no treasure in the cave mansion. It was just a good friend of mine who was in seclusion. You refused to listen. Now, my good friend is angry.”","Jian Wushuang’s words stunned everyone.","Then, they continued to look at the cave mansion.","As expected, an old figure slowly appeared at the entrance of the cave mansion.","When the old figure appeared...boom!","A terrifying aura that could suffocate all the experts present suddenly spread out. The Aura was vast and mighty, crushing everyone present. At this moment, everyone’s facial expression changed greatly! “This aura...the sixth level of the void!”","“It’s a super expert of the sixth level of the void. Moreover, such a dense aura has probably already reached the peak of the sixth level of the void!”","“Heavens, there’s actually an old monster that has reached the peak of the sixth level of the void hidden in this cave dwelling!”","The experts present were all shocked.","After the Demon Master of the Demon Master Chenhuo, who was at the entrance of the cave dwelling, released his aura to suppress everyone present, he coldly said, “This old man is in closed door cultivation. If you don’t want to die, scram!”","His voice contained a shocking killing intent, causing everyone who heard it to tremble in fear.","“Go, quickly leave!” “Quickly leave.”","“Run!”","Without any hesitation, the many experts present immediately scattered and fled in all directions.","Even the Principles Masters of the Azure Demon Divine Hall and Great Yu Palace, including Azure Demon, did not hesitate to flee.","“The sixth level of the Void, and it’s an old monster at the peak of the sixth level of the void. Such a super expert is not someone we can afford to provoke,” Azure Demon muttered in his heart.","He knew very well that not to mention that there was no so-called top-tier supreme treasure in the cave abode, even if there was one, he would not be qualified to fight for it if there was a powerhouse at the peak of the sixth level of the void there.","The sixth level of the void was much stronger than the fifth level of the void.","Didn’t they see that Sect Master Yu Hua was killed like a chicken?","W","Although there were many of them present, and most of them were quite strong, if they really made that powerhouse at the peak of the sixth level of the void unhappy and started to kill, it would definitely be a massacre, no one could stop them.","In just a moment, all the experts who had been crazy about the supreme treasure in the cave mansion had fled, leaving no one behind.","Even though their Sect Master, Yu Hua, had been killed, the remaining two Principles Masters did not have any intention of taking revenge. They also fled far away.","The void finally calmed down again.","“As expected, Chenhuo’s attack is much more direct than mine.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Although his battle strength was comparable to the fifth realm of the void, in terms of deterrence, he was far inferior to Chenhuo, who was at the peak of the sixth realm of the void.","Jian Wushuang put away the Blood Mountain Sword and went directly to the sky above the cave mansion.","“Chenhuo, what happened here didn’t affect the little guy’s ability to change his fate, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Fortunately, it was the most important period and no one broke in. Otherwise, all the previous efforts would have been wasted,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","The period when the cave mansion emitted a huge heaven and earth phenomenon was indeed the most important period for Demon Master Chenhuo to reconstruct the veins of the little guy. During this period, no one should disturb him.","Fortunately, during this period, the experts who rushed over were all blocked by Jian Wushuang alone. Until the process was over and the heaven and earth phenomenon disappeared, the experts would then rush in again, it was convenient for Demon Master Chenhuo to make a move.","“How is it now?” Jian Wushuang asked again.","“The little guy’s meridians have been reconstructed. Now, he just needs some natural treasures to nourish and stabilize them. It will take some time, but there is still no risk, and he won’t make such a big noise like before,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","“That’s good. I’ll continue to stand guard outside. You can take your time,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Okay.” Demon Master Chenhuo nodded and returned to the cave mansion.","Jian Wushuang continued to stand guard outside the cave mansion for the rest of the time. Because of Demon Master Chenhuo’s intimidation, the experts who had been scared away did not dare to come again. Everything went according to plan.","After two months, Demon Master Chenhuo walked out of the cave mansion with Zhao Mang","Looking at the two people who walked out, especially the smile on Zhao Mang’s face, Jian Wushuang knew that he had completed his heaven-defying change of fate.","His meridians had been reconstructed, so he could cultivate like a normal person in the future. Moreover, his innate advantage and cultivation talent would be much better than ordinary cultivators.","After all, Demon Master Chenhuo was a living example.","“Chenhuo, congratulations on taking in a good disciple. Zhao Mang also congratulates you. You can finally become a cultivator,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“I will never forget the kindness of all the powerful masters who gave me a new life.” Zhao Mang directly knelt down and respectfully kowtowed three times to Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Get up.” Demon Master Chenhuo waved his hand, and Zhao Mang could not help standing","up.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, thank you for guarding outside during this period of time.” Demon Master Chenhuo also thanked Jian Wushuang.","“It’s just a small matter. There’s no need to be so polite.” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","“Well, the heaven-defying fate-changing for this little guy has been completed. Now, it’s time for us to set off for the demon region,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Well, if possible, we don’t have to go there as quickly as possible. We can walk there slowly. I’m thinking of teaching this little guy on the way and giving him some experience,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Sure, I’m not in a hurry.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","He had two things to do in the demon region. The first was to meet his family in this life and find out the true identity of Miss Xiao’er.","The other reason was to find a way to kill the current grandmaster of the blood clan.","However, there was no need to be too anxious about these two things. Besides, Jian Wushuang had just exchanged many treasures from the treasure pavilion of the Heaven-cleaving Alliance to comprehend the destruction rules. He also wanted to study the destruction rules on the way, therefore, he did not mind traveling slowly. After making a decision, the three of them set off immediately."]},{"number":3440,"title":"Chapter 3440 - Location","paragraphs":["The Third Heaven was extremely vast.","The journey from the Dragon Fire Domain to the demon field was extremely long. Without using teleportation and some space passages, it would naturally take time for the three of them to reach the demon field.","On the way, Jian Wushuang tried his best to comprehend the destruction principles. As for Demon Master Chenhuo, he focused all his energy on teaching Zhao Mang.","In the blink of an eye, ten years had passed. Zhao Mang was sitting cross-legged on an empty land. His body was filled with vast divine power.","Suddenly, the void shook slightly, and Zhao Mang withdrew all his divine power. A brand-new divine power aura spread out from his body.","“It’s done!” Zhao Mang cried out in surprise.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the void beside him, also saw this scene and could not help exclaiming in admiration, “This little guy’s cultivation speed is really fast after defying the heavens and changing his fate. In just ten years, he has already advanced from an ordinary person who doesn’t even have a trace of divine power to the Immortal Saint Realm.”","There were many levels between ordinary cultivators and Immortal Saints. To become an Immortal Saint in just ten years, this speed was indeed terrifying Of course, the reason for this was not only because of Zhao Mang’s talent, but also because he had used a large number of natural treasures when defying the heavens and changing his fate. These natural treasures were all absorbed by Zhao Mang, causing his body to have an incomparably large amount of energy, in addition to the careful teaching of Demon Master Chenhuo, the speed of his progress was amazing because of the cultivation of various resources.","“Although this little guy’s progress is admirable, I’ve made a lot of progress in the past ten years.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","In the past ten years, he had spent all his energy on comprehending the destruction principles. His affinity for the destruction principles was no less than the space-time principles. With the help of many treasures, his progress was also remarkable.","In a short period of time, he had completely comprehended the first two volumes of the nine volumes of Vastheaven. The first six volumes of the nine volumes of Vastheaven contained everything from the rudiments to the complete mastery of the destruction principles. The remaining three volumes contained the application of the destruction principles. Comprehending the second volume was not only the rudiments, but also some attainments.","“The further I go, the more difficult it becomes to comprehend the nine volumes of Vastheaven. Although I only used ten years to comprehend the first two volumes, I don’t know how long it will take for me to comprehend the first six volumes,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","At this moment, Demon Master Chenhuo and Zhao Mang walked over. “Young man, congratulations on finally becoming an Immortal Saint. With your speed of improvement, I’m afraid it won’t be long before you catch up with me,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“It’s all thanks to master’s guidance that I’ve made such great progress. Besides, although I’ve made great progress, I’m still far from being comparable to you, Heavenly Sword Marquis. If I can reach your level in this life, I’ll be content,” Zhao Mang said, his words were also filled with reverence.","He had traveled with Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo for ten years, so he had a certain understanding of his master and Jian Wushuang","He knew that his master was a super expert and stood at the top of the entire Divine Beginning Realm.","As for Jian Wushuang...he already knew Jian Wushuang’s origin.","He was the number one genius in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm, but he was an Immortal Saint who could suppress many Principles Masters. Even his master, Demon Master Chenhuo, was just a guard by Jian Wushuang’s side. Such a figure... Zhao Mang could only respect him. “It’s good that you know yourself. You’ve just broken through to become an Immortal Saint, but you’re only a rank one True Saint. In the Divine Beginning Realm, you’re still an ant-like existence. You still have a long way to go,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“I’ll follow your instructions, master,” Zhao Mang said.","“Well, don’t hurt this little guy anymore,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile. “According to the star map, the monster territory is not far ahead.”","“There are all kinds of special races in the monster territory. They fight each other and are far more powerful and fierce than human cultivators. It’s said that there are territorial disputes everywhere in the monster territory. Many races fight and kill each other all year round, and there are many experts in the monster territory. Therefore, we should try not to cause any trouble when we get there,” Jian Wushuang said.","“The demon region is so big. Where can you find your family?” Demon Master Chenhuo looked at him.","After traveling together, Demon Master Chenhuo also knew the purpose of Jian Wushuang’s visit to the demon region.","101","“Although I don’t have a specific address, I can roughly guess their location,” Jian Wushuang said. “Oh?” Demon Master Chenhuo looked puzzled. Jian Wushuang took out a star map at a leisurely pace. “Look, this star map shows the locations of the territories of the many races in the demon region. They are very scattered. In addition to these races, there are eight large cities in the demon region. These eight cities are very special...” “Almost 99% of the places in the demon region are filled with fighting and killing. However, fighting is forbidden in these eight cities because these eight cities are places where the races trade with each other. There are not only experts from different races, but also human cultivators and some chambers of commerce for human cultivators.","“To put it simply, these eight cities are the transit points for the trade between different races. Any race must put down their hatred for each other when they enter. In addition, there are a large number of city guards in each of these eight cities to maintain order in the cities. No matter who it is, they are forbidden to attack in the cities. Because of this, compared to other places in the demon region, these eight cities are definitely the safest!","“My family members were very weak when they were brought to the demon region. They were not suitable to live in other places in the demon region. The only place where they could survive was in the eight cities. After all, as long as they were in the cities, even an ordinary person would be safe.","“Miss Xiao’er has an unclear relationship with the Nine-tailed Clan. She is probably not too far away from the Nine-tailed Clan. Naturally, she will place my family members in the cities closer to the Nine-tailed Clan. Among the eight cities, Piahuo City is the closest to the Nine-tailed Clan. The other seven cities are far away. Therefore, it is not surprising that my family members are in Piahuo City.”","Jian Wushuang had studied the star map of the demon territory. Without being noticed by Miss Xiao’er, he could roughly guess the locations of his relatives in this life. In his opinion, his relatives in this life...most likely, Miss Xiao’er would be placed in the Piahuo City."]},{"number":3441,"title":"Chapter 3441 - Piahuo City","paragraphs":["After determining the location of his relatives in this life, Jian Wushuang went straight to Piahuo City.","As one of the eight ‘pure lands’ in the demon region, the entire city was huge. There were many experts and human cultivators in the city, and the city was heavily guarded, a large number of city guards were stationed in every corner of the city.","In Piahuo City, the city guards would immediately take action if there was a fierce battle. Apart from stopping the battle, the two people who participated in the fierce battle would also face punishment in their eyes, moreover, this was because the fierce battle did not cause too much commotion.","If the fierce battle was very fierce or if someone killed someone in the city, they would be directly executed.","Because of this, the Piahuo City was relatively safe.","After entering the monster territory, Jian Wushuang rushed to the Piahuo City as fast as he could.","“The Piahuo City is indeed vast. Even with my soul perception, I can’t cover the entire city,” Jian Wushuang thought. He had tried his best to spread out his soul power, but he could only sense a part of the city.","But it was this part that allowed Jian Wushuang to sense a familiar figure.","“It’s really here.” Jian Wushuang smiled and directly rushed toward the figure he sensed.","In the void near the street in Piahuo City, a large number of figures gathered here.","“Chi Hu, this is the floating-fire city. How dare you hurt me here?” A delicate young man in a white robe shouted in a low voice as he was surrounded by people.","Standing in front of this young man was a burly man who was over three meters tall. His skin was completely black and he was wearing battle armor. This burly man was clearly from a special race, his body also emitted an incomparably valiant aura. The burly man parted his mouth and smiled when he heard the words of the delicate-looking young man. “Qiu Yun, you really are like this even though you say that you have not seen the world. It is true that fighting is prohibited in drifting fire city. However, as long as you do not cause too much of a commotion in a normal fight, you will only be punished a little at most. With my status, you can also be exempted from any punishment. In other words, as long as I do not kill you, I will be fine no matter what I do to","you.”","“Men, break both of his legs!”","“Yes.”","Two rank seven True Saints immediately attacked from behind the burly man. The white-robed young man had just reached the level of an Immortal Saint, so he naturally did not have any ability to resist the two rank seven True Saints. In just an instant...the white-robed young man’s legs were broken.","“Bastard!”","The white-robed young man clenched his hands tightly. His body was being pressed to the ground by the two rank seven True Saints. He could not even raise his head. He could only roar and curse.","But the more he struggled, the happier the burly man became.","“Haha, I told you not to give me face before. You think that I can’t do anything to you in Piahuo City? What a joke. Come on, chop off his arms as well.”The burly man ordered.","To an Immortal Saint, breaking his arms and legs was nothing. He could recover very easily. However, in his heart, this was a blatant humiliation to the white-robed young man. In front of everyone...he was wantonly trampling on his dignity. When the two rank seven True Saints heard the burly man’s order, they immediately planned to chop off the white-robed young man’s arms.","But right at this moment...","“Stop!”","A low shout suddenly rang out, and then a large number of figures charged over from the void beside them.","When they saw the people who had arrived, a commotion immediately appeared in the surrounding void.","“Quick, get out of the way! The city protection army is here!”","“Fighting is forbidden in fluttering fire city. Now that the city protection army is here, there will be a good show to watch.”","“Not necessarily. That Scarlet Tiger is the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan. His status is obvious. Moreover, he did not cause any deaths. Even the city protection army would not dare to do anything to him.”","Many people were whispering in secret.","In the blink of an eye, the city protection army had arrived in front of the crowd.","“Release him!” One of the captain-level saints immediately reprimanded.","However, the two rank seven True Saints who had pinned the white-robed youth to the ground did not react at all. They looked toward Chi Hu. Chi Hu smiled sinisterly and waved his hand, indicating for the two of them to let go.","“Yun ‘er.”","An azure-robed woman rushed out from the crowd and hurriedly picked up the white-robed youth.","“Mother.” The white-robed youth forced out a smile when he saw the woman.","“Bastard!” The green-clothed woman clenched her teeth in anger when she saw the miserable appearance of her son.","The commander of the City Protection Army by the side also frowned, he said, “Chi Hu, although you are the young chief of the Scarlet Gold Clan, this is after all floating fire city. Aren’t you treating the city protection army and the many tribes in the demon region too disrespectfully by acting in such a manner?”","“Haha, I merely taught an ignorant person a lesson. Moreover, I did not cause any deaths. Why, do you City Protection Army plan to settle scores with my Scarlet Gold Clan over this matter?” The burly man, Chi Hu, laughed fearlessly.","The expression of this city protection army captain changed.","The city protection army of Piahuo City and the City Protection Army of the other seven cities were actually supported by the top tribes in the demon region. Their existence was indeed to maintain order within these eight cities. Usually...the principles in these cities were extremely strict.","However, if the matter involved some top races...","For example, although the current Scarlet Gold race was not one of the four great celestial races, their strength was only second to the four great celestial races. Such a powerful race and the other party was the young grandmaster...therefore, the city protection army had to have some scruples.","Under normal circumstances, as long as a person like Scarlet Tiger did not go overboard in the city and killed people on the streets, the City Protection Army would turn a blind eye.","This was how it was today. “Scarlet Tiger, you have already taught him a lesson. Today’s matter ends here. If you attack this person again in Piahuo City, our City Protection Army can no longer pretend that we did not see it,” said the City Protection Army’s captain.","“Haha, that’s fine. For such a small character, teaching him a lesson once is enough. I have no interest in teaching him a lesson a second time.” Chi Hu smiled coldly, then turned around. “Let’s go.”","After saying that, Chi Hu and his subordinates planned to leave. The City Protection Army did not dare to stop them.","But at this moment...sou! Sou! Sou!","Three figures suddenly blocked Chi Hu and the others.","“Wanting to leave after teaching them a lesson, leaving nothing behind. Aren’t you being a little too relaxed?”","A cold voice suddenly reverberated in the air."]},{"number":3442,"title":"Chapter 3442 - Beheading","paragraphs":["His voice reverberated in the air, drawing the attention of the people around him.","Everyone turned to look at the three figures who had suddenly appeared.","“Who are these three?”","“I’ve never seen them before, but from the looks of it, they should be human cultivators.”","“Of the two Immortal Saints, one seems to have just reached the True Saint Realm. As for the last person...I can’t tell how deep he is. He seems to be a powerhouse.”","Some people were whispering among themselves.","Chi Hu and the others were naturally stopped by the three figures. “Who dares to block my way?” Chi Hu’s eyes were cold as he glanced at the three people in front of him. His tone carried a hint of condescension.","“I heard that the rules of the cities in the demon region are extremely strict. No one dares to be presumptuous here. But now it seems that they are just so-so.” Jian Wushuang sneered.","He had thought that no one would dare to fight in these cities after reading the introduction on the star map, but that was clearly not the case.","However, it was understandable. In this world, any rules were set by experts. As long as you were strong, you could break the rules no matter where you were.","“Humph, I don’t care who you are. Listen to me. I’m the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan. If you don’t want to die, get away from me. Otherwise...” Chi Hu’s eyes were emitting a cold light, the attendants behind him also showed a cold look. As one of the top clans in the monster region, the Scarlet Gold Clan could do whatever they wanted in the demon region. Even the four great divine clans would at least give the Scarlet Gold Clan some face, that was why Chi Hu was so arrogant and domineering.","But today, Chi Hu and the others had kicked an iron board. “The Scarlet Gold Clan?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. “I don’t remember a single Scarlet Gold Clan among the four great divine clans.”","“The Scarlet Gold Clan is not among the four great divine clans, but it’s still considered a top clan. In terms of strength, it’s only slightly weaker than the four great divine clans,” Demon Master Chenhuo said. After all, he was an expert who had been left behind 200 million years ago, he still knew about the Scarlet Gold Clan.","“I see. No wonder I have never heard of it,” Jian Wushuang said with a sneer. Jian Wushuang’s wanton sneer, as if he did not care about the Scarlet Gold Clan at all, completely infuriated Chi Hu. “You guys, catch this kid for me. I want him to kneel in front of me and Kowtow to me to apologize,” Chi Hu ordered.","“Yes.”","The attendants behind Chi Hu immediately prepared to attack.","Once they moved, the guards could not sit idly","by.","“Stop!”","The captain of the guards shouted in a low voice and rushed over with the guards.","But at this moment...","“No need to go through so much trouble.” Jian Wushuang raised his head slightly. At the moment he raised his hand, an invisible sword shadow condensed in front of him and then shot out.","It was too fast!","The speed of the sword shadow was beyond everyone’s imagination. Almost in an instant, the sword shadow had already passed by Chi Hu’s followers. Chi! Chi! Chi! Chi!","Heads were thrown out one by one.","Not only did the sword shadow destroy their divine bodies it also destroyed their divine power. In the blink of an eye, Chi Hu’s followers were all dead.","“What!?”","Everyone was stunned.","“Dead? All of them are dead!” “In an instant, all the True Saints above rank seven were killed.”","“How dare he kill people in the Piahuo City!”","Exclamations were heard one after another, and countless shocked eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang.","The captain of the City Protection Army was also stunned. They had wanted to rush over to protect Jian Wushuang and the others, but they did not expect that Chi Hu’s followers had died in an instant.","After killing those followers, Jian Wushuang raised his hand again and another sword shadow condensed in his hand.","This sword shadow was obviously heading toward Chi Hu.","“Oh no!” The captain of the City Protection Army was shocked.","Chi Hu was also shocked. When he saw the sword shadow rushing toward him, he immediately roared, “I am the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan. If you dare to kill me, my Scarlet Gold Clan will not let you go...”","Before he could finish his words, the sword shadow had already passed through his divine body.","Just like his subordinates, Chi Hu’s divine body collapsed immediately. His divine power was also destroyed. He died instantly.","Silence!","At this moment, the entire Piahuo City quieted down completely.","Everybody around was stunned. They could not believe what they were seeing.","The young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan was actually killed on the spot in Piahuo City?","“Something big has happened!”","The captain of the City Protection Army’s expression changed drastically. He knew very well that the death of the Scarlet Tiger in Piahuo City would cause a huge commotion. This matter had already completely gone out of his control, it was not something that a mere captain like him could solve.","Hence, he immediately took out his communication talisman and sent a message to the few higher-ups of the city protection army within Piahuo City.","When the few higher-ups of the City Protection Army received the message, they were all shocked and immediately rushed over as fast as they could.","In just a short while, four figures with monstrous auras appeared in the air. “Greetings, general.” The captain of the City Protection Army immediately bowed respectfully to the person who had just arrived.","The auras emitted by the four people who had just arrived were all the Principles Masters. The one in the lead was a burly man wearing purple armor with a single horn on his forehead. This burly man glanced at the ground below, although the godly bodies of the Scarlet Tiger and his followers had collapsed and their divine power had been completely annihilated, their corpses were still left behind.","“It really is Chi Hu...” The burly man in purple armor looked at Chi Hu’s divine body and his face turned livid. He then asked in a low voice, “Who did it?”","“General, it’s him.” The captain immediately pointed at Jian Wushuang.","“How dare you kill people wantonly in Piahuo City? And you killed the young patriarch of the Scarlet Gold Clan!” The burly man in purple armor said with a gloomy face.","The city guards of Piahuo City and the other seven cities of the demon region supported the top tribes of the demon region, and the Scarlet Gold Clan occupied a very big position among them. Usually, if a member of the Scarlet Gold Clan died in these eight cities, it would cause a great commotion. And now, the young grandmaster had died. This matter was too big...it was so big that the consequences might even implicate him.","Hence, toward the person who had killed the Scarlet Tiger, this burly man in purple armor gritted his teeth."]},{"number":3443,"title":"Chapter 3443 - Third Brother?","paragraphs":["“According to the rules, anyone who dares to kill someone in Piahuo City can be executed on the spot,” the purple-armored man said coldly.","“Commander, this person killed a Scarlet Tiger after all, and this matter is of great importance. Why don’t we suppress him first, then hand him over to the Scarlet Gold race, and let them decide what to do with him?” A Principles Master beside him said.","“Yes, it’s best to hand him over to the Scarlet Gold Clan.” The burly man in purple armor nodded.","However, Jian Wushuang smiled when he heard the burly man’s words. “You talk as if you can do whatever you want to me. Aren’t you going to ask me if I agree or not?”","“Boy, you’re a saint. Do you think you can resist me?” The burly man in purple armor said in a low voice.","“I’m sorry, but I don’t intend to let you deal with me. Besides, you are not qualified to do so.” Jian Wushuang sneered. Then he glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo and said, “Chenhuo, I’ll leave it to you.”","Demon Master Chenhuo nodded slightly and took a step forward.","It seemed like a step, but the moment he took that step, boom! An earth-shattering might erupted like a landslide and a tsunami, directly suppressing the entire area.","For a moment, the entire void started to tremble madly. It was as if the space could not withstand this pressure and was about to explode.","Even the heaven and earth void was like this, and the people in this area were all extremely terrified.","“This, this is...” The violet-armored burly man’s eyes were wide open. Although he was a peak fourth level void realm Principles Master, he was still trembling under this pressure.","The Principles Masters beside him were even more terrified than him.","“Void sixth level!”","“He is a peak void sixth level expert, and judging from his power, he is probably an extremely powerful existence among the void sixth level. It is very likely that he is on par with the four great clan leaders of the divine","race!”","The body and mind of the burly man in purple armor began to tremble madly.","Seeing that the deterrent effect was almost over, Demon Master Chenhuo withdrew his power, and the people around him heaved a sigh of relief. “So, do you still want to suppress me and hand me over to the Scarlet Gold Clan?” Jian Wushuang looked at the purple-armored burly man with a faint smile.","The purple-armored burly man’s face twitched slightly, he said seriously, “You have experts at the peak of the sixth void realm with you. The guards of the Piahuo City can’t fight against you, so we can’t suppress you. However, the rules of the Piahuo City and the other seven cities in the demon region are made by the clans of the demon region. Since you have violated the rules of the Piahuo City, I will still inform the clans who made the rules and let them decide.”","The burly man in purple armor said it beautifully, but in fact, he knew it very well. Although many people thought that the rules of the Piahuo City were very strict, the rules were made by experts, as long as one reached a certain level of strength, he could ignore any rules and restrictions.","were","And the Demon Master, who was beside Jian Wushuang, was such an expert.","An expert at the peak of the sixth realm of the void realm could kill a city in the demon region, including the four divine races, even if he killed a city in the demon region, let alone in the Piahuo City, at most, he could only talk about it. It would be impossible for him to kill such an expert.","His strength had reached the level of the Demon Master Chenhuo, and even a Saint Realm Master might not have the confidence to kill him personally. On the other hand, the four great clans and the entire demon region did not have any Saint Realm Masters or ruler-level experts.","Therefore, even if he reported this matter to the higher-ups, the top clans, including the four great clans, would probably turn a blind eye, even the Scarlet Gold Clan would not dare to have any thoughts of revenge after knowing that the person who killed Chi Hu was accompanied by an expert at the peak of the sixth void realm.","“I don’t care how you report this matter to those clans, but I have some private matters to deal with in the Piahuo City. You’d better go far away and stay away from me,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“As long as you don’t continue to kill people in the Piahuo City, the City Protection Army will not follow you,” the burly man in purple armor said.","“Don’t worry. As long as no one dares to provoke me, I won’t do anything,” Jian Wushuang said. “That’s good.” The burly man in purple armor let out a sigh of relief and then ordered the sergeants of the City Protection Army. “You, clean up the corpses below. The rest of you, disperse!”","Upon hearing this, everyone began to disperse. However, when they left, everyone was still discussing animatedly.","What they were discussing was naturally the scene just now.","“What a fellow. He killed someone in Piahuo City. He even killed the young clan leader of the Scarlet Gold Clan. However, this person is actually completely fine?”","“Nonsense, didn’t you hear? This person has a peak sixth level void realm existence by his side. Even the four great divine races do not dare to provoke such a super expert. How would the City Protection Army dare to attack?”","“This is a true expert. He is clearly violating the rules of the demon region, but no one dares to do anything to him.”","“Compared to that peak level six void realm expert, I am more curious about the identity of the person who killed Chi Hu. He is clearly an Immortal Saint, but that peak level six void realm expert by his side seems to be just a","guard?”","“A guard at the peak of the six void realms? Who is he?”","Everyone left in shock.","After the people around them began to disperse, Jian Wushuang and the other two rushed toward the green-robed woman and the white-robed young man whose legs had been broken by Chi Hu. Seeing Jian Wushuang and the other two arrive, the green-robed woman quickly bowed respectfully and said, “Greetings, my lords.”","“Yun ‘er, hurry up and bow.” The green-clothed woman urged the white-robed young man.","“Greetings, my lord.” The white-robed young man also reacted and saluted.","“My lord?” Jian Wushuang was stunned at first, but then he immediately reacted. The muscles on his face began to tremble, and in the blink of an eye, he had returned to his original appearance. “Big sister, look, who am","I?!","“Sister?” The green-clothed woman was stunned, then she looked up at Jian Wushuang.","Although it had been so many years, his extremely familiar and friendly appearance had not changed much. The green-clothed woman immediately recognized Jian Wushuang.","“You are my third brother?” The green-clothed woman’s voice was excited.","“It’s me, sister.” Jian Wushuang laughed.","In this life, besides his parents, he had an elder sister and an elder brother.","This elder sister was Zhuo Bing, the woman in green!"]},{"number":3444,"title":"Chapter 3444 - Reunion","paragraphs":["“Are you really my third brother?” Zhuo Bing was still in disbelief.","It was not her fault. After all, her impression of Jian Wushuang was still in the Golden House Nine Realms, a Small Witch Desert Region. At that time, although Jian Wushuang was extremely talented, his strength was only at the level of a Divine Master.","At that time, an Immortal Saint was like a god and even existed only in legends.","Now, after so many years, they had also come to the demon region. In this place, the Immortal Saint was nothing. There were many top-notch Immortal Saints here, so Zhuo Bing naturally learned a lot.","Because of this, she was unable to associate the shocking expert in front of her with her third brother, who had killed Chi Hu easily and even the City Protection Army could not do anything to him.","The gap between them was too big.","“Elder sister, look carefully. I am your third brother, the real one,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Zhuo Bing stared at Jian Wushuang for a while and finally confirmed it.","“Third brother, I finally meet you.” Zhuo Bing immediately became excited. At the same time, she pulled the delicate white-robed young man beside her and said, “Yun ‘er, quick, call me uncle.”","Qiu Yun was a little stunned at first, but he immediately reacted and called him uncle. After calling him uncle, his expression became strange again. “This big shot who dared to kill Chi Hu is my uncle?” Qiu Yun was confused.","Looking at the mother and son, Jian Wushuang indeed smiled faintly and could not help thinking of the scene in the desert region.","At that time, Zhuo Bing was very tough, but after coming to the demon region, where experts were as numerous as clouds, it seemed that her character had been erased. It was obvious that she had become a married woman and had a child.","“Elder sister, how are father and mother?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“They are very good, but they often talk about you and worry about you. Now, if they know that you have come, they will be very happy.” Zhuo Bing smiled and said, “Let’s go, third brother, I will take you to see them.”","“Okay.” Jian Wushuang nodded and immediately followed.","On the other side of the floating-fire city, there was a residential area where many human cultivators lived.","Zhuo Bing brought Jian Wushuang to a courtyard near the center. “Third brother, we live here. Father and mother are also here,” Zhuo Bing said. “Okay, I have already sensed it.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. His soul power had already sensed two familiar auras in the center of the courtyard.","These two auras were her parents in this life, Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin.","“It seems that father and mother are doing well.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","“Come, let’s go in.”","Zhuo Bing immediately led Jian Wushuang into the courtyard.","As soon as they entered the courtyard, Zhuo Bing immediately shouted, “Father, mother, Look, who is back!”","“Who is it?” A voice came from the room. When Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin walked out of the room and saw Jian Wushuang, they were both stunned.","“Father, mother, I’m back.” Jian Wushuang directly knelt down. His body trembled and he was a little excited.","“Shuang ‘er?”","Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin were immediately pleasantly surprised.","“Get up, you child...” Luo Xinqin quickly helped Jian Wushuang up.","“Father, mother, I’ve been unfilial. I’ve made you suffer,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It’s good that you’re back,” Zhuo Yunfeng said with a smile.","A moment later, the group sat down in the hall.","“Shuang ‘er, your mother has been worried about your safety all these years. She was afraid that you would run into danger while you were traveling alone. I’ve told her many times that you’re going to become a top expert, so you must go through the necessary hardships. You just need to find a way to get over it, but she hasn’t listened to you,” Zhuo Yunfeng said.","“How dare you say that to me? Aren’t you the same?” Luo Xinqin rolled her eyes at Zhuo Yunfeng, who was also embarrassed.","This scene made Jian Wushuang feel warm.","After exchanging a few words, Jian Wushuang asked, “Father, mother, how have you been these years?”","“Not bad.” Zhuo Yunfeng said, “When we were in the Witch Desert Region, we were picked up from the Witch Desert Region. After several years, we were sent here. After we were sent here, Miss Xiao’er saw us in person and bought us a courtyard in the floating-fire city. After that, we lived here all these years.”","“There are many experts in this place, but because of the City Protection Army, no one dares to mess around in the city. Therefore, although we are weak, we won’t encounter any threats in the city. At least, no one will come to find trouble with us. Not long after we settled down, your elder sister met your brother-in-law. They were like equals, so they got married and then had Yun ‘er.”","“Brother-in-law?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “Who is my brother-in-law?”","“Your brother-in-law is Qiu Mo, a human cultivator. He is the deputy director of a Chamber of Commerce in the fluttering fire city. He has a high position in the Chamber of Commerce. Miss Xiao’er has been protecting us all these years. With your brother-in-law around, our lives are quite comfortable,” Zhuo Yunfeng said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","What he was most worried about was the situation and safety of his family members. Now that he knew that they had been doing well, Jian Wushuang felt relieved.","“Father, since you have dealt with Miss Xiao’er and have been protected by her all these years, how much do you know about her?” Jian Wushuang asked. “Well...” Zhuo Yunfeng revealed a strange expression. “Shuang ‘er, isn’t miss Xiao’er your friend? You should know more about her than us, right?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. “To tell you the truth, I’m only an ally of Miss Xiao’er, but I don’t know much about her identity and background. I asked him to take you away because I didn’t have time to think about it.”","“Is that so?” Zhuo Yunfeng’s brows raised, following that, he said with a serious expression, “Actually, we don’t know much about this Miss Xiao’er’s background. We only know that this Miss Xiao’er is very strong and her methods are even more formidable. Even the Piahuo City’s military lord is extremely respectful when facing this Miss Xiao’er. I also heard that this Miss Xiao’er seems to have established a large faction, but we don’t know what faction it is.” “After all, we haven’t even been out of Piahuo City since we were picked up here.”"]},{"number":3445,"title":"Chapter 3445 - Decadence","paragraphs":["–","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Miss Xiao’er was really mysterious.","“Let’s not talk about her. By the way, I have been back for so long, why haven’t I seen second brother? where is he?” Jian Wushuang asked.","In this life, besides having an elder sister, he also had a second brother, Zhuo Peng.","“Your second brother, he...”","At the mention of Zhuo Peng, Zhuo Yunfeng’s expression became a little strange.","“What’s wrong? Did something happen to second brother?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Nothing major happened, but he has been a little dispirited these years,” Zhuo Yunfeng said.","“Dispirited?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“It’s like this,” Zhuo Bing said, “as you know, your second brother is a wild man and doesn’t like to live a comfortable life. After he came to Piahuo City, he longed to become an expert because of the excellent cultivation conditions here. Therefore, he worked hard and even entered a small force around Piahuo City to cultivate!","“But unfortunately, his talent was limited, so his achievements were naturally not that high. He suffered a setback or two. Fortunately, Miss Xiao’er came forward, so nothing happened. Later on, he also thought things through, so he wanted to live a comfortable life in Piahuo City. And just now, father also told him to help you. Your brother-in-law is a deputy director in a chamber of commerce in Piahuo City, so he has a certain status. Therefore, your brother-in-law arranged a position for him in that shop.","“It used to be peaceful, but not long ago, a girl came to the chamber of commerce. She was received by your second brother. It doesn’t matter if she was not received, but for some reason, the two of them fell in love with each other. Now, the girl often comes to the chamber of commerce and is received by your second brother. The two of them have developed a bond.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Isn’t that good? Do you agree with her?”","“It would be good if that’s all. But soon, your second brother will know that the girl’s background is very big.” Zhuo Bing continued, “The girl is from the Blood Marten Clan, and she is the beloved daughter of the clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan!","“This background was too powerful. Your second brother was just an ordinary cultivator at the level of a saint, and he didn’t have any power or status. He only held some moderate positions in an ordinary chamber of Commerce. Naturally, the Blood Marten Clan looked down on your second brother.”","“Therefore, even though that girl was extremely unwilling, after the Blood Marten Clan found out about this, they still forced the two of them to cut off contact. Some experts of the Blood Marten Clan even went out to warn your second brother to stop having any improper thoughts. That girl also returned to the Blood Marten Clan, and she never came to Piahuo City again.” “After that incident, your second brother became dispirited. He spent all his time drinking and never went to the chamber of commerce again.” “Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He had completely understood what had happened.","“Being trapped by love, especially when you know where your beloved is, but you can’t bring him back or keep him by your side. It’s really not a good feeling. I can see that my second brother is also a lover.” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","“Third brother, your second brother is really in pain now. Can you find a way to help him?” Zhuo Bing looked over.","But she had just finished speaking.","“Nonsense!” Zhuo Yunfeng directly shouted in a low voice, “The girl who made your second brother dispirited is the beloved daughter of the Blood Marten Clan’s grandmaster. She has a noble status. The Blood Marten Clan is already very merciful to only warn him and make him stop thinking. At this time, what do you want your third brother to do?","“But father, with my third brother’s ability, if he really wants to help, maybe...” Zhuo Bing had not finished her words.","“Shut up.” Zhuo Yunfeng scolded again, “Your third brother is quite talented, and he has been adventuring outside these years. Although his strength has improved a lot, he is still a member of the Blood Marten Clan, one of the top tribes in the demon area. Such a tribe is not something that can be easily provoked!”","Zhuo Yunfeng had stayed in the fluttering fire city for so many years, so he knew a little about the many clans in the demon region. He knew how terrifying the Blood Marten Clan was, so he reprimanded Zhuo Bing.","This made Zhuo Bing extremely speechless. At this time, Jian Wushuang finally spoke, “Father, don’t be anxious. Tell me first, what is the overall strength of the Blood Marten Clan? Who is stronger and who is weaker than the Scarlet Gold Clan?”","“Although I’ve been in the fluttering fire city all year round, I still know a little about the top clans in the demon region. It’s said that the Blood Marten Clan was able to challenge the four divine clans at its peak. Although it has declined, it’s still a top clan in the demon region. As for its overall strength, it should be slightly weaker than the Scarlet Gold Clan, but it’s definitely not much weaker,” Zhuo Yunfeng said.","“Oh, just like that?” Jian Wushuang could not help laughing","Zhuo Bing, who was beside him, also said, “My third brother dared to kill Chi Hu, the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan. The Blood Marten Clan is not as strong as the Scarlet Gold Clan. In front of my third brother, they are nothing.” “What did you say?” When Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin heard this, they were both stunned.","“You just said, who did Shuang ‘er kill?” Zhuo Yunfeng looked at Zhuo Bing in shock.","“Chi Hu is the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan.” Zhuo Bing said, “Today, in Piahuo City, that Chi Hu had a small conflict with Yun ‘er, so he humiliated Yun ‘er on the street. At this time, third brother rushed over and killed Chi Hu and his followers without saying a word.”","“You mean, Shuang ‘er killed people in Piahuo City? And killed the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan?” Zhuo Yunfeng’s eyes were wide open.","“Yes, but my third brother clearly violated the rules of Piahuo City. However, the city protection army of Piahuo City, including the commander of the City Protection Army, didn’t dare to attack my third brother. They said that even if my third brother killed Chi Hu, it would be in vain. After that, many top clans in the demon region, including the Scarlet Gold Clan, wouldn’t dare to come and find trouble with my third brother,” Zhuo Bing said.","“Is...is this true?” Zhuo Yunfeng looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","“Yes, it’s true.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Father, I can tell you that if nothing goes wrong, I can absolutely do whatever I want in the demon region. Even if I kill a young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan in Piahuo City, the top clans in the demon region can only watch and do nothing to me.”","“As for the Blood Marten Clan, they are nothing more than that.” Hearing this, Zhuo Yunfeng was a little stunned.","Jian Wushuang looked at Zhuo Bing and said, “Elder sister, where is second brother now? Let him come over first.”"]},{"number":3446,"title":"Chapter 3446 - Marriage Proposal","paragraphs":["“Yun ‘er, go and call your uncle over,” Zhuo Bing ordered.","“Yes.” Qiu Yun nodded and immediately went out of the courtyard.","Before long, Qiu Yun and Zhuo Peng came back together.","”Third brother!”","When Zhuo Peng saw Jian Wushuang, he immediately revealed an ecstatic expression and rushed over to give Jian Wushuang a hug.","“Second brother, long time no see.” Jian Wushuang also smiled.","“You also said that you haven’t heard anything for so many years. We were worried about you,” Zhuo Peng said.","“Aren’t you back safely?” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “By the way, I heard from father that you encountered some trouble.”","“Father told you?” Zhuo Peng glanced at Jian Wushuang and then sighed, “Although Ying ‘er and I agreed to marry her, the gap between our statuses is too big...”","“Let’s ignore the gap between our statuses for now. Second brother, let me ask you, do you want to marry her?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, of course, I want to marry her. Even in my dreams, I want to marry her, but she is a member of the Blood Marten Clan and the daughter of the clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan,” Zhuo Peng said. “I told you to ignore your statuses for now. Since you want to marry her, it’s easy,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile. “Third brother, do you have a way?” Zhuo Peng looked at Jian Wushuang expectantly.","“Of course, and it’s very simple. You just need to go with me to the Blood Marten Clan to propose marriage. Then I will help you bring your sweetheart back.” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Really?” Zhuo Peng’s eyes lit up. “Of course it’s true. Second brother, I’m afraid you don’t know that third brother is now standing at a height that we can’t imagine. Today, he killed Chi Hu, the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan, on the spot, in Piahuo City. But the city protection army of Piahuo City didn’t dare to do anything to him!”","vus","“With third brother’s current strength and status, if he goes to the Blood Marten Clan to propose marriage, I’m afraid the Blood Marten Clan won’t dare to disrespect him,” Zhuo Bing said.","“He killed the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan in Piahuo City, and he’s still fine?” Zhuo Peng immediately became fanatical. “Third brother...”","“Second brother, why don’t you make some preparations? We’ll go to the Blood Marten Clan now, how about it?’” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay, of course, I’ll make some preparations right away!” Zhuo Peng became excited and immediately began to make preparations. Zhuo Yunfeng looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Shuang ‘er, isn’t it too rushed to go to the Blood Marten Clan to propose marriage right now? Besides, since we’re going to propose marriage, we must prepare the betrothal gifts, but we haven’t prepared the betrothal gifts yet.” “Don’t worry, I have the betrothal gifts. I promise I won’t let my future sister-in-law suffer,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile. He had killed so many experts, including several Principles Masters, and even the Nether Master, as a top Principles Master, the flame divine guard naturally had a lot of treasures and resources.","As long as he took out some of them as betrothal gifts, the Blood Marten Clan would be tempted.","“Third brother, can you take me with you to propose marriage this time?” Zhuo Bing suddenly asked.","“I want to go too,” Qiu Yun also said.","Jian Wushuang could not help smiling. “If you want to go, of course. Father, mother, why don’t you go together?”","“Well...” Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin looked at each other, and then Zhuo Yunfeng said with a smile, “Then let’s go together. Let’s go and pick up the daughter-in-law of our Zhuo family.”","“Yun ‘er, go and call your father,” Zhuo Bing said.","“Okay.” Qiu Yun immediately went.","Not long after, Jian Wushuang left the drifting fire city with his family and went to the clan land of the Blood Marten Clan.","The clan land of the Blood Marten Clan was not far from Piahuo City, but it took Jian Wushuang more than half a day to get there with Zhuo Yunfeng and the others.","“Is this the territory of the Blood Marten Clan?” Jian Wushuang looked at the vast territory covered by the restriction.","The range of the restriction was so wide that it covered almost a whole and huge mountain range. Because of the restriction, even Jian Wushuang could not see the scene below.","“This restriction seems to be quite strong,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","“I’ve heard of the Blood Marten Clan. A long time ago, the Blood Marten Clan was only a medium-sized clan in the demon region. But later, because of this Blood Marten Clan, a very powerful expert appeared. It’s said that his strength has reached the peak of the six void realms, and is even infinitely close to the peak of the six void realms. It was under his leadership that the Blood Marten Clan became the top clan. At that time, they even dared to challenge the four great divine clans.”","“However, after the strongest expert of the Blood Marten Clan left the Divine Beginning Realm and ventured into the depths of the universe battlefield, the strength of the Blood Marten Clan gradually declined. Until now, they have only managed to maintain their position as a top clan. Now, the restriction covering the entire ancestral land should be created by the strongest expert of the Blood Marten Clan,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Infinitely close to the pinnacle of the six void realms? Isn’t that the same as you?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo.","Demon Master Chenhuo only raised his eyebrows and did not say anything.","“Second brother, you go. With me here to support you, you don’t need to be afraid or worried. Just tell me why you’re here,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Zhuo Peng took a deep breath and rushed toward the entrance of the Blood Marten Clan.","Jian Wushuang stayed in the void above and watched everything below.","Zhuo Peng went directly to the entrance. Before he got close, someone stopped him. “Who is it?”","Several saint-level members of the Blood Marten Clan were guarding the entrance. They stared at Zhuo Peng with cold faces.","“I am Zhuo Peng. I am from Piahuo City. This time, I am here to propose marriage,” Zhuo Peng said solemnly.","“Propose marriage?” The few members of the Blood Marten Clan were stunned at first, but then they burst into laughter, “kid, did you go to the wrong place? You are an Immortal Saint of the human race, yet you came to my Blood Marten Clan to propose marriage? Who in my Blood Marten Clan would fancy you?”","“The one I want to propose marriage is your Blood Marten Clan’s Princess Ying. You can just call her out,” Zhuo Peng said.","“What a joke. What status does my princess have? Why would she like a human kid like you? You’re clearly scheming against us. Hurry up and scram!” One of the Blood Marten Clansmen immediately berated.","But at this moment...","“What’s going on?” A low voice sounded. At the entrance, an evil-looking man in a black robe walked out with his hands behind his back."]},{"number":3447,"title":"Chapter 3447 - Offense","paragraphs":["“Lord Er Kong.”","Seeing the arrival, the few Blood Marten Clansmen who were guarding immediately saluted respectfully, at the same time, one of them said, “I don’t know where this human kid came from. He said that he came to propose marriage, and the person who proposed marriage was Her Highness the Princess.” “Oh?” The black-robed man glanced at Zhuo Peng and smiled wickedly. “Who did I think it was? It’s you?” “You human ant, how dare you dream of marrying the Princess of my Blood Marten Clan. To be honest, if not for Princess Ying’s pleas, the clan leader would have killed you long ago. How dare you take the initiative to offer your life to me?”","“Er Kong, I’m here to propose marriage to Ying ‘er. Ask Ying ‘er to come out and see me,” Zhuo Peng said. With Jian Wushuang behind him, Zhuo Peng was confident. “See you?”","“Haha, I advise you to stop daydreaming. The Princess will never come to see you. To tell you the truth, in order to save your life, the Princess has promised the clan leader that she will never see you again. Moreover, she has agreed to the engagement that the clan leader made for her. It Won’t be long before the princess gets married, but it won’t Be You. You’d better give up now,” the wicked man, Er Kong, said.","“What did you say?” Zhuo Peng’s expression changed greatly. Jian Wushuang, who was in the void above, could not stand it any longer. He immediately moved to Zhuo Peng’s side. “Third brother.” Zhuo Peng looked over.","“Leave it to me.” Jian Wushuang smiled and gestured for Zhuo Peng to step aside while Jian Wushuang looked at Er Kong, “Your name Is Er Kong, right? Please go in and inform him that I, Heavenly Sword Marquis, want to meet the clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?” Er Kong’s expression changed. He immediately felt that the name was familiar, but he did not immediately remember where he had heard it. However, because he had already noticed that Jian Wushuang’s aura was only at the Saint Realm, he said directly, “Clan leader, you are too busy to meet a random person. You’d better take the boy and get lost.”","“Oh, really?” Jian Wushuang smiled. “It seems that I was too polite.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang reached for the Blood Mountain Sword behind him with his right hand. The blade was slowly unsheathed, and a cold aura gradually spread in the surrounding area.","“What do you want to do?” Er Kong’s face turned cold.","However, Jian Wushuang did not pay any attention to him. He unsheathed the Blood Mountain Sword, and with shocking power, it directly slashed toward the huge restriction on the ancestral land of the Blood Marten Clan.","Whoosh!","The cold sword light instantly magnified and tore the space apart. A shocking sword shadow that was more than 300 meters long appeared in front of everyone.","“This sword!”","Er Kong, who had not thought much of Jian Wushuang at the beginning, was shocked when he saw this sword.","He saw that Jian Wushuang was just an Immortal Saint, but the power of this sword was obviously much stronger than that of many Principles Masters. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, Heavenly Sword Marquis...” Er Kong repeated the name and suddenly had an idea. “I remember now. He is Heavenly Sword Marquis, the number one genius in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm!”","“It’s actually him!”","Er Kong’s heart trembled. However, that shocking 300-meter-long sword shadow had already mercilessly slashed at the barrier.","Rumble...","Under the impact of the sword shadow’s power, the entire barrier began to tremble slightly. Meanwhile, within the ancestral land of the Blood Marten Clan, the earth and mountains began to shake.","“What’s going on?”","“Why is the surrounding world shaking?”","“It’s the clan-protecting formation shaking. Someone is attacking it!”","“How can it shake the clan-protecting formation like this? The person who is attacking must be a Principles Master at the fourth realm of the Void!”","The entire Blood Marten Clan was in an uproar.","The rule masters of the Blood Marten Clan were also alarmed. They immediately rushed toward the entrance of the clan.","When they arrived, they saw Jian Wushuang in front of them.","“You are...Heavenly Sword Marquis?”","The Principles Masters of the Blood Marten Clan were not as ignorant as Er Kong. They recognized Jian Wushuang at a glance.","“It’s me,” Jian Wushuang admitted directly.","When they learned that the person who attacked the clan-protecting formation was Jian Wushuang, the Principles Masters of the Blood Marten Clan were shocked but also angry.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, why did you attack the clan-protecting formation of the Blood Marten Clan?” Urxiu, the clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, asked in a low voice.","“I came here with great sincerity. I told you my name at the beginning and asked your people to go in and report it. However, your people said that you, the clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, are too busy to meet a nobody like me. They also told me to get lost. What do you think I should do?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently. Hearing this, the Principles Masters of the Blood Marten Clan were shocked.","To compare this super genius, Heavenly Sword Marquis, who was famous in the Divine Beginning Realm, to a nobody?","And to ask Heavenly Sword Marquis to get lost?","Even the three great sages and the three Great Freedom Alliance would not dare to say this, right?","In the current Divine Beginning Realm, who dared to treat Heavenly Sword Marquis as a nobody?","Immediately, they understood why Heavenly Sword Marquis attacked the Blood Marten Clan’s protective array. It was obvious that the words of the Blood Marten Clan’s clansmen had offended or even humiliated the other party.","After understanding this point, the Blood Marten Clan’s Principles Masters could not help but glare at Er Kong angrily.","Er Kong also knew that he had caused trouble. Sensing the gazes of these Principles Masters, he immediately lowered his head.","However, he had already caused trouble, so the Blood Marten Clan could only clean up for Er Kong.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, I’m afraid there’s been a misunderstanding. Er Kong has always stayed in the clan and rarely interacted with the outside world, so he might not have heard of your name, so he might have offended you. I hope you can be magnanimous and don’t blame me,” the Blood Marten Clan leader, Er Xiu, said apologetically.","Although he was the clan leader and the Blood Marten Clan was one of the top clans in the demon region, they did not want to provoke a terrifying existence like Jian Wushuang unless it was absolutely necessary.","“Since it’s a misunderstanding, and since your Blood Marten Clan is a little apologetic, I won’t be so stingy to pursue it. However, I came to your Blood Marten Clan for another matter,” Jian Wushuang said. “What’s the matter?” Ursa asked.","“Second brother, come over.” Jian Wushuang waved to Zhuo Peng behind him."]},{"number":3448,"title":"Chapter 3448 - Rejection","paragraphs":["Zhuo Peng, who was standing at the back, had some misgivings even though he had confidence and confidence in Jian Wushuang. After all, he was now facing the Blood Marten Clan, one of the top clans in the demon region.","However, when he saw that the clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, Er Xiu, did not dare to put on airs in the face of Jian Wushuang’s strength. On the contrary, he was very humble. Zhuo Peng no longer had any misgivings. Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s greeting, he immediately walked up.","“Clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, nice to meet you.” Zhuo Peng greeted him politely.","“And you are?” Er Xiu looked puzzled.","“Clan leader, he is the human cultivator who has a dispute with the princess,” Er Kong said immediately.","“You?” Er Xiu’s face darkened.","“Clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, let me introduce you. This is my second brother. We are blood-related brothers,” Jian Wushuang said.","“What?” Er Xiu was stunned.","The experts of the Blood Marten Clan were also stunned.","They were all high-level experts of the Blood Marten Clan, so they naturally knew that their princess had a relationship with a human cultivator in the Piahuo City not long ago. They had already investigated his background, he should not have a big background, and Zhuo Peng’s talent and strength were not that great. Although their princess liked such a human cultivator, they completely looked down on him.","If it was not for Princess Ying’s request, the Blood Marten Clan would have sent people to kill him.","But it was this human cultivator who did not have any status and ability in their eyes, and now, he actually brought in a big shot!","Heavenly Sword Marquis...this name, no matter which faction it was, they probably did not dare to look down on him in the slightest, and no faction dared to look down on his ability.","It was true that even though he was not ridiculously strong right now, and many factions were not afraid of him in terms of pure strength, what made Heavenly Sword Marquis the most terrifying was his terrifying potential!","He was the number one genius in the history of the Divine Beginning Realm. He was a super genius who could easily defeat many Principles Masters and even severely injure Saint Realm Masters. More importantly, this person’s ability to protect his life was incredible, and he basically could not die, as long as he was not dead, his strength would undoubtedly reach an extremely terrifying level after a period of time.","The Blood Marten Clan should be in awe of such a super genius. If they could avoid making enemies, they should not make enemies.","“Clan leader Blood Marten, you should know the origin of my trip after seeing my second brother, right?” Jian Wushuang looked at Er Xiu in front of him with a faint smile, “I’ll be Frank. I heard that my second brother and Princess Ying of the Blood Marten Clan are very compatible, so I’m here to propose a marriage for my second brother. This is the betrothal gift from my Zhuo family. Take a look.”","Jian Wushuang directly threw an interspatial ring to Er Xiu.","Jian Wushuang was indeed here to propose a marriage, and he was very sincere. For example, Jian Wushuang had given a lot of betrothal gifts in the interspatial ring. There were four or five supreme treasures, which was already very good.","However, after taking Jian Wushuang’s interspatial ring, Er Xiu and the experts of the Blood Marten Clan around him frowned.","Normally, the Blood Marten Clan would be very happy to have a relationship with Jian Wushuang, since Heavenly Sword Marquis had come to propose marriage in person and given them a lot of betrothal gifts, naturally, the marriage would not be a problem.","But now it was different.","The Blood Marten Clan was in a very delicate situation, and the marriage of Princess Ying was more important to the Blood Marten Clan.","Therefore, after a simple exchange with the experts of the Blood Marten Clan, Er Xiu quickly made a decision.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, I’m sorry, but I’m afraid our Blood Marten Clan can’t agree to this marriage,” Er Xiu said. “Oh, why?” Jian wushuang’s face darkened. “Is it because I didn’t give enough betrothal gifts? Or does your Blood Marten Clan still think that my second brother is not good enough for your princess?”","“No, no, Mr. Heavenly Marquis, you’ve given a lot of betrothal gifts, and you’re very sincere. As for your second brother, since you’re here, of course he can be a good match for my daughter. However, Mr. Heavenly Marquis is a step too late. My daughter already has a lover,” Er Xiu said.","“Impossible!” Zhuo Peng immediately shouted in a low voice. “I’m very clear about Ying ‘er’s character. We’ve only been separated for three years, how could she have someone else in her heart?”","“There’s nothing impossible about it. You’re indeed a step too late. Not only does my daughter have someone else in her heart, but both parties have already decided on a marriage contract,” Er Xiu said with a smile.","“How can this be?” Zhuo Peng’s body began to tremble. “No, I don’t believe it. Unless you let her come out and tell me personally, I will only believe what she says!”","“Clan leader Blood Marten, did you hear that?”","“Why don’t we invite Princess Ying out and let her explain it to my second brother face to face? As long as she can explain it clearly and make my second brother completely stop thinking about it, then I’m not the kind of person who will force my second brother to leave immediately. How about it?” Jian Wushuang looked at Er Xiu.","“Well...” Er Xiu pondered for a moment and then shook his head. “No, my daughter is going to be betrothed to someone else soon. How can I show my face in public at this time and get involved with others? If this gets out, won’t it be a disgrace to my Blood Marten Clan?”","“What will my daughter do in the future?”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and gave Er Xiu a deep look, then he smiled and said, “Clan leader Blood Marten, I’m afraid it’s not that your daughter doesn’t want to show her face in public, but as a father, you don’t dare to let her meet my second brother, right?” “How dare you!” Er Xiu’s voice suddenly sank. “Mr. Heavenly Marquis, although I respect your talent and strength, we are in front of the ancestral land of the Blood Marten Clan. You said that it’s not convenient for my daughter to meet outsiders. Are you going to force me?”","“Tsk, tsk, tsk...”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang praised, “Clan leader Blood Marten, I’m very curious. Where did you get the courage to not give me any face? What made you so determined and unwilling to marry Princess Ying ‘er to my second brother? But it doesn’t matter. I’ll know soon enough.”","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, what do you want to do?” Er Xiu narrowed his eyes and stared at Jian Wushuang. “What do you think? Since your Blood Marten Clan doesn’t want to let Princess Ying come out to meet us, we can only go in and meet her ourselves,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Haha, what a joke. What kind of place do you think my Blood Marten Clan is? Do you think you can just enter as you please?” Er Xiu could not help sneering."]},{"number":3449,"title":"Chapter 3449 - Attack the Magic Array","paragraphs":["The high-level experts of the Blood Marten Clan also looked at Jian Wushuang with contempt.","Although they knew that their talent was extremely heaven-defying and their methods were extraordinary, talent was talent, and it was different from true strength. The Blood Marten Clan had existed in the demon region for so many years as a top clan, so its foundation was naturally extraordinary. Without the consent of the Blood Marten Clan, it was naturally extremely difficult for others to break into the territory of the Blood Marten Clan.","Not to mention others, just the huge protective array covering the territory of the clan was not something ordinary experts could shake.","In the face of the ridicule of the experts of the Blood Marten Clan, Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and looked up. “Chenhuo.”","Demon Master Chenhuo appeared beside Jian Wushuang and asked, “What, do you want me to attack again?”","“Of course, I can’t defeat this formation alone. But with your strength, you should be able to defeat it, right?” Jian Wushuang asked with a smile.","“I’m not sure, but I can try,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Then let’s try first,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Demon Master Chenhuo did not say anything. He moved and appeared in front of the clan-protecting formation.","He stood there and was less than half a meter away from the Blood Marten Clan’s clan protection formation. Then, he extended his hand and touched the light membrane of the formation. He immediately sensed an extremely shocking power from the formation.","When the many experts of the Blood Marten Clan saw this scene, they all sneered.","“What is this person doing there?”","“From the looks of it, is he planning to break the Clan Protection Array?” “Humph, what a joke. The Clan Protection Array was created by the ancestor who led the Blood Marten Clan to greatness. No one has been able to break it for a long time. Although this person looks like an expert, it’s impossible for him to break the Clan Protection Array.”","The many experts of the Blood Marten Clan had absolute confidence in their Clan Protective Array.","Therefore, even when they saw the Demon Master Chenhuo appear in front of the array and clearly had the intention to attack the array, they did not stop him. They believed that it was impossible for the Demon Master Chenhuo to break the array.","But at this moment, the Demon Master Chenhuo had already made his move like lightning","He did not make much preparations. After feeling the power of the array formation, he clenched his right hand into a fist and threw a punch at the array formation.","The brutal punch was simple and crude. It contained unimaginable power as it instantly smashed into the light membrane of the array formation. The light membrane that was hit immediately produced a large number of ripples like giant rocks that were like water, these ripples spread out crazily in the surroundings.","The entire array formation also began to tremble violently. This kind of trembling caused the earth and mountains within the Blood Marten Clan to shake as if an earthquake had occurred.","“How could it be?”","When the Blood Marten Clan leader, Er Xiu, saw this scene, his eyes immediately widened. “The power of a punch actually caused such a huge tremor in the protective array formation of our Blood Marten Clan? Could this person be a super expert of the sixth level of the void!?”.","“The sixth realm of the void?” The other experts of the Blood Marten Clan were also shocked.","They could not sense the specific aura of Demon Master Chenhuo, so they thought that Jian Wushuang alone would not be able to threaten them.","But now that Demon Master Chenhuo had made a move, his strength had indeed frightened them.","The sixth realm of the void...this was the top expert of the Divine Beginning Realm.","“Fortunately, even though this person has the strength of the six realms of the void, our Blood Marten Clan’s clan protection array was personally created by that ancestor. If we want to break this Clan Protection Array, just one of the six realms of the void is definitely not enough. This person can at most slightly shake the array, but he definitely can’t break it,” said Er Xiu.","Hearing this, the experts of the Blood Marten Clan heaved a sigh of relief.","What they did not know was that Demon Master Chenhuo did not use his full strength in the beginning","His punch was just to test the sturdiness of the magic array.","“The person who created this magic array is indeed very capable. The power of this magic array is also very impressive.” Demon Master Chenhuo stood at the edge of the magic array and secretly praised.","“Chenhuo, there are so many people watching. Don’t embarrass yourself.” Jian Wushuang’s laughter came over.","Demon Master Chenhuo narrowed his eyes slightly and then flipped his palm. A full set of scarlet gold appeared on his hands.","This Scarlet Gold Glove was Demon Master Chenhuo’s own offensive magic weapon. It had already reached the level of a top-tier supreme treasure and was extremely powerful.","After putting on this Scarlet Gold Glove, his overall combat power naturally increased by a lot.","He was still standing less than half a meter away from the light membrane of the array, but his eyes were still shining with a fierce light. In his right palm, there was a shocking power condensing.","“Heavenly divine extermination!”","Demon Master Chenhuo growled. He clenched his right palm, and in an instant, a brilliant golden light surged up, enveloping the entire world in a golden color. The fist formed by his palm...it was like a huge golden sun.","This golden sun was extremely dazzling, illuminating everything in the world. Under the attention of the surrounding people, it suddenly struck the light membrane of the array formation.","Instantly...boom!","A series of violent explosions shook the entire void. Outside the light membrane, around the body of the Demon Master, Space had completely exploded, and a huge black hole appeared out of thin air.","In front of Demon Master Chenhuo, the light membrane of the array that had been smashed by the fist of Demon Master Chenhuo had completely caved in. It caved in extremely deeply, directly affecting the entire array.","Rumble...the entire array began to tremble madly, as if it was about to collapse. Even the entire ancestral land of the Blood Marten Clan began to turn upside down. “This...”","Upon seeing this scene, all the experts of the Blood Marten Clan were stunned.","They knew very well that although the array in front of them had not been directly broken, from the scene, it was obvious that this array had already reached the limit that they could endure.","Buzz buzz ~","The might of Demon Master Chenhuo’s punch was finally exhausted. The frantically trembling array protecting the tribe gradually regained its calm.","Seeing this, Demon Master Chenhuo was not angry, but happy instead. “Haha, not bad, not bad. The power of this array is indeed impressive. It can actually block my full-force attack of the god extinguisher. It seems that this array is qualified for me to use the god extinguisher of the dragon.”","“God extinguisher of the dragon?”","Hearing Demon Master Chenhuo talking to himself, the faces of the experts of the Blood Marten Clan changed drastically.","They could tell from the words of Demon Master Chenhuo that the punch just now was not the strongest move of Demon Master Chenhuo. He had yet to use an even stronger move!"]},{"number":3450,"title":"Chapter 3450 - Bow Your Head","paragraphs":["–","–","“How is this possible?”","“The Clan Protection Array of our Blood Marten Clan was personally set up by the most powerful ancestor back then. Furthermore, the ancestor had also instructed that unless one was like him, a supreme expert who had reached the peak of the sixth level of the void, no one would be able to forcefully break through this array. But this person...could it be that his strength is comparable to that of the ancestor at his peak?” Er Xiu widened his eyes.","At this moment, the members of the Blood Marten Clan had already noticed that a large amount of power was once again beginning to gather on the body of the Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Not good!” The expressions of the experts of the Blood Marten Clan changed drastically.","They could all see that the attack just now from the Demon Master Chenhuo had already reached the limit of the clan protection formation. It was estimated that the clan protection formation would not be able to withstand another two or three such attacks.","What Demon Master Chenhuo had just said meant that the attack he was about to unleash would be even stronger than the previous one!","“Stop, stop!”","Er Xiu did not dare to let Demon Master Chenhuo attack the formation again. After all, the formation had protected them for so many years. If it was broken by force, the formation would collapse, no one in the Blood Marten Clan could restore the clan-protecting formation, so they immediately shouted.","“Chenhuo, stop,” Jian Wushuang said.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the power gathered by Demon Master Chenhuo gradually calmed down.","Seeing this, the experts of the Blood Marten Clan finally heaved a sigh of relief.","“Clan leader Blood Marten, weren’t you very confident just now that I could enter your Blood Marten Clan whenever I wanted?” Jian Wushuang looked at Er Xiu mockingly. “Now that I’m standing here, do you dare to repeat what you just said?”","“This...” Er Xiu’s face could not help twitching. He dared to say that just now because he had absolute confidence in the Blood Marten Clan’s protective array. He believed that Jian Wushuang’s strength would not be able to shake the array, but he did not expect that...Jian Wushuang also had a terrifying Demon Master of the Chenhuo Clan by his side.","With the help of the Demon Master of the Chenhuo Clan, it was not impossible to break the array.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, it is indeed my Blood Marten Clan’s fault. I apologize to you, Mr. Heavenly Marquis, but my daughter has already been engaged to someone. I definitely did not lie about that,” Er Xiu said.","“Even if there is an engagement, it’s probably decided by your Blood Marten Clan. I’m afraid it’s not agreed by Princess Ying herself,” Jian Wushuang said.","Er Xiu was silent.","“Humph, I knew it. Even if Ying ‘er doesn’t see me anymore because of your Blood Marten Clan, she wouldn’t agree to the engagement so soon. It turns out that everything is decided by your Blood Marten Clan,” Zhuo Peng said in a low voice.","“Clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, since I came here personally to propose the marriage and brought a great betrothal gift, I have already given face to your Blood Marten Clan. But now I’m curious, who did you betroth Princess Ying to that is worthy for your Blood Marten Clan to come and ruin my face?” Jian Wushuang looked at Er Xiu coldly.","Er Xiu frowned and hesitated for a moment, then said, “To tell you the truth, the one who has an engagement with my daughter is the young clan leader of the Scarlet Gold Clan, Chi Hu!”","“Chi Hu?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Zhuo Peng, Zhuo Yunfeng, and the others who were watching quietly from above were also stunned.","They had been guessing who the Blood Marten Clan had betrothed Princess Ying to. They had not expected that it would be Chi Hu?","“Haha, this is interesting.” Jian Wushuang laughed. His smile was very strange. After a long while, he stopped laughing, he said, “Blood Marten Clan, since the engagement is with Chi Hu, I can tell you now that the engagement has been canceled.” “Canceled?” Er Xiu was stunned.","The experts of the Blood Marten Clan were also puzzled.","Jian Wushuang continued, “I’ll tell you directly. Not long ago, in the Piahuo City, I killed Chi Hu, the young grandmaster of the Scarlet Gold Clan, because he offended me.”","“What?” Er Xiu was shocked.","The experts of the Blood Marten Clan were also stunned. Chi Hu had been killed?","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, Chi Hu is really dead. Did you lie to me?” Er Xiu did not quite believe it.","“I’m not going to lie to you for such a thing. I killed Chi Hu in the Piahuo City, and it caused quite a stir. The ancestral land of your Blood Marten Clan is not far from the Piahuo City, and there must be clansmen in the city. You can send a message to your clansmen in the Piahuo City and ask him to inquire about it. He should be able to find out,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","Er Xiu immediately ordered the people next to him to send a message.","After a short while, they received a definite result.","“He’s dead, Chi Hu is indeed dead!”","“According to the news from Piahuo City, the one who killed Chi Hu was an Immortal Saint who used a sword. He killed Chi Hu and caused a huge commotion in Piahuo City. Even the commander of the Piahuo City’s City Protection Army personally rushed over, but because the other party had a super expert by his side, the City Protection Army didn’t dare to make a move at all...now, it seems that the one who killed Chi Hu was this Heavenly Sword Marquis, and the super expert by his side is this terrifying existence who has reached the peak of the six states of the void.”","The experts of the Blood Marten Clan had already made their own judgment. After a brief discussion, Er Xiu took a deep breath, then he solemnly said, “Mr. Heavenly Marquis, you’re right. Since Chi Hu is dead, the engagement between him and my daughter naturally doesn’t count. Now that Mr. Heavenly Marquis has personally proposed the marriage, please come to my Blood Marten Clan for a chat.”","“If you had done this earlier, it would have saved us a lot of trouble.” Jian Wushuang smiled and beckoned Zhuo Yunfeng and the others to come down. Then they entered the ancestral land of the Blood Marten Clan.","In a magnificent hall in the ancestral land of the Blood Marten Clan, Jian Wushuang and Er Xiu sat side by side, while Demon Master Chenhuo sat casually beside them. Zhuo Yunfeng, Zhuo Peng, and the others also sat casually","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, there are indeed many misunderstandings about today’s matter. Normally, if you came to propose marriage in person, the Blood Marten Clan would certainly give you a name. But this time, we did it out of helplessness.” Er Xiu sighed.","“I see.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He could see that the Blood Marten Clan must have some special reasons. Otherwise, they would not have been so tough in the beginning and directly refused his proposal. Even if it was the Scarlet Gold Clan on the other side, the clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan must know that Jian Wushuang might not be inferior to the Scarlet Gold Clan in terms of weight alone."]},{"number":3451,"title":"Chapter 3451 - Divine Moon Palace","paragraphs":["“Clan leader Blood Marten, tell me.” Jian Wushuang knocked on the armchair casually.","“Celestial Marquis, to tell you the truth, the Blood Marten Clan arranged the marriage between my daughter and Chi Hu so that the Blood Marten Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan could get closer through marriage. This way, we can have more confidence when we face the blood clan,” Er Xiu said.","“Blood Clan?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “What does the marriage between you and the Scarlet Gold Clan have to do with the blood clan?”","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, you may not know this, but although the Blood Marten Clan has always been a top clan in the demon region, in fact, our clan only had a period of glory when the ancestor was still alive. After the ancestor went to the universe battlefield, our clan gradually declined. Although we are still a top clan now, we are already at the bottom of the top clans!” “Many other races also secretly said that the Blood Marten Clan was not worthy of its name and no longer had the strength of a top race. In addition, the Heavenly Sword Marquis may also know that the competition between many races in the demon region has always been very cruel, and our Blood Marten Clan has been fighting with many races all year round!”","“Now that our Blood Marten Clan is under-estimated, our overall strength has already pulled away from many other top races. Naturally...many races want to replace our Blood Marten Clan, and there are even races that want to directly annex our Blood Marten Clan.”","“Are you saying that the clans that want to annex your Blood Marten Clan are the blood clan?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes.” Er Xiu nodded heavily. “Among the many top clans in the demon region, even if some of them have designs on the Blood Marten Clan, they would at most occupy the territory resources of the Blood Marten Clan. However, they would never want to annex or exterminate the Blood Marten Clan. After all, the Blood Marten Clan has had its glory. A camel that is about to die is bigger than a horse. In addition, there is the sect-protecting formation set up by the ancestor. The top clans in the demon region would not dare to truly fight with the Blood Marten Clan. However, the blood clan is different!”","“Blood clan, you are one of the four great divine clans. Your foundation and strength are far beyond that of the Blood Marten Clan. Even when the Blood Marten Clan was at its peak, we were still inferior to the blood clan when the ancestor was around, let alone now!”","“There is no doubt that the blood clan has the ability to directly devour and annihilate the Blood Marten Clan. From the actions of the blood clan over the years, it seems that the blood clan does have such a thought. It’s just that they are worried about the other divine clan, the Nine-tailed Clan, in the nearby territory. That’s why they haven’t made a move","yet.”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","The most powerful clans around the Piahuo City were not only the Scarlet Gold Clan and the Blood Marten Clan, but also the even more terrifying Nine-tailed Clan.","As for the blood clan, they were still some distance away from this territory. If the blood clan took action against the Blood Marten Clan, it would be equivalent to encroaching on the territory near the Nine-tailed Clan. Of course, the Nine-tailed Clan would not sit idly by.","“Since the Nine-tailed Clan is keeping the balance, what do you need to worry about?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I didn’t worry about it before, but over the years, the Nine-tailed Clan has also encountered some troubles,” Er Xiu said.","“Oh, what troubles?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“It’s a newly-risen clan. To be exact, it’s a newly-risen force,” Er Xiu said.","“Power?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Yes, it’s called Divine Moon Palace. It was founded hundreds of years ago. At first, it was very low-key and didn’t attract much attention. But in just a few hundred years, it has developed into a map that even the Nine-tailed Clan wouldn’t dare to underestimate. Especially 30 years ago, Divine Moon Palace even annexed the Howling Demon Clan and made the entire clan submit to it,” Er Xiu said.","“The Roaring Demon Clan?” Jian Wushuang’s pupils constricted.","Among the many clans in the demon region, he knew not only the four great divine clans but also a few powerful top clans. The Roaring Demon Clan was undoubtedly an extremely powerful top clan, although there were no experts of the sixth void realm in the clan, it was said that there were two experts at the peak of the fifth void realm and many powerful Principles Masters.","In terms of overall strength, the Roaring Demon Clan was much stronger than the Blood Marten Clan, even stronger than the Scarlet Gold Clan.","How could such a top clan be annexed by the Divine Moon Palace, which had been established for only a few hundred years?","The Divine Moon Palace had amazing methods!","“What’s next?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“After the Divine Moon Palace annexed the Roaring Demon Clan, its overall strength skyrocketed. It has become a force above all the top clans, and it is qualified to threaten the status of the four great divine clans. As the only divine clan in this territory, the Nine-tailed Clan also sensed the threat, so they wanted to suppress the Divine Moon Palace. Unexpectedly, the Divine Moon Palace directly fought with the Nine-tailed Clan!” Er Xiu exclaimed.","“The Divine Moon Palace is not fighting indirectly, but directly. It can even be said to be a direct declaration of war. The nine-tailed race will naturally not be outdone. Therefore, the nine-tailed race and the Divine Moon Palace have been fighting fiercely all these years. Although the nine-tailed race has the upper hand, they do not have an absolute advantage. Instead, the Divine Moon Palace has been recruiting experts everywhere all these years. As their strength grows, the threat they pose to the nine-tailed race also grows!”","“At this time, the Nine-tailed Clan has put all their attention on Divine Moon Palace, so they have no time to care about the fights between the other clans. Therefore, they have given the blood clan an opportunity. Not long ago, experts from the blood clan came here one after another and even fought with the Blood Marten Clan.”","“Is that why you want to recruit the Scarlet Gold Clan to fight against the blood clan through marriage?” Jian Wushuang looked at Er Xiu.","“Yes, the Blood Marten Clan is not the only one who has noticed the blood clan’s intention. The Scarlet Gold Clan has also noticed it. We have a tacit understanding with each other in this marriage alliance. Now that the marriage alliance has been formed, it’s suitable for the two top clans to fight against the blood clan together. With the combined strength of the Blood Marten Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan, as long as the blood clan doesn’t come out in full force, we’ll be able to protect ourselves,” Er Xiu said.","“After you proposed the marriage, I also thought about giving up the marriage with the Scarlet Gold Clan and choosing you, but you are a human cultivator and don’t stay in the demon region all year round. If something happens to the Blood Marten Clan, you won’t be able to come in time.”","“Secondly, although you are very talented and have great potential, your current strength...” Before Er Xiu finished his words, Jian Wushuang had completely understood."]},{"number":3452,"title":"Chapter 3452 - Alliance?","paragraphs":["–","–","“Although I’m talented, I’m afraid that the blood clan won’t respect me, let alone respect me. Clan leader Blood Marten, is that what you mean?” Jian Wushuang said.","Er Xiu smiled awkwardly. From his laughter, it was clear that he had tacitly agreed.","Jian Wushuang was helpless about this.","“Of course, that’s because our Blood Marten Clan didn’t know that you had an expert who had reached the peak of the sixth realm of the void. Otherwise, our Blood Marten Clan would have decisively given up on the Scarlet Gold Clan and chosen to form an alliance with you,” Er Xiu said.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang understood.","If he alone was not enough to make the blood clan fear him or her, then the addition of Demon Master Chenhuo would definitely be enough.","If the blood clan knew that the Blood Marten Clan had an expert at the peak of the sixth void realm as a helper, they would definitely not dare to have any thoughts about the Blood Marten Clan.","“Clan leader Blood Marten, since we’ve already said this, I’ll speak frankly. My second brother is definitely going to marry Princess Ying of your Blood Marten clan, and our Zhuo Clan and your Blood Marten Clan will naturally become in-laws. If your Blood Marten Clan is in trouble at this time, our Zhuo Clan will naturally not sit idly by. As a member of the Zhuo Clan, of course, I will also take action,” Jian Wushuang said.","“I’m relieved to hear your words, Mr. Heavenly Marquis. I’ll send my daughter here immediately.” Er Xiu hurriedly called out to the Blood Marten Clan. “Hurry, go and bring Ying ‘er here.”","“Yes.” Someone from the Blood Marten Clan immediately went over. Not long after, Zhuo Peng’s beloved Princess Ying appeared in front of everyone.","“This is my second sister-in-law?” Looking at the delicate and beautiful girl in front of him, Jian Wushuang’s expression could not help but change. He could not help admiring his second brother’s good taste. “Ying ‘er!”","Seeing the girl, Zhuo Peng was pleasantly surprised.","“Zhuo Peng, why are you here?” Princess Ying was a little surprised.","She had thought that she would never see Zhuo Peng again. She did not expect that Zhuo Peng would come to the land of the Blood Marten Clan.","“Ying ‘er, your father has promised to marry you to me. From now on, we will never be separated,” Zhuo Peng walked to Princess Ying and said excitedly.","“What?” Princess Ying was stunned at first, but then she looked at Er Xiu in disbelief. “Father...”","“Haha, daughter, Zhuo Peng is a good boy. I can see that he really likes you. Father will naturally fulfill your wish,” Er Xiu said with a smile.","“Great, great!” Princess Ying also shouted happily.","A moment later, Zhuo Peng pulled Princess Ying to Jian Wushuang.","“Ying ‘er, it’s all thanks to third brother’s help that we can be together this time. Let’s thank him together,” Zhuo Peng said.","“Third brother?” Princess Ying looked at Jian Wushuang in confusion.","Er Xiu, who was beside her, hurriedly said, “Ying ‘er, Mr. Heavenly Marquis is the number one genius in the Divine Beginning Realm. The reason why you and Zhuo Peng can be together this time is largely because of Mr. Heavenly Marquis.”","“Thank you, Mr. Heavenly Marquis.” Princess Ying bowed and said gratefully.","“Second brother, second sister-in-law, we are family. There’s no need to be so polite.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Princess Ying stood up, but she still looked at Jian Wushuang with some doubt.","“This person is Zhuo Peng’s third brother? That means he is younger than Zhuo Peng, but why is father so humble when facing him?” Princess Ying muttered in her heart.","“Second brother, you and second sister-in-law haven’t seen each other for a while. Go and have a good chat. You can meet father and mother in an instant,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Zhuo Peng immediately led Princess Ying to Zhuo Yunfeng and Luo Xinqin.","Jian Wushuang, who was still sitting side by side with Er Xiu, said in a soft voice, “Clan leader Blood Marten, the marriage between our two families has been decided. Now, let’s talk about another matter.”","“May I know what you are talking about?” Er Xiu asked.","“I have just agreed that if the blood clan threatens your Blood Marten Clan, I will do my best to help. But at the same time, if I encounter some trouble in the demon region, I’m afraid I will also need your Blood Marten Clan’s help. So, why don’t we form an alliance?” Jian Wushuang said.","“An alliance?” Er Xiu was stunned, but then he laughed. “Of course, it’s the best!”","Er Xiu could not wait to form an alliance with Jian Wushuang so that he could completely tie Jian Wushuang to his side.","“Don’t be in such a hurry to agree. This matter is not as simple as you think,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Oh?” Er Xiu was surprised.","“To tell you the truth, I will be in the demon region for a long time. Of course, I have a lot of things to do. I’m afraid that you, clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, and your entire clan won’t be able to accept some of these things,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Oh? What is it that our entire clan won’t be able to accept?” Er Xiu asked.","“For example, fighting a celestial race or even destroying one? Can your Blood Marten Clan accept that?” Jian Wushuang laughed.","“What?” Er Xiu was completely stunned. “Fighting a celestial race or even destroying one? Mr. Heavenly Marquis, are you kidding?”","“I’m not kidding. It’s really possible. That’s why I want you to think carefully.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, do you really want to attack a celestial race?” Er Xiu looked at Jian Wushuang in surprise. “It’s not that I want to attack, but I’m afraid that my other ally will do so.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“Who’s my other ally?” Er Xiu asked.","“My other ally, if I’m not mistaken, is the Divine Moon Palace you mentioned earlier!” Jian Wushuang said.","“What?” Er Xiu was shocked.","The Divine Moon Palace, the mysterious force that had only risen for a few hundred years but was already able to challenge the Nine-tailed Clan?","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, are you the helper that the Divine Moon Palace hired to deal with the Nine-tailed Clan?” Er Xiu asked in shock.","“I can’t be sure for now, but I think it’s most likely,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","According to Er Xiu, the Divine Moon Palace had only risen for a few hundred years, but it had developed at a terrifying speed.","Moreover, the Divine Moon Palace was obviously aimed at the Nine-tailed Clan. Therefore, Jian Wushuang immediately thought of Miss Xiao’er. According to his guess, Miss Xiao’er should be the one who created the Divine Moon Palace. Only Miss Xiao’er had the strength and motive to do so."]},{"number":3453,"title":"Chapter 3453 - Goodbye, Xiao’er","paragraphs":["“It’s actually very easy to determine whether Divine Moon Palace is my ally or not.” Jian Wushuang smiled. “Clan leader, if you want the blood clan to be afraid of your Blood Marten Clan and not dare to attack it, then naturally, you must let the blood clan know about my relationship with your blood marten clan. If that’s the case, then you can take the initiative to spread the news.”","“Moreover, when I killed Scarlet Tiger in Piahuo City previously, I caused quite a commotion. I also let the City Protection Army in Piahuo City know that I have an expert at the peak of the sixth level of the void. This news will also be spread out. When that time comes, the blood clan will not dare to act rashly. And if that ally of mine is really the Divine Moon Palace, then they will naturally come looking for me. We only need to wait here. When that time comes, you can decide whether you want to form an alliance with me or not.”","“I understand. I’ll send someone to spread the news now. Besides, Chi Hu is dead, so the engagement between the Blood Marten Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan doesn’t count. I have to make it clear to the Scarlet Gold Clan.” Er Xiu immediately went to make arrangements.","Jian Wushuang stayed in the Blood Marten Clan and waited quietly.","As time passed, the news that Heavenly Sword Marquis had arrived in the demon region and that an expert had reached the sixth realm of the Void had spread throughout the entire demon region.","The entire demon area was in an uproar, especially when the Heavenly Sword Marquis had killed the young patriarch of the Scarlet Gold Clan in Piahuo City and married the blood marten tribe. This meant that the Heavenly Sword Marquis had arrived in the demon area, he did not just pass by.","The various tribes in the demon area naturally began to pay attention. In the Grand Meeting Hall of the Scarlet Gold Clan, many high-level experts of the Scarlet Gold Clan gathered together.","“He’s going too far!”","“This Heavenly Sword Marquis is really going too far!”","Roars sounded continuously in the hall. It was the current chief of the Scarlet Gold Clan.","SON","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you killed my son. If I don’t take revenge, I’ll be a father in vain!” The chief of the Scarlet Gold Clan clenched his fists, his nails dug into his flesh. After a while, he said, “Didn’t Heavenly Sword Marquis kill someone in Piahuo City? This is against the rules set by the races of the demon area. What did the other races say?” “Clan leader, you know how capable Heavenly Sword Marquis is. Even the three Saint Realms can’t do anything to him. Who else can kill him?","“Moreover, the news from the Piahuo City said that Heavenly Sword Marquis had a super expert at the sixth realm of the void with him. He had extraordinary potential, and with such an expert by his side, who would dare to provoke the races of the demon region? Naturally, they would turn a blind eye and pretend not to know,” said an elder of the Scarlet Gold Clan.","“Pretend not to know? We made the rules together. How can we pretend not to know now?!” The Scarlet Gold Clan leader was furious.","“There’s nothing we can do about it. The Heavenly Sword Marquis is not easy to provoke. Even the four great celestial races are not willing to provoke him, let alone the top races. Moreover, the Heavenly Sword Marquis seems to be in a marriage alliance with the Blood Marten Clan. The Blood Marten Clan is also on his side. No one else dares to talk about gods,” continued the elder.","“By the way, it’s not as if all the races in the demon region don’t know about it. One of the four great celestial races, the nine-tailed race, has condemned him. However, the nine-tailed race is mainly because the Heavenly Sword Marquis killed the Nine Palace Saintess. Furthermore, the nine-tailed race has to deal with the Divine Moon Palace, so they have no time to worry about the Heavenly Sword Marquis. Therefore, they can only say it verbally.” “Humph, a bunch of trash!” The Scarlet Gold Clan leader snorted coldly. “Tribe leader, that Heavenly Sword Marquis is indeed not to be trifled with. Why don’t we just forget about this matter?” The elder said softly.","However, the moment he finished speaking, he was immediately met with the piercing cold gaze of the Scarlet Gold Clan leader. He was so frightened that he did not dare to say anything more.","“Humph, forget about it? What kind of joke is this? How can I not take revenge for killing my son?” The Scarlet Gold Clan leader’s voice was icy cold, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, just you wait. Maybe I can’t do anything to you now, but no matter what I do, I will make you pay for it!”","“And the Blood Marten Clan, do you think you can kick the Scarlet Gold Clan away with the ship of Heavenly Marquis Sword?”","“In your dreams!” The cold voice echoed in the hall, causing the air in the hall to freeze.","Jian Wushuang was waiting quietly in the Blood Marten Clan.","Meanwhile, the Blood Marten Clan had already lit lanterns and prepared for the wedding of Zhuo Peng and Princess Ying.","The two parties had already set a date and were waiting to get married. The location of the wedding was in the Blood Marten Clan.","However, on this day, someone came looking for him.","“Mr. Heavenly Marquis, Mr. Heavenly Marquis!” Er Xiu rushed to Jian Wushuang.","“Clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, why are you in such a hurry? Is someone really here?” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Yes, someone is here, and he specifically asked for you. In addition, the clansmen of the Blood Marten Clan who are guarding outside have sent a message to someone. The person is very mysterious, so we can’t see his face clearly. It’s even difficult to capture his aura. However, we can tell that he is definitely a real expert,” Er Xiu said.","“That’s most likely true. Let’s go and welcome him.” Jian Wushuang smiled and immediately rushed toward the entrance of the Blood Marten Clan with Er Xiu, along with Demon Master Chenhuo.","As soon as they reached the entrance, Jian Wushuang immediately saw two gray-robed figures in the void in front of him.","The two gray-robed figures were completely out of the gray robe’s coverage. The surrounding void was quite hazy, so he could not see their appearance.","However, Jian Wushuang did not need to see their appearances. He only needed to sense their unique aura to recognize them. “It really is her,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile.","The two gray-robed figures had also stepped down.","“Miss Xiao’er, it’s been many years. How have you been?” Jian Wushuang looked at the clearly delicate figure in front of him.","The gray robe retreated, and the surrounding haze disappeared. The delicate figure raised her head, revealing a peerless beauty with a deep charm, it was so charming that people could not help but bow their heads.","The moment they saw the woman’s face, the clansmen of the Blood Marten Clan were stunned. They stood there like stones, not moving at all.","“Miss Xiao’er’s charm is really getting better and better. She doesn’t even need to speak. Her every move is probably enough to make some weaker cultivators lose their minds completely,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","He had personally experienced Miss Xiao’er’s charm. At the same time, the Nine Palace Saintess in the Blood Wave Realm had also used the same trick on him.","However, the Nine Palace Saintess’ seductive methods were far inferior to miss Xiao’er’s."]},{"number":3454,"title":"Chapter 3454 - Xiao’er’s Origin","paragraphs":["–","–","“Jian Wushuang, the last time we met, you didn’t even step into the Divine Master Realm. But in the blink of an eye, so many years have passed, and you’re already recognized as the number one genius in the Divine Beginning Realm. Even the three Saint Realms can’t do anything to you. You’re really extraordinary,” Xiao’er said, her voice was sweet and intoxicating.","“Miss Xiao’er, aren’t you different now? If I’m not wrong, the Divine Moon Palace, which has just risen in the demon region, was created by Miss Xiao’er,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“It’s just a small trick.” Xiao’er smiled, tacitly acknowledging the relationship between the Divine Moon Palace and her.","“A small trick? It’s not a small trick to be able to create a major force in a short period of time that can challenge the Nine-tailed Clan and have an expert of the sixth realm of the void with you.” Demon Master Chenhuo suddenly spoke, his eyes were intentionally or unintentionally looking at the gray-robed figure behind Xiao’er.","The gray-robed figure was still shrouded in the gray robe and did not reveal his appearance. His aura was also very hazy. However, with the strength of Demon Master Chenhuo, he could naturally sense the hidden aura of the other party. “The sixth realm of the void?” Jian Wushuang also revealed a surprised look.","“I spent a lot of effort to subdue this servant beside me. Unlike You, a super expert at the peak of the sixth realm of the void would willingly follow him as a guard. This is really surprising,” Xiao’er said. “A servant?”","Jian Wushuang and the experts from the Blood Marten Clan around him were secretly shocked.","They had thought that the expert behind Xiao’er was just an expert under her command. They did not expect that he was just a servant? To make a super expert of the six realms of the void a servant...","“Although Chenhuo is working with me as a guard, we are working together as equals. Unlike You, Miss Xiao’er, who directly makes an expert of the six realms of the void a servant,” Jian Wushuang said with a faint smile, “Well, let’s not talk about these unnecessary things. Let’s go to the Blood Marten Clan and talk about it slowly.” “Okay.” Xiao’er nodded.","UNnler","“Mr. Heavenly Sword Marquis, and Miss Xiao’er, please come in,” Er Xiu said respectfully.","He knew very well that although he was the grandmaster of the Blood Marten Clan, he was nothing in front of Jian Wushuang or Miss Xiao’er.","Jian Wushuang had amazing potential. He was even a threat to the three Saint Realms, and he was accompanied by the guards of experts at the peak of the six void realms.","As for Miss Xiao ‘er, he had just heard that she was the mysterious expert who founded the Divine Moon Palace. The Blood Marten Clan could not afford to offend either of them.","The group returned to the Blood Marten Clan and then came to the meeting hall of the Blood Marten Clan.","Because the people who came to discuss the matter were too special, the entire hall had been covered by a magic array.","There were only five people sitting in the hall.","They were Jian Wushuang, Xiao’er, Er Xiu, Demon Master Chenhuo, and the servant who followed Xiao’er.","Except for the five people, no one else was qualified to enter the hall.","“Jian Wushuang, do you still remember what we talked about?” Xiao’er looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Of course I do. We formed an alliance and helped each other,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s right. As my ally, you now know that I created the Divine Moon Palace, so you naturally know what I need your help with,” Xiao’er said.","“I know. I’m just going to help you deal with the Nine-tailed Clan. But before that, there’s something I have to figure out,” Jian Wushuang said after a moment of silence, then he said, “That’s where you come from, and what kind of grudges do you have with the Nine-tailed Clan?”","“Well...” Xiao’er’s expression changed slightly. “Why? Can’t you tell me about it now?” Jian Wushuang shrugged.","“You are my ally and have enough strength. Of course, you are qualified to know about this, but Grandmaster Er Xiu...” Xiao’er looked at Er Xiu with interest.","Er Xiu and the Blood Marten Clan were not allies of Divine Moon Palace.","“Grandmaster Blood Marten has also intended to form an alliance with us. The main purpose of this visit is to form a true alliance between the three of us,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Oh, is that so?” Xiao’er raised her eyebrows. “At least the Blood Marten Clan knows what’s good for them. It saves the Divine Moon Palace from having to take action personally.” “What?” Er Xiu was surprised, but then he said in a low voice, “Miss Xiao’er, do you mean that you had planned to take action against the Blood Marten Clan?”","“What do you think?” Xiao’er looked at Er Xiu with a sneer, “In this territory, other than the Nine-tailed Clan, there are only two top tribes, your Blood Marten Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan. Now, my Divine Moon Palace has been developing very fast, but it has basically reached its limit. If you want to increase your strength again, you can only think of ways to annex or control other tribes. Your Blood Marten Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan are naturally the best targets for my Divine Moon Palace.”","“I’m not afraid to tell you now that I’ve secretly controlled some members of the Blood Marten Clan, including a few core figures. If you don’t plan to form an alliance with Jian Wushuang, my Divine Moon Palace will make a move within three years at most. At that time, your Blood Marten Clan will definitely take the initiative to provoke my Divine Moon Palace. Then, my Divine Moon Palace will use this as an excuse to swallow your Blood Marten Clan with lightning speed.”","“Believe me, if my Divine Moon Palace really wants to devour your Blood Marten Clan, then even the Nine-tailed Clan won’t have the time to react.”","Upon hearing Xiao’er’s words, Er Xiu’s face turned pale. At the same time, he felt a lingering fear in his heart.","He knew very well that Xiao’er’s words were not the slightest bit exaggerated. With the Divine Moon Palace’s current strength and means, it would be too easy for them to devour his Blood Marten Clan.","If it were not for the fact that the Nine-tailed Clan would stop them, they would not have to prepare anything.","Now that Divine Moon Palace had made careful preparations, they would not give the Blood Marten Clan any chance to react. Just like when Divine Moon Palace swallowed the Roaring Demon Clan.","The Roaring Demon Clan was much stronger than the Blood Marten Clan, but they were suddenly swallowed by Divine Moon Palace.","At the thought of this, Er Xiu was even more shocked.","“Clan leader Er Xiu, Jian Wushuang just said that your Blood Marten Clan only intends to form an alliance with the Divine Moon Palace?” Xiao’er looked at Er Xiu again.","“No, no, Miss Xiao’er, I’ve already decided that my Blood Marten Clan will form an alliance with the Divine Moon Palace and Mr. Heavenly Marquis now. No matter what your orders are, my Blood Marten Clan will not refuse. Even if you want my Blood Marten Clan to help the Divine Moon Palace fight against the Nine-tailed Clan, we can do it,” Er Xiu said solemnly."]},{"number":3455,"title":"Chapter 3455 - Nine-Life Charming Heaven Skill!","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang and Xiao’er laughed at his words.","“Clan leader, from now on, your Blood Marten Clan is our ally,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Although the Blood Marten Clan is at the bottom of the top clans, it is still a top clan and has a good foundation. It would be great if we can get the Blood Marten Clan to help us without fighting,” Xiao’er added.","“Miss Xiao’er, since the Blood Marten Clan is now our ally, Clan Leader Erxiu is also qualified to know everything. Now you can tell us about the grudge between you and the Nine-tailed Clan,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Sure.” Xiao’er nodded and was silent for a moment, then she said, “Jian Wushuang, when we first met, you already knew that I am a reincarnated cultivator. But what you don’t know is that this is not my first reincarnation.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","“Before this life, I had reincarnated eight times. This time, it was the ninth time. It was the ninth time that the secret skill that I cultivated had truly reached perfection. From then on, I could do everything I wanted to do. The previous eight lives were just the middle of the transition,” Xiao’er said.","“Nine reincarnations, just to cultivate a secret skill to the perfection level? What secret skill is that?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","However, Er Xiu’s eyes suddenly widened. “Could it be...”","“Oh? Clan leader Er Xiu, do you know the secret skill I cultivate?” Xiao’er looked at Er Xiu.","“I know a legendary secret skill that requires nine reincarnations to reach the perfection level. This secret skill is said to come from the universe battlefield and is an extremely magical and incredible secret skill. It’s called the nine-lives succubus skill!” Er Xiu said.","“As expected of the leader of the Blood Marten Clan. Your knowledge is indeed extraordinary. That’s right. The secret technique I’m cultivating is precisely the nine-lives succubus technique.” Xiao’er said with a smile.","“How can it be?” Er Xiu was extremely shocked, “Nine-lives succubus technique. Isn’t that a secret technique that the Nine-tailed Clan doesn’t impart? You have such a great enmity with the Nine-tailed Clan. It’s obvious that you have the intention of completely exterminating the Nine-tailed Clan. How can you cultivate the Nine-tailed Clan’s supreme secret technique?”","“Moreover...it’s said that since the Nine-tailed Clan obtained the nine- life charm, no one has been able to successfully cultivate it. They don’t even have the qualifications to cultivate it. In all these years, no one has ever cultivated this secret skill, but you actually succeeded?”","“Haha, no one can cultivate this secret skill?”","“Yes, before me, no one could cultivate it, but now it’s different. As for why I cultivate this secret skill, it’s actually very simple. Because I’m originally a member of the Nine-tailed Clan,” Xiao’er said.","“As expected.” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, but he was not surprised.","Since Xiao’er had been entangled with the Nine-tailed Clan and possessed the unique enchantment skill of the Nine-tailed Clan, he had guessed that Miss Xiao’er might be from the Nine-tailed Clan.","However, Er Xiu found it difficult to understand, “You’re clearly a clansman of the Nine-tailed Clan, and since you can cultivate the nine-life enchantment skill, the Nine-tailed Clan must have attached great importance to you and even treated you as a treasure. But how could you end up hating the Nine-tailed Clan so much?”","“Hmph, I’m not lying. My real name is Daji, and I’m originally a member of the Nine-tailed Clan. Furthermore, I have the purest Emperor Phoenix bloodline in the Nine-tailed Clan. The Emperor Phoenix bloodline is the bloodline of the Nine-tailed Clan’s royal clan. In the Nine-tailed Clan, only the owner of the Emperor Phoenix bloodline can become the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan and lead the entire clan.”","“Hence, after I was born, many members of the Nine-tailed Clan did treat me as a treasure, and everyone treated me with great respect and respect. Everything was going well for me, but after that, because of one thing, it completely changed. My family and my clansmen abandoned me, completely ignoring my life and death. In the end, the Nine-tailed Clan even did not hesitate to kill me with their own hands.” As Xiao’er spoke up to this point...their body began to tremble slightly, and their eyes were filled with shocking hatred.","However, Jian Wushuang was still puzzled. He could not help but ask, “Miss Xiao’er, what exactly is the matter you mentioned?”","“It has something to do with the Seven Star Xuan Sect.” Xiao’er glanced at Jian Wushuang lightly. She knew that Jian Wushuang had a deep relationship with the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","When Jian Wushuang used the Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s secret skill in front of her in the Witch Desert Realm, Xiao’er recognized him at a glance.","Jian Wushuang was shocked.","It was related to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect?","Then...","“Jian Wushuang, do you know why I chose to ally with you instead of killing you when I first saw you and saw you use the Seven Star Mysterious Sect’s secret skill?” Xiao’er stared at Jian Wushuang. “To be honest, you were nothing but an ant in my eyes at that time. You were not qualified to ally with me at that time. However, I proposed the alliance because of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect behind you!”","“You may not know this, but I have always been on the side of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect because the person I love the most is from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect!”","“The person you love the most?” Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then he looked at Xiao’er in shock. “Miss Xiao’er, is your husband an expert from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect?”","“Husband? Humph, he is just a heartless man. Although I have a marriage contract with him, I didn’t have the time to get married. But he was almost everything to me at that time,” Xiao’er said softly.","“Miss Xiao’er, who is the person you’re talking about? What’s his name?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“His name is Di Shisan. You have a close relationship with the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. Have you heard of him?” Xiao’er asked.","However, when Jian Wushuang heard Xiao’er’s entire name, he suddenly widened his eyes, and his heart instantly surged.","Di Shisan?","He had heard of this name more than once!","In his previous life, among the experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect in the eternal chaotic world, he had first come into contact with Di Shisan.","He was the first sword emperor who had saved his life several times and the eternal chaotic world at that time!","Jian Wushuang had even come into contact with sword principle with his help and had also cultivated it for a period of time in the trials he had arranged.","It could be said that aside from his master, Di Shisan was the expert that the Seven Star Mysterious Sect had left behind in the eternal chaotic world!","This was an absolute swordsman that even Jian Wushuang could not help but admire and admire.","And this person was actually the husband of Miss Xiao’er?"]},{"number":3456,"title":"Chapter 3456 - Xiao’er’s Hatred","paragraphs":["Chapter 3456 Xiao’er’s Hatred","“Jian Wushuang, you seem to have heard of him?” Xiao’er asked.","“I do know him. Not only that, I have met him and had many dealings with him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You have met him?” Xiao’er’s body suddenly trembled. “How is that possible? He died in battle when the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was destroyed. How many years has it been since that battle? How can you have met him?”","“Is he still alive?” Xiao’er looked at Jian Wushuang with an unprecedented glint in her eyes.","Jian Wushuang naturally noticed the look in Xiao’er’s eyes. At the same time, he could see the anxiety and anticipation in her eyes. It was obvious that Miss Xiao’er had long determined that Di Shisan had died with the Seven Star Mysterious Sect.","After hesitating for a moment, Jian Wushuang raised his head again and said, “Di Shisan...is indeed alive.”","Upon hearing this, the light in Xiao’er’s eyes instantly soared to the maximum, and her face revealed a look of ecstasy.","“Really?” Xiao’er was still a little apprehensive.","“Of course it’s true. To tell you the truth, he was the one who guided me to truly enter the sword principle. Moreover, he once saved my life and was a great benefactor to me,” Jian Wushuang said. “Where is he now? Why hasn’t there been any news about him after so many years?” Xiao’er asked hurriedly.","“It’s because his current location is very special and completely isolated from the Divine Beginning Realm. Of course, I know about the existence of that place, but I’m still too weak. It’s still unknown whether I can enter it successfully. However, it won’t be long before I go there. As long as I can re-open that space, not only Di Shisan but also many experts left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect will have a chance to see the light of day again,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s great, that’s great!” Xiao’er was so excited that she did not know what to do. Even after so many years, no one could replace Di Shisan in her heart.","“Miss Xiao’er, if I really enter that space and see Di Shisan in the future, I will naturally tell them about you,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Xiao’er was filled with anticipation.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang asked, “Miss Xiao’er, did you just say that the Nine-tailed Clan abandoned you because of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and Di Shisan?”","“Yes.” Xiao’er nodded slightly. “At that time, Di Shisan and I were in love, and we matched each other in terms of status and background. Our marriage was decided. Everything was going well, but something unexpected happened. It happened during the world-ending war!” “In that war, the three Saint Realms led the attack. With the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao, many top forces of the Divine Beginning Realm attacked the Seven Star Mysterious Sect at the same time!","“At that time, no one knew the exact reason. The four divine races and the Eight Directions Divine Sect didn’t care if they had any grudges with the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. They all obeyed the orders of the three Saint Realms and charged into the Seven Star Mysterious Realm together. “You have to know that at that time, Di Shisan and I were already engaged. Everyone knew Di Shisan’s status in the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. The nine-tailed race and the Seven Star Mysterious Sect were already on good terms. Logically, the nine-tailed race should be on the side of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. However, in reality, the nine-tailed race also listened to the orders of the three great Saint Realms. They betrayed their trust and charged into the Seven Star Mysterious Sect together!”","“As the Saintess of the Nine-tailed Clan, I naturally opposed it. However, not only did the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan not care about my position, she even ordered me to be secretly executed when she found out that I was going to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect to fight together with Di Shisan!”","“How could that be?” Jian Wushuang frowned. “Even if the patriarch of the Nine-tailed Clan forbade you to have any relationship with Di Shisan for some special reasons, he shouldn’t have killed you directly. After all, you have the Emperor Phoenix Bloodline.”","“Emperor Phoenix Bloodline?”","“Humph, in that era, there were two people in the Nine-tailed Clan who had awakened the Emperor Phoenix Bloodline. Besides me, the other one was Di Xi’s daughter. Di Xi wanted his daughter to inherit her position and become the next patriarch of the Nine-tailed Clan. Therefore, he made things difficult for me in the Nine-tailed Clan. And that time, he found an opportunity to kill me!” Xiao’er sneered.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","He had said that things could not be so simple. It turned out that there was a struggle for the patriarch’s throne.","“You were indeed looking for an opportunity to kill me, but unfortunately, my reputation in the Nine-tailed Clan was not low at that time. Many elders of the Nine-tailed Clan were on my side at the beginning. Although everyone objected because of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, many elders did not agree to my execution. In the end, one of the elders who was closest to me secretly let me go. However, Di Xi continued to pursue me and killed me. In the end, I died at her hands!” Xiao’er said.","“She killed you?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Yes, I did die once, but it was an opportunity for me to find the cultivation method of the nine-life succubus skill. I entered the reincarnation passage and began my nine-life cultivation journey...” Xiao’er stopped.","After a while, she looked up again. “Jian Wushuang, you should know why I hate the Nine-tailed Clan, right?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","It was true that Miss Xiao’er was a member of the Nine-tailed Clan and an extremely important possessor of the Emperor Phoenix Bloodline. However, the entire Nine-tailed Clan had abandoned her, and she was even hunted down and killed once, now that she had finally experienced the nine reincarnations and cultivated the nine-life charm to perfection, she had the ability to fight against the Nine-tailed Clan. Naturally, she wanted revenge.","“Miss Xiao’er, although the Nine-tailed Clan has treated you unfairly and indeed abandoned you, you still have the bloodline of the Nine-tailed Clan. Moreover, it’s not as if no one in the Nine-tailed Clan was on your side back then. I can understand that you hate the Nine-tailed Clan, but if you want to destroy the Nine-tailed Clan just like that, it’s too...” Jian Wushuang had not finished his sentence.","Xiao’er waved her hand, “I know. That’s why my initial goal was not to destroy the nine-tailed race. All I wanted to do was to take back what originally belonged to me. Besides that, there’s also Di Xi. Although she went to the universe battlefield, her descendants are still fine within the nine-tailed race and are still occupying the position of clan leader.”"]},{"number":3457,"title":"Chapter 3457 - The Alliance Was Reached","paragraphs":["Chapter 3457 The Alliance Was Reached","After listening to Xiao’er’s explanation, Jian Wushuang finally understood.","Miss Xiao’er had spent so much effort building the Divine Moon Palace to fight against the Nine-tailed Clan. Her real goal was not to destroy the Nine-tailed Clan but to destroy Di Xi, who had once ruled the clan. What she really wanted...she should kill Di Xi’s descendant, the current clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, and replace him to take control of the Nine-tailed Clan.","It had to be said that with Miss Xiao’er’s experience, she was indeed qualified and had a reason to murder Di Xi’s descendant.","“Jian Wushuang and Clan Leader Er Xiu, now that you know the specific grudge between me and the Nine-tailed Clan, as my allies, I need you to do your best to help me take back the position of clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan. Are you willing?” Xiao’er looked over.","“Of course.” Er Xiu had long been frightened by Xiao’er’s words, so he agreed without thinking. He had no choice but to agree. If he did not, the Divine Moon Palace would directly attack his Blood Marten Clan, moreover, judging from the current situation, it was not necessarily a bad thing for his Blood Marten Clan to choose to stand on the side of the Divine Moon Palace.","“Jian Wushuang, what about you?” Xiao’er looked at Jian Wushuang again.","“I can help you deal with the Nine-tailed Clan with all my strength, but after I help you regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan, I also need your help to deal with another clan,” Jian Wushuang said directly.","“With your current ability and the presence of this top expert beside you, you shouldn’t care about ordinary clans, even top clans. But now, you want the help of my Divine Moon Palace and the Blood Marten Clan. Don’t tell me you’re going to deal with a great divine clan as well?” Xiao’er asked.","“Yes, I’m going to deal with the Blood Clan, one of the four great divine clans. To be exact, I’m going to deal with someone in the Blood Clan,” Jian Wushuang said. “Who?” Xiao’er asked.","“The clan leader of the Blood Clan. He must die!” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","But upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, both Xiao’er and Er Xiu were shocked.","Er Xiu looked at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","As for Xiao’er, although she looked calmer, she was equally astonished. “Jian Wushuang, you want to kill the Blood Clan’s Grandmaster?”","“Yes, because of a special matter, I need the help of Spirit Ancestor from the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect. Spirit Ancestor’s condition is to kill the Blood Clan’s Grandmaster,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Spirit Ancestor?” Xiao’er narrowed her eyes. “I’ve heard of her as well. The hatred between her and the clan leader of the Blood Clan is indeed great. However, Spirit Ancestor is most talented in her soul. You want to ask her for help because of her soul, right?”","“Yes, I need her to perform a soul peeling for my most important person and to ensure the integrity of that person’s soul to the greatest extent,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Soul extraction requires a lot of soul control ability. I can say that no one in the Divine Beginning Realm can guarantee that a person’s soul will not be damaged in the slightest when the soul is extracted. However, if the soul is extracted by Spirit Ancestor, even if there is no guarantee, there is still a 99% chance.” Xiao’er nodded secretly.","“Miss Xiao’er, you are from the Nine-tailed Clan and have cultivated the nine-life heaven-enchanting skill to the perfection. If you were to strip your soul, would you be comparable to the Spirit Ancestor?” Jian Wushuang suddenly asked, he found that Miss Xiao’er had a great background and must have high attainment in the soul. If she could reach the same level as the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan in the soul aspect...he could have asked Miss Xiao ‘er to help him without seeking the help of the Spirit Ancestor.","However, upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Xiao ‘er shook her head. “Jian Wushuang, you don’t know that the members of the Nine-tailed Clan have a lot of innate talent in the soul aspect. For example, the current clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan should be no weaker than the Spirit Ancestor in the soul aspect. However, this is also because the current clan leader specializes in cultivating. There is another cultivation system in the Nine-tailed Clan, which specializes in enchantment!”","“Although the enchantment is closely related to the soul, it is not a thorough study of the soul. Therefore, the attainments in the soul are not as good as those in the cultivation of the soul. As for me, including the nine-life enchantment, I belong to the Enchantment School. Therefore, my attainments in the soul are not very high. If I were to strip someone’s soul, it would not cause any harm to their soul. At most, I would only have an 80% chance!”","Jian Wushuang was stunned, but then he forced a smile.","It seemed that it was impossible for Xiao’er to do the soul stripping for his wife.","“In that case, I can only ask the Spirit Ancestor to help. Then I must kill the Blood Clan leader,” Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","“But the Blood Clan leader has a cultivation at the peak of the six void realms. Even if the top expert beside you personally helps him, I’m afraid he won’t be able to win. Moreover, this is only a direct battle. It’s too difficult to kill an expert at the peak of the six void realms,” Xiao’er said. “I know. That’s why I’m asking for your help. I’ll also find more helpers to help me,” Jian Wushuang said. “Okay, I can promise you that after I regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan, I’ll do my best to help you kill the Blood Clan leader. But if I can’t kill him in the end, you can’t blame me,” Xiao’er said.","“The Blood Marten Clan will also do our best,” Er Xiu quickly said.","Of course, Er Xiu also knew that his help was just words. If he really wanted to kill the clan leader of the Blood Marten Clan, he must rely on the top experts, and he, the strongest member of the Blood Marten Clan, had just reached the fifth void realm, so he could not pose any threat to the clan leader.","“Then it’s a deal.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","Although he knew it would be too difficult to kill the clan leader, it was still better to have two allies, the Divine Moon Palace and the Blood Marten Clan, than to be alone.","Especially Miss Xiao’er, who was already in control of the extremely powerful Divine Moon Palace. If she could help her control the Nine-tailed Clan, she would definitely be very powerful, she would definitely be able to help him a lot.","“Since it’s already agreed, the most important thing now is to help me control the Nine-tailed Clan again. It won’t be easy to complete this step,” Xiao’er said.","“Miss Xiao’er, you’ve been preparing for so many years. Judging from the activity in Your Divine Moon Palace, you should have a detailed plan, right?” Jian Wushuang asked."]},{"number":3458,"title":"Chapter 3458 - The Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3458 The Plan","–","–","“The plan...” Xiao’er smiled faintly. “My original plan was to hide in the dark and find the right time to swallow the two top races, the Scarlet Gold Clan and the Blood Marten Clan, with lightning speed. In this territory, only the Nine-tailed Clan and my Divine Moon Palace will be left to contend for hegemony. Moreover, by swallowing these two top races, my Divine Moon Palace’s overall strength will also be stronger. By then, we will definitely be able to suppress the Nine-tailed Clan!”","“However, now that the Blood Marten Clan is on our side, and with your help, Jian Wushuang, it will be easier to carry out this plan.”","Hearing this, Er Xiu’s heart trembled. He had wondered if Xiao’er was just trying to scare him by saying that he would attack the Blood Marten Clan. But now, it seemed that the annexation of the Scarlet Gold Clan and the Blood Marten Clan...was indeed part of the Divine Moon Palace’s plan. “The Blood Marten Clan is already on our side. Does this mean that the Scarlet Gold Clan is your first target?” Jian Wushuang looked at Xiao’er.","“Yes, the Scarlet Gold Clan is extremely powerful. If we can annex them, our Divine Moon Palace’s strength will definitely rise to another level,” Xiao’er said.","“If we attack the Scarlet Gold Clan, the clan will fight to the death. It will be very difficult to swallow them without paying too much.”Jian Wushuang asked.","“I understand. Of course, I have a way.” Xiao’er smiled and glanced at the gray-robed figure next to her.","The gray-robed human figure followed Xiao’er to the Blood Marten Clan. However, his face had always been hidden under the gray robe. Moreover, the aura on his body had always been concealed. However, under Xiao’er’s instructions, the gray-robed human figure had finally stood up, after which, he withdrew the gray robe on his body and revealed his own appearance.","This was an old man with a thin face and a goatee. His eyes were like the stars and were exceptionally dazzling.","When he saw the goatee, Er Xiu shouted, “Lord Xu, you are Lord Xu!”","“Lord Xu?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","Over the years, he had obtained information about some top experts in the Divine Beginning Realm from the spacetime temple, including many powerful universe masters who had gone into seclusion. Lord Xu was one of them.","Lord Xu was an extremely powerful expert at the six levels of the void, and he was a lone wolf.","One had to know that the six levels of the void were super experts who stood at the top in the Divine Beginning Realm. Such a super expert was also a lone wolf. He did not have any restrictions and could do whatever he wanted. In the Divine Beginning Realm, he could also do whatever he wanted. Among the various factions in the Divine Beginning Realm, no one was willing to provoke a lone expert of the six realms of the void, including the three great holy regions. Most likely, none of them were willing. But such an expert was actually following by Xiao’er’s side at this moment? “How could it be?”","“Lord Xu was famous for being stubborn. He had lived for so many years and had a very strange temper. During this period, many large factions had tried to make connections with him, but they were all rejected by him. It was basically impossible to want him to join a certain faction, but now...” Er Xiu looked at Lord Xu in astonishment.","“Lord Xu has a strange temper and a proud personality. It’s known to all that it’s impossible for him to work for someone. But in front of Miss Xiao’er, Lord Xu is just a servant...it seems that Miss Xiao’er has controlled Lord Xu with a special method. If I’m not mistaken, it must be the enchantment, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, Lord Xu was indeed controlled by my enchantment. It’s the nine-life heavenly charms technique that you all know of. Of course, I also spent a lot of money and experience, and there was also a lot of luck involved in it. That’s why I was able to control him.” Xiao’er laughed, “With my current strength, even if I used the nine-life heavenly charms technique, it would still be too difficult for me to control an expert at the sixth level of the Void.”","“However, as long as it’s not the sixth realm of the void or a small number of experts with strong mental states who are not affected by my charm, it’s difficult for an ordinary expert of the fifth realm of the void to resist my charm.”","“Miss Xiao’er, do you mean that you can directly control the high-level experts of the Scarlet Gold Clan with your charm?” Jian Wushuang looked over.","“Yes.” Xiao’er nodded. “My ultimate goal is the Nine-tailed Clan. Besides worrying that the Scarlet Gold Clan will be in the way when dealing with the Nine-tailed Clan, the most important thing is that there are many high-level experts of the Scarlet Gold Clan. There are nearly ten Principles Masters, and there is a Patriarch of the fifth void realm and two Principles Masters at the peak of the fourth void realm. This battle strength is not weak!”","“If I can control this power, it will greatly improve the overall strength of the Divine Moon Palace.","“As for the ordinary clansmen of the Scarlet Gold Clan who are below the rule master level, they are of no use to me. I don’t even bother with them","“The reason why the Divine Moon Palace was able to completely annex the Roaring Demon Clan is because the Principles Masters of the Roaring Demon Clan are all under my control. They obey me completely. No matter what orders I give them, even if I want them, including the entire roaring demon clan, to die, they will do it unconditionally.”","“I see.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “That is to say, if we want to deal with the Scarlet Gold Clan, we only need to control the high-level experts of the Scarlet Gold Clan.”","“Yes, my plan was to control the high-level experts of the Scarlet Gold Clan one by one and then disintegrate the clan from the inside. When the Scarlet Gold Clan is almost disintegrated, the Divine Moon Palace will take action to control the entire Scarlet Gold Clan. But now, with the help of the Blood Marten Clan and you, Jian Wushuang, there is no need to go through so much trouble. We can attack the Scarlet Gold Clan right now and forcibly take control of the clan,” Xiao’er said.","Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","If it was just the Divine Moon Palace, they would have to be more cautious when dealing with the Scarlet Gold Clan alone. After all, the Divine Moon Palace had to guard against the Nine-tailed Clan.","But now, with the addition of Jian Wushuang and the Blood Marten Clan, the overall strength of the Divine Moon Palace had increased greatly, so there was no need to be so cautious.","“Miss Xiao’er, when do you plan to make a move?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I’ll go back and prepare my men. In three months, we’ll do it directly,” Xiao’er said.","“In three months?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and nodded. “In three months, we’ll wait for your news, Miss Xiao’er.”"]},{"number":3459,"title":"Chapter 3459 - Breaking the Formation","paragraphs":["Xiao’er and Lord Xu soon returned to Divine Moon Palace. After all, they were going to deal with the Scarlet Gold Clan, so Divine Moon Palace had to be prepared.","Jian Wushuang stayed in the Blood Marten Clan.","Ten days later, Zhuo Peng and Princess Ying got married in the Blood Marten Clan’s territory.","The wedding was quite grand. Experts from the surrounding clans and forces were sent to attend the wedding, and the gifts were also quite generous. After all, one of the two families that got married was the Blood Marten Clan, the other one was the most famous Heavenly Sword Marquis in the Divine Beginning Realm. The clans in the demon region naturally had to give him face.","During the wedding, Jian Wushuang only showed up briefly and did not have much interaction with these clans.","However, the wedding went smoothly and Zhuo Peng got married to Princess Ying as he wished.","After the wedding, the Blood Marten Clan began to secretly prepare.","In the blink of an eye, three months had passed.","In a secluded void not far away from the Blood Marten Clan, several figures stood there waiting quietly. Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo were among these people, in addition to the six Principles Masters of the Blood Marten Clan, including Er Xiu.","Suddenly, everyone in the void raised their heads.","“They’re here.” Jian Wushuang also looked forward.","Sure enough, in the void in front of them, there were more than a dozen figures, led by two gray-robed figures.","Although the two gray-robed figures concealed their appearances and auras, Jian Wushuang and Er Xiu both knew that they were Xiao’er and Lord Xu, who had become slaves.","As for the experts behind them, they were naturally the experts of Divine Moon Palace. There were a total of 18 Principles Masters, and their auras were very strong. Almost all of them had reached the third realm of the void, and there were many Principles Masters in the fourth realm of the void, even there were three experts in the fifth void realm.","“As expected of Divine Moon Palace, which is able to fight the Nine-tailed Clan head-on. What a powerful lineup.” Jian Wushuang secretly praised these experts.","“Clan leader Er Xiu, you should have told the Blood Marten Clan’s Principles Masters the whole story, right?” Xiao’er first looked at Er Xiu.","“Miss Xiao’er, don’t worry. I have already informed them. Furthermore, the entire Blood Marten Clan has agreed to stand on the same side as the Divine Moon Palace and the Heavenly Sword Marquis.” Er Xiu laughed.","The five experts from the Blood Marten Clan behind him immediately nodded.","These masters of the rules of the Blood Marten Clan had also learned of the Blood Marten Clan’s alliance with the Divine Moon Palace from Er Xiu. At the same time, they also learned of the purpose of this trip. In the beginning, their hearts were extremely shaken, however, after so many days, they had calmed down.","At the same time, Er Xiu had already told them about the relationship between the Blood Marten Clan and the Divine Moon Palace. Therefore, no one in the Blood Marten Clan objected to this matter.","“It’s good that you all understand. Since we have chosen to attack the Scarlet Gold Clan, the Divine Moon Palace will certainly use the people that we had painstakingly planted in the Scarlet Gold Clan. Therefore, we must not make any unexpected changes in the middle of this attack. Otherwise, once all our efforts have been wasted, the Scarlet Gold Clan and the Nine-tailed Clan will be on guard. It will be too difficult to control the Scarlet Gold Clan with the same method in the future,” Xiao’er said.","“Miss Xiao’er, your Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan have been fighting fiercely for years. You’ve mobilized so many experts at once. The Nine-tailed Clan should have noticed it, right?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Don’t worry. I’ve made preparations this time. I’ve temporarily diverted the attention of the Nine-tailed Clan. Although I’ve mobilized these experts, they haven’t noticed me. But just to be on the safe side, we must be as fast as possible. We must finish the battle quickly. We mustn’t give the Nine-tailed Clan any time to react,” Xiao’er said.","“In that case, what are we waiting for? Let’s go to the Scarlet Gold Clan now,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay.” Xiao’er nodded.","More than 20 Principles Masters immediately headed toward the territory of the Scarlet Gold Clan as fast as they could.","With the speed of the Principles Masters, they arrived at the void outside the territory of the Scarlet Gold Clan in less than half a day.","“The Scarlet Gold Clan is right in front of us.” Er Xiu looked at the hazy void in the distance.","“After all, it’s the nest of a top clan. If I’m not mistaken, the Scarlet Gold Clan should also have a very powerful clan-protecting formation,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Of course.” Er Xiu nodded. “Our Blood Marten Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan are in the same territory. Over the years, we have fought with each other many times. Both sides know very well that the Scarlet Gold Clan also has a very powerful clan-protecting formation. Although the power of the clan-protecting formation is not as powerful as ours, it would be quite difficult to break it by force. Of course, if a super expert at the peak of the sixth realm of the void attacks...”","When Er Xiu said this, he could not help but glance at Demon Master Chenhuo beside him.","“This defensive array of the Scarlet Gold Clan is indeed not weak. However, it is not too difficult to break it.” Xiao’er smiled. After which, she glanced at Lord Xu beside her. “Go.”","Lord Xu nodded. His body flashed and he had already rushed toward the Scarlet Gold Clan alone.","The Principles Masters of the Blood Marten Clan revealed a puzzled expression when they saw this scene.","“Could it be that Miss Xiao’er wants Lord Xu to break the formation alone?” Er Xiu frowned. “Although Lord Xu’s strength is outstanding, he is not considered the top amongst the six void realms. It is unlikely for him to break the formation of the Scarlet Gold Clan alone, right?”","“Haha, just be prepared and watch.” Xiao’er smiled confidently.","Seeing Xiao’er’s expression, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly, but he already understood. “I’m afraid Miss Xiao’er doesn’t want Lord Xu to break the formation alone, but someone in the Scarlet Gold Clan should cooperate with him.”","Jian Wushuang remembered that Miss Xiao’er had just said that if they wanted to attack the Scarlet Gold Clan, they had to use the people who had been planted in the Scarlet Gold Clan. If nothing unexpected happened, they would be able to break the clan-protecting formation.","Sure enough, not long after Lord Xu arrived outside the Scarlet Gold Clan, the inside of the clan-protecting formation of the Scarlet Gold Clan suddenly... Boom!","With a violent boom, the entire clan-protecting formation of the Scarlet Gold Clan shook violently and then began to shake crazily.","And at this moment, Lord Xu directly attacked.","Chi!","An incomparably sharp black spear, carrying with it a shocking might that only sixth level void realm experts possessed, pierced through the space and ferociously stabbed toward the defensive formation of the Scarlet Gold Clan."]},{"number":3460,"title":"Chapter 3460 - Defeat the Scarlet Gold Clan","paragraphs":["The power of the Scarlet Gold Clan’s clan protection formation was indeed extraordinary. If Lord Xu alone were to attack it head-on, one or two attacks might not be enough to defeat the clan protection formation. However, if someone were to provide support from the inside...if they were to attack the clan protection formation from the inside, coupled with Lord Xu, the clan protection formation would not be able to withstand it.","As expected, when Lord Xu’s black spear, which carried an earth-shaking power, struck the clan protection array, the entire array collapsed and a large amount of power began to dissipate, the Scarlet Gold Clan, which was originally covered by the array, was completely exposed in this world.","“The clan protection array of the Scarlet Gold Clan has been broken. Help me and attack the Scarlet Gold Clan together with me. Remember to try not to kill the upper echelons of the Scarlet Gold Clan. Use lightning-like methods to suppress them before leaving them to me to control. In addition, we have to be as fast as possible.”","As soon as Xiao’er finished speaking, many Principles Masters of the Divine Moon Palace and the Blood Marten Clan immediately covered the territory of the Scarlet Gold Clan like dark clouds.","As for Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo, they also followed the crowd as if they were strolling in a garden.","When they arrived at the territory of the Scarlet Gold Clan, the entire clan was already in chaos. “Chi Li, what are you trying to do?” “Elder Chi Li, are you crazy?”","“Chi Li, my Scarlet Gold Clan has done nothing wrong to you. Why did you break the clan protection array of my Scarlet Gold Clan today?”","Low cries resounded through the entire sky. The Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan had already risen up, and they were all extremely shocked and furious.","The one who was surrounded by the Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan was a golden-robed old man. That golden-robed old man had a smile on his face at this moment. This smile was extremely demonic.","“Elder Chi Li!” The eyes of the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader were cold as he stared at the golden-robed old man.","However, the gaze of this golden-robed old man suddenly turned toward the empty space in front of him. “He is here.”","The many Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan also immediately sensed it. They all turned their heads over. When they saw this, their expressions changed greatly.","They saw a large group of figures. None of them emitted an extremely majestic and powerful aura that had reached the level of Principles Masters. A total of over twenty people pressed down like dark clouds, a powerful pressure that could suffocate people was emitted from these figures.","At the same time, hearty laughter reverberated within the entire Scarlet Gold Clan.","“Haha, the Scarlet Gold Clan is very lively.” “This is my first time coming to the Scarlet Gold Clan, one of the top races in the demon region.”","“Clan Leader Scarlet Gold, how have you been?”","This unbridled laughter resounded throughout every corner of the Scarlet Gold Clan. The ordinary clansmen of the Scarlet Gold Clan were all in a daze. They did not know what had happened. Only the Principles Masters...all of their faces were extremely ugly. “The Principles Masters of the Blood Marten Clan are inside. Other than that, there are even more Principles Masters from...the Divine Moon Palace!” The eyes of the Scarlet Gold Clan leader narrowed. “It’s the Divine Moon Palace. The Divine Moon Palace wants to attack our Scarlet Gold Clan!”","The Scarlet Gold Clan Leader immediately understood and made a decision.","“Quick, quickly send a message to the Nine-tailed Clan. All the elders, work together and block them,” the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader shouted sternly.","Instantly, the many Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan who were originally surrounding the golden-robed old man immediately rushed forward to meet those Principles Masters who were attacking them.","Seeing this scene, the golden-robed old man laughed out loud, “Hahaha! Just these Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan want to block my Divine Moon Palace? They are simply daydreaming!”","Indeed, although the Scarlet Gold Clan was a top clan, they were also very strong among the top clans. They had a total of ten Principles Masters, including the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader, he was an expert at the peak of the fifth void realm.","However, his battle strength was nothing in front of the combined forces of the Divine Moon Palace, the Blood Marten Clan, and Jian Wushuang.","“Boom!”","Ira V","IS O","With a loud boom, Lord Xu rushed to the front of the crowd. His aura was overwhelming, and the power of the experts of the six void realms was fully displayed in his hands. He was also extremely fast, he immediately rushed into the group of Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan.","Chi! Chi!","The two strange spear shadows pierced through the void and the divine bodies of the two Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan without any hindrance.","The divine bodies of these two Principles Masters immediately collapsed, losing nearly 40% of their divine power on the spot.","Following that, many experts from the Divine Moon Palace and the Blood Marten Clan came pressing over. The difference in battle strength between the two sides was too great, and the situation was directly one-sided.","In just a single exchange, six of the ten Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan had their divine bodies crushed on the spot. Then, after a few rounds, the Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan were completely crushed, at this moment, Miss Xiao’er also directly took action.","In just a short moment, she used her charm to control a total of three Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan.","This time, the Scarlet Gold Clan had even less ability to resist.","“Run, quickly run!”","When the Scarlet Gold Clan’s grandmaster saw the situation in front of him, he already understood that the Scarlet Gold Clan had no way to resist the other party. And although the Nine-tailed Clan had sent their experts over as soon as they received the news, even if they were to use the spatial passage...it would take some time for them to resist the enemy.","However, during this time, the group of Principles Masters in front of them was fully capable of wiping out the entire Scarlet Gold Clan.","Therefore, in order to better preserve the Scarlet Gold Clan, the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader immediately gave the order to abandon the clan and flee.","Upon hearing the order of the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader, the experts of the Scarlet Gold Clan immediately gave up resisting and began to flee in defeat.","However, just as they were about to flee...Jian Wushuang, who had been standing in the void nearby and had not made a move, suddenly made a move.","He gently raised his hand and drew a line in the void around him. A wave of the power of space-time principles instantly swept out. Buzz, buzz, buzz!","The world shook. With the help of the golden banner, Jian Wushuang completely confined the space-time around him in an instant. The space-time binding immediately applied to the experts of the Scarlet Gold Clan.","The power of the space-time binding was shocking. It immediately slowed down the Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan and made it impossible for them to escape from the experts who were chasing them.","“No! No!”","Scarlet Gold’s Clan Leader body trembled and his eyes were filled with fear. Right under his nose, the Principles Masters of his Scarlet Gold Clan were being chased by the experts of the Divine Moon Palace or the Blood Marten Clan and then trapped and suppressed, not long after, they were forcefully controlled by Xiao’er with her enchantment, and Lord Xu was already blocking in front of him.","In just a short moment, nine out of the ten Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan were controlled by Xiao’er. The only one who was still controlled was the Scarlet Gold Clan leader."]},{"number":3461,"title":"Chapter 3461 - All Under Control","paragraphs":["It had been less than 15 minutes since the guardian array of the Scarlet Gold Clan had been destroyed and the Divine Moon Palace and the blood marten race had attacked the Scarlet Gold Clan. However, the Scarlet Gold Clan had already calmed down.","The many clansmen of the Scarlet Gold Clan had been appeased by the Principles Masters who had been controlled by the Scarlet Gold Clan. After all, most of them did not know what had happened. With the appeasement of the elders...most of them did not think too much about it.","And the entire Scarlet Gold Clan had naturally been completely controlled by the Divine Moon Palace.","If there was only one thing that had not been controlled, it would be the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader.","In the void at the center of the Scarlet Gold Clan, a layer of temporary array had been set up around this void. This array had blocked the vision and soul probing of the Scarlet Gold Clan’s clansmen. In other words...the members of the Scarlet Gold Clan did not know what was happening in the void.","In this void, many Principles Masters of the Divine Moon Palace, the blood marten race, and the Scarlet Gold Clan were gathered there. However, at this moment, everyone’s eyes were fixed on the person in the middle, it was naturally the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader.","“Scarlet Gold Clan Leader, at this point, aren’t you going to surrender?” Er Xiu looked at the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader with a mocking expression.","“Er Xiu!” Scarlet Gold Clan Leader’s eyes were bloodshot like a hungry beast. “Your Blood Marten Clan actually defected to the Divine Moon Palace?”","“Defected? No, my Blood Marten Clan is an ally of the Divine Moon Palace. Mr. Heavenly Sword Marquis can testify to that,” Er Xiu said with a smile.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis?” Clan Leader Scarlet Gold immediately looked at Jian Wushuang again. His eyes were bloodshot, and a shocking hatred rose from the bottom of his heart.","He had killed his son with Jian Wushuang, and today, Jian Wushuang had attacked his clan with many experts from the Divine Moon Palace and the Blood Marten Clan, although Jian Wushuang did not fight with the experts from his clan, Jian Wushuang only used the time-space restriction and time-space restriction at any time, it completely blocked the escape route of the experts from his clan.","Because of this, none of the Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan could escape. Everyone was left behind and then controlled by Miss Xiao’er.","“Clan leader, I personally don’t have any malice toward the Scarlet Gold Clan, but unfortunately, I was born in this world and have no control over many things. Today, the Scarlet Gold Clan has been reduced to such a state. You can only blame yourself for being too weak,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Haha, too weak?”","“Yes, too weak. If we were not only a top clan but also a divine clan, we wouldn’t have been so easily defeated by you. How dare you kill my son?” Clan Leader Scarlet Gold shouted.","“Well, it’s all over now. Clan Leader Scarlet Gold, you’d better behave. Maybe you’ll suffer less. Otherwise...” Xiao’er’s eyes shone with a strange light.","Upon seeing Xiao’er, the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader revealed a terrified expression.","“It’s you, it’s you!”","“It was you who used a method to control Elder Chi Li, allowing Elder Chi Li to act as an insider and destroy our tribe’s protective array. It was also you who turned all the Principles Masters of our clan into Palace Masters!”","“You demon!”","The Scarlet Gold Clan Leader roared crazily, and his gaze was directed at the Principles Masters of the clan who originally belonged to the clan.","At this moment, these Principles Masters were standing in the surrounding void like wooden blocks. They looked at him with a hint of mockery and ridicule.","“Bastards, idiots, they are all a bunch of idiots!” The Scarlet Gold Clan Leader could not help but shout in shock and anger.","“Don’t worry, you will soon become like them.” Xiao’er smiled, then, she said, “This Scarlet Gold Clan Leader still looks lively and vigorous. It seems that he still has a lot of godly power left. Lord Xu, destroy his godly body once more and make him lose the ability to resist.”","“Yes.” Lord Xu nodded and then attacked again.","With Lord Xu’s power at the sixth level of the void, it was too easy for him to destroy the divine body of the clan leader of the Scarlet Gold Clan when the clan leader of the Scarlet Gold Clan could not escape anymore.","In just a moment, the divine body of the clan leader of the Scarlet Gold Clan was destroyed again, and the remaining divine power was also damaged. However, Lord Xu did not destroy the last bit of divine power left by the clan leader of the Scarlet Gold Clan. He left the clan leader of the Scarlet Gold Clan with his life.","And at this moment, Xiao’er appeared in front of the Scarlet Gold Clan leader.","“Scarlet Gold Clan leader, look at me,” Xiao’er said softly. Her voice was so beautiful that people could not help but feel intoxicated.","“Demon, you demon.” The Scarlet Gold Clan Leader clearly knew Xiao’er’s methods and knew that he could not look at Xiao’er. However, when he heard Xiao’er’s voice, he could not help but look over. When he looked over, his eyes quickly became empty and he was stunned. In the void beside them, Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo stood there quietly, making everyone pay attention to the scene in front of them.","They saw Scarlet Gold Clan Leader and Xiao’er looking at each other. The former was completely stunned as if he was possessed, while Xiao’er was mumbling something to him, Scarlet Gold Clan Leader nodded stiffly on the way.","After a while...","“Well, go and recover your divine power,” Xiao’er said softly.","“Yes, master.” Scarlet Gold Clan Leader nodded and then flew toward the void.","This scene made Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrink.","“Miss Xiao’er’s enchantment is really amazing. An expert at the peak of the fifth void realm became her slave in a short time,” Jian Wushuang murmured.","“It is indeed a terrifying enchantment. Fortunately, Miss Xiao’er’s cultivation is not very high. She is only at the fourth void realm. If she reaches the fifth void realm or even the sixth void realm, no one among the masters of rules would be able to resist her enchantment. Even I don’t have absolute confidence,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Fortunately, Miss Xiao’er is my friend, not my enemy. Otherwise, I would have killed her earlier,” Jian Wushuang said.","After controlling all the experts of the Scarlet Gold Clan, Xiao’er flew toward Jian Wushuang.","“Miss Xiao’er, Congratulations. After controlling the Scarlet Gold Clan, your Divine Moon Palace’s overall strength has reached a new level. I’m afraid that the Divine Moon Palace won’t be afraid of the Nine-tailed Clan even without the help of me and the Blood Marten Clan,” Jian Wushuang said.","“It’s nothing. Although my Divine Moon Palace can compete with the Nine-tailed Clan, I’m still far from taking control of the Nine-tailed Clan. You and the Blood Marten Clan are indispensable,” Xiao’er said with a smile."]},{"number":3462,"title":"Chapter 3462 - Shook the Demon Realm","paragraphs":["“Of course, after controlling the Scarlet Gold Clan and controlling all the Principles Masters of the Scarlet Gold Clan, the overall strength of our Divine Moon Palace has indeed surpassed that of the Nine-tailed Clan. If we include the Blood Marten Clan and you, Jian Wushuang, the strength of our camp is far beyond that of the Nine-tailed Clan!”","“With such a huge difference in strength, we can truly declare war on the Nine-tailed Clan,” Xiao’er said.","“Declare war? Why? Has your Divine Moon Palace not truly declared war on the Nine-tailed Clan?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“No,” Xiao’er said, “Although my Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan have been fighting and fighting, we have never declared war on the outside. However, I want to let the entire demon realm and even the entire Divine Beginning Realm know that My Divine Moon Palace wants to fight to the death with the Nine-tailed Clan. I also want to openly retake control of the Nine-tailed Clan!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and did not say anything more.","Soon, the Divine Moon Palace sent a message to declare war on the Nine-tailed Clan! In addition, although the Divine Moon Palace had attacked the Scarlet Gold Clan with lightning speed, completely controlling the Scarlet Gold Clan and all the Principles Masters, the news of the attack on the Scarlet Gold Clan still spread, although the Scarlet Gold Clan quickly calmed down, many people immediately recalled the howling demon race from before.","When the Divine Moon Palace attacked the howling demon race, they had also attacked with lightning speed. Not long after, the howling demon race calmed down as if nothing had happened, but after that, the howling demon race had completely submitted to the Divine Moon Palace.","The Scarlet Gold Clan’s situation was clearly the same as the howling demon clan’s.","Naturally, many people guessed that the Scarlet Gold Clan might have submitted to the Divine Moon Palace as well.","By annexing two top races in a row and declaring war on the Nine-tailed Clan, the Divine Moon Palace’s actions shocked all the races in the fey domain.","The entire fey domain was also showing signs of a storm brewing.","In the territory of the Nine-tailed Clan.","In the magnificent palace, many high-level experts of the nine-tailed race gathered together.","Most of the members of the nine-tailed race were women, and only a small number of them were men. Even among the highest-level experts, almost all of them were women. At this moment, the high-level experts of the nine-tailed race all had solemn expressions. “Divine Moon Palace, after such a small fight for so long, are you finally going to go all out?” The third princess of the Nine-tailed Clan, Da Yu, sat near the leader’s seat. As the third princess of the Nine-tailed Clan, and with her cultivation base at the fourth realm of the void, Da Yu’s status in the Nine-tailed Clan was naturally extremely lofty. Under the premise that the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan had been in closed-door cultivation all this while, the only people in the entire Nine-tailed Clan whose status was comparable to this da Yu were the few elders whose strength had reached the fifth realm of the void.","“Hmph, the Divine Moon Palace is fine if they don’t make a move, but now that they’ve made a move, they’ve directly taken control of the Scarlet Gold Clan...” Sixth Princess Da Su said coldly, “Although there’s no clear news from the Scarlet Gold Clan, we can be sure that the Scarlet Gold Clan is definitely like the Howling Demon Clan. Many of their experts have been controlled by the Divine Moon Palace through some unknown means.” “After the Divine Moon Palace annexed the Howling Demon Clan, they were already extremely powerful. They are not much weaker than our Nine-tailed Clan. Now that they have annexed the Scarlet Gold Clan, and judging from the distress message sent by the Scarlet Gold Clan Leader, there are also experts from the Blood Marten Clan who attacked the Scarlet Gold Clan. In other words, the Blood Marten Clan is very likely controlled by the Divine Moon Palace, or they are already on the side of the Divine Moon Palace,” said a five states void realm elder from the Nine-tailed Clan in a low voice. “If that’s the case, the three top races that originally existed around our territory are already on the side of the Divine Moon Palace. In addition, it’s said that the Blood Marten Clan is related to the Sword Heavenly Marquis. If the Heavenly Sword Marquis is on the same side as the Divine Moon Palace, then our nine-tailed race is indeed in a bad situation.”","Hearing this, the elders of the nine-tailed race fell silent.","Indeed, the Nine-tailed Clan could easily deal with the Divine Moon Palace alone.","Even if the Divine Moon Palace annexed the Howling Demon tribe, the Nine-tailed Clan could still suppress them.","However, if the Divine Moon Palace annexed the two top tribes, the Scarlet Gold Clan and the Blood Marten Clan, together with the help of Heavenly Sword Marquis, the Divine Moon Palace’s strength would probably surpass the Nine-tailed Clan’s.","“Humph, even if the Divine Moon Palace is powerful, our nine-tailed race is not weak. If they want to fight us to the death, we have to see if they have the ability to do so.” Da Yu sneered, then, she said, “I’m not worried that the Divine Moon Palace will come and fight us head-on. What I’m more concerned about is the origin of the Divine Moon Palace. Also, what kind of methods did they use to control the Howling Demon Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan?”","“If we don’t figure these things out as soon as possible, even if the Divine Moon Palace can’t do anything to us now, they can still use the same method to deal with other top races. or they can annex the weaker races in the surroundings and constantly strengthen themselves. Sooner or later, the Divine Moon Palace’s strength will reach a level that even the Nine-tailed Clan is far from being able to contend with.”","“Third princess is right. It is indeed the most important thing to find out the origins of the Divine Moon Palace and the means of controlling the experts of the Divine Moon Palace. However, our Nine-tailed Clan has been investigating this matter for a long time, but we haven’t found any clues. Even now, we still don’t know who the palace master behind the Divine Moon Palace is...” The elder of the fifth realm of the void said in a deep voice.","Da Yu’s face darkened as she said sternly, “No matter what, we have to figure this out first. Otherwise, the Nine-tailed Clan will be too passive.”","“Yes.”","The ordinary elders of the Nine-tailed Clan nodded one after another.","And at that moment...","Boom! The void shook, and the entire Nine-tailed Clan shook violently.","Then, in a corner of the ancestral land of the Nine-tailed Clan, a powerful aura rose up into the sky, as if a huge dragon that had been slumbering for hundreds of millions of years had suddenly woken up!","The aura was too powerful, too powerful. As soon as it rose up, the entire Nine-tailed Clan was in an uproar.","Within the Majestic Palace, the elders who had been sitting upright suddenly rose to their feet when they sensed the aura. Numerous gazes turned to look at the source of the aura."]},{"number":3463,"title":"Chapter 3463 - Six Realms of the Void, Three?","paragraphs":["“This aura...it’s mother!” Da Yu was the first to call out.","“Mother, you’re coming out of seclusion?” Da Su was pleasantly surprised. “Clan leader?”","“Clan leader?”","The elders of the Nine-tailed Clan who had reached the level of Principles Masters were also pleasantly surprised at this moment.","The clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan had been in closed-door cultivation since a long time ago. Naturally, he was in closed-door cultivation to strive for a higher level of strength.","Everyone knew this.","During the time when the clan leader was in closed-door cultivation, there were indeed many things in the Nine-tailed Clan. For example, the princess was killed by Jian Wushuang, the sudden rise of Divine Moon Palace, and the fight between the Nine-tailed Clan and Divine Moon Palace over the years, although the fight was very fierce, the patriarch never came out of seclusion.","She had been in seclusion and never came out even when her daughter died.","But today...","“Mother, you are finally coming out of seclusion. Judging from your aura, I’m afraid that you are much stronger than before!” Da Yu said excitedly.","“This aura...” An elder of the Nine-tailed Clan who had reached the peak of the fifth level of the void exclaimed, “You are too strong. You are much stronger than the ordinary sixth level of the void. Without a doubt, the clan leader’s strength has reached the peak of the sixth level of the Void. I wonder if he has reached that peak!”","“After the Divine Moon Palace declared war on the Nine-tailed Clan, the clan leader has just come out of seclusion and his strength has improved greatly. This part-time job is to bless the Nine-tailed Clan!” “Haha, with the clan leader here, we don’t need to worry about the Divine Moon Palace.”","The experts of the Nine-tailed Clan laughed and then rushed toward the source of the aura.","The entire Nine-tailed Clan was also in a jubilant mood.","Although the Divine Moon Palace had not risen for long, its lair was very vast. It was heavily guarded and had countless experts.","Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo were currently in the lair of the Divine Moon Palace.","“It has only been a few hundred years since its rise, but there are really many experts in the Divine Moon Palace. I can sense more than 30 Principles Masters in my consciousness alone, not to mention the Scarlet Gold Clan and the Blood Marten Clan. If these two top clans are added together, the Divine Moon Palace’s camp would probably have more than 50 Principles Masters,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","Fifty Principles Masters. If it was in an extremely short period of time, even a Saint Realm might not be able to gather such a number.","One had to admit that the power that the Divine Moon Palace controlled was indeed terrifying “The number of Principles Masters that my Divine Moon Palace controls is indeed not small, but their quality isn’t too high. Many of them have just reached the second level of the void realm, and there aren’t many who have reached the third level of the void realm or above. Furthermore, there was only one super expert at the sixth level of the void realm, Lord Xu. But now, according to what I know, there are two experts at the sixth level of the void realm in the Nine-tailed Clan!”","“One of them has just broken through the sixth realm of the void and is not as strong as Lord Xu, but the other is the current patriarch of the Nine-tailed Clan. Her strength is extremely strong among the six realms of the void. Just now, I received news from the Nine-tailed Clan that the patriarch of the Nine-tailed Clan has come out of seclusion,” Xiao’er said.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He also knew that the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan had been in closed-door cultivation. Even though he had killed her daughter, the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan had never come out of his closed-door cultivation.","“Not only has she come out of her closed-door cultivation, but her strength has also improved greatly. If I’m not mistaken, her battle strength should have reached the peak of the six void realms. In my Divine Moon Palace’s camp, I’m afraid that only Demon Master Chenhuo, who is by your side, can contend with her,” Xiao’er said.","“The peak of the six void realms?” Jian Wushuang frowned. “If that’s the case, won’t we be in trouble?”","Jian Wushuang had been staying with Demon Master Chenhuo all this time. He was well aware of the terrifying strength of an expert at the peak of the six void realms.","Under normal circumstances, no force or sect would dare to provoke an expert at the peak of the six void realms as long as he was in charge.","If an expert reached the peak of the six void realms, even a Saint Realm Master might not be able to kill him, let alone an expert of the same level. If he could not kill such an expert... it would be difficult for an ordinary person to resist his wanton slaughter.","“Yes, there is trouble, and it’s not a small one. However, we have officially declared war on the Nine-tailed Clan. We have no choice but to take action. Moreover, we might be able to deal with an expert at the peak of the six void realms,” Xiao’er said.","“Do you have a way to kill her?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Xiao’er.","“Kill her? Of course not. But I want to regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan. All I need to do is to firmly control the clan. As for the nine clan leaders, I can think of a way to drive them away,” Xiao’er said.","“Drive them away?” Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “If the Nine-tailed Clan leader really reaches the peak of the sixth realm, even if Demon Master Chenhuo takes action personally, he might not be able to win. I’m afraid it’s very difficult to drive her away.”","“I know. That’s why I’ve specially invited other experts over. When they join forces with Demon Master Chenhuo, they’ll have the confidence to drive the Nine-tailed Clan leader away,” Xiao’er said.","“You’ve invited other experts? Who are they?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“Don’t worry. They’ve already set off. I reckon they’ll be here in three days. When they arrive, they’ll definitely meet you,” Xiao’er said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang did not insist. He waited quietly in the Divine Moon Palace with Demon Master Chenhuo.","Two days later, the experts Xiao’er had specially invited had arrived.","“Jian Wushuang, let me introduce you. These three are Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master. They are all from Star Palace,” Xiao’er introduced.","“Hello, Jian Wushuang.” Axe One Master, who was wearing a golden robe and carrying a golden axe on his back, greeted Jian Wushuang with a smile.","“You are Jian Wushuang? I’ve long heard of your name, but this is the first time I’ve actually met you.” Marquis Duan Yu, who was gentle and refined, also smiled faintly.","As for Star Saint Master, he was rather cold. He only glanced at Jian Wushuang coldly and did not say anything.","However, the three people in front of him made Jian Wushuang a little confused.","“These, these three people...are all experts at the peak of the six void realms!”","“How is this possible? There are only so many experts of the six realms of the void in the Divine Beginning Realm. How come there are three of them all of a sudden? Moreover, I’ve never heard of these three people before?”"]},{"number":3464,"title":"Chapter 3464 - Star Palace","paragraphs":["–","Jian Wushuang could be considered as a peak expert in the Divine Beginning Realm. He was already at the top level, and his knowledge was not comparable to what he had seen before. In particular, through the Temporal Temple, he had a great understanding of the experts in the Divine Beginning Realm, he had a great degree of understanding of them.","Although he had never met or interacted with many of the top experts in the Divine Beginning Realm, he had at least heard of and knew of them.","But now, he actually did not know of any of the three experts at the peak of the six void realms?","This was a little too incredible.","“Star Palace.”","Jian Wushuang repeated the name.","These three experts of the six void realms all came from Star Palace.","It must be known that in the Divine Beginning Realm, even in a Saint Realm, it was not possible to produce three experts of the six void realms at once.","But Jian Wushuang had never heard of Star Palace before, but this time, it was three experts of the six void realms!","“Jian Wushuang, isn’t it strange? Where did these three experts of the six void realms come from?” Xiao’er looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes, it’s very strange. And what exactly is this Star Palace?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“I don’t know much about the origin of Star Palace, but I know that it has been a terrifying force lurking in the dark for a very long time. Even so, no more than ten people in the Divine Beginning Realm know of its existence. Even I learned of its existence by chance,” Xiao’er said.","Jian Wushuang was a little stunned. It was the first time he knew that such a terrifying force was hiding in the Divine Beginning Realm.","In the vast Divine Beginning Realm, only less than ten people knew about the existence of Star Palace. It must be very well-hidden.","“Oh, I know one more thing. It’s the leader of Star Palace, the Palace Master of Star Palace. I’ve met him before. He told me that his name is Xuan God Daoist!” Xiao’er said.","“Xuan God Daoist?” Jian Wushuang was shocked, but he soon understood.","“I see. Xuan God Daoist was left behind by master, or the Seven Stars Mysterious Sect. He had extraordinary means. After the Seven Stars Mysterious Sect was destroyed and the entire Seven Stars Divine Realm was sealed by his master, he was still active in the Divine Beginning Realm. After such a long time, it’s not a problem for Xuan God Daoist to secretly accumulate strength and gather a powerful force!” Jian Wushuang understood.","Daoist Xuan God...that was the mysterious person he had met when he was born.","Although he had only met Daoist Xuan God once, he had already understood many things.","First of all, Daoist Xuan God was on the same side as his master, Xuan Yi. If he was not mistaken, Daoist Xuan God was very likely a member of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect!","The Temporal Temple Master had told him before that at its peak, the Seven Star Mysterious Sect had a total of three ruler-level experts. However, all he knew was his master, Xuan Yi, Xuan Yan, the Palace Master of divine punishment who was also sealed in the Seven Star Mysterious Realm, was also in a deep sleep, but he did not know about the other one.","The other one should be the sect master of the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, and Jian Wushuang guessed that this Seven Star Sect Master might be the Xuan God Daoist!","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang looked at the three people in front of him again. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, nice to meet you.”","“Haha, Heavenly Sword Marquis, You’re too kind. Although it’s your first time meeting us, I’m afraid we’ll have to interact with each other in the future,” Marquis Duan Yu, who was the most amiable of the three, said with a smile.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","Marquis Duan Yu exchanged a glance with Axe One Master and Star Saint Master, then he said, “To tell you the truth, my friends, the three of us are here under the orders of the palace master to help you and Miss Xiao’er regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan. The palace master also told us that after Miss Xiao’er takes control of the Nine-tailed Clan, the three of us will not be in a hurry to return to the Star Palace. Instead, we will continue to stay here. During this time, Heavenly Marquis, if you have any trouble, the three of us will do our best to help you.” “All-out help?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly lit up.","Of course, he needed the help of these three people to kill the Blood Clan Leader. He was worried that he could not kill the Blood Clan Leader, but now he had three powerful helpers for no reason?","Although the three people in front of him had not really fought, they were experts of the six void realms, so their strength was not too weak. If they waited for Divine Moon Palace to regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan, their overall strength would greatly increase, by then, Demon Master Chenhuo, Lord Xu, Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master would have gathered the strength of five experts of the sixth realm of the void. They might have a chance to kill the clan leader of the Blood Clan.","“The three of you, we can talk about the matter between you and Jian Wushuang later. But now, you have to help the Divine Moon Palace to control the Nine-tailed Clan,” Xiao’er said.","“Of course. Now that we are here, we will do our best,” Marquis Duan Yu said with a smile. “That’s good. The overall strength of the Divine Moon Palace is far above that of the Nine-tailed Clan. If we attack the Nine-tailed Clan, there are two troublesome things. The first is the current patriarch of the Nine-tailed Clan!” Xiao’er said in a low voice, “According to the news from the Nine-tailed Clan, the patriarch has come out of seclusion and his strength has improved greatly. He has reached the peak of the six void realms. His strength can pose a great threat to us.”","“However, my Divine Moon Palace’s camp already has two void sixth stage experts, Demon Master Chenhuo and Lord Xu, especially Demon Master Chenhuo. His strength is definitely not inferior to that Nine-tailed Clan Leader, and it might even be even stronger. If we have three more people helping us, even if we can’t kill that Nine-tailed Clan Leader, we can still crush her and make her flee in a sorry state.”","“So, the second thing that’s more troublesome now is the Nine-tailed Clan’s clan protection formation...” Xiao’er’s expression became solemn.","“I’m originally from the Nine-tailed Clan, so I’m very familiar with the clan protection formation of the Nine-tailed Clan. That Formation is extremely powerful, and it’s far from what the Scarlet Gold Clan and the Blood Marten Clan’s clan protection formation can compare to. If we want to directly destroy the formation, unless a Saint Realm Master or a ruler level expert personally makes a move, even if two or three experts who have reached the pinnacle of the six realms of the void join hands, they might not be able to defeat it.”"]},{"number":3465,"title":"Chapter 3465 - Marquis Duan Yu","paragraphs":["“The clan-protecting formation of the Nine-tailed Clan is so powerful?” Jian Wushuang could not help being surprised.","In his opinion, the clan-protecting formation of the Blood Marten Clan was already very powerful. However, it was clear that the clan-protecting formation of the Nine-tailed Clan was much more powerful than that of the Blood Marten Clan.","“The clan-protecting array of the nine-tailed race is a complete set of array that the ancestors of the nine-tailed race obtained by chance while adventuring in the universe battlefield. The power of this array is indeed extraordinary. Unfortunately, in the history of the nine-tailed race, there has never been a ruler-level great being born. Otherwise, if a ruler-level great being had personally activated this array and set it up, then even a ruler-level great being would not have been able to shake this array in the slightest,” Xiao’er said.","“It’s normal. After all, it’s a divine clan, so it has some foundation. Without some powerful means, the Nine-tailed Clan couldn’t have survived until now,” Axe One Master said calmly.","“Miss Xiao’er, can you deal with the formation of the Nine-tailed Clan from the inside, like you did with the Scarlet Gold Clan?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“No.” Xiao’er shook her head. “The method used to break the formation of the Scarlet Gold Clan can’t be used on the formation of the Nine-tailed Clan. The formation is a complete formation, which is like a treasure. It has a formation spirit, and its foundation, core, and even the whole formation are controlled by the formation spirit. Even the patriarch of the Nine-tailed Clan is not qualified to control the formation, so he can’t break it from the inside.”","“In addition, even if I have to control some of the top experts of the Nine-tailed Clan, I have been trying to infiltrate them over the years. However, the souls of the clansmen of the Nine-tailed Clan are extremely powerful. The stronger they are, the harder it is to control them. Besides, the Nine-tailed Clan is not like those top clans. They won’t give me an opportunity so easily. Therefore, although I have controlled a few people in the Nine-tailed Clan, including the rule master, there are no important figures.”","“If that’s the case, we’ll be in trouble,” Jian Wushuang said with a frown.","“It won’t be a problem. The clan-protecting formation of the Nine-tailed Clan is strong, but it’s not impossible to break it,” Axe One Master suddenly said with a smile.","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang and Xiao’er immediately looked at Axe One Master.","“Axe One Master, do you have a solution?” Xiao’er asked.","“Miss Xiao’er, Heavenly Sword Marquis, you may not know this, but among the three of us, Star Saint Master and I are good at fighting and defending. We face our enemies head-on. Both of us are not weak in the six void realms, but Marquis Duan Yu...although he is also in the six void realms, his real combat strength is probably not much stronger than a peak of the five void realms,” Axe One Master said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang and Xiao’er could not help glancing at the gentle Marquis Duan Yu.","“To tell you the truth, I am not good at fighting head-on. What I am good at is the Dao of formation!” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“Good at formation?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “Marquis Duan Yu, you mean you can break the clan-protecting formation of the Nine-tailed Clan?”","Marquis Duan Yu just smiled and said nothing","“It’s not that simple.” Xiao’er frowned and said, “As far as I know, there was an expert who reached the peak of the Formation Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm. He stayed outside the clan-protecting formation of the Nine-tailed Clan for a hundred years, but he couldn’t find any clues, let alone break it. Marquis Duan Yu, you may be good at formations, but to break the clan-protecting formation of the Nine-tailed Clan, I’m afraid...”","“Haha, looks like Miss Xiao’er doesn’t really believe me.” Marquis Duan Yu smiled, but he wasn’t angry at all, instead, he continued to smile. “Miss Xiao’er, I know that the Nine-tailed Clan’s protective array is a complete five elements array. It contains the fusion power of the five great laws of metal, wood, water, fire, and earth, forming a perfect formless array that can be used to attack or defend. It’s extremely terrifying!” “Haha!”","“The person who created this formation must have surpassed an ordinary ruler. Of course, it’s not easy to break such a formation. Those so-called formation masters in the Divine Beginning Realm... Haha, to put it bluntly, they haven’t really roamed the universe battlefield or understood the formation in the universe. These people can’t even be considered as the threshold of the formation.”","“But I’m different.","“I don’t know much about the arrays in the Divine Beginning Realm, but I’ve studied those arrays in the universe battlefield. There are many complete arrays in the universe. Not only these five elements arrays, but there are also some special arrays that are higher in level than the five elements arrays. I’ve studied them and even tried to crack them. It’s not a difficult task.”","Although Marquis Duan Yu was still gentle and refined, his words were filled with absolute confidence and even pride.","Jian Wushuang and Xiao’er could not help looking at him with surprise.","At this moment, Axe One Master said, “Don’t worry, I can guarantee that no one in the Divine Beginning Realm can compare to Marquis Duan Yu in terms of formations, especially those that are passed down in the universe battlefield. If there is only one person in the Divine Beginning Realm who can break your five-elemental formation, Marquis Duan Yu is the only one. Moreover, in order to ensure that there will be no accidents, palace master asked us to wait for a special supreme treasure.”","“What supreme treasure?” Xiao’er asked.","“The realm-breaking talisman is a supreme treasure passed down in the universe. All formations below the level of an ‘Earth Saint’ can not hide from it. As for the five-elemental formation of the Nine-tailed Clan, it can only reach the level of an Earth Saint when it is at its strongest. As for now, it is not even an earth saint level. With Marquis Duan Yu’s understanding of the dao of formation and the realm-breaking talisman, it should be easy for him to break the five-elemental formation of the Nine-tailed Clan,” Axe One Master said with a smile.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang and Xiao’er’s eyes lit up.","“In that case, I’ll rely on you in the magic formation,” Xiao’er said.","“My purpose is to break the formation. As for the battle between you and the Nine-tailed Clan, I don’t intend to interfere,” Marquis Duan Yu said with a smile.","“That’s not a problem,” Xiao’er said with a smile.","“Well, since we can solve the two most troublesome problems, we can discuss when we are ready to fight,” Jian Wushuang said.","“We have declared war on the Nine-tailed Clan, so we must fight to the death with them. The Nine-tailed Clan naturally knows this. We are all ready, but I’m afraid the Nine-tailed Clan is not ready yet. Let’s take advantage of the fact that they are not fully prepared!” Xiao’er said seriously."]},{"number":3466,"title":"Chapter 3466 - The Army Arrived","paragraphs":["“Immediately? If that’s the case, then I’ll ask Miss Xiao’er to gather the experts as soon as possible,” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“The experts of our Divine Moon Palace have long been prepared. Now, we’re only waiting for the experts of the Howling Demon Clan, the Scarlet Gold Clan, and the Blood Marten Clan to arrive,” Xiao’er said.","Very soon, the Howling Demon Clan, the Scarlet Gold Clan, and the Blood Marten Clan, which had been completely controlled by Xiao’er, as well as the Blood Marten Clan, which had formed an alliance with the Divine Moon Palace, arrived.","Of the three top clans, the Howling Demon Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan were both extremely powerful. This time, upon receiving Xiao’er’s orders, they sent out more than ten Principles Masters from the two top clans.","The Blood Marten Clan was slightly weaker, but they had also sent out six Principles Masters.","However, the Divine Moon Palace’s own power was even more terrifying. All the Principles Masters in the Divine Moon Palace, including nearly 20 of them, had also come out in full force.","In the vast void, numerous experts could be seen floating in the air.","At a glance, there were nearly 50 of them, and all of them were Principles Masters, not to mention Jian Wushuang!","The strength of nearly 50 Principles Masters was too strong!","“Although the Nine-tailed Clan is a celestial race, there are only about 30 Principles Masters in total. They are far inferior to our camp. As for the top experts, we have five experts of the six void realms, including Demon Master Chenhuo, Lord Xu, Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master. We are also far stronger than them. We will definitely win this battle!” Xiao’er’s eyes lit up.","“Let’s go!”","With Xiao’er’s order, many experts from the Divine Moon Palace’s camp headed straight for the Nine-tailed Clan.","The atmosphere in the Nine-tailed Clan was very tense.","“Mother, we have already sent out invitations to all the solitary experts and forces who have benefited from our Nine-tailed Clan. Some experts have agreed to rush over. Now, five Principles Masters have arrived in the tribe. The rest will arrive soon.” Da Yu stood respectfully in the hall.","At the very top of the great hall, there was a luxurious woman dressed in a fiery red robe. This woman looked much more beautiful than Da Yu, only slightly more mature. She sat there quietly, her fingers tapping on the armchair, her gaze was lazy as she scanned the area below her.","Everyone who was caught by her gaze, including the two experts of the fifth level of the void, could not help but lower their heads.","This gorgeous woman in a fiery red robe was the current clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, Da Ying.","“What else?” An indifferent voice came out from the gorgeous woman’s mouth. Although the Nine-tailed Clan was already in an extremely tense atmosphere due to the Divine Moon Palace’s direct declaration of war, as the clan leader, Da Ying...appeared very languid and calm.","“There’s also the Dark Clan...among the four great divine clans, our Nine-tailed Clan has the best relationship with the Dark Clan. Many years ago, the clan encountered some unforeseen circumstances, and our Nine-tailed Clan once lent a helping hand. Therefore, our Nine-tailed Clan has sought the help of the Dark clan this time. The clan leader of the Dark Clan has also promised to lend a helping hand to our Nine-tailed Clan. Moreover, we are already starting to worry about the experts. It won’t be long before many experts of the Dark Clan arrive!” Said Da Yu.","Upon hearing this, the elders of the Nine-tailed Clan heaved a sigh of relief.","The Dark Clan...was one of the four great divine clans. In terms of strength, they were slightly stronger than the Nine-tailed Clan. If the Dark clan was willing to lend a hand, it would naturally be of great help to the Nine-tailed Clan, if the Dark clan were to lend a hand, the Divine Moon Palace alone would not be able to do anything to the Nine-tailed Clan.","“Back then, the Nine-tailed Clan did help the Dark Clan. Now that the Dark Clan has helped the Nine-tailed Clan, we have to return the favor. If we use this favor now, we won’t be able to do it again in the future,” Da Ying said calmly.","“That’s right. However, the threat of the Divine Moon Palace is too great. We can only use this favor for now,” Da Yu said. “In addition to the Dark Clan, I have also negotiated with the experts of the three Saint Realms.”","“Oh?” Da Ying’s expression finally changed. He looked down and asked, “What did the three Saint Realms say?”","“It’s very strange. Logically speaking, the Heavenly Sword Marquis is standing with the Divine Moon Palace this time. Given the enmity between the three saint domains and the Heavenly Sword Marquis, since the Heavenly Sword Marquis has already intervened, the three Saint Realms should also intervene. Even if they can’t do anything to the Heavenly Sword Marquis, they shouldn’t let the Heavenly Sword Marquis succeed. I negotiated with the experts of the three Saint Realms. I thought they would agree to help, but in the end...” Da Yu frowned.","“They didn’t agree?” Asked Da Ying.","“Yes, not only did they not agree, but they also said that the fight between the forces and clans in the demon realm had nothing to do with the three holy realms. They didn’t mention anything about Heavenly Sword Marquis,” said Da Yu.","“It’s normal. The real purpose of the three holy realms is to kill Heavenly Sword Marquis. They have already attacked once before, and the three masters of the Saint Realm have all appeared at the same time, but they still failed to kill him. Under such circumstances, they won’t attack again so soon. At least, they won’t easily deal with Heavenly Sword Marquis before they have absolute confidence. But once they are ready to attack, the time for Heavenly Sword Marquis to die will come,” said Da Ying with a smile.","“Mother, are you saying that the three great Saint Realms are preparing a great killing weapon to kill Heavenly Sword Marquis? But they have even personally attacked the three great Saint Realm Masters. Do they have any more powerful methods?” Da Yu frowned.","“Don’t underestimate the three great Saint Realms. Don’t forget that the will of the Heavenly Dao stands behind the three great Saint Realms. Their methods are not what you can imagine.” Da Ying smiled. “Forget it. Even if the three Saint Realms aren’t willing to take action, as long as the Dark Clan is willing to lend a helping hand and the experts invited by our Nine-tailed Clan to help, there’s no need to fear the Divine Moon Palace.”","“Mother is right.” Da Yu nodded respectfully.","But right at this moment...","“Oh?” Da Yu’s expression suddenly changed. Many Principles Masters of the Nine-tailed Clan in the hall were also shocked.","“What’s wrong?” Da Ying looked down.","“Mother, the experts of the Divine Moon Palace have arrived!” Da Yu said seriously.","“Oh? So soon?” Da Ying could not help but look surprised, but then he smiled. “Yes, the people of the Divine Moon Palace are very smart. They know that our Nine-tailed Clan is not fully prepared. The experts invited and the reinforcements of the Dark Clan haven’t arrived yet, so they want to take the opportunity to attack our Nine-tailed Clan directly.”","“Hmph, you think well, but the truth is not that easy.” Da Yu sneered.","“Let’s go out and take a look together.”","Da Ying waved his hand, but he had already disappeared into the hall."]},{"number":3467,"title":"Chapter 3467 - Attracting Attention","paragraphs":["In the void outside the ancestral land of the Nine-tailed Clan, numerous figures were gathered there.","Each of these figures was emitting a magnificent and tyrannical aura. Any one of these auras had already reached the level of a Principles Master.","Nearly fifty Principles Masters were gathered together, and the pressure formed made the members of the Nine-tailed Clan who had already seen the scene here unable to breathe.","“So many Principles Masters...this Divine Moon Palace is really powerful.” Da Ying had already arrived at the void at the edge of the clan land. He could not help but sigh when he saw the scene outside the clan land, “It seems that the outside world has produced many talented people during the years I’ve been in seclusion. A Heavenly Sword Marquis and a mere Immortal Saint had turned the Divine Beginning Realm upside down. And now, there’s someone who has condensed such a powerful force in such a short period of time!”","“Mother, the reason why the Divine Moon Palace could rise so quickly is that they used some unknown method to directly control the Howling Demon Clan and the Scarlet Gold Clan. The method used by the Divine Moon Palace is similar to soul control or enchantment. However, we don’t know what exactly it is,” said Da Yu.","“If they really rely on soul control or enchantment, it’s really amazing. The Nine-tailed Clan is also good at soul control and enchantment. I wonder if the person behind the Divine Moon Palace has something to do with the Nine-tailed Clan.” Da Ying narrowed his eyes.","At this moment...among the crowd outside, Axe One Master, Duan Yu Marquis, and Star Saint Master had already appeared at the front.","Even though the three of them had concealed their auras, Da Ying was a peak expert of the six states of the void, so he naturally sensed the existence of these three people at the first moment.","“What’s going on?”","“Didn’t they say that there is only one expert of the six states of the void in the Divine Moon Palace, and there are only two experts of the six states of the void who have been following Heavenly Sword Marquis All this time? But why are there a total of five experts of the six states of the void in front of us now?” Da Ying’s expression had become solemn.","“Five void sixth realm experts?” The Principles Masters of the surrounding Nine-tailed Clan were shocked when they heard this.","“Impossible. There are only so many void sixth realm experts in the Divine Beginning Realm. How could there be three void sixth realm experts in the Divine Moon Palace?” Da Yu said.","enses are wro","“Why? Do you think my senses are wrong?” Da Ying glanced at Da Yu.","Da Yu’s body trembled, but her eyes were still filled with disbelief.","“Five experts of the sixth level of the Void?”","“How can there be so many?”","He was not the only one. Even the Principles Master of the Nine-tailed Clan was panicking.","After all, the Nine-tailed Clan only had two experts of the sixth level of the void.","“Purely in terms of lineup, this Divine Moon Palace has nearly twenty more Principles Masters than our Nine-tailed Clan. Even the top experts of the sixth level of the void are three more than us. In terms of overall combat strength, our Nine-tailed Clan and the Divine Moon Palace are no longer in direct proportion. Now that the Divine Moon Palace is attacking head-on, they naturally have a high chance of winning. Our Nine-tailed Clan is not suited to face them head-on,” Da Ying said.","The surrounding elders nodded one after another.","They could see that the gap between the two sides was too big. It would be foolish to fight them head-on.","“Let’s wait. Although it’s a little sullen, what we Nine-tailed Clan need to do now is to guard the ancestral land. We can’t go out. With the five-element formation left by the ancestor, Divine Moon Palace can’t attack. We can only wait here quietly for the reinforcements of the Dark World Clan. When the experts of the Dark World Clan arrive, we will be qualified to fight the Divine Moon Palace head-on,” Da Ying said.","The experts of the Nine-tailed Clan naturally obeyed Da Ying’s orders.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang, Xiao’er, and the others were standing together in the void.","“It seems that the Nine-tailed Clan doesn’t intend to fight.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","“It’s normal. There are no more than 30 Principles Masters in the Nine-tailed Clan. Besides, the auras of Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master Can’t be hidden from the clan leader. They know that there’s a big gap between them and us, so of course, they choose to avoid fighting.” Xiao’er smiled. “But this is also within our expectations.”","“Duan Yu Marquis, I’ll leave the Nine-tailed Clan’s clan protection array to you.” Xiao’er glanced at Duan Yu Marquis.","“It’s not difficult to break the array, but I’m worried that during the process of breaking the array, the experts of the Nine-tailed Clan will appear and disturb me.” Duan Yu Marquis said.","“That’s simple. You can rest assured and go break the array. I’ll think of a way to divert the attention of the Nine-tailed Clan for you so that no one will disturb you.” Xiao’er said.","“Haha, then I will go.” Duan Yu Marquis laughed and immediately headed toward the ancestral land of the Nine-tailed Clan.","“Miss Xiao’er, what method do you have to divert the attention of the Nine-tailed Clan? Do you want us to attack them head-on?” Axe One Master asked.","“I have my own methods. Just watch.” Xiao’er smiled and immediately rushed forward.","In the blink of an eye, she had arrived in front of the Nine-tailed Clan’s ancestral land. She was only a few hundred meters away from the entrance of the Nine-tailed Clan.","“The current Grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan, come out and have a chat.” Xiao’er’s voice was calm, but it spread throughout the entire void. Naturally, it also spread to the Nine-tailed Clan.","“Who are you? Do you deserve to have a chat with my Grandmaster?” A deep voice immediately sounded from within the Nine-tailed Clan. This voice belonged to some of the five void realm elders of the Nine-tailed Clan.","“My name is Xiao’er. I’m afraid that this name will be unfamiliar to your Nine-tailed Clan. However, my current identity is the Divine Moon Palace’s Palace Master!” Xiao’er said with a faint smile.","“What?” Exclamations immediately sounded from within the Nine-tailed Clan.","They could see Xiao’er’s appearance through the five elements array formation. The latter looked like a little girl, but this little girl was actually the mysterious Palace Master of the Divine Moon Palace who possessed heaven-reaching means? The founder of the Divine Moon Palace?","“What kind of joke is this? The Palace Master of the Divine Moon Palace was able to establish the Divine Moon Palace on his own, and in just a few hundred years, he led the Divine Moon Palace to such an extent. He could even compete with my Nine-tailed Clan. How can such a method be compared to an ordinary person?”","“Although the mysterious Palace Master of the Divine Moon Palace has never appeared before, according to my Nine-tailed Clan’s guess, the Palace Master of the Divine Moon Palace should be at least a sixth level void realm expert. But you...are only at the fourth level of the void realm, and your aura isn’t too dense. Clearly, you have just broken through not long ago, and you dare to Pretend?” The five level void realm elder of the Nine-tailed Clan shouted.","“Haha, I didn’t expect that in the eyes of your Nine-tailed Clan, I have such great ability?”. Xiao’er smiled, but then he said seriously, “I am indeed the Palace Master of the Divine Moon Palace. It’s easy to face him head-on. Lord Xu, come here!”"]},{"number":3468,"title":"Chapter 3468 - The Bloodline of the Emperor Phoenix","paragraphs":["Chapter 3468 The Bloodline of the Emperor Phoenix","After hearing the order, Xu Zhu immediately came to Xiao’er’s side respectfully.","“Kneel.” Xiao’er said softly.","Xu Zhu did not hesitate at all and directly knelt down in front of the countless experts present.","This scene caused the experts of the Nine-tailed Clan to be extremely shocked.","“A powerful expert at the sixth level of the void actually kneeled before her in public?”","“That person is Xu Zhu. I’ve heard of him. It’s said that he’s a solitary expert with a proud personality. With his strength and personality, even if he’s facing a saint realm master or a ruler realm expert, he definitely wouldn’t be like this. After all, a powerful expert at the sixth level of the void wouldn’t completely disregard his dignity!” “Just what kind of method did that woman use to actually make an expert of the six states of the void be willing to become a slave?”","The Principles Masters of the Nine-tailed Clan were all discussing amongst themselves.","“How is it? Now, do I have the qualifications to talk to your Nine-tailed Clan’s Grandmaster?” Xiao’er said with a faint smile.","Within the Nine-tailed Clan, everyone’s gazes turned toward Da Ying.","Da Ying waved her sleeve. Although her body did not move, in the void outside the ancestral land of the Nine-tailed Clan, a strand of her consciousness had condensed and formed.","“Divine Moon Palace Master.” Da Ying’s voice was calm.","“You are the current Grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan? Your name should be Da Ying, right? And your mother, the previous Grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan, is Da Gu.” Xiao’er asked.","“So what if I am?” Da Ying’s expression was cold.","“It’s nothing. I just think it’s a little funny. I didn’t expect that the most inconspicuous and ordinary looking little fellow, Da Gu, would become the clan leader in the end. Da You’s taste isn’t that good.” Xiao’er sneered.","But after hearing Xiao’er’s words, Da Ying’s gaze immediately turned cold.","“Who are you? How dare you call my mother a little fellow?” Da Ying’s heart was already filled with anger.","Da Gu was her mother, the previous clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan.","As for Da You...that was her grandmother, the previous clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan.","Many years ago, Da You passed the position of clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan to her mother, Da Gu. Subsequently, her mother, Da Gu, passed the position of clan leader to her. Although there were only two generations between them, in reality, as a member of a celestial race...each generation of the Nine-tailed Clan had an extremely long time to pass on the inheritance.","A clan leader usually had an extremely long period of time in office. 100-200 million years could only be considered short. It was usually 400-500 million years.","For example, from the time she took over the position of clan leader until now, it had already been more than 200 million years.","However, this Divine Moon Palace Master who appeared out of nowhere actually mentioned her mother and even her grandmother the moment she opened her mouth. Moreover, she even called her mother a little fellow?","“Da Ying, you don’t have to be angry. I call that Da Gu a little fellow, so I naturally have the qualifications. Because if we were to really talk about seniority, Da Gu would have to call me aunt. Even Da You would have to call me aunt.” Xiao’er said with a smile.","“What?” Everyone in the Nine-tailed Clan was shocked.","Even Da Ying was shocked.","“What, you don’t believe me?” Xiao’er smiled. “Da Ying, listen carefully. Xiao’er is only my name in this life. However, countless years ago, my real name was Da Ji. As the clan leader, have you ever heard of this name?” Xiao’er said seriously.","“Da Ji?” Da Ying’s pupils constricted at first. Then, as if he had thought of something, his body trembled and his expression changed drastically. “Da Ji? You are the Da Ji who fought with grandmother for the position of clan leader back then?”","As soon as he said that, Da Ying immediately shook his head. “Impossible, Da Ji...that person is someone from who knows how many years ago. He is even older than grandmother. Moreover, this Da Ji had already been executed for betraying my Nine-tailed Clan back then. How could she still be alive?","“Even if she really survived, with this Da Ji’s talent, she should have at least reached the sixth level of the void. How could she have just stepped into the fourth level of the void like you?”","Da Ying’s cold voice reverberated in the world. She absolutely did not believe that the person in front of her was the same Da Ji from back then.","It was not just her. Everyone in the Nine-tailed Clan also did not believe it.","Da Ji...although it had been a long time since she was born, she was once a prominent figure in the Nine-tailed Clan. She was even a strong competitor for the Nine-tailed Clan Leader position. Her talent and reputation were shocking. Even now...many people in the Nine-tailed Clan knew of her existence.","Because they knew, they did not believe that Xiao’er was Daji.","However, Xiao’er smiled in the face of the doubts of the Nine-tailed Clan members. “I know you don’t believe me, but I naturally have a way to prove it. First, it’s this...”","Xiao’er moved and a pure bloodline power rose from her body.","This bloodline power originated from the Nine-tailed Clan’s bloodline. Moreover, the purity of the bloodline immediately caused the many members of the Nine-tailed Clan to palpitate the moment it rose, when they saw the bloodline aura that rose from Xiao’er’s body, most of the tribe members could not help but feel a desire to submit in their hearts.","“This bloodline aura...” Da Ying’s expression also changed drastically.","Under the guidance of the bloodline aura, a blurry shadow that was so huge that it covered the entire void rose from behind Xiao’er.","This blurry shadow was silver-white in color. Only its head had a faint golden edge. Its huge body was extremely luxurious and beautiful. There were nine silver-white tails behind it. These nine tails were slightly raised, it made this figure look extremely beautiful.","“This is...the body of the Emperor Phoenix!”","No one knew who was the first person in the Nine-tailed Clan to cry out in shock, and the next person to unite the Nine-tailed Clan was completely shaken.","“The is indeed the body of the Emperor Phoenix!”","“The bloodline of the Emperor Phoenix, this is the supreme bloodline of our Nine-tailed Clan!”","“Oh my God, Emperor Phoenix Bloodline, did our Nine-tailed Clan give birth to the Emperor Phoenix bloodline again?”","The Nine-tailed Clan was completely boiling.","Emperor Phoenix bloodline, that was the supreme bloodline of the Nine-tailed Clan. Since the birth of the Nine-tailed Clan, the number of people who had the Emperor Phoenix bloodline that had been born over countless years were few and far between. This represented the highest nobility of the Nine-tailed Clan, the purest bloodline.","Under normal circumstances, the Emperor Phoenix bloodline was the Orthodox bloodline of the Nine-tailed Clan. One could become the leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, which was also the clan leader.","After all, the Emperor Phoenix bloodline was not born in every era. In this era, Da Ying, as the clan leader, did not have the Emperor Phoenix bloodline, including her mother, Da Gu, however, as her grandmother, Da You, was the one who possessed the Emperor Phoenix bloodline, as the orthodox bloodline, the chances of her descendants awakening the Emperor Phoenix bloodline in the future were extremely high. That was why Da Ying was qualified to become the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan."]},{"number":3469,"title":"Chapter 3469 - Was Even More Qualified","paragraphs":["Chapter 3469 Was Even More Qualified","In this generation, no one from the Nine-tailed Clan had awakened the Emperor Phoenix bloodline. But now, this Divine Moon Palace master before them actually possessed the Supreme Emperor Phoenix bloodline of their Nine-tailed Clan, furthermore, this Divine Moon Palace had directly led many experts to attack the Nine-tailed Clan. This shocked the Nine-tailed Clan to an unprecedented level.","“Emperor Phoenix bloodline. Hmph, so what if you have Emperor Phoenix bloodline? It’s not like our Nine-tailed Clan doesn’t have Emperor Phoenix bloodline in history. Who knows what method you used to obtain my Emperor Phoenix Bloodline?","“Who knows, it might be our Nine-tailed Clan’s enemy who secretly used a special method to possess our Nine-tailed Clan members?” Da Ying shouted sternly.","Many members of the Nine-tailed Clan were startled awake after hearing these words.","That’s right. Just the Emperor Phoenix bloodline alone could not prove anything. Furthermore, it could not prove Xiao’er’s identity.","“Hehe, just the Emperor Phoenix bloodline alone can not prove it. What about this move?” Xiao’er smiled strangely. The moment she revealed her smile, in the eyes of the enormous nine-tail void behind her...two light purple rays suddenly flashed.","These two light purple rays were extremely dazzling. They were like two purple stars that instantly attracted the attention of everyone present.","At the instant everyone saw these light purple rays, obscure energy swept over.","Within the Nine-tailed Clan, countless members of the tribe raised their heads and looked at the eyes of the nine-tailed void figure that were emitting light purple rays. Their gazes gradually became misty, becoming dull, becoming dull, and forgetting themselves.","Even many Principles Masters of the Nine-tailed Clan revealed the same expression.","They were all attracted by the gaze of the nine-tailed phantom.","And those who were also attracted by the gaze of the nine-tailed phantom, but did not immerse themselves in it, were only the extremely powerful Principles Masters of the Nine-tailed Clan. However, although these Principles Masters were not attracted by that gaze...the shock in their hearts was even greater at this moment.","“This, could this be...”","“Nine-life succubus heavenly technique, yes, it’s the supreme secret technique of our Nine-tailed Clan, nine-life succubus heavenly technique!”","“The supreme divine ability of the succubus heavenly technique, the supreme treasure of our Nine-tailed Clan. Ever since our Nine-tailed Clan obtained this secret technique, no one has been able to truly master this secret technique. But now...what she is using is definitely the nine-life succubus heavenly technique. And just by looking at it, even the Principles Masters can not help but be affected. This clearly shows that she has completely mastered the nine-life succubus heavenly technique!”","“Could this Divine Moon Palace Master really be that Da Ji from back then?”","Numerous gazes were fixed on Xiao’er. The Principles Masters who were initially filled with doubts about Xiao’er’s identity had now begun to waver in their hearts.","“Da Ying, and everyone from the Nine-tailed Clan, you should be able to believe it now, right?” Xiao’er stood in front of the nine-tailed phantom with an indifferent expression. Her voice was like a bewitching charm as it reverberated through the world. “Back then, the Nine-tailed Clan actually gave birth to two owners of the Emperor Phoenix bloodline at the same time. One of them was me, and the other was your grandmother, Da You!”","“Originally, your grandmother, Da You, was far inferior to me in terms of strength, talent, seniority, and seniority. I was publicly acknowledged as the first successor of the Nine-tailed Clan back then. However, it was a pity that Da You’s mother, who was also the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan at that time, Da Xi, was selfish. In order for Da You to smoothly become the new clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, she tried every means to make things difficult for me in the clan back then. However, I dodged all of them one by one!”","“But later, the four divine races and the Eight Directions Celestial Sect joined forces with the three holy regions to attack the Seven Stars Mysterious Sect. Because I was already engaged to Shisan Di, the leader of the Seven Stars Mysterious Sect, Da Xi schemed to say that I had betrayed the Nine-tailed Clan and secretly executed me.","“Fortunately, I was lucky enough to comprehend the nine-lives charming heaven spell before I died. I entered the path of reincarnation and began my reincarnation. After that, I experienced nine reincarnations and nine experiential journeys. I finally mastered the nine-lives charming heaven spell and began my journey of revenge!”","“Unfortunately, the nine reincarnations took too long. In this life, that Da Xi had already gone to the cosmic battlefield. Her descendants, Da You and Da Gu, had also left one after another, leaving the position of clan leader to you, Da Ying!”","“And today, I came here to take back what originally belonged to me. I want to retake control of the Nine-tailed Clan. Anyone who dares to disobey me in the Nine-tailed Clan will be killed without mercy!”","“Da Ying, if you are sensible, you can give up your position as the clan leader now and bring your daughters out of the Divine Beginning Realm to the universe battlefield. I can consider the fact that we are from the same race, so I won’t bother with your grudges in the past. But if you are stubborn, I will attack the Nine-tailed Clan directly. At that time, not only will the Nine-tailed Clan suffer, even you and your daughters won’t be able to live!”","Xiao’er’s voice carried a somber killing intent as it reverberated throughout the world.","The Nine-tailed Clan members who heard this immediately went into an uproar.","One had to know that they had previously thought that the Divine Moon Palace was the enemy of the Nine-tailed Clan and that there was no way to resolve it with their Nine-tailed Clan. Both sides had to fight to the death, and since that was the case...they were prepared to fight to the death.","But now, they knew that the Divine Moon Palace was not the enemy of the Nine-tailed Clan. Instead, the Divine Moon Palace Master was a member of the Nine-tailed Clan. It was only because the Nine-tailed Clan had mistreated her previously that she was here to seek justice...to take back control of the Nine-tailed Clan.","This immediately made many Nine-tailed Clan members waver.","After all, to most clan members, no matter who became the Nine-tailed Clan’s tribe leader, it did not matter much.","And what Xiao’er wanted was the Nine-tailed Clan’s clan leader position, and she did indeed have the qualifications to do so.","Possessing the Emperor Phoenix bloodline, and even mastering the nine-lives succubus heaven technique that no one in the Nine-tailed Clan had ever mastered. The only flaw might be that her current strength was slightly weaker, but for her to be able to...she had created a Divine Moon Palace that was so terrifying that even her overall strength surpassed that of the Nine-tailed Clan. One could only imagine how formidable her methods were.","All in all, Xiao’er was more qualified than Da Ying to become the Nine-tailed Clan leader.","Since Xiao’er was more qualified to become the Nine-tailed Clan leader, it was not justified for her to become the Nine-tailed Clan leader. Moreover, if Xiao’er became the clan leader, not only would she be able to avoid a life-and-death battle, but she would also be able to become the Nine-tailed clan leader! Moreover, Xiao’er would definitely merge the Divine Moon Palace into the Nine-tailed Clan. In this way, the Nine-tailed Clan’s overall strength would also receive an unprecedented increase. This would be of great benefit to the Nine-tailed Clan!","After understanding this point, many members of the Nine-tailed Clan were gradually leaning toward Xiao’er’s side."]},{"number":3470,"title":"Chapter 3470 - Suppression","paragraphs":["Chapter 3470 Suppression","The Nine-tailed Clan was in an uproar.","Countless members of the Nine-tailed Clan were discussing Xiao’er’s Emperor Phoenix bloodline and the nine-life heavenly charms technique.","And just as many people began to lean toward Xiao’er, a Principles Master suddenly knelt down.","“Elder Da Lan of the Nine-tailed Clan welcomes the return of Grandmaster Da Ji to retake control of the Nine-tailed Clan!” The Principles Master’s voice was so loud that it directly drowned out the voices of everyone present. It did not only reverberate throughout the entire Nine-tailed Clan, it also reverberated throughout the entire world.","For a moment, countless members of the Nine-tailed Clan focused their gazes on this Principles Master.","“Da Lan, are you crazy? We haven’t even confirmed whether this person is really the original Da Ji. How can you say such a thing?” Da Yu was the first to rebuke.","However, the Principles Masters, Da Lan, said in a deep voice, “I’m not crazy. I’m just being realistic. Grandmaster Da Ji was a figure from the era of Grandmaster Da You. Not only does she have the bloodline of the Emperor Phoenix, but she has also cultivated the nine-lives charming heaven technique that no one in our Nine-tailed Clan has ever mastered. No one in our Nine-tailed Clan can compare with her in these two aspects!”","“The Nine-tailed Clan has always valued bloodlines above all else. Grandmaster Da Ji is naturally more qualified than Da Ying to be the Grandmaster of the Nine-tailed Clan!”","“Promise Me. If I were you, for the sake of the Nine-tailed Clan, I would take the initiative to offer the position of Grandmaster and hand the Nine-tailed Clan over to Grandmaster Da Ji. Not only would I be able to avoid a great war, but I would also be able to increase the strength of the Nine-tailed Clan to an unprecedented level. This is truly for the good of the Nine-tailed Clan!”","“Shut up!” Da Yu was furious.","As for Da Ying, his face turned gloomy.","“Da Yu, everything I said is for the good of the Nine-tailed Clan. Even if you kill me, I will say it out loud and make Da Ying hand over the position of tribe leader so that Grandmaster Da Ji can take control of the Nine-tailed Clan again. This is the best choice for the Nine-tailed Clan!” Da Lan added.","After he finished speaking, he was supported by many clansmen around him.","“Yes, in the clan motto, above bloodline, Da Ying does not possess the bloodline of Emperor Phoenix, so she can not be compared to Grandmaster Da Ji. Furthermore, Grandmaster Da Ji has mastered the nine-lives succubus heaven technique. She is more qualified than anyone else to be the new clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan!”","“I also support Grandmaster Da Ji!”","“Grandmaster Da Ying, for the sake of our Nine-tailed Clan, please hand over the position of Grandmaster.”","More and more clansmen began to speak. Among them, there was no lack of Principles Masters. For a moment, many people agreed with them.","“Crazy, you’re all crazy!”","“Da Lan, do you know what you’re doing?”","“Shut up, all of you shut up!”","In the Nine-tailed Clan, there were also many experts who were not swayed and still followed Da Ying. At this moment, they all stood out.","This was equivalent to two voices coming from within the Nine-tailed Clan.","One was to ask Da Ying to hand over the position of clan leader so that Xiao’er could control the Nine-tailed Clan.","The other was naturally following Da Ying as usual.","The two voices appeared within the Nine-tailed Clan at the same time, causing the Nine-tailed Clan to fall into complete chaos.","In the void outside the Nine-tailed Clan, many experts from the Divine Moon Palace’s camp were still standing there, their gazes looking forward.","Although they could not see what was happening in the Nine-tailed Clan’s ancestral land because of the protective array, they could hear the chaotic voices coming from inside the Nine-tailed Clan. Obviously, the Nine-tailed Clan was now in a complete mess, it was a complete mess.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang could not help exclaiming in admiration, “Miss Xiao’er’s methods are really impressive. She revealed her identity at the gate of the Nine-tailed Clan’s ancestral land, causing chaos in the Nine-tailed Clan. If I’m not wrong, the first person who said she would support her to regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan, Da Lan, should be the expert she secretly controlled!”","Xiao-er had previously said that she controlled some people in the Nine-tailed Clan, but the status of the people she controlled was not too high.","AS","And now, this Da Lan was only a void second level Principles Master, but it was this kind of person who had played a huge role at the crucial moment, causing the Nine-tailed Clan to be in complete chaos.","“This Miss Xiao’er’s methods are indeed brilliant, but this world still relies on strength to speak. And in the Nine-tailed Clan, in terms of pure strength, the clan leader, Da Ying, is naturally the strongest. It’s impossible for this Miss Xiao’er to disintegrate the Nine-tailed Clan just like that and make that Da Ying obediently hand over the position of clan leader. If nothing goes wrong, it won’t be long before the voice of support for Xiao’er in the Nine-tailed Clan will be suppressed,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","“That’s for sure. However, when Da Ying suppressed Da Lan and the others and completely suppressed the voice, Duan Yu Marquis was not affected at all. When the Nine-tailed Clan has calmed down, the magic array will have been broken. Miss Xiao’er’s goal has been achieved.” Jian Wushuang smiled.","He knew very well that Xiao’er’s original intention was not to make Da Ying hand over the position of clan leader, nor was it to disintegrate the Nine-tailed Clan from the inside.","Her real purpose was to attract the attention of the Nine-tailed Clan and buy time for Marquis Duan Yu to break the array so that the Nine-tailed Clan would not notice and disturb Marquis Duan Yu. From the looks of it now...Xiao’er had indeed completely attracted the attention of the Nine-tailed Clan.","As time passed, the voice of support for Xiao’er from the Nine-tailed Clan was gradually suppressed. But at this moment, Marquis Duan Yu had already returned to Xiao’er’s side.","“How is it?” Xiao’er glanced at Marquis Duan","Yu.","“I have underestimated this five elements array. Although I have understood this array before, it is still quite difficult to truly crack it. Fortunately, with the assistance of the realm-breaking talisman, I was able to crack this five elements array. Right now, I have already infiltrated most of the five elements array, but the Nine-tailed Clan and the array spirit did not sense it at all. Next, as long as Miss Xiao’er gives the order, I will be able to instantly crack this array.” Duan Yu Marquis said confidently.","“That’s great. Thank you, Duan Yu Marquis.” Xiao’er was obviously excited.","“It’s nothing.” Duan Yu Marquis smiled.","Xiao’er nodded and took a step forward. Her cold voice echoed in the air, “Da Ying, have you thought about whether you want to hand over the position of clan leader or me?”","“Haha, Divine Moon Palace Master, your methods of bewitching people are indeed impressive. However, to think that you can control my Nine-tailed Clan with such a trivial trick is a little too whimsical. If you really have the ability, just do it. No matter what tricks your Divine Moon Palace has, my Nine-tailed Clan will take it.” Da Ying’s laughter echoed through the world."]},{"number":3471,"title":"Chapter 3471 - Destroying the Dead","paragraphs":["At this moment, the Nine-tailed Clan had completely calmed down. Da Ying had also used her lightning-fast methods to control the Nine-tailed Clan into an iron plate. She was not afraid of Xiao’er’s bewitchment at all.","“Da Ying, this is your own choice. In that case, you can’t blame me,” Xiao’er said coldly. “There’s no point in talking nonsense. If you have the ability, just bring your men and attack directly,” Da Ying said.","“Hehe, Da Ying, it seems that you’re very confident in the Nine-tailed Clan’s protective array. That’s right. After all, it’s a five-element array obtained from the universe battlefield. Under normal circumstances, unless a sage realm master or a ruler level powerhouse comes personally, it’s impossible to break it. Unfortunately, there are exceptions to everything. Today, I want you to see how this protective array was broken.” Xiao’er smiled coldly.","“Marquis Duan Yu, let’s do it!”","Marquis Duan Yu had already made full preparations. After Xiao’er’s signal, he smiled faintly and waved his hand, causing a green token to fly toward the array in front of him.","This green token was the realm-breaking token!","“Realm-breaking token?” Da Ying saw this green token in the array and recognized it at a glance. However, she still smiled lightly. “So what if there is a realm-breaking token? Do you think that just because someone said so, this array can be...”","Before Da Ying could finish her words, she suddenly stopped.","That was because she had already noticed that after the realm-breaking talisman entered the formation, the originally indestructible clan-protecting formation began to tremble crazily at this moment.","The entire formation was trembling violently as if it was on the verge of collapse.","At the same time, as the Nine-tailed Clan’s clan leader, Da Ying also received a message from the formation spirit at the first moment.","This message told her that someone had used a great method to infiltrate the inner part of the formation and had already broken most of it. Now that the realm-breaking talisman had been used, the formation could not withstand it and was about to collapse!","“How is this possible?”","“This is the strongest formation of our Nine-tailed Clan. How could it be broken by someone?”","Da Ying’s expression changed drastically. She did not believe that the strongest formation of the Nine-tailed Clan could be broken by someone.","But the truth was in her eyes.","Rumble...","A violent rumble suddenly came from the array formation. Following that, the five elements array formation that covered the entire Nine-tailed Clan began to collapse, the five elements — gold, wood, water, fire, and earth — scattered crazily.","In the blink of an eye, the five elements array formation that the Nine-tailed Clan was proud of completely collapsed.","And the Nine-tailed Clan was completely exposed in front of the many experts of the Divine Moon Palace Camp.","“Da Ying, don’t you just want to trap and guard this array formation and wait for the experts of the dark world to arrive? Do you think I don’t Know?” Xiao’er sneered, “But unfortunately, this array formation has already been broken. You won’t be able to wait for the experts of the dark world to arrive either!”","“Those who belong to the Divine Moon Palace, charge in. Those who dare to resist will be killed without mercy!”","Xiao’er’s voice was solemn.","Previously, no matter if it was to deal with the Howling Demon Clan or the Scarlet Gold Clan, Xiao’er had given orders to keep the experts of the other party as long as possible so as to facilitate her control and strengthen her own side.","But now, facing the Nine-tailed Clan, Xiao’er displayed an unprecedented killing intent.","It was clear that she did not want to rely on her charm to control the experts and clansmen of the Nine-tailed Clan. Instead, she wanted to completely wipe out the entire Nine-tailed Clan through a bloody massacre, then, she would take control of it and make the Nine-tailed Clan truly submit to her!","The nature of these two were completely different.","Hearing Xiao’er’s order, the numerous Principles Masters of the Divine Moon Palace camp instantly moved.","Hong! Hong! Hong! Hong! Hong! – – – – One after another, incomparably powerful auras soared into the sky. Nearly fifty Principles Masters either transformed into a sea of fire, shrouded in boundless darkness or were like blades or sharp blades, directly charging into the Nine-tailed Clan.","A terrifying aura that was like a raging wave completely enveloped and suppressed the Nine-tailed Clan.","The Nine-tailed Clan was in a complete uproar.","The expressions of the Nine-tailed Clan members changed drastically when they saw the Principles Masters swarming over like wasps.","They knew very well that the Nine-tailed Clan could not compare to the Divine Moon Palace in terms of overall strength. The only thing they could rely on was the Nine-tailed Clan’s clan protection array. However, they did not expect the clan protection array to be broken by the Divine Moon Palace.","Without the protection of the array, the experts of the Divine Moon Palace directly charged over. How could they resist?","“Quick, stop them!”","“No matter what price we have to pay, we must stop them!”","Low cries rang out one after another. Even though they knew that there was a huge difference in the battle strength between the upper echelons of the two sides, the masters of rules of the Nine-tailed Clan still tried their best to meet them, wanting to stop the experts of the Divine Moon Palace.","However, the Principles Masters who chose to meet them were only a part of them. There was still a part of them. Previously, they were only forced by Da Ying’s suppression and then placed their hopes on the clan protection array. But now that the clan protection array was broken...this part of the experts immediately understood the situation in front of them. Hence, they gave up on resisting and did not attack.","The people of the Divine Moon Palace also listened to Xiao’er’s orders. As long as they did not resist, they would not attack them.","As a result, there was no way to resist the power of Divine Moon Palace in front of the experts of Divine Moon Palace.","It was completely one-sided.","“It’s as easy as crushing a dead branch.”","Jian Wushuang was still standing in the void outside the Nine-tailed Clan. He looked calmly at everything in front of him. He also understood that since the protection formation of the Nine-tailed Clan had been forced...moreover, when two different voices emerged in the chaos of the Nine-tailed Clan, he knew that there was almost no suspense in this battle.","If there was only one suspense, it would be Da Ying!","“After all, Da Ying is an expert at the peak of the six realms of the void. It’s not easy to deal with him. Chenhuo, go. If you don’t help, no one in the Divine Moon Palace Camp will be able to stop him,” Jian Wushuang said.","He had already seen Da Ying fight with Axe One Master and Star Saint Master.","Although they were fighting one against two, Da Ying still had the upper hand.","There was nothing he could do. Although Axe One Master and Star Saint Master were both at the six void realms, they were still far from the peak of the six void realms. If they joined hands, they could barely fight against Da Ying.","“What About You? Will you fight in this battle?” Demon Master Chenhuo glanced at Jian Wushuang slowly. “Of course, there are a few acquaintances of mine in the Nine-tailed Clan. I have to greet them properly.” Although Jian Wushuang was smiling, his smile was as cold as a blade, his eyes were already looking at the two people in the battlefield ahead.","These two people were Da Yu and Da Su!"]},{"number":3472,"title":"Chapter 3472 - Da Yu","paragraphs":["In the Nine-tailed Clan, the two people who had dealt with Jian Wushuang were Da Yu and Da Su.","When he was outside the Blood Wave Realm, Jian Wushuang was already on the verge of death when he was surrounded and killed by the inescapable net of the three saint realms. However, at this critical moment, Da Yu and da Su had rushed to the battlefield with a group of Principles Masters of the Nine-tailed Clan, for him, it was like adding insult to injury.","Fortunately, he was lucky enough to survive that battle. However, he would not forget the people who had attacked him.","Although Da Yu and Da Su had wanted to avenge the Nine-tailed Clan’s saintess, he would not let them off since they were already in front of him.","The battle within the Nine-tailed Clan was at its climax. Many experts from the Divine Moon Palace were trying their best to eliminate the resistance of the Nine-tailed Clan. Meanwhile, Demon Master Chenhuo had already stopped Da Ying, with the help of Axe One Master and Star Saint Master, they had also suppressed Da Ying.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang made his move.","He ignored the Principles Masters of the Nine-tailed Clan and went straight to the center of the battlefield, appearing in front of Da Yu.","“Da Yu, do you still remember me?” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","“It’s you?” Seeing Jian Wushuang, Da Yu’s eyes immediately turned scarlet. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, how dare you appear in front of me!”","“Why not?” Jian Wushuang smiled, “Now, your Nine-tailed Clan is in great danger. Your mother, including you, is still in danger. Why do you still want to avenge the Nine Palace Saintess?”","“Humph, you killed my sixth sister. This is irreconcilable!” Da Yu shouted in a low voice.","“Well, I’ll give you a chance now. Let’s fight to the death here.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was indifferent. He glanced at the three Principles Masters from the Divine Moon Palace Camp. “Leave Da Yu to me. You don’t have to interfere.”","“Mr. Heavenly Sword Marquis, do you want a fair fight with her?”","“Mr. Heavenly Sword Marquis, she’s not weak. She’s relatively strong among the four void realms. You have to be careful if you fight with her.”","“Yes. The three of us have been attacking her for so long, but we still can’t do anything to her. It shows her strength.”","The Principles Masters of Divine Moon Palace said one after another.","“Don’t worry. I know what to do,” Jian Wushuang said.","Seeing this, the three Principles Masters did not say anything more. They immediately retreated to the side to deal with the experts of the other Nine-tailed Clan.","“Da Yu, no one will be in our way now. Make your move,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, since you want to die, you can’t blame me.” Da Yu’s eyes were cold, emitting a cold light.","“No need to talk nonsense. Bring out all your strength. Otherwise, you won’t have a chance.” Jian Wushuang’s voice was indifferent, and the way he looked at Da Yu was also extremely cold.","Da Yu’s aura was slightly heavy, but suddenly, a fierce light flashed in her eyes.","Swish!","A stream of light flashed, and Da Yu’s figure disappeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“You’re quite fast.” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. His soul perception could easily capture Da Yu’s position.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, die!”","A cold voice came from the void beside Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang turned around and saw that the void had been shattered, and Da Yu emerged from it, at the same time, she was holding a long cyan spear in her hand.","The long spear suddenly pierced through the void with a strange piercing force and rushed toward Jian Wushuang’s head.","Jian Wushuang was still standing there. When he saw the cyan long spear in front of him, he immediately sensed the strong power contained in the long sword.","The piercing power of this spear was especially astonishing.","Most importantly, at the moment the long spear came at him, a strange cyan light lit up in Da Yu’s eyes.","The cyan light shot toward Jian Wushuang like a demonic charm and directly entered his body.","Jian Wushuang’s body shook slightly, but he immediately returned to normal.","“Enchantment?” Jian Wushuang sneered in his heart.","Having lived two lives and experienced so many trials and tribulations, his heart had long been like a blade.","Now, even if Xiao’er used the nine-life heaven charm on him, it would be difficult for it to really affect him. Compared to Xiao’er, Da Yu’s enchantment was far inferior, it could not affect Jian Wushuang at all.","After easily withstanding the charm attack, Jian Wushuang unsheathed his Blood Mountain Sword.","Buzz!","A surge of shocking sword essence suddenly rose up. With a murderous intent, it shot into the sky.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang struck out with his sword.","“Wushuang Sword Manual, Xi Xiang!”","Whoosh!","The huge blood-red sword light slashed out. Jian Wushuang had already activated his life divine power and even used his heaven-cleaving skill. The power of the sword reached its peak in an instant.","Bang!","The huge blood-red sword light smashed into the green spear with terrifying power. The green spear shook, and the terrifying impact made Da Yu unable to hold the spear, the cyan spear was also sent flying.","However, the power of the blood-red sword beam did not decrease as it continued to slash at Da Yu’s divine body.","Although Da Yu was a ruler of the laws of the fourth level of the Void, and a member of the Nine-tailed Clan, and her protective abilities were not ordinary, under the power of the blood-red sword beam, her divine body actually collapsed, and a large amount of divine power was annihilated on the spot.","By the time her divine body recovered, her aura had weakened by nearly 40 percent!","“How is this possible? How can he destroy my divine body and destroy nearly 40 percent of my divine power with a single strike? Even an ordinary expert of the five void realms can’t do this!” Da Yu was terrified.","She did not know that Jian Wushuang’s life divine power and heaven-cleaving skill, combined with his three parts of will, were indeed more powerful than ordinary experts of the five void realms.","For example, in the Divine Ancestor Daoist Sect, the Xuan Master of the nether ancestor lineage was an expert of the void five realms. He was considered an extremely powerful existence among the void five realms, but when it came to power, as long as Jian Wushuang used the heaven-cleaving skill, he would be no match for him! In other words, once Jian Wushuang used the heaven-cleaving skill at full strength, his power could barely reach the peak of the void five realms!","An expert at the peak of the five void realms could not bear the power alone. It was normal for her to lose 40% of her divine power with one sword attack. If she were to fight against an expert at the bottom of the four void realms...with one sword attack, she could at least destroy half of her divine power and kill her opponent with another sword attack.","As for the ordinary second or third void realm experts, Jian Wushuang could kill them with one move."]},{"number":3473,"title":"Chapter 3473 - Space-Time Illusion Kill","paragraphs":["“Da Yu, is this your strongest strength?” Jian Wushuang held his sword with one hand and looked at Da Yu coldly.","“You, you...” Da Yu widened her eyes and was speechless.","An Immortal Saint destroyed her divine body and destroyed nearly 40% of her divine power with one sword?","She could not accept this result.","“Your strength is too weak. It seems that you won’t have a chance to avenge your sixth sister. Let me send you to reunite with your sixth sister.” As Jian Wushuang spoke, a faint sword essence rose from his body, at the same time, a large amount of the power of space-time principles began to gather.","Tas","Jian Wushuang stood in the middle of the battlefield, but at this moment, his heart was unprecedentedly calm. It was as if all the sounds and people around him had disappeared, leaving him alone, and the sword in his hand.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang moved.","He took a step forward, and the Blood Mountain Sword in his hand fell down.","As if he had teleported, he appeared behind Da Yu, and no one saw how he passed through the void.","Da Yu was also completely stunned. She could clearly sense that her life force was running out, and more than 60 percent of her remaining divine power had been destroyed.","“How can it be so fast...” Da Yu murmured.","“You should be glad that it didn’t take me long to comprehend this sword move. You should be proud that you were able to die under it.” Jian Wushuang smiled and slowly sheathed the Blood Mountain Sword.","Da Yu could not say a word. Her voice was completely cut off, but the strange thing was that although she was dead, her divine body was still intact. There was only a small sword scar on her neck.","However, this sword mark destroyed all her divine power in an instant and killed her on the spot!","The sword mark was caused by the sword skill that Jian Wushuang had just displayed. It was called...the instant of life and death!","The instant of life and death was a sword skill that Jian Wushuang had created in the Peerless Sword Manual. This sword skill was so fast that it could kill the opponent in an instant before the opponent had time to react. It could decide the opponent’s life and death in an instant.","This move was already very terrifying.","However, with this move alone, even with Jian Wushuang’s current strength, it was still impossible to destroy more than 60% of Da Yu’s divine power in an instant without any reaction space, it was impossible.","The reason why Jian Wushuang could do this now was because he had perfectly combined the move of the instant of life and death with the space-time illusion kill!","The space-time illusion kill was the fourth move of the space-time divine skill. Its nature was almost the same as the life and death instant, and it was also a divine ability that could kill an opponent at a terrifying speed in an instant.","In the Temporal Temple, during the 300 years that Jian Wushuang had cultivated with the Temple Master, the Temple Master had instructed him to try to integrate the space-time illusion kill into the life and death instant, at that time, Jian Wushuang had also tried to do the same, but the process was very complicated and extremely difficult, so Jian Wushuang could only study it slowly.","Over the years, he had been studying this unique move. Finally, during the days in the Divine Moon Palace, he had finally combined the spacetime illusion kill with the moment of life and death. Now, when he fought with Da Yu...it was the first time he had truly used this move. He had instantly killed Da Yu, who still had more than 60% of his divine power left.","“The moment of life and death is one of the killing moves in the unparalleled sword scripture that I created. The space-time illusion kill is also an extremely terrifying killing move in the space-time divine skill. With the combination of the two...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were shining.","The space-time divine skill was a supreme divine skill created by the Temporal Temple Master.","This divine skill was mainly used in some auxiliary means. It was a relatively different way of using space-time.","For example, the heaven-designated skill was used to freeze space-time.","The space-time annihilation was a large-scale annihilation method.","The third move, space-time teleportation, was a life-saving divine skill.","Each move was actually a special auxiliary means, but the fourth move was a real killing move, so it was naturally extraordinary.","“Unfortunately, although I have combined the space-time illusion kill with life and death, I am not very familiar with the combination process and have yet to reach the true power. With my current strength, perhaps the experts of the void fourth realm won’t have time to react and their divine bodies will be cut by my sword. But if they are experts of the void fifth realm, they might have a chance to react. Even if they can’t keep up with my speed, they can still try their best to protect themselves,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","He was able to kill Da Yu, who still had more than 60% of her divine power, mainly because she was not very strong. If he encountered an expert of the five void realms, it would not be easy for him to kill her with this move.","But no matter what, Da Yu was already dead.","Then, Jian Wushuang went to look for Da Su.","“Da Su, your sister is dead. You should go with her.” Jian Wushuang smiled, but there was a huge amount of killing intent condensed on his body.","Da Su was much weaker than Da Yu, so there was no room for her to struggle in front of Jian Wushuang.","In just a moment, Da Su was also killed by Jian Wushuang","After killing Da Yu and Da Su, Jian Wushuang left the battlefield and did not fight again.","The war among the Nine-tailed Clan was coming to an end. Most of the experts of the Nine-tailed Clan either surrendered or gave up fighting, as long as a few of them were stubborn, under the siege of the many experts from the Divine Moon Palace Camp, they were directly killed.","Even though their strength had reached the level of Principles Masters, it was very difficult to kill them. However, this was only in a one-on-one situation. However, if they were to face the siege of several experts and seal off space and time, there was no way out...these Principles Masters were naturally easy to kill.","It could be said that the Nine-tailed Clan was now completely under Xiao’er’s control. However, Xiao’er still had the biggest problem that she had yet to solve.","This problem was naturally that Da Ying!","Da Ying, who had already reached the peak of the six states of the void, was also from the Nine-tailed Clan. Even though he had not awakened the Emperor Phoenix bloodline, his bloodline level was only second to the Emperor Phoenix bloodline. His innate advantage and talent were extremely great... in a one-on-one fight, even the Demon Master Chenhuo could not gain the slightest advantage against her. Even though the Demon Master Chenhuo had the help of Axe One Master and Star Saint Master, she could only slightly suppress Da Ying.","However, Da Ying’s combat strength was still extremely abundant. Even though the entire Nine-tailed Clan was now under Xiao’er’s control, she did not. She was still fighting with her life on the line."]},{"number":3474,"title":"Chapter 3474 - Demon Master Chenhuo and Da Ying","paragraphs":["Bang! Bang! Bang!","Deafening booms rang out one after another.","In the void above the Nine-tailed Clan, on the main battlefield, a large area of space collapsed, then reassembled, then collapsed again...","The spatial rifts that spread over hundreds of meters were devouring everything around them like a bloody mouth.","The devouring power generated by such a huge spatial crack was enough to devour ordinary Principles Masters.","The scale of this battle was too large and the power was too shocking. It was not something that ordinary Principles Masters could interfere with.","Those who dared to enter this battlefield were at least at the fifth level of the void, and they only dared to stand at the edge. And in the center of this battlefield, the ones who were fighting were shockingly those super experts who had reached the sixth level of the void.","At this moment, the four of them were working together to crazily attack Da Ying.","Even though Da Ying’s strength was monstrous, facing the four of them working together, he still appeared to be in a rather miserable state.","Hong!","Another shocking rumble sounded, and a huge hole appeared in the sky.","“Nine-tailed Clan leader, at this point, aren’t you going to surrender?” Axe One Master said coldly.","“Surrender? Haha, do you think the few of you are worthy?” Da Ying laughed coldly, at the same time, he waved his hand, and a blood-colored claw mark tore through the void and appeared in front of Axe One Master. Axe One Master immediately waved the huge axe in his hand to block this claw.","“As expected of the Nine-tailed Clan, one of the celestials. You have just reached the peak of the six states of the void not long ago, but with your innate advantage, the battle strength you unleashed is not inferior to mine at all.” Demon Master Chenhuo said calmly.","“Hmph, your strength is also impatient.” Da Ying glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo.","Among the four people surrounding her, Demon Master Chenhuo was the strongest and posed the greatest threat to her.","“I have been staying in a secluded secret realm of heaven and earth for nearly 200 million years. After so many years, it has been a long time since I had a good fight with someone. Today, it is rare for me to meet a powerful opponent like you. I want to have a good fight,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Bring it on.” Da Ying was not afraid at all.","“The three of you, step aside first.” Demon Master Chenhuo glanced at Axe One Master and the other two.","Previously, he was worried that Demon Master Chenhuo would not be able to completely restrict Da Ying alone, allowing Da Ying to go to other battlefields and heavily injure the Divine Moon Palace Camp. But now, the war between the Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan had ended, the entire Nine-tailed Clan was under Xiao’er’s control, leaving only Da Ying alone.","In the face of such a situation, they were not afraid that Da Ying would stir up any more trouble. Since Demon Master Chenhuo wanted to fight Da Ying alone...Axe One Master, Star Saint Master, and Xu Zhu would naturally do as Demon Master Chenhuo wished.","As the three of them retreated, only Demon Master Chenhuo and Da Ying were left on the main battlefield.","“Nine-tailed Clan leader, I’m going to make my move.”","Demon Master Chenhuo was still smiling, but the crimson-gold glove on his hand began to emit a rich golden light.","“Sky God Annihilation!”","Demon Master Chenhuo suddenly roared. He clenched his right hand, and instantly, a brilliant golden light surged up, enveloping the entire world in a golden color and the fist formed by his hand...was like a huge golden sun.","This golden sun was extremely dazzling, illuminating everything in the world. Under the watchful eyes of everyone around, it suddenly attacked Da Ying in front.","Da Ying narrowed her eyes slightly. She looked ahead, and the huge golden sun seemed to want to swallow her whole.","And the terrifying power contained within the golden sun, she could naturally feel it very clearly.","“Hmph!”","With a cold snort, behind Da Ying, a gigantic nine-tailed phantom condensed out of thin air, and dense bloodline power burst out.","Although this bloodline power was not as pure as Xiao’er’s Emperor Phoenix bloodline, it was not weak either.","After the nine-tailed phantom appeared, a sharp whistle suddenly resounded through the void.","Following that, Da Ying extended her palm, and the void in front of her exploded inch by inch.","A scarlet red light suddenly flashed out.","Not only was the speed of this blood light terrifying, but the power it released in an instant was also extremely powerful. In the blink of an eye, it collided head-on with the golden sun.","When the two collided, instantly...boom!","The void shook violently, as if the sky and earth were collapsing. The entire Nine-tailed Clan also began to tremble crazily. The void in the center of the main battlefield had completely disappeared. What replaced it was a huge, boundless space black hole. This space black hole covered the entire battlefield, and a large amount of spatial turbulence was surging crazily, it gave people a suffocating pressure.","When the spectators outside the battlefield, including many Principles Masters on the battlefield, saw this scene, they could not help but gasp and light up.","In the middle of the battlefield, after the two forces collided, both the Demon Master Chenhuo and Da Ying were pushed back at the same time. Both of them were pushed back a great distance by the powerful rebound force, and it was with great difficulty that they managed to regain their balance.","“Amazing!”","After the Demon Master Chenhuo regained his balance, his eyes emitted a bright light, and he let out a loud laugh.","“You’re also very strong. I think that after I broke through and got out of the Divine Beginning Realm, other than Saint Realm Masters, there shouldn’t be anyone else who could be my match. I didn’t expect that I would meet you...in terms of cultivation base and the purity of power, you might be stronger than me. If it weren’t for the innate advantage of the Nine-tailed Clan, I might not be your match,” Da Ying added.","“Haha, that’s what makes it interesting.” Demon Master Chenhuo continued to laugh. “To be able to take my divine extinguisher head-on without being at a disadvantage, you are also qualified to take my strongest move.”","“Strongest move?” Da Ying’s pupils constricted.","Jian Wushuang, who was watching the battle from outside the battlefield, as well as several experts from the Blood Marten Clan, all understood.","Demon Master Chenhuo’s technique was extremely powerful. In terms of his ultimate move, although the divine extinguisher he had just used was extremely powerful and had almost destroyed the Blood Marten Clan’s clan-protecting array with one move, it was not his strongest move.","His strongest move was Dragon God Destruction!","“It seems that Chenhuo is going to use Dragon God destruction. I’ve never seen this move before. I wonder how powerful it will be.” Jian Wushuang was also looking forward to it.","Everyone around the battlefield was also looking at Demon Master Chenhuo.","At this moment, Demon Master Chenhuo’s aura was extremely calm, but under this calmness, a shocking power slowly rose."]},{"number":3475,"title":"Chapter 3475 - Dragon God Annihilation","paragraphs":["Boom!","The void trembled, and a surging golden airwave suddenly swept out from the surroundings of Demon Master Chenhuo. This golden airwave directly retreated into the surrounding void, and at this moment, the power and aura that had gathered on Demon Master Chenhuo’s body...had also directly reached the peak!","“Dragon God Annihilation!”","The Demon Master Chenhuo slowly spoke, and his right hand slowly clenched into a fist. All the power gathered into this fist.","Then, it directly blasted out.","In an instant, golden light exploded, filling the entire world.","Another huge golden sun appeared in this world.","At a glance, this golden sun was no different from the golden sun formed when the Demon Master Chenhuo used the God Annihilation. However, there were so many experts present, and they could see the difference between these two golden suns with a glance.","If the golden sun formed when the God Annihilation was used earlier was to devour and annihilate everything.","However, the golden sun at this moment carried an unprecedented wild and violent strength. This wild and violent strength was as though the golden sun would explode at any moment.","The Dragon God Annihilation contained this explosive strength.","“This punch!”","Da Ying’s eyes shrunk when she saw the golden sun in front of her.","She was confident that she could block the golden sun earlier. However, the explosive force contained within the golden sun caused her heart to tremble.","“Humph!”","A cold snort sounded. Da Ying also attacked.","The huge nine-tailed phantom was completely solidified at this moment. Following a sharp screech, the entire nine-tailed phantom stood up. Meanwhile, Da Ying’s face was also flushed red and was nearly distorted, her body was also filled with power.","“Break!”","With a low shout, a huge blood-red stream of light descended from the sky and slashed toward the golden sun like a blade.","Hua!","The moment the blood-red stream of light touched the golden sun, it instantly shot into the golden sun. However, it was unable to completely split the golden sun apart. It was only trapped within...the power contained within the flowing light was madly annihilating everything within the golden","as","sun.","In the blink of an eye, more than half of the power within the golden sun had been annihilated by the blood-colored flowing light. However, the remaining power was still sweeping over.","As the golden sun appeared in front of Da Ying...boom!","The golden sun directly exploded.","The terrifying impact force formed by the explosion momentarily overshadowed the heavens and earth. The terrifying airwaves formed wave after wave of impact waves that spread out like rotten wood.","Da Ying, who was at the center of the battlefield, was naturally the first to receive the impact of the explosion. His entire body was also annihilated by the earth-shaking power.","Rumble!","Heaven and earth shook. This terrifying power continued for a long time before it slowly dissipated.","When the power completely dissipated and the main battlefield was once again revealed, everyone immediately cast their gazes inside.","In the center of the battlefield, Demon Master Chenhuo was still standing there. Even though she had used up a lot of divine power and her aura was weaker than before, her overall combat power was still not affected much.","As for Da Ying...at this moment, her figure was in a bit of a sorry state. The robe on her body was obviously the transformation of a supreme treasure armor, but it was still torn, revealing her snow-white skin, at the same time, there was a trace of blood at the corner of her mouth. As for the aura on her body, it was clearly weaker than before.","“Taking a direct hit from my Dragon God Annihilation, it was only a light injury, and the godly power consumed was probably only about 20%. Nine-tailed Clan leader is indeed impressive,” Demon Master Chenhuo looked at Da Ying and said calmly.","“I have just broken through to the pinnacle of the sixth level of the void space not long ago, and I have not had the time to perfect my absolute art, nor have I created the strongest absolute art. In this aspect, I am inferior to you,” Da Ying said in a deep voice as she stared at Demon Master Chenhuo.","Absolute arts were also a huge factor in the overall strength of the cultivator.","Regardless of whether it was the Immortal Saint or the Principles Master, once they reached a certain level, they would think of ways to create a certain level of absolute arts.","Take the Principles Master for example. His absolute arts were also divided into many levels, from the most basic level one, level two, level three absolute arts to level six absolute arts.","Under normal circumstances, when a Principles Master reached the level of the six states of the void, he would create a level six absolute art. If his strength reached the peak level of the six states of the void, he would naturally be able to create a level six pinnacle absolute art. However...a level six pinnacle absolute art was not the highest level absolute art among the Principles Masters.","Above the level six pinnacle absolute art, there was another strongest absolute art!","This strongest absolute art could only be created by cultivators who had reached the pinnacle of the six states of the void. However, if some of the more talented peak tier experts of the six states of the void were to spend time, they would also have the opportunity to create it.","For example, the Dragon God Annihilation of the Demon Master Chenhuo was created by him during his long time in the secret realm of heaven and earth. It was the strongest absolute art at the Principles Masters.","However, although Da Ying was weaker than you, Demon Master Chenhuo, in terms of cultivation, the absolute art she created was still at the peak level of level six, which was quite different from the Demon Master Chenhuo’s strongest absolute art, there was indeed a big gap between them.","“Nine-tailed Clan leader, in terms of absolute art, you are still slightly weaker than me. If you continue to fight, you will lose without a doubt. Moreover, you are now alone, and I have the help of three experts of the six states of void. You have already lost this battle!” Demon Master Chenhuo’s voice was cold, “You are very strong. We can’t keep you here, but it’s impossible for you to turn the situation around by yourself. So, you should leave.”","Demon Master Chenhuo, Jian Wushuang, and Xiao’er knew that they could not keep Da Ying here with their current abilities, so they had to beat him back, or let him leave on his own.","But how could Da Ying be satisfied?","“Leave?” Da Ying smiled coldly. “Haha, it’s ridiculous. I’m the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan. How could I abandon the clan and leave it to this rebel who came out of nowhere?”","“The clan leader is unwilling to leave on his own. It seems that he wants to suffer.” Demon Master Chenhuo’s eyes turned cold.","Axe One Master, Star Saint Master, and Xu Lord also rushed over. It was obvious that the four of them were planning to attack Da Ying once again.","Seeing this scene, Da Ying’s expression turned ugly. However, he let out a strange laugh, “Hehe, you have the advantage in numbers. It’s true that I can’t fight against you all by myself. However, if you want me to leave just like that, you are underestimating me too much!”","“I can leave, but before I leave, I’ll make you pay the price!”"]},{"number":3476,"title":"Chapter 3476 - The Clan-Guarding Treasure","paragraphs":["“Pay the price?”","Everyone looked at Da Ying, who was clearly in a frenzy, with a strange expression.","In the eyes of the experts present, the outcome of today’s battle was already decided. Although Da Ying’s strength was formidable, she was still facing the even stronger Demon Master Chenhuo and the other three Principles Masters who had reached the sixth level of the void, in such a situation, what waves could she stir up?","“Could it be...” Xiao’er’s expression suddenly changed. Back then, she had almost inherited the position of the Nine-tailed Clan’s Grandmaster. She knew many secrets of the Nine-tailed Clan, and looking at Da Ying’s current appearance...Xiao’er immediately thought of something.","And Da Ying’s next action immediately confirmed Xiao’er’s guess.","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, Da Ying flipped his palm and took out a mysterious black pearl.","The black pearl was completely black and surrounded by a faint black air current. The black air current surrounded the early pearl and completely blocked the soul power of the experts present, every time someone tried to use soul power to check the black pearl, they would immediately feel their soul power disappear into thin air, as if it was directly swallowed by the pearl.","“What a strange pearl.” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“Soul-devouring pearl, it really is a soul-devouring pearl!” Xiao’er became nervous. “Quick, retreat!”","Xiao’er shouted at the first moment. After hearing the shout, Lord Xu immediately obeyed Xiao’er’s order and retreated.","Axe One Master and Star Saint Master looked at each other in dismay. They did not know what the black pearl was, but they could tell that it was extraordinary. Therefore, they did not hesitate and retreated at the first moment.","Only the Demon Master Chenhuo was confident in his own strength. Even when he saw Da Ying take out the black pearl and heard Xiao’er’s stern cry, he did not have the slightest intention of retreating.","“Go to hell!”","Da Ying revealed a sinister laugh. She pushed the black pearl forward. Instantly, an extremely terrifying soul power burst out from the black pearl. This soul power...she transformed into a black devil and instantly appeared in front of the Demon Master Chenhuo, and covered him completely.","Then, endless soul power crazily rushed into the Demon Master Chenhuo’s divine body.","“Hmph!”","The Demon Master Chenhuo let out a low snort, and his expression immediately changed drastically.","“This...”","Axe One Master, Star Saint Master, and the others, who had already retreated and were not covered by the soul power from the black pearl, revealed shocked expressions when they saw this scene.","The experts watching the battle were also shocked.","“Demon Master Chenhuo, we’re in big trouble!” Xiao’er said.","“Miss Xiao’er, what’s going on? What’s the pearl that Da Ying took out?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was low, and his face was very ugly. Demon Master Chenhuo had been following him and acting as his guard all these years.","But on the surface, he was a guard. In fact, he and Demon Master Chenhuo had long become good friends. Now that he saw that Demon Master Chenhuo was in danger, Jian Wushuang was naturally extremely nervous.","“That pearl is the Soul Devouring Pearl. It can be said to be the clan-guarding true treasure of the Nine-tailed Clan. It’s also the strongest trump card!” Xiao’er said.","“Clan-guarding true treasure? The strongest trump card?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“The Soul Devouring Pearl was obtained by the ancestors of the Nine-tailed Clan from the Universe Battlefield. It doesn’t have any terrifying power, but it has the ability to devour soul power. In other words, no matter how much soul power you have, as long as you touch the pearl, you will be completely devoured!”","“And after the soul energy is devoured by the pearl, it doesn’t disappear. Instead, it still exists inside the pearl. At this time, if the owner of the pearl guides it, the soul energy inside the pearl can instantly burst out and form the most terrifying soul attack!” Xiao’er said seriously.","“The ancestors of the Nine-tailed Clan knew the miraculous use of this pearl after they obtained the Soul Devouring Pearl. Therefore, the Nine-tailed Clan has always treated this pearl as their clan’s supreme treasure. Over the long period of time, the Soul Devouring Pearl has been handed over to every clan leader. And every clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan will try their best to feed the Soul Devouring Pearl with soul energy during their reign!”","“There’s even a place in the Nine-tailed Clan where the Soul Devouring Pearl is dedicated to the cultivation of the soul power of the members of the Nine-tailed Clan. The Soul Devouring Pearl is always there. The members of the Nine-tailed Clan would consume their soul power when they cultivate their soul power or some soul attack methods. However, the soul power that was consumed didn’t disappear. Instead, it was devoured by the Soul Devouring Pearl!”","“After being passed down from generation to generation, the soul power that was devoured by the Soul Devouring Pearl would naturally become more and more terrifying. In fact, it had long reached an unbelievable level. Once such a terrifying soul power was instantly released under the guidance of the controller, the soul impact formed by it would be unbelievably powerful!”","Jer V","“That’s why the Soul Devouring Pearl is the strongest trump card of the Nine-tailed Clan. If the soul power in the Soul Devouring Pearl were to burst out, the soul attack formed in an instant could even kill a Saint Realm Master!”","“What did you say?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically.","Once the Soul Devouring Pearl burst out, the soul attack formed could even kill a Saint Realm Master?","But now, the soul attack that burst out of the Soul Devouring Pearl was on the body of the Demon Master.","How could the Demon Master block it?","“Damn it!” Jian Wushuang could not help cursing secretly, and he also complained to Xiao’er.","He did not expect that Da Ying would have such a terrifying killing move, and Xiao’er did not warn him before.","As if seeing Jian Wushuang’s slight complaint, Xiao’er hurriedly said, “Jian Wushuang, the existence of the Soul Devouring Pearl is one of the greatest secrets of the Nine-tailed Clan. Only the Grandmaster has the right to know and control it. Although I was very close to becoming the Grandmaster, I have not really become the Grandmaster. Therefore, I have only heard a little about the Soul Devouring Pearl, but I am not sure if it really exists.”","“It’s too late for that now. Let’s think of a way to help Chenhuo escape!” Jian Wushuang snorted.","“Once the Soul Devouring Pearl is guided, the soul power that burst out in an instant can not be stopped. However, perhaps because of Da Ying’s limited ability, she did not guide all of the soul power in the Soul Devouring Pearl to burst out. Therefore, with the strength of Demon Master Chenhuo, she might have a chance to survive,” Xiao’er said.","The Soul Devouring Pearl had devoured the soul power that the Nine-tailed Clan had accumulated for countless years. If it were to burst out completely, it could even kill a Saint Realm Master. However, it would not be easy to draw out such a huge amount of soul power, of course, it would not be easy."]},{"number":3477,"title":"Chapter 3477 - Chenhuo, Danger!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3477 Chenhuo, Danger!","Like the soul power that Da Ying had guided out of the Soul Devouring Pearl, although it was also extremely powerful, it was obviously not enough to kill a Saint Realm Master.","However, if he could not kill a Saint Realm Master, he could still kill experts at the peak of the six realms of the void, or even the peak of the six realms of the void.","Buzz, buzz, buzz. Endless soul power rushed into Demon Master’s divine body like a raging wave, crazily destroying his soul.","Demon Master had already closed his eyes and put all his energy into resisting the soul power. His face was extremely gloomy and unsightly.","As time passed, the soul power around Demon Master slowly dissipated, but at the same time, his aura began to weaken.","“His aura is weakening too fast!” Jian Wushuang frowned, his heart filled with worry.","Finally, the soul power that Da Ying had guided from the Soul Devouring Pearl was completely exhausted, but at this moment, Demon Master Chenhuo’s aura had reached the bottom and gradually disappeared..","“The aura of sinking fire...I can’t sense it?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed drastically.","Although the Demon Master’s ability to conceal his aura was amazing, he usually concealed his cultivation and still had his life aura. But now, not only Jian Wushuang, but everyone present...I can barely feel the presence of Chenhuo.","“Demon Master Chenhuo, died?” Many people in the mind all came up with this idea.","“Even if she didn’t channel all of it and only channeled part of her soul power, she still couldn’t make it?” Xiao’er’s expression was also very ugly. After all, Demon Master Chenhuo was an expert in her camp, moreover, she was Jian Wushuang’s person. If she died in this battle because she had not told Jian Wushuang about the existence of the Soul Devouring Pearl, which made Demon Master Chenhuo wary...then her alliance with Jian Wushuang would probably collapse.","They might even turn against each other.","At this moment, the happiest person on the field was naturally Da Ying.","“Haha, dead, dead!”","“Good!”","Da Ying laughed with madness, “So what if you’re stronger than me? You still died at my hands, including Divine Moon Palace’s and Heavenly Sword Marquis’. You think you can make my Nine-tailed Clan submit to you without paying a price? Dream on!”","“Da Ying!” Xiao’er stared at Da Ying with a cold gaze.","“Tsk, tsk. He’s an expert at the peak of the six void realms. In the entire Divine Beginning Realm, I’m afraid no one is his match except for experts at the saint realm or above the ruler level. However, he thinks too highly of himself and underestimates the means of the Nine-tailed Clan.” Da Ying smiled to himself, he completely ignored Jian Wushuang’s cold and piercing eyes.","However, just when Da Ying thought that Demon Master Chenhuo had died, he was overwhelmed with joy.","Demon Master Chenhuo, who was still standing in the void with his eyes tightly shut, suddenly opened his eyes.","The moment he opened his eyes, his aura, which had almost disappeared, suddenly rose at an incredible speed. In just a moment, it had reached its peak, but it continued to rise, in the end, it reached a whole new level.","At the same time, a wild laughter suddenly sounded in the world. “Haha, it’s a blessing in disguise. It’s really a blessing in disguise!”","In the void, everyone’s eyes instantly locked on Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Chenhuo!” Jian Wushuang was overjoyed.","“He’s not dead?” The eyes of Axe One Master, Star Saint Master, and the others lit up.","“It’s good that he’s not dead.” Xiao’er heaved a sigh of relief.","On the other hand, Da Ying’s face instantly darkened.","“How is that possible?!”","“Your aura just now was clearly about to dissipate. How is it possible that he’s not dead?”","“Moreover, even though I didn’t guide out all the soul power in the Soul Devouring Pearl just now and only guided a portion of it, this portion should be enough to kill anyone below the Saint Realm Master Realm. How can you withstand it? How is it possible that you’re still alive?”","Da Ying’s face was filled with disbelief, and her voice was completely deranged.","Upon hearing this, the Demon Master Chenhuo smiled, “Nine-tailed Clan leader, the soul attack contained in the pearl You took out is indeed very terrifying, and it’s definitely the most terrifying soul attack I’ve ever encountered. If my soul, or rather, my state of mind, was slightly less tenacious, I’m afraid I would have died in that move of yours. Unfortunately, I’ve been alone in a secret realm of heaven and earth for nearly 200 million years!”","“For the past 200 million years, I have endured endless boredom and loneliness. My mind and soul have also undergone a transformation in the past 200 million years. They have become indestructible and unshakable. This move of yours will never be able to kill me!”","Upon hearing the words of Demon Master Chenhuo, Jian Wushuang suddenly understood.","Indeed, in order to resist a soul attack, the most important thing was the toughness of one’s soul, in addition to one’s strong soul battle strength!","And this toughness of the soul was achieved through endless training.","As for the Demon Master, he did not train his soul through a lot of life-and-death experiences. He had improved his entire soul to a new level during the nearly 200 million years in the secret realm of heaven and earth.","Who could stay in the Heaven and Earth Secret Realm alone for nearly 200 million years without going crazy?","Demon Master Chenhuo had done it. His soul was unprecedentedly tough, so he naturally blocked the soul attack just now.","“Impossible, impossible!”","“Your life aura just now has obviously disappeared. How could you recover?” Da Ying was still unwilling to believe it.","“Haha, I have to thank you for that.” Demon Master Chenhuo smiled. “Nine-tailed Clan leader, I really have to thank you. Thank you for that killing move. If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have made the breakthrough so quickly!”","“Breakthrough?”","Everyone was stunned when they heard this word.","“Could it be...” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with a fierce light as he looked at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Nine-tailed Clan leader, you may not know this, but when I was still trapped in the secret realm of Heaven and Earth, I had already reached the peak of the six void realms. I was only one step away from the peak of the six void realms, and it was a very small step. However, this step was always difficult to cross!”","“After I left the secret realm of heaven and Earth, I followed Heavenly Sword Marquis everywhere. In addition to this agreement between me and him, I also hoped to meet more experts with him and have more opportunities to fight with top experts!”","“As expected, I met you!” Demon Master Chenhuo smiled."]},{"number":3478,"title":"Chapter 3478 - Da Ying Was Defeated","paragraphs":["“Nine-tailed Clan leader, I have to say that your killing move just now was indeed extremely terrifying. When that massive soul force charged toward me, even I almost died. However, it was precisely because of this move that I felt the existence of death. It was also precisely because of this life and death crisis that stimulated my potential, allowing me to finally grasp the fourth law and take that small step.”","“That’s why I have to thank you, Nine-tailed Clan leader.” Demon Master Chenhuo laughed loudly.","His laughter was very carefree. It was obvious that he was pleasantly surprised by this breakthrough between life and death.","“How is this possible?”","“This move of mine was meant to kill you. How can it help you?”","“Also, you have already lived for so long and have reached the peak of the sixth level of the void. Logically speaking, your potential should have been used up long ago. How can you still breakthrough between life and death?”","Da Ying was still in disbelief.","The surrounding experts also found it hard to accept.","Jian Wushuang was the only one who could understand.","“Chenhuo was publicly recognized as a genius elder before the Purple Star Demon Sect was destroyed. His talent is very shocking, and his potential is extremely great. If he cultivated normally, he would have had a chance to become a ruler. It’s just that after the Purple Star Demon Sect was destroyed, Chenhuo was trapped in the secret realm of heaven and earth and could not gain any experience.”","“But even without any experience, he still managed to raise his strength to the peak of the six void realms, just one step away from the peak. Such talent...”","Jian Wushuang knew very well that perhaps it was because of the innate terminated meridians that Demon Master Chenhuo was so talented!","Previously, his cultivation had stagnated because he had been trapped in the secret realm of heaven and earth. However, that did not mean that Chenhuo’s potential had been exhausted.","Now, he had come out of the secret realm of heaven and Earth with Jian Wushuang and reentered the Divine Beginning Realm. In this fight with Da Ying, Da Ying had used his final killing move, it could be said that he had experienced a life-and-death crisis that he had not experienced in the past 200 million years.","As the saying went, “When one accumulates strength, one will gain strength.” Demon Master had accumulated too much. Now that he had experienced the life-and-death crisis that he had not experienced for a long time, it was natural for him to make a breakthrough.","“Chenhuo, congratulations on taking this step. You should be invincible below the master of the Saint Realm. Are you sure you can kill Da Ying?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo. “Yes,” he said.","“Kill her?” Demon Master Chenhuo narrowed his eyes. “My strength has improved a lot, but I don’t know if I can really kill her.”","“Then let’s try it. I’ll help you.” Jian Wushuang smiled and waved his hand. Instantly, the power of Temporal Principles spread out, in an instant, the entire Nine-tailed Clan was covered.","The space-time shackles, together with the space-time shackles, immediately affected Da","Ying.","“Humph, it’s just a small trick.” Da Ying snorted. His body shook slightly, and the space-time shackles were instantly broken.","However, Demon Master Chenhuo had already made his move.","Bang!","The void rumbled as Demon Master Chenhuo’s body swayed in a strange manner. With this sway, Demon Master Chenhuo appeared in front of Da Ying as though he had teleported. “So fast!”","Da Ying’s expression changed drastically.","When she fought with Demon Master Chenhuo previously, the latter’s speed was extremely fast. However, it was not that fast.","But now, the Demon Master’s speed was so fast that she could not even see him clearly.","After his figure appeared, the Demon Master formed a fist with his right hand and blasted out.","In an instant, the world seemed to be on the verge of completely collapsing.","The gigantic golden sun appeared in the void once again. However, the size of the golden sun was now a full circle larger than before, and the power it contained was naturally much greater than before.","The golden sun brought with it an earth-shattering might as it directly covered Da Ying","When she felt the power contained within the golden sun, Da Ying’s heart twitched a little. However, she was not satisfied with her reaction, and she immediately used all her strength to resist.","A blood-colored stream of light descended from the sky like a blood-colored bolt of lightning. It directly hacked toward the golden sun, wanting to split it apart.","But in the end...","Pa!","The blood-red light struck the golden sun, producing a crisp sound. The power of the golden sun was greatly weakened, but it was only weakened. The blood-red light was destroyed by the golden sun...then, it continued to attack Da Ying.","“Not good!”","Da Ying’s expression changed. He wanted to dodge, but it was too late. His body was covered by the huge golden sun.","Then, endless power erupted from the golden","sun.","Rumble...","The surrounding void was shaking crazily. One terrifying power after another formed a shocking airwave that swept out crazily.","The countless experts watching the battle could not help but suck in a breath of cold air when they saw the terrifying scene in the center of the battlefield.","And this shocking power only lasted for a moment before gradually dissipating.","ove","When everything dissipated, everyone looked over again and discovered that Da Ying’s current figure was abnormally wretched even though she was still standing there. The clothes on her body were also stained with blood, especially her aura...it had already been greatly weakened, and her divine power had already been consumed by more than 30% in that instant!","“I’ve lost 30% of my divine power in one move. The Principles Master, who is at the pinnacle of the six realms of the void and has mastered seven levels of willpower, is indeed terrifying. I’ll show you.” Da Ying took a deep look at the Demon Master Chenhuo, then he immediately transformed into a strange cyan phantom and rushed toward the void behind him.","“You want to escape?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. He immediately used the space-time binding to try to limit Da Ying’s speed.","However, Da Ying was an expert at the peak of the sixth realm of the void. Although he had lost a lot of divine power, his battle strength was still there. Jian Wushuang used the golden sky painting flag to use the space-time binding at full strength, it might have an effect on an expert at the peak of the fifth realm of the void, or even an ordinary expert at the sixth realm of the void, but it was of little use to Da Ying.","Under everyone’s gaze, Da Ying burst out with terrifying speed and fled. In the blink of an eye, he had disappeared from everyone’s sight.","Meanwhile, the Demon Master Chenhuo moved. At first, he wanted to chase after Da Ying, but he obviously hesitated for a moment before stopping in the end.","There was nothing he could do. Even though his current strength had completely surpassed Da Ying’s, if Da Ying wanted to escape, it would be very difficult for him to stay."]},{"number":3479,"title":"Chapter 3479 - It Was Possible","paragraphs":["It was best that Da Ying did not stay completely, and she did not die...an expert who had reached the peak of the six states of the void was a great threat to the Divine Moon Palace and Xiao’er who had regained control of the Nine-tailed Clan.","However, this was within her expectations. When Xiao’er decided to attack the Nine-tailed Clan, she already knew that it was impossible for her side to kill Da Ying. They could only force Da Ying back. This could not be helped. As for Da Ying’s threat... she could only think of a way to deal with it in the future.","In any case, the Nine-tailed Clan was now completely under Xiao’er’s control.","Whoosh!","In a flash, Demon Master Chenhuo had returned to Jian Wushuang’s side.","“Chenhuo, congratulations on reaching the pinnacle of Principles Master. The next step should be to advance to the ruler level?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo with a faint smile.","“I was lucky enough to take this step. As for the ruler level...how could it be so easy?” Chenhuo shook his head with a smile.","The word ‘ruler level’ was too important.","It had been many years since the creation of the Divine Beginning Realm. However, after such a long time, there were very few ruler-level experts in the Divine Beginning Realm. Every one of them was extremely talented, furthermore, they had gone through endless experiences and had definitely obtained great opportunities before they became rulers.","As for the Demon Master Chenhuo, if nothing had happened to the Purple Star Demon Sect, he would not have stayed in the heaven and earth secret realm for nearly 200 million years. Instead, he would have stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm or had been training in various places in the Universe Battlefield, then, he might still have some confidence in reaching the ruler realm, but now...","He was talented, but he had wasted nearly 200 million years in the secret realm of heaven and earth, which had a great impact on him. Although he still had hope of becoming a ruler in the future, the hope was not great, whether he could break through to become a ruler in the future depended on luck.","“I’m not in a hurry to become a ruler. You, on the other hand, should think of a way to break through to become a Principles Master. If you can’t even break through to become a Principles Master, how can you reach an agreement with me?” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Principles Master...” Jian Wushuang touched his nose.","In fact, in terms of combat strength, he was now considered very strong among the Principles Masters of the five void realms.","However, he was still an Immortal Saint. He did not even have the slightest sign of breaking through, let alone becoming a Principles Master.","“I have a feeling that I’m still quite far from becoming a Principles Master. At the very least, I have to completely master the destruction principles and even completely merge the destruction principles with the space-time and reincarnation principles in order to have a chance of breaking through,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","After chatting with Demon Master Chenhuo for a while, Xiao’er, Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master walked over.","“Demon Master Chenhuo, congratulations on stepping into the pinnacle of Principles Master!” Xiao’er said first.","“As far as I know, only Elder Dark Bone has reached the pinnacle of Principles Master in the Divine Beginning Realm. Now, Brother Chenhuo has also reached it,” Axe One Master said.","“Only after reaching this step can one truly walk unhindered in the Divine Beginning Realm. Even a Saint Realm Master would not be able to kill a Principles Masters who has reached the pinnacle,” said Marquis Duan Yu.","“Everyone is too polite.” Demon Master Chenhuo only smiled faintly. Although he was pleasantly surprised by his breakthrough just now, he had calmed down now.","After all, although it was important for him to take this step, it was still not enough for him to take revenge. After all, the one who destroyed the Purple Star Demon Sect was the Flame Saint Realm, one of the three Saint Realms, now, he still had to rely on Jian Wushuang","“Miss Xiao’er, is there any trouble in the Nine-tailed Clan?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Xiao’er.","Xiao’er smiled faintly, she said, “Because of my identity, many clansmen of the Nine-tailed Clan have already sided with me in their hearts. Even the stubborn ones have almost died in the battle just now, and most of the remaining ones are willing to submit. Even if there are a few stubborn people hiding in there, it doesn’t matter to the overall situation.”","“Besides Da Ying, doesn’t the Nine-tailed Clan have a second expert in the sixth realm of the void?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes, but this person is not on the same side as Da Ying. When the war broke out, I had planned to ask Lord Xu to keep her busy. I didn’t expect that she had no intention to fight back. She has been standing there without putting up any resistance. Now she is willing to submit to me. With her help and the absolute strength of my Divine Moon Palace, nothing will happen to the Nine-tailed Clan,” Xiao’er said.","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. “If you regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan, the power in your hands will reach a whole new level. Don’t forget your previous agreement with me.”","“Don’t worry. After the Nine-tailed Clan has calmed down, I will help you to deal with the Blood Clan,” Xiao’er said, “however, there is another problem in the Nine-tailed Clan. Da Ying is, after all, an expert at the peak of the sixth realm of the void. Although she has been defeated, she will not be satisfied. She will definitely find a way to regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan. With such a big hidden danger, I always feel that there is a thorn in my heart.”","“Why? Do you want to completely remove this thorn?” Jian Wushuang looked at Xiao’er.","“Of course, but this thorn is too powerful. How can it be so easy to remove?” Xiao’er said helplessly.","“In fact, Miss Xiao’er, if you really want to kill Da Ying, there is a way.” A voice suddenly sounded. It was Marquis Duan Yu.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang and Xiao’er looked at Marquis Duan Yu in unison.","“Marquis Duan Yu, do you have a way to kill Da Ying?” Xiao’er looked at Marquis Duan Yu with a glimmer of light in her eyes.","Marquis Duan Yu smiled, he said, “Da Ying is indeed very strong. It’s very difficult to kill her with normal means. Even with an expert at the pinnacle of the Principles Master Realm like Demon Master Chenhuo, Da Ying can still escape even if she can’t defeat him!”","“Therefore, it has been said in the Divine Beginning Realm that only a Saint Realm Master or a master level expert can kill an expert at the pinnacle of the six states of the void. But in fact, it’s not the case!”","“Marquis Duan Yu, do you really have a way to kill an expert at the pinnacle of the six states of the void?” Jian Wushuang was also interested.","After all, the Blood Clan leader that he wanted to kill had the same cultivation. Previously, he had been worried about how to kill him.","Now, if Marquis Duan Yu had a way to kill Da Ying, he naturally had a way to kill the Blood Clan leader."]},{"number":3480,"title":"Chapter 3480 - Netherjade Five Kill Array","paragraphs":["“It’s not impossible to kill the strongest expert of the six states of the void.” Marquis Duan Yu smiled faintly. “To put it bluntly, the reason why it’s so difficult to kill the strongest expert of the six states of the void is because such an expert doesn’t wait for his own strength to be tyrannical, and his life-saving ability is also extremely strong!”","“If we really compare strength, Da Ying is obviously weaker than Demon Master Chenhuo. But if Da Ying wants to escape, Demon Master Chenhuo can’t do anything about it. In that case, we just have to find a way to prevent Da Ying from escaping.”","“No way to escape?” Jian Wushuang and the others were surprised.","“That’s easy to say, but how can we prevent an expert at the peak of the six states of the void from escaping? How can an ordinary array block an expert like Da Ying?” Xiao’er said.","W","“Of course not, but what if it’s a high-level special array from the Universe Battlefield?” Marquis Duan Yu smiled. “I may not know about other special arrays in the Universe Battlefield, but I know of one that can trap an expert at the peak of the sixth realm of the void.”","“What kind of formation?” Jian Wushuang and Xiao’er immediately looked over.","“The Netherjade Five Kill-kill formation!” Marquis Duan Yu said, “This formation is a high-level killing move and is used to kill enemies. However, its trapping ability is also very good. After all, if you want to kill someone, you must first keep him alive!”","“And this formation requires five cultivators of the same realm to control it at the same time. The power of the formation is also determined by these five people. If you want to use this formation to trap and kill experts at the peak of the sixth realm of the void, then you must let five experts at the sixth realm of the void control it!”","“Five experts who have reached the sixth level of the void?” Xiao’er’s expression changed. “I have a beard master under my command, and the sixth level of the void that the Nine-tailed Clan has now also submitted to me. There are two sixth level of the void here, and if we include Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master, there are exactly five of them, and their realms are all the same!”","“Miss Xiao’er, the three of us have come to help you under the orders of the palace master. However, the palace master only said that he would help you regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan. He did not say that the three of us would help you kill Da Ying.” Marquis Duan Yu smiled and said, “As for me telling you about this Netherjade Five Killing array now, I am only telling you a method to kill Da Ying. He did not say that the three of us would personally help you.”","“Yes, the three of us have helped you regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan and completed our mission. As for the rest of the matter, we don’t intend to interfere,” Axe One Master said with a smile.","“But the method I mentioned is indeed feasible,” Marquis Duan Yu continued, “As long as the five experts of the six void realms work together to cast the Netherjade Five Kill Magic Formation, we can guarantee that Da Ying will not be able to escape from the magic formation. Then, as long as Demon Master Chenhuo acts personally, together with the magic formation, we can definitely kill Da Ying in the magic formation!”","Jian Wushuang nodded secretly.","Indeed, as long as Da Ying was trapped in the magic formation and could not escape, Demon Master Chenhuo would definitely crush her with her strength. It was not impossible to kill her. At most, it would take some strength and effort.","“Marquis Duan Yu, your method is feasible, but if the three of you don’t take action, where can I find the other three experts of the six void realms to set up the Netherjade Five Kill Magic Formation?” Xiao’er rolled her eyes at Marquis Duan Yu. “How about I ask your Palace master again?”","“Miss Xiao’er, before we left, Palace Master had already gone into closed-door cultivation. Even if you send a message to him now, I’m afraid you won’t get any reply from him.” Marquis Duan Yu smiled. “But if Miss Xiao’er really wants the three of us to help, it’s actually not impossible. But it depends on your opinion.”","“Me?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“My lord, I’ve said before that the palace master has instructed us to help you with anything after we understand the Nine-tailed Clan. In fact, if you need our help, we are just following your orders.”","“My lord, if you need our help, we won’t refuse. Of course, that includes killing Da Ying for Miss Xiao’er.”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","“That is to say, as long as Jian Wushuang agrees, you three will help me.” Xiao’er was also surprised.","“Of course, from now on, the three of us will listen to you until Palace Master gives us another order,” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“That’s great. Marquis Duan Yu, Axe One Master and Star Saint Master, I’m in an alliance with Miss Xiao’er. We’re on the same side. Da Ying is a great threat to miss Xiao’er’s Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan. If we can get rid of this threat, we’ll get rid of it as soon as possible,” Jian Wushuang said.","“We understand what you mean. In that case, I’ll teach Lord Xu and the other Principles Master of the six void realms of the Nine-tailed Clan about the five-killing formation. From today on, the five of us will practice the formation together and try to control it as soon as possible,” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“Thank you, Marquis Duan Yu,” Jian Wushuang said.","“But the problem now is that even if we have completely mastered the five-killing formation, we still don’t know the exact location of Da Ying. I’m afraid it won’t be easy to find her and kill her,” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“That’s a problem, but it doesn’t matter,” Xiao’er said, “as long as we master the formation and have the ability to kill Da Ying, the rest will be easy.”","“After all, this Da Ying has been chased out of the Nine-tailed Clan by us. She will definitely be unwilling, and there will definitely be waves in the future. Moreover, she will be quite confident in her own strength. She won’t think that we have the ability to kill her, so she won’t be too low-key in her actions. With our Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan’s intelligence abilities, as long as she dares to show her face, we will be able to immediately find her existence. Therefore, the most urgent matter now is to master the Netherjade Five Kill array formation as quickly as possible.”","“In that case, I’ll ask Miss Xiao’er to make a space in the Nine-tailed Clan so that we can focus on practicing the Netherjade Five Kill array,” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“No problem. I’ll make the arrangements now.” Xiao’er nodded.","The Nine-tailed Clan had completely calmed down.","After Xiao’er took control of the Nine-tailed Clan, she immediately arranged a place for Marquis Duan Yu and the others to practice the Netherjade Five Kill array."]},{"number":3481,"title":"Chapter 3481 - Tricky","paragraphs":["After Xiao’er regained control of the Nine-tailed Clan, Jian Wushuang stayed in the clan.","During this period, Marquis Duan Yu, Axe One Master, Star Saint Master, Master Xu, and Master Shadow Fox, the Master of the rules of the six void realms, had been practicing the five-killing formation of the nether jade, since the formation was prepared to deal with Da Ying, and it was difficult to guarantee that there were still loyal Da Ying members in the Nine-tailed Clan, the place where they practiced the formation was completely isolated, except for a few people, no one could enter.","Naturally, no one knew what they were doing inside.","During this time, Jian Wushuang was very relaxed. Occasionally, he would drink tea and chat with Demon Master Chenhuo.","“It’s been half a year. If I’m not mistaken, Marquis Duan Yu and the others should have practiced their magic formation by now,” Jian Wushuang said.","“I’ve personally seen the magic formation they practiced. The power of the magic formation is indeed amazing. After the five of them joined hands to cast the magic formation, even if I was trapped inside, it would be difficult for me to break it. However, at that time, they were not very familiar with the magic formation. Now, they should be able to break it,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","The level of the Netherjade Five Kill formation was extremely high. Originally, it would be extremely difficult for even a sixth level void martial artist to master it, and the time required would be very long.","But fortunately, there was Marquis Duan Yu, who had extremely high attainments in the formation, and he was also one of the five people who controlled the formation. Thus, although this formation was used by five people at the same time, the main person who controlled it was Marquis Duan Yu, therefore, in about half a year, they should be able to master the magic formation.","“Once the magic formation is completed, Xiao’er will find an opportunity to kill Da Ying, but...” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “Chenhuo, if Da Ying is really trapped in the Netherjade Five Kill magic formation and you kill her yourself, are you sure you can kill her?”","Although Jian Wushuang was very confident in the strength of Demon Master Chenhuo, Da Ying was, after all, an expert at the peak of the sixth realm of the void.","“I can’t say for sure.” Demon Master Chenhuo shook his head. “However, after I take this step, my strength is much stronger than before. It’s definitely not difficult for me to crush Da Ying. As for killing her, it’s very likely that she can’t escape.”","“How confident are you?” Jian Wushuang looked at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“50%. After all, this Da Ying will definitely go crazy and do whatever it takes. She has been the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan for so many years, so she must have many trump cards. The Soul Devouring Pearl she used on the battlefield may only be one of them.”","“If I really push her to the limit, I don’t know whether I can kill her or not. Or I can’t guarantee that I will be able to withstand her desperate use of her trump card,” said Demon Master Chenhuo.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly.","Indeed, to kill an expert at the peak of the six void realms, not only did she have to be unable to escape, but she also had to be careful of her counterattack.","Anyone would be desperate before they died, let alone this Da Ying.","And a Da Ying at the peak of the six void realms, who was also the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, would be quite terrifying if she was desperate.","Under such circumstances, it was not easy to continue to kill her. Even if she was killed in the end, there was no guarantee that they would not pay a price.","At this moment...Xiao’er flew over from the distance and appeared directly in front of Jian Wushuang and Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Jian Wushuang, Demon Master Chenhuo,” Xiao’er said with a solemn expression.","“Miss Xiao’er, judging from your solemn expression, have you found the whereabouts of Da Ying?” Jian Wushuang asked.","During the past six months, Xiao’er had ordered the intelligence agencies of Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan to do their best to find the existence of Da Ying. As Xiao’er had expected, Da Ying did not keep a low profile, she was often found.","However, since three months ago, Da Ying seemed to have suddenly disappeared. The intelligence agencies of Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan could not find her again.","“Yes, I found her, but it’s because of this that I’m in a tricky situation,” Xiao’er said.","“Tricky?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. “Da Ying has already been driven out of the Nine-tailed Clan. is she going to cause any trouble?”","“If it was just her alone, it wouldn’t be a big deal. We could have set off to kill her at any time after Marquis Duan Yu had completely mastered the five killing formation of the dark jade. However, we didn’t expect her to go to the Blood Clan during the three months when she disappeared!” said Xiao-er in a low voice.","“Blood Clan?” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes and stood up immediately. “Why did she go to the Blood Clan?”","“If I’m not mistaken, she wants to join hands with the Blood Clan to fight against the Nine-tailed Clan,” Xiao’er said.","“So, the Blood Clan agreed?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","In her opinion, the Blood Clan and the Nine-tailed Clan were one of the four great divine clans. They should not really fight against the Nine-tailed Clan for the sake of a Da Ying. After all, the Nine-tailed Clan and Divine Moon Palace had now joined hands, their overall strength had long surpassed that of before.","Now, in the Demon Realm, all the clans believed that the Nine-tailed Clan was the strongest among the four great divine clans.","At this juncture, the Blood Clan should not be so blind as to provoke the Nine-tailed Clan.","“Jian Wushuang, you don’t know that the four great divine clans in the demon realm are not as calm as they appear on the surface, especially the Nine-tailed Clan and the Blood Clan,” Xiao’er said in a deep voice.","“The Blood Clan and the Nine-tailed Clan have been fighting for a long time because of the proximity of their territories. Sometimes, the Nine-tailed Clan is superior to the Blood Clan, and sometimes, the Blood Clan is superior to the Nine-tailed Clan. In short, the two divine races have been fighting for an unknown number of years and have accumulated a huge amount of hatred toward each other. No matter who we are, as long as there is an opportunity, we will definitely attack each other without hesitation!”","“And this time, because of me, the Nine-tailed Clan and the Divine Moon Palace have joined hands, and their strength has increased to an unprecedented level. This naturally made the Blood Clan wary and even fearful. As for Da Ying, she also knows that it is already very difficult for her to regain control of the Nine-tailed Clan by herself, so she naturally has to find helpers!”","“The first person she thought of should be the dark clan. However, although the Dark clan is on good terms with the Nine-tailed Clan and owes the Nine-tailed Clan a favor, this favor is owed to the Nine-tailed Clan, not her, Da Ying. Therefore, when the Dark clan knows that the war between the Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan is merely an internal conflict between the Nine-tailed Clan, the Dark clan will not pay any attention to it!”","“At this time, even if Da Ying finds the Dark Clan, she won’t get any help from the dark clan, so she can only go to the Blood Clan!”"]},{"number":3482,"title":"Chapter 3482 - Severe Soul Injury?","paragraphs":["“The Blood Clan has always been wary of the current Nine-tailed Clan. Now that Da Ying has taken the initiative to seek refuge with us, we naturally agree.” Xiao’er’s expression was solemn.","“If that’s the case, then it’s really troublesome.” Jian Wushuang also nodded slightly. “Moreover, your goal is to kill Da Ying, and my goal is to kill the clan leader of the Blood Clan. If we deal with these two people one by one, as long as Marquis Duan Yu’s formation is complete, it’s absolutely possible to kill them. However, now that the two of them have joined hands, it’s too difficult to deal with them both at the same time.”","Jian Wushuang was well aware that if Da Ying and the Blood Clan had not joined hands, they could have killed them one by one with Marquis Duan Yu’s five killing formation. However, if the two of them had gathered together...it would not be enough for them to kill the two of them at the same time.","After all, Demon Master Chenhuo was powerful, but he was not confident that he could kill Da Ying alone, not to mention that there was a Blood Clan Grandmaster who was no weaker than Da Ying.","“We have no choice but to wait. After all, the Blood Clan and the Nine-tailed Clan have been fighting for so many years. Previously, Da Ying was the Blood Clan Grandmaster. Under such circumstances, Da Ying and the Blood Clan might not be able to forget about the past. It may not be long before their alliance is broken. At that time, we can still proceed according to the plan.”","“In addition, even if they really forget about the past, Da Ying and the Blood Clan Grandmaster can not stay together forever. We can wait. As long as they separate, we can attack immediately and still have a chance to kill them,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes, that’s what I thought. I’ve instructed the chess pieces in the Blood Clan to pay close attention to the movements of Da Ying and the Blood Clan leader. As soon as they have a chance to separate, we will attack immediately,” Xiao’er said.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, but his heart was still heavy.","After all, if Da Ying really joined hands with the Blood Clan leader, it would be much more difficult and unpredictable to kill them than before.","They could only wait for an opportunity.","Time passed, and another half a month passed in the blink of an eye.","During this half a month, the five Principles Masters on Marquis Duan Yu’s side had already grasped the dark jade five kill array. Once it was used, even the Demon Master Chenhuo wouldn’t be able to escape for a while, and to trap Da Ying, who was much weaker than the Demon Master Chenhuo, or the Blood Clan leader, there was naturally no problem.","At the same time, Xiao’er had also received the news from the Blood Clan.","“The news has been confirmed. Da Ying has indeed joined hands with the Blood Clan. In order to show her sincerity, she gave the Soul Devouring Pearl, the most precious treasure of the Nine-tailed Clan, to the Blood Clan. The Blood Clan has accepted her completely,” Xiao’er said in a deep voice.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang, Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and the others all had ugly expressions on their faces.","“Soul Devouring Pearl...this is a treasure that almost caused Chenhuo to lose his life. How could Da Ying give it up?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","“It’s just a treasure, not to mention that the Nine-tailed Clan left it behind. Now that Da Ying is no longer the clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, of course she doesn’t care about this precious treasure. But the problem is that she has gained the trust of the Blood Clan with this treasure. Next, she will join hands with the Blood Clan completely,” Xiao’er said coldly.","“In addition, the people I left behind also said that Da Ying immediately went into seclusion after gaining the trust of the Blood Clan. They also told the Blood Clan that she would be in seclusion for a long time, as if to heal her injuries.”","“Heal?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, and he immediately looked at Demon Master Chenhuo. “Chenhuo, did you hurt Da Ying badly?”","“I think so,” Demon Master Chenhuo said calmly. “After I made a breakthrough, Da Ying suffered a lot of damage to her divine body. However, because of her immortal body, she only lost part of her divine power. Perhaps it will take some time for her to recover after reaching her level, but it’s not necessary for her to go into seclusion to recover her divine power.”","“In that case, why is she in seclusion?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“I understand.” Xiao’er suddenly stood up, she said, “If I’m not wrong, Da Ying is indeed injured. However, it’s not the damage to her divine body or the consumption of divine power, but the damage to her soul. The damage is so great that she must immediately enter seclusion to recover.”","“Soul damage?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. “You mean, when she channeled the soul power of the Soul Devouring Pearl, she also suffered the damage from the soul power?”","“That must be the case.” Xiao’er nodded, he said seriously, “I didn’t know much about the Soul Devouring Pearl. I’ve only heard a little about its use, but it’s one of the biggest killer moves of the Nine-tailed Clan. The previous clan leaders of the Nine-tailed Clan have told me clearly that unless we are on the brink of death, we must not use the Soul Devouring Pearl!”","“However, if it’s only because the Soul Devouring Pearl consumes a large amount of soul power, then because the soul power that the Soul Devouring Pearl has consumed over a long period of time is ridiculously large, there’s no need for such restrictions. Therefore, there’s only one possibility, and that is that while the soul power in the Soul Devouring Pearl is activated, the guide will also suffer the backlash from the soul power!”","“The more soul power she channeled, the greater the backlash. It’s understandable why Da Ying didn’t channel all the Soul Power in the Soul Devouring Pearl during the battle. I’m afraid it’s not because she didn’t want to channel it, but because she knew that the more she channeled, the greater the damage to her soul. That’s why she didn’t dare to be so reckless!”","“Now that she has been defeated and retreated to the Blood Clan, she naturally has to think of a way to recover her soul. Furthermore, after using the Soul Devouring Pearl once, she clearly knew how terrifying the backlash power contained in the Soul Devouring Pearl was. She didn’t dare to use it a second time, so she handed the Soul Devouring Pearl to the Blood Clan without any hesitation!”","“All of this can be explained!”","Hearing Xiao’er’s words, the experts present immediately understood.","“Looks like that’s the case.” Star Saint Master also stood up, he said, “Although I don’t know about the Soul Devouring Pearl, I more or less know about the soul. In order to guide such a huge wave of soul energy that doesn’t belong to me to cause an impact on my opponent, I naturally have to bear a huge risk!”","“If that’s the case, then Da Ying should be in a weakened state. This is the best time for us to kill her.” Axe One Master also said."]},{"number":3483,"title":"Chapter 3483 - Requesting for More","paragraphs":["Help","“That’s true, but that Da Ying is currently in the territory of the Blood Clan. Even if she is currently in a weakened state, if we want to kill her, we still have to pass through the Blood Clan. As for the Blood Clan, in terms of overall strength, they are slightly stronger than the previous Nine-tailed Clan. Of course, the overall strength of our Nine-tailed Clan currently surpasses that of the Blood Clan.” Xiao’er said.","“Are we going to kill Da Ying directly?” Axe One Master narrowed his eyes.","“The Blood Clan also has a clan-protecting formation, but it’s not as powerful as the Nine-tailed Clan’s. It’s not difficult to break it,” Marquis Duan Yu said with a smile.","“If we really want to fight, we have to kill more than just Da Ying. If possible, we have to kill the clan leader as well,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Kill the clan leader?” Marquis Duan Yu raised his eyebrows. “It’s already difficult enough to kill Da Ying just by charging into the territory of the Blood Clan. But if we want to kill the clan leader, I’m afraid our current lineup is not enough.”","“That’s true.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","He understood that it would require extraordinary combat strength to charge into the Blood Clan and kill both Da Ying and the clan leader at the same time.","And on their side, even though they had Demon Master Chenhuo and a total of five void sixth level Principles Masters, the only one who could truly threaten Da Ying and the Blood Clan leader was actually Demon Master Chenhuo alone.","“If our camp can have another expert like Demon Master Chenhuo, then it is possible to charge into the Blood Clan and kill Da Ying and the Blood Clan leader.” Axe One Master suddenly said.","“That’s easy to say. However, in the Divine Beginning Realm, among the Principles Masters, the only one who could match the current Demon Master Chenhuo is probably Elder Dark Bone. Elder Dark Bone has a strange personality. Even if the three great Saint Realm Masters or the ruler realm experts personally invite him, he might not give us face, let alone us,” Xiao’er said.","“Of course, an ordinary person wouldn’t be able to invite him. But, didn’t the Heavenly Sword Marquis have dealings with Elder Dark Bone?","“Back on the Saha Island, the three Saint Realms set up an inescapable net to kill you. At that time, Elder Dark Bone stood on your side and helped you fight against a Master of the Saint Realm,” Axe One Master said with a smile.","“In that battle, Elder Dark Bone did help me a lot. But, he helped me because his disciple owed me a favor. He was just returning the favor for his disciple,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Really?” Axe One Master smiled, he said, “My young friend, I’m afraid you’ve underestimated this Elder Dark Bone. He lived for a very long time, not only because of his own strength, but also because he ignored the fights between the forces in the Divine Beginning Realm. No one would look for trouble with him!”","“Even though he finally got a disciple and loves this treasure, do you think he would offend the three Saint Realms and even fight the master of the Saint Realm for this treasure?”","Jian Wushuang frowned.","He had thought about this question before, but since Elder Dark Bone had left after the battle, he did not have the time to ask. Therefore, he could only take it as Elder Dark Bone returning the favor to his disciple.","However, if he thought about it carefully, there were indeed many things that were not right.","“Axe One Master, are you saying that Elder Dark Bone helped me for other reasons?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Of course. As for this reason, you will know it in the future. Now, you can go directly to him and ask him to help you. He will most likely not refuse you. If he really refuses, you can say that you came to him on the orders of Star Palace Master. He will definitely not refuse you,” Axe One Master said confidently.","“Okay, I’ll go look for Elder Dark Bone now.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang took out a message token. This message token did not belong to Elder Dark Bone, but to his disciple, Underworld Emperor.","“Underworld Emperor.” Jian Wushuang directly sent a message to Underworld Emperor.","A moment later, Underworld Emperor replied, “Brother Heavenly Marquis, how come you have time to look for me?”","“Are you still trapped in the trial your master gave you?” Jian Wushuang asked first.","In the Blood Wave Realm, Jian Wushuang and Emperor Ming fought side by side, and they were good friends.","Even after they separated, they would occasionally communicate with each other. Jian Wushuang also knew that not long after Emperor Ming became a Principles Masters, his master, Elder Dark Bone, sent him to a special place, saying that it was to give him a trial.","Until now, Emperor Ming was still trapped in that experience.","“I can’t help it. The test my master arranged for me is very difficult. I can’t get out of here in a short time.” Emperor Ming smiled. “Let’s not talk about this. Brother Heavenly Marquis, you must have something else to talk to me about today, right?”","“Yes, I have something urgent. I want to talk to Elder Dark Bone, but I don’t have Elder Dark Bone’s communication token, so I can only talk to you,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s easy. Although my master left me here, he has been staying here by himself. I’ll send a message to him from my body. Please wait for a moment,” Underworld Emperor said and then sent a message to Elder Dark Bone.","A moment later, he got the result.","“Brother Heavenly Marquis, my master has come. He will take my message token and communicate with you,” Underworld Emperor said. Not long after that, a slightly hoarse voice came from the other side of the token, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, I heard that you have something to ask me?”","“Yes.”Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and then said seriously, “Senior, I want to ask you to help me with something.”","“Help?” Elder Dark Bone paused, then he said faintly, “Heavenly Sword Marquis, you should know that I don’t have any entanglement with you. The reason I helped you outside the Blood Wave Realm was because my disciple owed you a favor. Since the end of the battle, my disciple has already repaid the favor. Now, neither I nor my disciple owes you anything. Why should I help you?”","“Senior, I know I can’t force you to do anything, but I really need a strong helper like you, so I have no choice but to ask you. If you help me, I will definitely remember your favor!” Jian Wushuang said seriously.","“Your favor...well, it’s worth considering.” Elder Dark Bone smiled faintly, but he did not directly agree.","“Senior, I came to invite you on the orders of Palace Master Star Palace,” Jian Wushuang said again.","“Palace Master Star Palace?” Elder Dark Bone’s voice obviously changed, but then he smiled and said, “I didn’t expect Star Palace to make contact with you so soon. It’s really unexpected.”"]},{"number":3484,"title":"Chapter 3484 - 4 Elder Dark Bone Arrived","paragraphs":["What Elder Dark Bone said made Jian Wushuang’s heart skip a beat.","Obviously, Elder Dark Bone knew about Star Palace, and he knew that Star Palace would definitely contact him.","“Well, since Star Palace has already contacted you, and it’s under the instructions of Star Palace Master, I’ll help you again. Tell me, what do you need me to do?” Elder Dark Bone said with a faint smile.","“Senior, I want to kill Da Ying and the Grandmaster of the Blood Clan. However, they are, after all, two experts at the peak of the sixth realm of the Void. Although I can set up the five kill formation of the nether jade to prevent them from escaping, I only have Chenhuo, an existence at the peak of the sixth realm of the void. He alone is not sure that he can kill them, so I need your help,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Da Ying is the former clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan. Together with the clan leader of the Blood Clan, both of them are extremely powerful. If they work together, even if they are trapped by the magic formation, it would be difficult for an expert of the ultimate six realms to kill them. However, if we can gather two experts of the ultimate six realms of the void, we have a much greater chance of killing them.” Elder Dark Bone said with a strange smile.","“That’s right. We’ve also received news that Da Ying’s soul has been severely injured. He should be in a weakened state now. If you attack him, together with our Demon Master Chenhuo and five-kill formation, there’s a high chance of killing them,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, you should be in the Nine-tailed Clan now, right?” Elder Dark Bone said with a strange smile.","It seemed that although he did not care about worldly affairs, he had been paying attention to some major changes in the Divine Beginning Realm.","News of the Nine-tailed Clan’s change had already spread in the Divine Beginning Realm, so Elder Dark Bone had obviously received the news.","“It’s in the Nine-tailed Clan. When will senior come?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Since you said that Da Ying is currently in a weak state, I can’t give her a chance to catch her breath. I’ll leave now. You can wait for a few days in the Nine-tailed Clan,” Elder Dark Bone said.","“Thank you, senior.” Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised.","Then, Jian Wushuang cut off the communication with Elder Dark Bone.","Seeing Jian Wushuang put away the communication token, Xiao’er, Axe One Master, and the others immediately looked","over.","“My young friend, how did it go?” Axe One Master asked with a smile. From his smile, it could be seen that he had the answer in his heart.","“Elder Dark Bone has agreed, and he will be coming soon,” Jian Wushuang said.","“That’s great.” Xiao’er’s eyes lit up.","“With Elder Dark Bone, the strongest expert in the six realms of the void, and Demon Master Chenhuo...as long as our five-kill formation can prevent Da Ying and the Blood Clan leader from escaping, they will almost certainly die!” Marquis Duan Yu said seriously.","When everyone knew that Elder Dark Bone would arrive, they calmed down. However, no one noticed that Demon Master Chenhuo had narrowed his eyes.","“Elder Dark Bone...an ultimate expert of the six states of the void? I really want to meet him.” Demon Master Chenhuo muttered to himself.","In just ten days, Elder Dark Bone had arrived at the Nine-tailed Clan.","Besides his disciple, Underworld Emperor, there was also a handsome and dignified middle-aged man in a golden robe.","“Brother Heavenly Sword Marquis!” Underworld Emperor was the first to speak and shouted enthusiastically.","“Underworld Emperor.” Jian Wushuang greeted his good friend and then went to Elder Dark Bone and bowed respectfully. “Elder Dark Bone.”","Elder Dark Bone had helped him at a critical time, and he had come to help him this time. Jian Wushuang naturally respected such a person, who was also a super expert.","“Mr. Elder Dark Bone.”","Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master also said to show their respect.","Elder Dark Bone nodded slightly, but then he looked directly at Xiao’er and said, “Da Ji, long time no see. How have you been?”","“I’ve experienced nine reincarnations. After so many years, I thought you should have left the Divine Beginning Realm a long time ago. I didn’t expect you to stay here,” Xiao’er said with a strange tone.","“Elder Dark Bone, do you know Miss Xiao’er?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise.","“Of course.” Elder Dark Bone smiled. “Da Ji and I have known each other for many years, but it’s because of that person.”","“Him? You mean...Di Shisan?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Yes.” Elder Dark Bone nodded. “I’ve been in the Divine Beginning Realm for a long time. During this time, I’ve met countless experts, but I think I can slightly suppress them as long as they haven’t reached the saint realm master or the master level. However, Di Shisan, who was at his peak, was the only exception!”","“Di Shisan is indeed a talented man. His understanding of sword principle has gone beyond the realm of the Divine Beginning Realm and reached a whole new level.”","“A whole new level?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Yes, in the Divine Beginning Realm, one’s understanding of sword principle is limited to three levels. At the third level, one can derive all things. This level is actually the limit and end point for many sword principle cultivators in the Divine Beginning Realm. However, Di Shisan’s understanding of sword principle has gone beyond the third level and reached a higher level, the fourth level!”","“It’s a whole new realm. Not to mention ordinary Principles Masters, even many master level experts can’t reach it. That’s why his swordsmanship is so terrifying. No one can block his killing sword!” “Di Shisan, who had reached the pinnacle of the six realms of the void, used a shocking technique during the world-ending war. He chopped off the arm of a master level expert with one sword. That sword move was earth-shaking!”","At this point, Elder Dark Bone could not help exclaiming in surprise.","However, Jian Wushuang’s heart was shocked.","In his previous life, he had interacted with Di Shisan many times. Moreover, when Leng Ruxue’s Master’s consciousness incarnation had descended into the eternal chaotic world, Di Shisan had said that he had cut off one of his arms, now, it seemed that the person whom Elder Dark Bone said was cut off by Di Shisan should be Leng Ruxue’s master.","Jian Wushuang had thought that Leng Ruxue’s master was also a master of the Saint Realm, but now it seemed that was not the case.","Leng Ruxue’s master was a genuine master level expert!","Under such circumstances, Di Shisan was able to cut off one of the master’s arms. It was evident how powerful Di Shisan was at that time. No wonder Elder Dark Bone praised him so much."]},{"number":3485,"title":"Chapter 3485 - Life Fall King","paragraphs":["“Because Di Shisan was so powerful that even I was amazed, I went to see him more than once to spar with him. Di Shisan did not refuse to fight with him. After a few times, we have more or less established a friendship. When I came into contact with Di Shisan, I naturally came into contact with Da Ji,” Elder Dark Bone said with a smile.","“I see.” Jian Wushuang understood.","It turned out that Elder Dark Bone was not acquainted with Xiao’er, but with Di Shisan.","“By the way, Elder Dark Bone, who is this?” Jian Wushuang looked at the middle-aged man in a golden robe next to Elder Dark Bone.","“He is my good friend in the Universe Battlefield, Life Fall King. He just happened to visit me this time, so I brought him along.” Elder Dark Bone laughed, “After all, it’s difficult to kill two experts at the peak of the six void realms. If Life Fall King was there to help, nothing would happen.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang could not help looking at Life Fall King again.","In his perception, Life Fall King was in an ethereal state like Demon Master Chenhuo. He could not sense the existence of the other party’s specific aura and strength, or even his ability to conceal his aura, it seemed that Life Fall King was even more powerful than Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, there’s something I have to tell you first. It’s my good friend, Life Fall King. He’s actually...a Chaos Master!” Elder Dark Bone suddenly said.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Not only him, but Xiao’er, Demon Master Chenhuo, Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master were also shocked.","“Master, a master-level expert?” Jian Wushuang looked at Life Fall King in astonishment.","But Life Fall King smiled faintly and said, “Don’t listen to Elder Dark Bone. I’m only at the sixth realm of the Void.”","“What, what do you mean?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","“My good friend is indeed a Chaos Master, but he’s not a native ruler born in the Divine Beginning Realm. He’s from outside the Divine Beginning Realm and from the Universe Battlefield!” Elder Dark Bone said.","“A ruler from outside the Divine Beginning Realm?” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","“Rulers from outside the Divine Beginning Realm will be restrained by the heavenly will of the Divine Beginning Realm after they arrive in the Divine Beginning Realm. This pressure is greater than the pressure exerted by the power of the heavenly will on rulers born in the Divine Beginning Realm. For example, the rulers who rose up in the Divine Beginning Realm, such as Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and others, are still suppressed by the heavenly will in the Divine Beginning Realm, but their combat strength is still stronger than that of ordinary masters of the Saint Realm!”","“But the overlords from the outside world will be suppressed by the will of the Heavenly Dao, so he can only exert the battle strength of the sixth realm of the void. Of course, even if he only has the battle strength of the sixth realm of the void, I’m not confident that I can defeat him,” Elder Dark Bone said.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows, but then his expression changed again. “No, if that’s true, then during the world-ending battle, countless experts fought their way into the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. At that time, there were also masters from outside the world who intervened. If these masters from outside the world were suppressed by the will of the Heavenly Dao, then how could the Seven Star Mysterious Sect be defeated?”","“This is actually very easy to understand.” Elder Dark Bone smiled. “Heavenly Sword Marquis, you should know how those masters from outside the world came about during the world-ending battle.” “They are...” Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat, but he already somewhat understood.","“Those overlords came to the divine realm because of the will of the Heavenly Dao. It can even be said that the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao invited them. Since the will of the Heavenly Dao invited them, how could the will of the Heavenly Dao give them too much","pressure?”","“Therefore, although the overlords from the Divine Beginning Realm were still suppressed, they were still able to display battle strength that was no weaker than that of Temporal Temple Master, Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master, and the others in the Divine Beginning Realm. That was why the Seven Star Mysterious Sect was defeated,” Elder Dark Bone said.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but come to a realization.","“I did not enter the Divine Beginning Realm by the will of the Heavenly Dao. Instead, I entered by myself. Naturally, I’m under a lot of restrictions, so don’t count on me,” Life Fall King said with a smile.","Although he was a genuine chaos ruler, Life Fall King did not put on too much airs in front of Jian Wushuang and the others. Instead, he was very gentle and willing to talk to them.","“Life fall, don’t be humble. Even though you’re bound by a lot of restrictions, you can still help a lot by killing experts at the peak of the six void realms. I’m afraid that neither Da Ying nor the Blood Clan leader will be able to block your death magic,” Elder Dark Bone said with a strange smile.","Hearing Elder Dark Bone’s words, Jian Wushuang and Xiao’er felt relieved.","They had thought that if Elder Dark Bone came, they would have more than half of the success. They did not expect that he would bring a ruler-level expert, Life Fall King, along with him!","Although Life Fall King was restricted by the power of the will of heaven and could only exert the battle strength of the six void realms, the strength of a ruler was naturally incomparable to that of an ordinary Principles Master. With the addition of Life Fall King... their plan this time could almost be said to be without any surprises.","“By the way, Heavenly Sword Marquis, when you sent me a message earlier, you said that you have an expert who has reached the pinnacle of the six realms of the void. You must be talking about him, right?” Elder Dark Bone looked at him with a strange gaze, he had already looked at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“Yes, let me introduce him. This is Demon Master Chenhuo. He has just broken through to the pinnacle of the six realms,” Jian Wushuang said.","“The Divine Beginning Realm is the oldest and most recognized Principles Master, Elder Dark Bone. I’ve heard a lot about you.” Demon Master Chenhuo Stared at Elder Dark Bone with a strange look in his eyes.","“In the Divine Beginning Realm, there was only one expert who reached the pinnacle of the six realms of the Void. Now there are three more. Congratulations.” Elder Dark Bone laughed. “There’s another one?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","“Aren’t you the only expert in the Divine Beginning Realm who has reached the pinnacle of the six void realms?” Xiao’er also looked at Elder Dark Bone.","“No, there is indeed another expert besides me. You haven’t met him yet, but you will definitely meet him in the future,” Elder Dark Bone said.","“I don’t care if you meet him in the future, but I know that I have met one now,” said the Demon Master Chenhuo suddenly, a bright light flashing in his eyes."]},{"number":3486,"title":"Chapter 3486 - Sparring","paragraphs":["Chapter 3486 Sparring","“Chenhuo.” Jian Wushuang could not help looking at Demon Master Chenhuo.","“I’ve been lonely for too long. It’s rare for me to meet a decent opponent. How could I miss it?” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","Jian Wushuang nodded secretly. He could understand.","Before the Purple Star Demon Sect was destroyed, Demon Master Chenhuo was a genius. He was also very belligerent and liked to challenge experts everywhere.","rs.","After the destruction of the Purple Star Demon Sect, he stayed in the secret realm of heaven and earth for nearly 200 million years alone. Just as he said, he had been lonely for too long, and he had not had a good battle with anyone for a long time, even after he came out of the secret realm of heaven and earth, he still did not meet any opponents because he was too strong.","The only one he met was probably Da Ying from before.","However, after he made a breakthrough in that battle and reached a new level, an expert at Da Ying’s level was no longer qualified to be his opponent. Now, only experts at the pinnacle of the six void realms were qualified to be his opponent.","There were only three such experts in the entire Divine Beginning Realm, including him. It was too difficult to meet them.","Now that Elder Dark Bone was standing in front of him, he naturally did not want to miss this opportunity.","Knowing this, Jian Wushuang did not stop him.","“Elder Dark Bone, do you want to fight with me?” Demon Master Chenhuo asked directly.","Elder Dark Bone also looked at Demon Master Chenhuo with a strange look, but then he smiled slightly. “Experts at the pinnacle of the six void realms are indeed very difficult to meet in the Divine Beginning Realm unless they are in the Universe Battlefield. Now that we can meet one, it doesn’t matter if we fight.”","Hearing this, the surrounding people could not help but become excited.","Elder Dark Bone had obviously accepted the challenge.","The fight between two experts at the pinnacle of the six void realms was certainly exciting.","“After all, we’re in the Nine-tailed Clan. I’m afraid we won’t be able to fight freely. Let’s find another place,” Elder Dark Bone said.","“Okay.” Demon Master Chenhuo nodded, and then the two directly rushed out of the ancestral land of the Nine-tailed Clan.","“Let’s go and take a look.”","Jian Wushuang, Life Fall King, Xiao’er, Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, Star Saint Master, and Shadow Fox Master did not want to miss the battle and followed them.","They came to an empty space not far from the ancestral land of the Nine-tailed Clan. Then, they made way for a huge battlefield, with Demon Master Chenhuo and Elder Dark Bone standing in the center of the battlefield.","A golden fist glove appeared in the hands of Demon Master Chenhuo.","“This fist glove was given to me by Master when Purple Star Devil Sect was still around. Later, I found someone to refine and strengthen it. Finally, it was upgraded to a top-tier true treasure. Its name is Golden God!” Demon Master Chenhuo said indifferently.","“Top-tier true treasure?” Elder Dark Bone smiled. “A top-tier true treasure from the Divine Beginning Realm. It’s powerful, but it’s nothing compared to a universe true treasure. However, today’s battle is just a sparring match. To be fair, I won’t use a universe true treasure. I got this blade many years ago, but I’ve never used it since. I’ll use it to fight you today.”","As Elder Dark Bone spoke, a pitch-black blade appeared in his hand.","This blade looked ordinary, but anyone could feel a shocking coldness from it.","Without a doubt, this blade was also a top-tier true treasure, but it was clearly not Elder Dark Bone’s strongest godly weapon!","There was nothing he could do about it. Elder Dark Bone had lived for too long, and he often went to the Universe Battlefield to explore. He even had a lot of universe true treasures, many of which were more powerful than the top-tier true treasures in the absolute beginning godly world.","As for Demon Master Chenhuo, he had never been to the Universe Battlefield, and he had stayed in the universe secret region for a long time, so he had no chance to collect more powerful true treasures. The glove in his hand was indeed his most powerful godly weapon.","“Sinking fire, make your move,” Elder Dark Bone said with a faint smile. Even though he was facing Demon Master Chenhuo, who was at the same level as him and was at the pinnacle of the six levels of the void space, Elder Dark Bone still looked very relaxed, it was as if Demon Master Chenhuo was not really in his heart.","And Demon Master Chenhuo had also noticed this. Although he was not angry, he had already used his actions to express his dissatisfaction.","Boom!","A sudden explosion of air could be heard. The void where Demon Master Chenhuo was originally at had instantly turned into nothingness. His figure had already disappeared in that void, and when he reappeared...he had already arrived in front of Elder Dark Bone. At the same time, his right hand had already turned into a huge star, directly striking toward Elder Dark Bone.","When Elder Dark Bone saw this, he unhurriedly slashed out with his blade.","This blade was soft, as if it did not possess any power.","However, as the blade light passed by, an empty tunnel appeared.","In the blink of an eye, the fist of the Demon Master clashed with the blade light.","Peng!","The void exploded on the spot, and a black hole with a diameter of nearly 1,000 meters appeared in this vast world.","“Black hole?”","“What a huge black hole. This area is simply unbelievable!”","“The strongest expert of the six void realms is indeed...extraordinary!”","The surrounding six void realm Principles Masters who were watching the battle could not help but exclaim in admiration. Even though they were all at the six void realms, the gap between the ordinary six void realms and the pinnacle of the six void realms was too great.","One had to know, what was the pinnacle of the six void realms?","That was after one had completely grasped and fused the three principles, comprehended the fourth principle, and grasped the seventh portion of the power of the will!","But the ordinary six states of the void, including the experts at the peak of the six states of the void, only grasped six will’s power. Compared to the pinnacle of the six states of the void, there was one less will’s power, and the difference of one will’s power...how huge was it?","To put it bluntly, the pinnacle of the six states of the void actually did not belong to the scope of the six states of the void. Speaking of which, they could already be considered to have reached the seven states of the void!","They had an extra portion of will power compared to the six void realms. In terms of pure divine power, they were far above the six void realms.","Just like now, when the Demon Master and Elder Dark Bone were fighting, the two of them were clearly just casually attacking and did not use any ultimate moves or secret techniques. However, the power that burst out in that instant...caused the several experts of the six void realms present to be shocked.","The casual attack of the Demon Master and Elder Dark Bone was not something that ordinary void six stage experts like them could achieve. At the same time, it was also something that they could not withstand.","Hualala ~ ~","After the spatial black hole appeared, the void started to recover at a terrifying speed. Meanwhile, the Demon Master and Elder Dark Bone had already retreated."]},{"number":3487,"title":"Chapter 3487 - Was Easily Deciphered","paragraphs":["Chapter 3487 Was Easily Deciphered","“Just comparing power, the two of them look similar.” Axe One Master said.","“Very normal. Both are at the pinnacle of the six realms of the void, and both have grasped seven portions of willpower power. In terms of basic power, they are comparable. The only difference is that both have grasped the fusion principles, and who is more proficient in a head-on collision. But now, it seems that both have grasped the nature of the laws, and they are not too different.” Marquis Duan Yu laughed.","“However, the power of the divine power is about the same, so it doesn’t mean much.” Axe One Master added.","As expected, in the center of the battlefield, the two people who had separated moved again.","This time, the two of them moved at the same time, but in an instant, their figures disappeared from everyone’s sight.","While the spectators were still thinking of ways to capture the figures of the two of them, bang!","A loud boom was heard. The two had already exchanged blows in the void of the battlefield. The power that burst out in an instant was earth-shaking, and the airwaves swept wildly.","The spectators were affected by the power and immediately looked toward the source. However, when they looked over, they could not see anything. Instead, another violent boom was emitted from another void.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The booms came one after another. Not only Jian Wushuang, but even the rules masters of the six void realms could not catch the figures of Demon Master Chenhuo and Elder Dark Bone, they could only follow the booms to find their positions.","However, when they followed the voice, they found that Demon Master Chenhuo and Elder Dark Bone were already in other places.","It was too much for them to handle!","Everyone’s eyes could not keep up with the speed of Demon Master Chenhuo and Elder Dark Bone.","“Too fast, too fast!”","“I’m a Principles Master of the six void realms, but I can’t keep up with their speed?”","“Indeed, the experts at the pinnacle of the six void realms are really terrifying!”","Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master could not help but exclaim in admiration.","Even they could not keep up with the speed of Demon Master Chenhuo and Elder Dark Bone, so Jian Wushuang naturally could not keep up with them.","“This is true speed!” Jian Wushuang clenched his hands. “Although I have comprehended the space-time principles and am very good at speed, many experts at the five void realms can’t keep up with me when I use my full strength, my speed is like a child’s play compared to senior sinking fire or Elder Dark Bone. It’s ridiculous.”","On the battlefield, the speed unleashed by Demon Master Chenhuo and Elder Dark Bone was indeed too shocking.","And it was very obvious that the two of them were currently competing in speed.","This competition lasted for a long period of time. The two of them had clashed nearly a hundred times, but they were still unable to determine the victor.","“Haha, Demon Master Chenhuo, your speed is indeed very impressive.” Elder Dark Bone let out a strange laugh. “Among the principles I control, there are two major principles, wind and thunder. I myself am quite good at speed, but I didn’t expect that my full speed would still be unable to surpass yours.” Demon Master Chenhuo narrowed his eyes.","“Just based on speed, it is impossible to determine the victor. You should bring out your true ability.” Elder Dark Bone laughed.","“As you wish.” Demon Master Chenhuo’s face was cold. A majestic power had begun to gather around him. At the same time, a rich golden light began to erupt from the scarlet-gold glove on his right hand.","“Here it comes, the ultimate move of Chenhuo!” Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank.","The two most powerful ultimate moves of Demon Master Chenhuo were Divine Destruction and Dragon God Destruction.","Judging from the power accumulated by Demon Master Chenhuo and his movements, he must have intended to use divine destruction first.","Boom!","Heaven and earth shook and endless golden light gathered. In the blink of an eye, a huge golden sun rose up.","The golden sun brought with it an incomparably terrifying impact force as it crushed toward Elder Dark Bone.","Although they stood outside the battlefield and were far away from the golden sun, the spectators, including the Principles Masters of the six void realms, could not help but feel a sense of fear when they saw the golden sun, I could not help but feel a sense of dread.","It was as if the golden sun were to come at them, and they would not be able to resist it.","But as a golden sun target of Demon Master Chenhuo, but only a faint smile, followed by the hands of the pitch-black sword again cut","out.","Is still light, as if there is no strength of a knife, but the moment the knife light cut out, but with a sense of destruction.","Instantly, the saber light flashed through the golden sun, directly splitting it in half. The earth-shaking might contained within the golden sun also retreated to the sides.","“My Sky God Annihilation was actually broken so easily?”","Seeing the result in front of him, even the Demon Master Chenhuo could not help but reveal a trace of surprise.","“Demon Master Chenhuo, do you have any more powerful ultimate moves?” Elder Dark Bone still looked at the Demon Master Chenhuo with a faint smile.","“Hmph!”","Demon Master Chenhuo snorted coldly, and in an instant, his majestic might once again condensed.","The sky was still filled with golden light, and it was still that enormous golden sun. However, at this moment, the golden sun that Demon Master Chenhuo displayed was a full size larger than before, furthermore, this golden sun had a wildness that the previous golden sun did not have.","This wildness was as if this golden sun could explode at any time.","Dragon God Destruction!","The most powerful ultimate move of the Demon Master Chenhuo had already been fully displayed in his hands.","At this moment, the Demon Master Chenhuo had also used his full strength!","And looking at the golden sun at this moment, Elder Dark Bone’s gaze finally tightened. “Not only has he broken through to the pinnacle of the six states of the void, he has even created the most powerful ultimate move?”","“Interesting!”","Elder Dark Bone smiled again, following which the pitch-black battle saber in his hand slashed out once again.","Hua!","This saber was no longer the soft and feeble one from before.","This saber strike was rather swift and fierce, and it was indomitable!","In the blink of an eye, the saber light had already slashed onto the golden sun, and in an instant, the golden sun split apart. However, before the shocking might contained within the golden sun started to erupt, that pitch-black saber light already had a world-destroying intent, it completely annihilated the power contained in the golden sun.","In other words, the huge golden sun had already been annihilated by the saber light of Elder Dark Bone before it could even erupt with its proper power.","Elder Dark Bone was still able to easily neutralize Demon Master Chenhuo’s most powerful move, Dragon God Annihilation.","“How is this possible?” Demon Master Chenhuo was stunned.","“He blocked it so easily?” Jian Wushuang was also very surprised.","“It’s a little too powerful.” Axe One Master and the others also widened their eyes in astonishment."]},{"number":3488,"title":"Chapter 3488 - He Had Lived for Far Too Long","paragraphs":["Chapter 3488 He Had Lived for Far Too Long","“Demon Master Chenhuo, I’ve already asked you to attack twice. Furthermore, you’ve already used your strongest move. Next, you should also receive my blade.” Elder Dark Bone smiled faintly.","Demon Master Chenhuo immediately prepared himself.","Under everyone’s gaze, Elder Dark Bone attacked once again.","Hua!","Elder Dark Bone did not take too long to gather his strength before he casually slashed out with his blade.","This slash was indeed very casual. It did not seem like he was using any powerful ultimate move.","Moreover, after the battle blade attacked, the void in front of him did not even have the slightest ripple. There was not even a blade light.","Elder Dark Bone’s blade did not seem to have any effect on the surrounding void, nor did it have any power bursting out.","Seeing this scene, the few people watching the battle revealed puzzled expressions.","Even the Demon Master Chenhuo frowned slightly. However, suddenly, the expression of the Demon Master Chenhuo changed. His right hand instantly gathered a majestic power and exploded toward the void in front of him.","Bang!","His fist smashed into the void in front of him. There was actually a formless and terrifying blade light charging over.","Fortunately, Demon Master Chenhuo reacted in time. In any case, this formless blade light had directly struck his body.","Even though he reacted, the power contained within that formless blade light was still not something that Demon Master Chenhuo’s last-minute punch could compare to.","After an intense explosion sounded, Demon Master Chenhuo’s body suddenly shot out. He directly shot to the edge of the battlefield before he finally came to a stop.","He regained his balance, but at this moment, he was shocked. He looked at his right hand with a look of disbelief.","Elder Dark Bone had already put away his blade and looked at him again, “Dark Fire Demon Master, you don’t have to be too surprised. You may not know this, but I have lived for a very long time. During this long time, I have been to the Universe Battlefield many times and met countless great beings. I have even met many ruler-level great beings in the Universe Battlefield.","“And even in the Universe Battlefield, there are no restrictions on the ruler-level experts. Under the premise that they can unleash their strongest strength, this old man still has the confidence to survive in the hands of an ordinary ruler-level expert!”","“As for the experts at the pinnacle of the six states of the void, this old man has met even more in the Universe Battlefield. But among these experts at the pinnacle of the six states of the void, other than Di Shisan from the Seven Star Mysterious Sect, there is really no one who is a match for this old man. You have just broken through to the pinnacle of the six states of the void not long ago, so it is very normal for your strength to be inferior to this old man.”","“Right.” Life Fall King laughed, “But in terms of strength, Elder Dark Bone is indeed much stronger than ordinary experts at the pinnacle of the six void realms. It is precisely because of this that he was able to survive against a ruler-level expert, which is why he has the qualifications to befriend me. As for you, Demon Master Chenhuo... you have just broken through to the pinnacle of the six void realms, yet you are already so strong. It is already very rare, but if you want to challenge Chenhuo, you are still lacking quite a bit.”","“I was defeated in this battle. I am completely convinced of my defeat,” Demon Master Chenhuo said directly.","He could already tell that although he was already on the same level as Elder Dark Bone, Elder Dark Bone was far stronger than him in terms of true strength.","This could be seen from Elder Dark Bone’s extremely casual manner when he fought with him.","When Elder Dark Bone fought with him, he should not have used his full strength.","Moreover, Elder Dark Bone himself had said that even in the Universe Battlefield, he was confident that he could survive in front of a ruler-level expert. This ability was something that even the Demon Master Chenhuo felt inferior to.","One had to know that a ruler-level expert, even in the Divine Beginning Realm, was still stronger than a Saint Realm Master under the restriction of the will of the Heavenly Dao.","In the Universe Battlefield, a ruler-level expert could display his peak strength without any restrictions. His combat strength was definitely dozens of times stronger than that of a master of the saint realm, or even more.","In the face of such absolute strength, Demon Master Chenhuo was confident in his survival. One could only imagine how powerful he was.","“Alright, you two, this battle ends here.” Jian Wushuang had already walked forward.","He glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo and asked, “How do you feel, Chenhuo?”","“How can a loser feel? I still don’t understand the last move he made,” Demon Master Chenhuo said.","“Yes, we don’t understand the move either. What’s going on?” Axe One Master asked.","The last blade that Elder Dark Bone used was indeed a little too strange.","That was because in their view, that blade did not produce any ripples and did not affect the void at all.","They did not even see where the blade light was. Even Demon Master Chenhuo did not sense the blade light at the beginning. It was only later that he could sense it because the blade light was attacking him.","And seeing everyone’s puzzled look, Elder Dark Bone laughed, “Actually, that blade of mine was nothing. In terms of power, it was slightly weaker than the strongest move of Demon Master Chenhuo. However, that blade of mine was somewhat illusory. This is also related to the principles that I have grasped. Of course, the main reason is that I have been roaming the Universe Battlefield for too long and have fought with all kinds of experts.”","“There are many top-tier warriors fighting with each other. During these battles, they have naturally comprehended some unique and unique ultimate moves. For example, that blade just now is considered a unique ultimate move. In the future, if you have roamed the Universe Battlefield for a long time and fought with many top-tier warriors, you might also be able to comprehend some unique ultimate moves.”","“Is that so?”","Everyone could understand.","Elder Dark Bone’s blade was indeed strange, but when they thought about how long he had lived, everyone felt relieved.","He had lived for such a long time and fought with countless top-tier great beings. Under such circumstances, it would be strange if he could not comprehend some special techniques and ultimate moves.","“Although I have reached the pinnacle of the six void realms, I have never been to the Universe Battlefield,” Demon Master Chenhuo could not help but say.","Sa","“Neither have I,” Jian Wushuang said. At the same time, he immediately remembered that among the few opportunities left by Xue Bei in the Blood North Secret Realm, there was a star map of the Universe Battlefield, the star map was to go to a special place, but since he had never been to the Universe Battlefield, he naturally had not been there.","“The Universe Battlefield is the real paradise for experts. It seems that after I finish what I’ve done here and extract Shuang ‘Er’s soul, I’ll have to go to the Universe Battlefield to experience it,” Jian Wushuang thought to himself."]},{"number":3489,"title":"Chapter 3489 - Spirit Ancestor’s Shock","paragraphs":["Chapter 3489 Spirit Ancestor’s Shock","“Well, the sparring is over. Next, we should discuss how to deal with Da Ying and the Blood Clan,” Xiao’er said.","“With the addition of Mr. Elder Dark Bone and Lord Life Fall King, the strength of our camp has greatly increased. With such strength, we don’t need to discuss how to deal with the Blood Clan and Da Ying, who is already in a weakened state with a severely injured soul. We can just fight them directly,” Axe One Master said.","“That’s right. We already have absolute strength, so we don’t need to waste time. We can attack directly. But before that, I have to invite someone,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Who?” Xiao’er looked over.","“Spirit Ancestor,” Jian Wushuang said, “The reason I want to kill the Blood Clan’s Grandmaster is because of the agreement between me and Spirit Ancestor. Now that we’re going to attack the Blood Clan, we naturally have to invite her to witness it. Once she arrives, we’ll attack immediately.”","“Sure.” Xiao’er nodded.","Elder Dark Bone, Light Fall King, and Axe One Master naturally did not have any objections.","On the same day, Jian Wushuang sent a message to Spirit Ancestor.","A few days later, Spirit Ancestor arrived at the Nine-tailed Clan.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis, I already know what you did in the demon realm with the Divine Moon Palace. Now that you’ve specially invited me here, are you planning to attack the Blood Clan?” Spirit Ancestor asked directly when she saw Jian Wushuang.","“Spirit Ancestor, don’t worry. Come with me first.” Jian Wushuang smiled and led Spirit Ancestor to a palace below.","Spirit Ancestor followed Jian Wushuang to the palace.","However, as soon as she stepped into the palace, she immediately saw many figures sitting in the palace. At the same time, she also felt the rich and powerful auras emitted by these figures.","“Six realms of the void, so many experts of the six realms of the void!”","Even though the Spirit Ancestor was experienced and knowledgeable, she was also shocked by the lineup before her.","One must know that even the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect, one of the three great Freedom Alliances of the Divine Beginning Realm, did not have as many Principles Masters of the six realms of the void who stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm all year round. Not to mention, other than a few Principles Masters of the six realms of the void...she could not even sense the specific level of a few others.","This made her even more shocked.","“Spirit Ancestor, let me introduce you first. This is Miss Xiao’er, the Palace Master of Divine Moon Palace. She created Divine Moon Palace by herself, and now she has regained control of the Nine-tailed Clan,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Palace Master of Divine Moon Palace?” Spirit Ancestor was stunned, but when she saw Xiao’er, she was a little surprised.","She did not know that Palace Master of Divine Moon Palace was only in the fourth realm of the void realm.","However, what Jian Wushuang said next shocked her. “This is Lord Xu, Miss Xiao’er’s servant. Next to him is Master of Shadow Fox of the Nine-tailed Clan. You should have heard of him.”","“Lord Xu? Servant?” Ancestor Spirit was shocked.","“These three are Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master,” Jian Wushuang introduced.","However, as Axe One Master had warned him not to reveal the existence of Star Palace, he did not mention that the three of them were from Star Palace.","Spirit Ancestor looked at Axe One Master and the other two with a strange expression.","Although she was a loner and never paid attention to the outside world, she knew most of the powerful Principles Masters in the Divine Beginning Realm. However, she had never heard of Axe One Master and the other two.","Then, Jian Wushuang brought Spirit Ancestor to Demon Master Chenhuo.","“This is Demon Master Chenhuo,” Jian Wushuang said.","“I know him. He was with you when you came to the divine ancestor Daoist sect. He is so strong that even Spirit Ancestor thought he was weaker than you,” Spirit Ancestor said.","“Yes, but not long ago, Chenhuo’s strength improved after the battle with Da Ying. Now, he has reached the pinnacle of the six void realms,” Jian Wushuang said. “What?” Spirit Ancestor was shocked and looked at Demon Master Chenhuo with a humble expression.","“Spirit Ancestor, this is Elder Dark Bone. You should have heard of him,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Elder Dark Bone?” Spirit Ancestor glanced at Elder Dark Bone and said with a smile, “Mr. Elder Dark Bone, long time no see. How have you been?”","“Haha, last time I saw you, you were still seeking revenge against the Blood Clan for your husband’s death. I didn’t expect Heavenly Sword Marquis to invite me to kill the clan leader of the Blood Clan to make a deal with you.” Elder Dark Bone laughed leisurely, obviously, he had interacted with Spirit Ancestor before.","Spirit Ancestor could not help but smile.","“Spirit Ancestor, there’s one more. This is Life Fall King, a good friend of Elder Dark Bone. This time, he came with Elder Dark Bone. In addition, Life Fall King is a ruler-level expert,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Ruler-level!” Spirit Ancestor was shocked and immediately looked at Life Fall King in shock. At the same time, he bowed respectfully and said, “Greetings, my lord!”","Life Fall King only glanced at Spirit Ancestor and did not say anything.","“Spirit Ancestor, all of you here are the experts who came with me to the Blood Clan to kill the Blood Clan leader for you. Do you still feel satisfied?” Jian Wushuang said.","“Yes, of course I’m satisfied.” Spirit Ancestor was extremely excited at this moment. Her body was even slightly trembling.","After all, she had been waiting for this day for a long time.","Before this, she really could not find any way to kill the Blood Clan leader.","Later, when she finally met Jian Wushuang, she saw that Jian Wushuang had great potential and unlimited possibilities. It just so happened that Jian Wushuang needed her help, so she made such a request to kill the Blood Clan leader.","In fact, she knew that such a request was indeed a bit too much, but she had no choice but to seize this slim chance.","She did not expect that Jian Wushuang would actually agree to her request and kill the Blood Clan leader for her with all his strength. Moreover, he had invited a lineup that was simply shocking to her!","Five ordinary experts of the six void realms, two experts of the ultimate of the six void realms, and a True Saint Master Realm expert!","If such a lineup could not kill the Blood Clan leader, it meant that she would not be able to avenge her husband in the future.","“Spirit Ancestor, since you are satisfied with this lineup, then what I said before...” Jian Wushuang looked at Spirit Ancestor.","“Heaven Marquis, don’t worry. It would be good if we could successfully kill the Blood Clan leader during this trip. Even if we are lucky enough to let the Blood Clan leader escape, as long as everyone here has done their best, I will not have any regrets. I will still do my best to help you do that,” Spirit Ancestor said.","“That’s good.” Jian Wushuang nodded with satisfaction."]},{"number":3490,"title":"Chapter 3490 - Target: The Blood Clan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3490 Target: The Blood Clan!","“In that case, let’s not waste any time. Let’s go to the Blood Clan now!” Jian Wushuang suggested.","The surrounding people looked at each other and nodded.","Then, they set off directly.","Because their purpose this time was to kill Da Ying and the Blood Clan leader, they did not want to wipe out the Blood Clan. Therefore, they were the only ones who set off to the Blood Clan.","As for the Principles Masters of the Divine Moon Palace and the Nine-tailed Clan who were below the sixth realm of the void realm, none of them went.","The Blood Clan land was far away from the Nine-tailed Clan. It would take a long time for ordinary experts to travel, but this time, almost all the experts who went to the Blood Clan were above the sixth realm of the Void Realm, they traveled at a terrifying speed.","In less than half a day, they had arrived outside the ancestral land of the Blood Clan.","When they arrived, the Blood Clan did not receive any news. The entire Blood Clan was very calm, but the clan-protecting formation of the Blood Clan had been operating normally.","“Marquis Duan Yu, it’s up to you.” Jian Wushuang glanced at Marquis Duan Yu.","“Leave it to me. But if any experts of the Blood Clan come out, please block them for me. Don’t let them affect me,” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“Don’t worry. With our formation there, no one from the Blood Clan will dare to come out,” Jian Wushuang said.","Marquis Duan Yu nodded and immediately rushed toward the ancestral land of the Blood","Clan.","There was a huge formation outside the ancestral land, which was the protection formation of the Blood Clan. Marquis Duan Yu appeared next to the formation and began to crack it.","However, it was the protection array of the divine clan after all. Its power level was extremely high. Marquis Duan Yu’s act of cracking it openly caused quite a commotion.","In a secret room in the ancestral land of the Blood Clan.","This secret room was extremely hidden. Even many of the elders and high-level experts of the Blood Clan did not know of the existence of such a secret room, let alone an innocent intruder.","At this moment, there were two people sitting in this secret chamber.","One of them was wearing a blood robe. His face was thin, but his skin was extremely ruddy as if it was stained with a layer of faint blood.","He was the clan leader of the Blood Clan, also known as the Blood Master!","As for the other person, he was wearing a black robe. His entire body was wrapped in the black robe, so it was impossible to see his exact appearance. Moreover, the aura emitted from his body was also extremely cold, there was even an extremely evil aura.","“Yama, what does your master mean by that?” The Blood Master frowned and asked.","“Blood master, don’t be anxious.” Under the black robe, a hoarse voice slowly sounded, “It’s not that you don’t know my master’s position. This matter involves not only the Nine-tailed Clan, but also Heavenly Sword Marquis.”","“As you know, Heavenly Sword Marquis, even the three great Saint Realms can’t do anything to him now. They have no intention of attacking him for the time being. No matter what, my master still has to stand with the three great saint realms on the surface. If my master really wants to help you at all costs, that would be to directly shed all pretense of cordiality with Heavenly Sword Marquis. At that time, we still don’t know what will happen to Heavenly Sword Marquis. However, the three Saint Realm Masters will definitely blame my master.”","“Humph, with your master’s strength and methods, are you afraid that the three Saint Realm Masters will blame him?” The Blood Master coldly glanced at the black-robed","man.","“Of course. After all, my master is currently living under someone else’s roof. He has to listen to the three Saint Realm Masters more or less. It is obvious that the three Saint Realm Masters want to follow the Heavenly Sword Marquis and find an opportunity to give him a fatal blow. However, if the Heavenly Sword Marquis is alerted because of my master’s rash attack, the three Saint Realm Masters will definitely be unhappy,” the black-robed man said indifferently.","“In other words, your master is not willing to get involved in this matter?” The Blood Master said coldly.","“I didn’t say that, but in my opinion, since you sincerely want to cooperate with my master, my master will not reject you so easily. Otherwise, he would not have sent me here personally. It can be said that my master is still willing to cooperate with you, Blood Master. However, my master has a lot of things to worry about now, so he has not made a definite decision. He will have to wait a little longer and see what the situation is like before deciding,” the black-robed man said.","“It depends on the situation?” The Blood Master was shocked and angry. “Humph, if we look at the situation again, the Nine-tailed Clan and the Heavenly Marquis of Sword will attack us!”","“It’s not necessary. Even if the Heavenly Sword Marquis joins hands with the Nine-tailed Clan and the Divine Moon Palace, their lineup is indeed much stronger than the Blood Clan. However, the Blood Clan now has not only you, but also Da Ying. With you two experts at the peak of the six states of the void, what can they do to you with only one expert at the peak of the six states of the void? Besides, I’m among the Blood Clansmen now. If they really attack, I’ll naturally lend you a hand,” the black-robed man said.","“With your words, I feel a little relieved.” The Blood Master let out a sigh of relief.","But suddenly...the Blood Master’s expression changed, and he stood up abruptly.","“What’s wrong?” The black-robed man looked over.","“It’s a formation. Our clan’s protective formation has been attacked, and the formation spirit told me that that person is using a special method to break the formation. If he continues to break the formation like that, it won’t be long before the formation spirit can’t hold on any longer!” The Blood Master said in a deep voice.","“Break the formation?” The black-robed man stood up in shock.","“It’s the Nine-tailed Clan. It must be the Nine-tailed Clan’s people who have come to kill us. There’s also that Heavenly Sword Marquis. At this time, only they would dare to attack us, and only their people can break our clan’s formation so quickly! The Blood Master immediately became nervous.","“Da Ying told me before that the array of the Nine-tailed Clan was broken by a mysterious expert of the six states of the void in the camp of the Divine Moon Palace. The array of the Nine-tailed Clan is a five-element array from the Universe Battlefield. However, in terms of level, it’s higher than the array of the Blood Clan. Even the array of the Nine-tailed Clan can’t withstand it. Naturally, the array of the Blood Clan will also be broken by that person!”","The black-robed man’s aura surged as he said leisurely, “I didn’t expect that the Nine-tailed Clan and the Heavenly Sword Marquis would actually dare to attack the Blood Clan so quickly. Where did they get their courage from?”","“It’s over now. They’ve already charged over. We should think of a way to stop them first,” The Blood Master said in a deep voice. “Don’t be anxious.” The black-robed man waved his sleeve and said in a deep voice, “Blood Master, didn’t you invite many experts who are skilled in formations to prevent the Nine-tailed Clan and the Heavenly Sword Marquis from attacking? These experts can be used now!”"]},{"number":3491,"title":"Chapter 3491 - Array Defense","paragraphs":["Chapter 3491 Array Defense","“Yes, I almost forgot. These experts who are good at array formations all have an extremely high level of research in array formations. Moreover, they came to the inner part of our Blood Clan very early and began to study our clan’s protective array formations. They already have a very good understanding of our clan’s protective array formations!” “As for the person who broke the formation invited by the Nine-tailed Clan, although he has a very high attainment in formations, he is only one person. Moreover, he is outside the formation, so he can break the formation outside. The experts I invited are constantly repairing and fighting against him inside the formation. With so many people working together with the formation spirit, I don’t believe he can break our clan’s protective formation.” A cold smile appeared on the Blood Master’s face.","He had long been on guard against the Nine-tailed Clan and Jian Wushuang.","In particular, he had learned from Da Ying that the Nine-tailed Clan had been conquered largely because the clan’s protective array had been broken by someone, that meant that the other party must have an expert in array formation.","Therefore, in order to be on the safe side, he had paid a great price to invite many experts with high attainments in array formation.","Now, these experts could be used.","Following the Blood Master’s instructions, the experts who were good at the field of formation quickly began to cooperate with the spirit of the formation to fight against Marquis Duan Yu.","As the Blood Clan already knew that the Nine-tailed Clan and Jian Wushuang had come to attack, they were also on full alert.","The entire Blood Clan could be said to be on full alert.","In the void outside the Blood Clan, Jian Wushuang and the others were also waiting quietly.","They waited for a full hour. “Something is wrong.” Axe One Master frowned and said, “Marquis Duan Yu’s attainments in the Dao of formation have long reached the peak. Even the five-elemental formation of the Nine-tailed Clan did not take him long to crack without anyone’s influence. However, the guardian formation of the Blood Clan is not as high-level or as complicated as the five-elemental formation of the Nine-tailed Clan. Yet, Marquis Duan Yu still hasn’t cracked it after an hour?”","“Yes, it’s a little strange.” Jian Wushuang nodded. However, they did not go up to him to ask about it because Marquis Duan Yu was still breaking the formation and the Blood Clan did not send any experts to disturb him.","At this moment, Marquis Duan Yu, who had been in the middle of breaking the formation, finally opened his eyes and got up to return.","“Marquis Duan Yu, how is it?” Axe One Master hurriedly asked.","“You look like you’ve run into some trouble.” Jian Wushuang also asked.","“I did run into some trouble.” Marquis Duan Yu nodded and said, “The level of this formation isn’t very high, and I’ve known about it before. As long as no one interferes with me, it’s easy to break this formation. But I didn’t expect that the Blood Clan had been prepared.”","“Prepared?” Everyone was puzzled.","“If I’m not mistaken, there should be more than a dozen or more experts who are proficient in array within the Blood Clan. These experts already have a very good understanding of the Blood Clan’s protective array. If they work together and cooperate with the spirit of this array, they will continue to tangle with me. As soon as I break a place, they will immediately repair or change that place. They will constantly obstruct me, making it impossible for me to break this array.” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“Is that so?” Everyone immediately understood.","Previously, when they saw that no one from the Blood Clan had walked out of the formation, they thought that no one could affect Marquis Duan Yu. They did not expect that the Blood Clan could actually make those experts who were good at formations...it had a great impact on Marquis Duan Yu from inside the formation.","“However, that Blood Clan leader has clearly underestimated me.” Marquis Duan Yu smiled again. “He thought that by inviting these experts who are good at arrays to obstruct me from cracking the array formation from the inside, he would be able to ensure that this array formation is complete. However, he didn’t know that the experts he invited who are good at arrays are just a bunch of useless chickens and dogs. Their understanding of arrays might be at the level of a master in the Divine Beginning Realm. However, if they were placed in the Universe Battlefield, they wouldn’t even be able to compare.”","“They don’t know how changeable the array is, nor do they know how many ways to break it. For example, the one I used to break it one by one is just one of the ways to break it. But there are more ways to break it. They have never come into contact with it, so how can they really hinder me?”","“So, Marquis Duan Yu, you already have a way to break the array?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","“Yes, I have secretly arranged many methods in the magic array during the fight with them. Now, as long as I activate these methods at the same time, the magic array will be in a temporary state of stagnation. In this short period of time, only one of you, Demon Master Chenhuo or Mr. Elder Dark Bone, can easily break this magic array,” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“Amazing!” Axe One Master could not help but exclaim.","“In that case, Chenhuo, please help Marquis Duan Yu to break the formation,” Jian Wushuang said. “Sure.” Demon Master Chenhuo nodded slightly and then walked toward the formation with Marquis Duan Yu.","“Demon Master Chenhuo, this is the place. As long as you stand here, you can attack the formation immediately if I ask you to. It doesn’t need to be very powerful. With the strength of an expert at the pinnacle of the six void realms, you can break the formation with just one attack,” Marquis Duan Yu said.","“Understood.” Demon Master Chenhuo nodded.","As for Marquis Duan Yu, he closed his eyes and began to activate the techniques he left behind in the array.","A moment later, Marquis Duan Yu’s eyes opened once again.","“At this moment, Demon Master Chenhuo, make your move!” Marquis Duan Yu shouted.","Demon Master Chenhuo did not hesitate. He raised his right hand and a majestic might condensed in it. Following that, he punched out toward the array in front of him.","The fist smashed into the light membrane of the magic formation like a meteorite. Because the magic formation was in a temporary state of stagnation, it was impossible to distribute all the power of Demon Master Chenhuo’s punch to every corner, moreover, the spot where Demon Master Chenhuo attacked was the weak point of the magic formation. Therefore, the punch instantly blew a big hole in the light membrane of the magic formation.","The appearance of the big hole immediately caused the entire formation to collapse.","The overwhelming power began to retreat frantically. In a short while, the protective formation of the Blood Clan had disappeared, and the Blood Clan had been completely exposed to Jian Wushuang and the others.","“Axe One Master, Star Saint Master, Lord Xu, and Lord Shadow Fox!” Marquis Duan Yu shouted in a low voice.","Axe One Master, Star Saint Master, Lord Xu, and Lord Shadow Fox were already prepared. They were standing in four corners of the ancestral land of the Blood Clan. After hearing Marquis Duan Yu’s shout, the four of them attacked at the same time.","Instantly, with Marquis Duan Yu as the core, a brand new array formation was formed!","This array formation was the Netherjade Five Kill Array Formation!"]},{"number":3492,"title":"Chapter 3492 - Charge Into the Blood Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3492 Charge Into the Blood Clan","In the ancestral land of the Blood Clan, the Blood Master initially thought that the experts who were skilled in arrays that he had invited had successfully stopped Marquis Duan Yu from breaking the array. He was originally extremely happy, but suddenly...the protective array of the Blood Clan was broken.","This sudden change caused the Blood Master to turn pale with fright. The entire Blood Clan became extremely nervous.","The many high-level experts of the Blood Clan all rose up with solemn expressions.","Especially when the Netherjade Five Kill formation around the Blood Clan was formed, the Blood Clan experts all felt a trace of panic in their hearts.","“What’s going on? Wasn’t the person who broke the formation already blocked? How did he break it all of a sudden? What’s going on?” The Blood Master’s expression was unsightly as he continuously roared.","“It’s too late to say this now. The formation has been broken. This is the truth. However, even if the formation is broken, the combined forces of the Nine-tailed Clan and the Heavenly Sword Marquis might not be able to do anything to you.” The mysterious black-robed man beside him said.","The Blood Master’s gaze darkened as he nodded to himself.","At this moment, Da Ying, who was originally in seclusion within the Blood Clan, was alarmed by the commotion here. He had also forcefully broken through and appeared beside the Blood Master.","“Blood Master, what’s going on?” Da Ying frowned as she looked around at the huge formation that had formed around her. That formation had brought her quite a bit of pressure.","“What else can be going on? Isn’t it just the Nine-tailed Clan and the Heavenly Sword Marquis that are charging over? Hmph, you clearly know that there are two experts at the peak of the six states of the void in our Blood Clan, yet you still dare to charge in. You really have guts.” The Blood Master snorted coldly, he then looked at Da Ying. “Da Ying, how has your strength recovered during these few days of closed-door cultivation?”","“The backlash to my soul was too severe previously. I was only in closed-door cultivation for such a short period of time, and my battle strength was unable to recover to its peak. Now, I can only display close to 70% of my battle strength.” Da Ying said. “Close to 70%? That’s about it. If you and I join hands, a mere expert at the peak of the six states of the void would not be able to take us down. If it really doesn’t work, isn’t Elder Dark Bone around?” The Blood Master glanced at the black-robed man beside him.","“Don’t worry, Blood Master. If it comes to a critical moment, I will take action,” the black-robed man said.","“That’s good.” The Blood Master nodded slightly. After the Netherjade five-kill formation was set up, Jian Wushuang and the others, who had been waiting outside, finally walked into the Blood Clan ancestor’s land and soon appeared in front of The Blood Master, Da Ying, and the others.","“Da Ying, do you think you can hide in the Blood Clan and live in peace?” Xiao’er stared at Da Ying with a cold face.","“Hmph, Da Ji, I admire you. Not only are you able to find so many powerful helpers, but you are also very good at setting up formations. If I’m not wrong, the formations you are setting up around here should be used to prevent me from escaping, right?” Da Ying said in a low voice.","“That’s right. This array is prepared to kill experts like you who have reached the peak of the six states of the Void. This array is called the Netherjade Five Kill array. It is formed by the joint efforts of five experts of the six states of the Void. Da Ying, if you have the ability, you can go and try to see if you can escape from this array.” Xiao’er said with a cold smile.","“The array formed by five experts of the six states of the void?” Da Ying’s face sank.","Actually, there was no need to try. When she was trapped in the formation and felt the power of the formation, she had guessed that it would be difficult for her to break out of the formation, even if she joined hands with the Blood Masters and Yama, it would be difficult for her to break out of the formation.","However, even if she could not break out of the formation, it did not mean that they would die.","After all, this was the ancestral land of the Blood Clan. There were many Blood Clan experts present, and there were also the Blood Master and Yama. Da Ying had some confidence.","“Da Ji, since you want to kill me, then bring out all your methods. I want to see if you really have the ability,” said Da Ying.","“Don’t worry, I won’t let you down.” Xiao’er smiled coldly.","At this moment, the Spirit Ancestor also took a step forward and stared at the Blood Master. He said in a low voice, “Blood Master, do you still remember me?”","“Oh, isn’t this the Spirit Ancestor of the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect? Why, are you also involved in today’s battle? However, what can you do with your strength?” The Blood Master stared at the Spirit Ancestor with a strange smile.","Although the Spirit Ancestor was also the ruler of the rules of the six states of the void, her combat strength was still far from the peak of the six states of the void. She was only slightly better at the aspect of the soul. The Blood Master did not take her to heart at all.","“Yes, I can’t threaten you with my strength alone, but I’m afraid you don’t know that it’s because of me that Heavenly Sword Marquis is willing to spend so much effort to kill you!” Spirit Ancestor said coldly.","“What did you say?” The Blood Master frowned immediately.","“Blood Master, Spirit Ancestor is right,” Jian Wushuang said at this moment, “The reason why I didn’t hesitate to attack the Blood Clan was because I had an agreement with Spirit Ancestor that I would help her kill you. Without this reason, who would dare to attack the Blood Clan, one of the four divine clans?”","“I see,” The Blood Master said, “I didn’t expect that Spirit Ancestor, whom I didn’t take seriously before, would bring so much trouble to the Blood Clan. Fortunately, even if you attack the Blood Clan and break the Clan Protection Array, I’m afraid it won’t be easy for you to kill me and Da Ying in the Blood Clan with your current lineup.”","“It’s true that we’re not enough. Even the Demon Master Chenhuo, who is by my side, would find it difficult to kill either of you. But do you think that’s all I’m prepared for?” Jian Wushuang chuckled.","As soon as he finished speaking, two figures walked over from the void behind him.","These two figures were Elder Dark Bone and Life Fall King","“Haha, Blood Master, right? I’ve never met you before. However, the previous three chiefs of your Blood Clan have met me many times.” Elder Dark Bone’s laughter echoed in this world.","The moment the Blood Master saw Elder Dark Bone, his pupils shrank.","“You, you are...Elder Dark Bone?” The Blood Master’s face changed drastically. “How can that be? I thought you never cared about the fights between the forces of the Divine Beginning Realm. Why are you willing to help Heavenly Sword Marquis now?”","“It’s up to me whether I want to join the fights between the forces of the Divine Beginning Realm or not. If I’m willing to help Heavenly Sword Marquis, who in the Divine Beginning Realm can do anything about it?” Elder Dark Bone sneered.","Hearing Elder Dark Bone’s reply, the Blood Master and Da Ying’s faces became extremely ugly!"]},{"number":3493,"title":"Chapter 3493 - Yama","paragraphs":["Chapter 3493 Yama","Previously, Jian Wushuang only had one demon master, Demon Master Chenhuo. Although he was also at the pinnacle of the sixth realm of the void, they were not too afraid of him.","After all, it was almost impossible for Demon Master Chenhuo to kill them alone. Even if he used a magic formation to trap them completely, he could not kill them.","However, it would be completely different if there was an old monster named Elder Dark Bone.","Elder Dark Bone was an old monster from the same era as the Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master and the Temporal Temple Master. He had lived for too long and his strength was unfathomable.","Most importantly, Elder Dark Bone’s methods were endless. He was famous for this. Even Saint Realm Masters did not dare to look down on him. One could imagine how terrifying this Elder Dark Bone was.","In the hearts of the Blood Master and Da Ying, Elder Dark Bone’s threat to them was undoubtedly incomparable to that of Demon Master Chenhuo. Even if two demon masters of the Chenhuo Realm were tied together, in their eyes, they could not compare to Elder Dark Bone.","Under such circumstances, Elder Dark Bone still had to join hands with Demon Master Chenhuo to deal with them?","“Alright, stop talking nonsense with them. Let’s just attack,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Our targets are only the Blood Master and Da Ying. However, this is the ancestor land of the Blood Clan. As one of the four great divine clans, the Blood Clan has many Principles Masters. Although these Principles Masters are not very strong, they can still cause us a lot of trouble if they join hands. So...Life Fall King, please help us,” Elder Dark Bone said with a smile.","“Sure.” Life Fall King did not refuse. With a wave of his hand, a purplish green jade pot appeared in his hand.","This purplish green jade pot did not give off any shocking true treasure aura. It looked ordinary.","However, the moment Life Fall King took out the jade pot and opened its lid, hong!","Beams of purplish green light shot out in all directions like a spider web with the jade pot as its core.","These purplish-green rays of light swept toward the many Principles Masters of the Blood Clan like a spider web.","The sudden turn of events gave these Principles Masters of the Blood Clan a fright. They immediately attacked, wanting to shatter or block this purplish-green ray of light...then...this purplish-green ray of light was incomparably tyrannical. Whenever it appeared in front of a Principles Master, it would immediately wrap around this Principles Master at a terrifying speed. However, no matter how this Principles Master struggled...he could not get rid of the light beam.","Even the Principles Masters of the five void realms among the Blood Clan who were stronger could not get rid of the purplish-green light beam. They were also wrapped up and formed one purplish-green cocoon after another.","In a short moment, all the Principles Masters of the Blood Clan were trapped in the purplish-green cocoon.","“This is...”","Jian Wushuang and the others were secretly shocked by what they saw. At the same time, they were deeply impressed by the fact that they were masters of the Divine Realm.","Even though the masters of the Divine Realm from the outside world were greatly restricted and could not show their peak strength, their skills were still impressive.","Now, they could easily restrain all the Principles Masters of the Blood Clan with just a random item. Such skills were indeed incomparable to those of the Principles Masters.","“These small characters have already been temporarily bound by me. Now, it’s up to you guys.” Life Fall King laughed.","“Demon Master Chenhuo, let’s make our move.” Elder Dark Bone glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo.","Demon Master Chenhuo nodded slightly, and then...sou! Sou!","These two ultimate experts of the six states of the void attacked at the same time.","Both of them turned into streaks of light and appeared in front of the Blood Master and Da Ying respectively.","The two of them picked one opponent each and began to kill.","The Blood Master and Da Ying naturally would not give up without a fight. The two of them immediately used all their skills to defend.","What was worth mentioning was that Demon Master Chenhuo was fighting the Blood Master, and Da Ying’s combat strength was not at its peak. He could only use 70% of his strength, and he was fighting the even more terrifying Elder Dark Bone.","Even at her peak, Da Ying would probably find it difficult to survive against Elder Dark Bone, let alone now.","Elder Dark Bone had only casually attacked, but in just two short exchanges, Da Ying felt an enormous life-and-death crisis. “This won’t do. Elder Dark Bone is too strong. Even if he casually attacked now, I wouldn’t be able to hold on. The moment he puts in a bit of effort, I might be instantly killed by him.” Da Ying was incomparably terrified, she did not dare to continue fighting with Elder Dark Bone. She immediately looked at the black-robed man who had been standing at the edge of the battlefield.","“Yama, why aren’t you attacking?” Da Ying shouted in a low voice.","“Yama?” Jian Wushuang frowned and fixed his eyes on the black-robed man.","When he had just entered the ancestor’s land of the Blood Clan and met the Blood Master, he had already noticed the black-robed man next to the Blood Master.","This was because the aura emitted by this black-robed man was very strange. Just like the previous Demon Master Chenhuo, he could not sense it at all.","The method of concealing one’s aura was so tyrannical. His strength was definitely not weak.","And now, along with Da Ying’s cry for help, a helpless voice came from under the black robe. “I originally thought that with the Blood Master and Da Ying, the two strongest experts at the peak of the six states of the void, there would be no need for me to make a move. But now, it seems that it is still not enough.”","After the black-robed man finished speaking, his body moved in a strange manner and arrived beside Da Ying. At the same time, he blocked the attack that Elder Dark Bone had casually unleashed.","Even though he blocked it, Elder Dark Bone’s casual attack was so powerful that it was frightening. The black-robed man was immediately forced back.","“Keke, as expected of Elder Dark Bone. His strength is really frightening.” The black-robed man laughed coldly.","“If my guess is correct, you should be Yama from the Sorcerer God’s Sect, right?” Elder Dark Bone looked at the black-robed man calmly. He was not the least bit surprised that the black-robed man was able to receive his attack.","“It is me. I am truly flattered to be able to say my name from Elder Dark Bone’s mouth.” The black-robed man laughed.","“Hehe, don’t be humble. In the Sorcerer God’s Sect, other than the Sorcerer God and that mysterious prophet, your status should be the highest, and your strength is only second to the two of them. Although I rarely interact with the Sorcerer God’s Sect, I have heard of you, Yama,” Elder Dark Bone said with a smile, “It’s just that I don’t know when the Sorcerer God’s Sect has become together with the Blood Clan. Today, you still want to stand up for the Blood Clan and this Da Ying?”.","“I don’t want to either. However, the Blood Clan and our Sorcerer God’s Sect did have some history before. Now that everyone is attacking the Blood Clan in such a grand manner and I happen to be present, I can’t just pretend that I didn’t see it, right?” The black-robed fella laughed."]},{"number":3494,"title":"Chapter 3494 - Fantasy Secret Skill","paragraphs":["Chapter 3494 Fantasy Secret Skill","“Now the question is, Elder Dark Bone, and everyone here, can we give up on this for the sake of the Sorcerer God’s Sect?” Pluto looked around at Jian Wushuang and the others and said calmly.","Outside the battlefield, Jian Wushuang, Xiao’er, and Spirit Ancestor’s faces darkened.","They had thought that the trip to the Blood Clan would be a success and that no major changes would occur. They had not expected that the Sorcerer God’s Sect would get involved in this matter.","The Sorcerer God’s Sect was an extremely terrifying force. Its leader, the Sorcerer God, was a ruler-level expert!","The black-robed Pluto, who appeared in front of them, seemed to have reached the peak of the six void realms based on his aura. He knew that he was standing in front of Elder Dark Bone, however, he did not show any fear. Obviously, he had the confidence to face Elder Dark Bone.","However, it was impossible for them to give up this plan!","“Sorcerer God’s Sect?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold. “The Sorcerer God’s Sect alone is not powerful enough to stop us.”","“Yes, in today’s battle, Da Ying and The Blood Master will die. Unless your Sorcerer God comes, you alone can not stop us,” Xiao’er said.","“The Sorcerer God comes personally? Haha, it has been hundreds of years, but I wonder if his injuries have all been healed?” Jian Wushuang sneered.","In the battle on the Saha Island, he had received the power of the entire Blood Wave Realm from blood wave. His strength had soared, and he had fought against the Flame Saint Master and the Sorcerer God alone. He had also used his most powerful killing move, he had severely injured the two of them.","This battle was also the battle that made Jian Wushuang famous.","Although it had been hundreds of years and the two of them had certainly recovered from their injuries, Jian Wushuang had brought up this matter to expose the scars of the Sorcerer God’s Sect.","“Is that so? That’s a pity.” Pluto sighed and said slowly, “Since you don’t want to leave, I can only try my best to stop you.”","“With just you?” Underworld Emperor looked at Pluto mockingly and then slashed out with one hand.","A cold blade light instantly slashed out.","This blade light, even if it was not used by a supreme treasure divine weapon, the instant it burst out, it still easily tore open space. The blade light carried a sharp power that seemed to be able to tear apart everything in the world, it even made the surrounding spectators jump in fear. His strength had reached Elder Dark Bone’s level, and he could destroy the world with just a raise of his hand.","Seeing the blade light attacking, the Underworld Emperor was unmoved. Under his black robe, a strange smile spread out.","Hua!","The cold blade light directly passed through the Underworld Emperor’s body, but it didn’t touch any physical body. Instead, it completely passed through the Underworld Emperor’s body.","“Oh?! Underworld Emperor raised his brows and looked at Pluto with a hint of surprise.","“Tsk, tsk. In the Divine Beginning Realm, everyone knows that Elder Dark Bone, your strength is tyrannical and your methods are amazing. Even the masters of the Saint Realm wouldn’t dare to underestimate you. I, Pluto, also know my own limits. Of course, I’m not your opponent in a head-on fight. However, as long as I don’t fight you head-on, I’m afraid that you won’t be able to do anything to me,” said Pluto with a strange smile. “I’ve clearly locked onto his god body. He didn’t Dodge when the saber light slashed at him, but this saber light didn’t touch him. It’s really strange,” muttered Underworld Emperor, then, he slashed again with his right hand.","The same saber light flew out again.","However, the moment this saber light flew out, it split into nine. There were nine saber lights, and each of them was extremely sharp. Moreover, they slashed at Pluto from nine different directions at the same time.","However, the Underworld Emperor still smiled. His body did not move at all.","In the end, the nine blade lights still did not touch anything substantial and passed through the Elder Dark Bone’s body.","This scene caused Elder Dark Bone’s expression to change slightly. The surprise in his eyes became even denser.","“Could it be that the person in front of you is not your actual body but merely an illusory body?” Underworld Emperor frowned and asked.","“Haha, Elder Dark Bone, you really have good eyesight.” Underworld Emperor laughed. Then, more and more strange black-robed figures appeared beside him.","These black-robed figures, whether it was their appearance or the aura they emitted, were exactly the same as Underworld Emperor. Whether it was with the naked eye or soul perception, one could not tell the difference between them.","However, these strange black-robed figures continued to appear, dozens, hundreds, and nearly a thousand!","In a short while, nearly a thousand black-robed figures appeared in the world. Each of them looked exactly like Pluto, and even their aura was the same.","“This...”","Jian Wushuang stood outside the battlefield and was shocked to see the thousands of black-robed figures appearing in the void in front of him.","Because in his perception, any one of these black-robed figures was extremely powerful. It was a complete scene with Yama. He could not figure out which of these black-robed figures was Yama’s real body.","“Illusion body secret skill?” Elder Dark Bone could not help laughing when he saw the scene around him. “These illusions are so interesting that even I can’t tell if they are real or fake.”","“Elder Dark Bone, I told you that I’m not your opponent in a head-on fight. However, it won’t be a problem if I keep you busy. Now that I’m standing in front of you, you can think of a way to find my real body. Or you can ignore me and continue to kill Da Ying. However, you have to get rid of me first.” Pluto smiled faintly.","“Let’s give it a try.” Elder Dark Bone casually moved his body.","His terrifying speed, which Jian Wushuang could not see clearly, suddenly burst out.","There was almost no trace left in the world. But suddenly, one of the nearly 1,000 black-robed figures struck out with lightning speed and a sharp claw attacked the void in front of him.","This claw was clearly aimed at the empty space. However, just as the claw was about to land in that empty space, Elder Dark Bone’s figure suddenly appeared.","This claw was coincidentally aimed at Elder Dark Bone, causing him to be unable to immediately wave his hand to block it. Naturally, Elder Dark Bone’s figure was also blocked.","After his figure was blocked, Elder Dark Bone’s expression finally became a little grave. “You can keep up with my speed and even stop me in time. Your method is indeed powerful.”","“Haha, it’s just a small trick. It can’t threaten you at all, Elder Dark Bone. But as I said, it’s almost impossible for you to break through my obstruction and kill Da Ying.” Yama laughed."]},{"number":3495,"title":"Chapter 3495 - Fantasy Alliance, Cang Heaven World!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3495 Fantasy Alliance, Cang Heaven World!","Yama was very confident.","Although he was not Elder Dark Bone’s opponent and did not dare to fight him directly, he was confident that Elder Dark Bone would not be able to do anything to him. Moreover, if he tried his best to stop him... Elder Dark Bone would not be able to get away from him and get the chance to kill Da Ying.","“It seems like this old man is indeed having a hard time getting past you.” Elder Dark Bone nodded, but then he laughed, “Haha, I didn’t expect that after roaming the Divine Beginning Realm for so long, I would one day be stopped by a peak level six void realm expert. Moreover, there’s nothing I can do. Underworld Emperor, you’re really capable.”","“You flatter me, but the truth is right in front of us. Elder Dark Bone, and everyone here, listen to my advice and leave,” said Underworld Emperor.","However, upon hearing this, Elder Dark Bone laughed even more happily, “Haha, interesting, this is really interesting.”","Beside the battlefield, Life Fall King, who had his hands behind his back, also smiled and said, “Elder Dark Bone, you have lost a lot of face this time.”","“I have no choice. This old man did not expect that this Underworld Emperor actually knew the illusory heaven technique of the Fantasy Alliance. Moreover, he has already cultivated this secret technique to the great success stage. All the illusory bodies and the original body have long merged into one and can change at any time. I really can’t do anything to him,” said Elder Dark Bone casually.","“Well, it’s strange that he has cultivated the illusionary heaven skill to the profound realm. It’s worthy of being one of the six secret skills of the Fantasy Alliance.” Life Fall King nodded.","Elder Dark Bone and Life Fall King were talking to each other. They seemed to be having a pleasant conversation, which confused Jian Wushuang, Xiao’er, and Spirit Ancestor.","Pluto’s face darkened. “How? How do you know the Secret Skill I used? And you know that I used the secret skill from the Fantasy Alliance?”","Elder Dark Bone and Life Fall King looked at each other and laughed even more happily.","“Haha, Pluto, it’s not your fault. Although I’ve been in the Universe Battlefield for a long time, I’ve never been to the Fantasy Alliance before, so I don’t know the secret skill of the Fantasy Alliance. However, by chance, I’ve made a good friend. He’s the one who came with me this time, Life Fall King!” Elder Dark Bone laughed, “Life Fall King, introduce yourself.”","“Sure.” Life Fall King nodded slightly and looked at Pluto, he said in a low voice, “I come from the Cang Heaven World, which is right next to the Fantasy Alliance. Besides, the Cang Heaven World and the Fantasy Alliance have always been mortal enemies!","“Since we are mortal enemies, of course I know some secret techniques of the Fantasy Alliance, and I know them very well!”","“What?” Pluto was shocked. He looked at Life Fall King in shock.","This person in front of him came from the Universe Battlefield, and just happened to come from the Fantasy Alliance’s mortal enemy, the Cang Heaven World?","“Pluto, now you know.” Elder Dark Bone continued to laugh, “I have been with Life Fall King for a long time. During our conversation, I naturally heard about the Fantasy Alliance. Of course, I also heard about the fantasy sky technique. Therefore, when you used this secret technique, Life Fall King probably recognized it at a glance. After I used two slashes consecutively, I also confirmed that it was this secret technique.”","“Humph, even if you know the origin of my secret technique, so what? You still can’t get around me to kill Da Ying.” Pluto said coldly.","“Oh, is that so?” Elder Dark Bone grinned.","“Idiot!” Life Fall King laughed disdainfully, “Our Cang Heaven World and the Fantasy Alliance are mortal enemies. Both sides have been fighting for many years, so we already know everything. The few powerful secret techniques of the Fantasy Alliance, including their weaknesses, do you think the Cang Heaven World doesn’t know?","“You can use this secret technique to deal with other people, even if you want to deal with Elder Dark Bone, but you shouldn’t have used it. You shouldn’t have used it in front of","me.","“However, it’s not your fault. The Fantasy Alliance is extremely far away from the Divine Beginning Realm. It’s because I’ve been wandering in the universe all year round that I came here and met Elder Dark Bone. Under normal circumstances, the Divine Beginning Realm, the Fantasy Alliance, or the Cang Heaven World wouldn’t have any contact with each other. Moreover, there are very few experts in the Fantasy Alliance, and most of their time is spent cultivating in the Fantasy Alliance. They rarely move around in the Universe Battlefield.","“Even if you want to move around, you have to at least reach the pinnacle of the Principles Masters, and you obviously haven’t reached that level yet!”","“That is to say, you aren’t a powerful warrior or disciple of the Fantasy Alliance at all. You just happened to get the fantasy sky technique left behind by the Fantasy Alliance and are good at cultivating this secret technique. Otherwise, if you knew that I was present, you wouldn’t have dared to say such words just now.”","Hearing these words, Pluto suddenly had a bad premonition in his heart.","That was right, he was not a powerful warrior of the Fantasy Alliance. He had never been to the Fantasy Alliance. He did not even know where the Fantasy Alliance was.","He had only learned this secret technique by chance when he was adventuring in the Universe Battlefield.","And now, he was pointed out by Life Fall King","And it was obvious that Life Fall King knew how to deal with the illusion sky technique.","“Life Fall King, although this person isn’t a disciple of the Fantasy Alliance, he has cultivated the illusion sky technique of the Fantasy Alliance after all. So, he has more or less been related to the Fantasy Alliance. Then, this matter is related to you from the Cang Heaven World. So... I’ll leave this Underworld Emperor to you. How about it?” Elder Dark Bone said with a strange smile.","“Sure.” Life Fall King did not refuse.","Before this, he did not care much about killing Da Ying or the Blood Clan leader. The reason why he came was because of Elder Dark Bone. Even if he attacked, it was just to give face to Elder Dark Bone.","But now, the person in front of him was related to the Fantasy Alliance. That was his own matter.","“Those who are related to the Fantasy Alliance must die!”","Life Fall King’s eyes were cold as he stared at Pluto. He waved his hand and a strange black pearl was thrown out.","This pearl appeared on the battlefield before it exploded.","As the pearl exploded, a strange and strange power spread in the surrounding void space.","As this power spread, the thousand figures gathered by Pluto started to dim.","“What?”","“What’s going on?”","The Underworld Emperor was shocked when he saw the scene around him.","In just a short while, the black-robed figures around him disappeared completely, leaving only his original body standing there.","The Underworld Emperor’s expression was ugly. He wanted to use the illusory heaven technique again, but he immediately found that there seemed to be some special things in the void around him that prevented him from forming an illusion.","He could not even form one illusion, let alone the thousands of illusions.","At this moment, the Life Fall King’s voice sounded, “I said that your illusion sky technique won’t work before I’m full!”"]},{"number":3496,"title":"Chapter 3496 - Sorcerer God","paragraphs":["Chapter 3496 Sorcerer God","“Scum of the Fantasy Alliance, die!”","Life Fall King’s voice was cold and murderous as he pointed out with a finger.","This finger carried a strange power. The moment he pointed out, the void in front of him shattered.","A huge and dark vortex appeared out of thin air. This vortex was vast and boundless, like a prehistoric giant beast that was crazily devouring everything around it.","Following that, from within the Vortex, a huge dark finger that seemed to extend from boundless hell charged toward the Underworld Emperor with destructive power.","The Underworld Emperor stood there and looked at the huge dark finger that extended in front of him. His expression changed greatly in fear.","“This power...the pinnacle of the six states of the void, it is at least at the pinnacle of the six states of the void. It is even stronger than the blade light of Elder Dark Bone!”","“How is this possible?”","“How can there be an existence stronger than Elder Dark Bone among the experts present today?”","Pluto growled. He frantically tried to use his illusory heaven technique, but it was useless. He wanted to dodge the giant finger, but he was horrified to find that the giant dark finger had completely locked him down, preventing him from moving at all.","He could only watch as the giant finger of darkness continued to enlarge in front of him. In the end, the giant finger of darkness was not affected at all and directly struck Pluto.","Bang!","A low rumble sounded, and the void shook.","After the giant finger of darkness displayed its full power, it slowly dissipated in the world.","At this moment, Pluto’s body had already been pushed to the ground by the giant finger. Even the ground had a huge hole. Pluto was at the bottom of the hole. He struggled to stand up slowly, however, his expression was no longer as relaxed as before. There was a miserable and pathetic look on his face.","The black robe on his body was formed from a protective treasure. However, it was in tatters now. There was still blood on his body and the corner of his mouth.","Especially the aura on his body. Compared to before, it was weakened by more than 40%!","“Too powerful. One attack has consumed more than 40% of my divine power. If I use this attack twice more, I will definitely die!” Pluto raised his head and looked at Life Fall King with fear.","Life Fall King frowned, he murmured, “The restriction of this world is too great for me. I can’t even use 10% of my strength. I can’t even kill an ant at the peak of the sixth void realm with one attack.”","Life Fall King was not satisfied with the result of his attack.","However, the surrounding people, such as Jian Wushuang and the others, had long been amazed.","“As expected of a ruler-level expert. Even an outsider, whose strength is limited by the power of the will of heaven, can not exert more than 10% of his strength. However, even with less than 10% of his strength, he can still easily crush Pluto and cause him to lose more than 40% of his divine power in one attack. I’m afraid that even Elder Dark Bone can not match his strength.” Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart.","Previously, Life Fall King said that he was too restricted and that the strength he could display in the Divine Beginning Realm was not that great, so he could not count on him for this move.","But now, it seemed that Life Fall King was too modest.","Or it could be said that previously, Life Fall King did not have anything to do with him, so he did not want to personally make a move, so he deliberately said this. But now, because it involved the Fantasy Alliance, he had to personally make a move. The strength he displayed...immediately frightened everyone.","“Life Fall King, your opponent is just a little guy at the peak of the sixth level of the void. Don’t lose face in front of so many people.” Elder Dark Bone laughed weirdly.","“Humph, do I still need you to say it?” Life Fall King’s eyes turned cold, and a suffocating pressure suddenly erupted from his body.","“Die!”","Life Fall King pointed his finger out again.","This finger crushed the time and space in the world. In an instant, a Dark Demon God that was over 30,000 feet tall appeared in the void.","This Dark Demon God had three eyes. The third eye shot out a strange purple beam of light. With a violent swing of its huge arm, a huge fist that was like a huge, boundless dark star appeared, it carried an incomparable impact force and attacked Pluto ferociously.","This dark star was even more powerful than the dark finger that Life Fall King had just used.","Clearly, Life Fall King was serious. He had pushed the power that he could use in the Divine Beginning Realm to the extreme.","The dark star formed by this punch made Pluto’s expression change drastically.","One had to know that Life Fall King’s finger had used up more than 40% of his divine power. And now, this even stronger punch was likely enough to destroy all of his remaining divine power.","“Save me!”","“Master, save me!”","Pluto knew that he could not block that punch. He would most likely die in that punch. Thus, he did not have the slightest intention to block it. Instead, he directly crushed a dark green token in his hand, moreover, he let out a series of explosive roars.","The moment that command talisman shattered, a majestic aura instantly rose up and filled the void.","When that Dark Demon God’s fist smashed over, circles of dark air currents also blocked it.","When that Dark Demon God’s fist smashed against the dark air currents, it was as though it had smashed into cotton. It did not cause too much of a commotion, but its power was completely neutralized.","“Oh?” Life Fall King frowned and raised his head to look ahead.","“Haha, Life Fall King, with your status and strength, you actually attacked one of my subordinates. Isn’t that a little too much?” Within the Dark Qi flow, a hearty laughter rang out, following that, a hazy figure slowly appeared in front of everyone.","This hazy figure was quite tall, and the aura it emitted was extremely unique. As for its appearance, no one could see it clearly.","However, even if no one could see his face clearly, they could still guess his identity.","“Sorcerer God!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold.","The Sorcerer God’s Sect had always stood together with the three Saint Realms.","Back on the Saha Island, the Sorcerer God had appeared and killed him together with the three masters of the Saint Realm, but he had been repelled by him.","Now, Jian Wushuang saw the Sorcerer God again. However, judging from his appearance, the Sorcerer God should be just a consciousness avatar, not the real body.","“Sorcerer God, are you going to stop me?” Life Fall King stared at the Sorcerer God coldly.","“No matter what, Yama is my subordinate. If you want to kill him, I can’t pretend that I didn’t see it,” the Sorcerer God said with a faint smile.","“So, you want to make an enemy of me and the Cang Heaven World?” Life Fall King said coldly."]},{"number":3497,"title":"Chapter 3497 - The Final Kill","paragraphs":["Chapter 3497 The Final Kill","“Making an enemy out of you, making an enemy out of the Cang Heaven World?” The Sorcerer God frowned.","To be honest, he was not afraid of a single Life Fall King, but if it was the entire Cang Heaven World, then it would be completely different.","The Cang Heaven World was an extremely powerful force even in the Universe Battlefield. Although it was quite far away from the Divine Beginning Realm, the influence of the Cang Heaven World could still reach here, if they really became enemies with the entire Cang Heaven World...there were quite a number of ruler-level experts in the Cang Heaven World, and there were quite a number of them who were stronger than him. Some of the top existences among them even had the qualifications to kill him directly.","Hence, the Sorcerer God was more or less afraid of the Cang Heaven World.","“Life Fall King, although we haven’t had much contact before, I still know your great name and the Cang Heaven World behind you. Your Cang Heaven World is the mortal enemy of the Fantasy Alliance, and I’m clear about this. However, this subordinate of mine isn’t a member of the Fantasy Alliance. If I say that protecting him is equivalent to offending the entire Cang Heaven World, isn’t that a little unreasonable?” The Sorcerer God said in a low voice.","“What a joke. This subordinate of yours has cultivated the illusory heaven technique of the Fantasy Alliance. How can he not be considered a member of the Fantasy Alliance? Even if he isn’t, he has a great relationship with the Fantasy Alliance. Our Cang Heaven World naturally has to be killed!” Life Fall King said coldly.","“Pluto has cultivated the illusory heaven technique, but this is just a fortuitous encounter where he obtained the cultivation method of the fantasy heaven technique. He has never had any contact with the Fantasy Alliance. You should be able to see this point. After all, if he really had any contact with the Fantasy Alliance, he would have long been brought to the Fantasy Alliance’s Lair to cultivate. Why would he stay under my command?” Sorcerer God said.","“Hmph, who knows why he would stay under your command. In any case, kill him, just in case.” Life Fall King snorted coldly.","“Life Fall King!” The Sorcerer God’s voice became gloomy, “I have already explained it over and over again. Do you still want to be so aggressive? “Alright, I will tell you now. This Yama King is my soul slave. He has long been controlled by my consciousness and is my most loyal servant. You should also know a little about my background. I have nothing to do with the Fantasy Alliance.”","“Soul slave?” Life Fall King’s expression changed, and there was a hint of surprise between his brows.","If Pluto was only a subordinate of the Sorcerer God, then Life Fall King had a reason to kill him.","But if it was the Sorcerer God’s soul slave, then Pluto’s consciousness was completely controlled by the Sorcerer God. Then it did not matter whether Pluto was related to the Fantasy Alliance or not. As long as the Sorcerer God did not have any entanglement with the Fantasy Alliance, it would be fine. As for the Sorcerer God’s background...of course, Life Fall King knew some things. Indeed, he would not have any entanglement with the Fantasy Alliance.","“Sorcerer God, you said that he was your soul slave. How do you prove this?” Life Fall King asked.","“It’s very simple. I asked him not to resist. You just need to use your soul power to check if he has my soul imprint in his body,” the Sorcerer God said, “But before you check, I have to warn you. Don’t do anything to him in the dark. After all, this slave is quite useful to me. If you dare to do something to him in the dark, then even if you are from the Cang Heaven World, I will have a way to make you pay the price. After all, this is the Divine Beginning Realm. The restrictions you have here are much greater than mine.”","“Don’t worry. If he really is your soul slave, then I won’t do anything to him.” Life Fall King nodded. Then, a wave of soul power directly covered Pluto.","Pluto did not resist. In just a moment, Life Fall King withdrew that wave of soul power.","“How is it?” Sorcerer God looked over.","“You’re right. He is indeed your soul slave. In that case, I won’t make things difficult for him for your sake,” Life Fall King said.","“That’s good.” The Sorcerer God nodded slightly.","But at this moment, Jian Wushuang spoke, “Sorcerer God, Life Fall King was generous and did not kill your soul slave. But today’s matter has nothing to do with your Sorcerer God sect. If you still want to get involved, I’m afraid you won’t be able to keep your soul slave.”","What Jian Wushuang said was the truth.","Although Life Fall King would not attack again, because Life Fall King had just broken Yama’s illusion-sky skill and the power of the pearl was still surrounding the surrounding void, in this place... Yama would not be able to use the illusion-sky skill again. As long as there was no illusion-sky skill, Elder Dark Bone could easily defeat or kill him.","As for the Sorcerer God himself, he was just a consciousness clone. His combat strength was not very strong, so he did not have much influence on the situation on the battlefield.","“Heavenly Sword Marquis...” the Sorcerer God looked at Jian Wushuang with a strange look in his eyes and then smiled. “Little guy, last time I suffered a great loss at your hands. I thought I would not be able to deal with you so quickly. I did not expect that things would be unpredictable. Now we have seen it.”","“That’s because you’re too lenient. Otherwise, there wouldn’t be so much trouble,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Maybe, but today’s matter doesn’t have much to do with us. Originally, we just wanted to be a peacemaker, but we didn’t expect to get into such a situation. Well, since we can’t be good people, we won’t get involved in this matter. Do whatever you want. Goodbye!” The Sorcerer God said, his figure disappeared.","As for Yama, because of the existence of the Netherjade Five Kill array, he could not leave directly. He simply flew to the edge of the void and closed his eyes, no longer paying attention to the matter in front of him.","When the Sorcerer God’s consciousness avatar disappeared, it was clear that Yama did not intend to attack again. This made the Blood Master and Da Ying immediately despair.","Despair!","Yes, despair!","Without other helpers, how could the two of them resist Elder Dark Bone and Demon Master Chenhuo?","Not to mention the Netherjade five-kill formation and Jian Wushuang’s existence.","They could not escape from the inescapable net and had almost no hope of survival.","“Blood Master, and Da Ying, you two should go on your way as soon as possible,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Elder Dark Bone and Demon Master Chenhuo both smiled coldly. They immediately attacked Blood Master and Da Ying.","“No, no!”","“It’s over, it’s over!”","Blood Master and Da Ying had completely lost hope. The only thing they could do now was to try their best to survive longer.","However, their efforts were clearly in vain. After all, the gap between them was too big.","Da Ying was already heavily injured and his strength was greatly reduced. Under the attack of Elder Dark Bone, he could not hold on for long before he was directly killed by Elder Dark Bone.","Then, Elder Dark Bone joined hands with the Demon Master Chenhuo and killed the Blood Master in a very short time.","From then on, both The Blood Master and Da Ying were killed!"]},{"number":3498,"title":"Chapter 3498","paragraphs":["Chapter 3498 Left","Jian Wushuang and the others were very happy that their trip had ended perfectly with the death of Da Ying and the Blood Master, despite the unexpected incident with Yama.","Especially Xiao’er and Spirit Ancestor.","For Xiao’er, Da Ying was a thorn in her heart. If she could not kill him, she would not be able to control the Nine-tailed Clan in peace.","But now that Da Ying was dead, this thorn in her heart was gone. In the future, she would naturally be able to do whatever she wanted. Only then would her long-term goal be truly accomplished.","As for the Spirit Ancestor...her killing intent toward the Blood Master was unprecedentedly strong.","The Blood Master had a grudge against her for killing her husband. For countless years, the Spirit Ancestor had dreamed of killing him, but now he had finally succeeded.","“He’s dead. He’s finally dead.”","“Haha, this bastard is finally dead. Husband, you can finally rest in peace!’","Spirit Ancestor laughed, her laughter was filled with madness, and her eyes were wet with tears.","When the people around saw this, they also secretly sighed.","Elder Dark Bone, Demon Master Chenhuo, Marquis Duan Yu, and others had also removed the Netherjade Five Kill formation and walked over.","“Everyone, thank you for your help this time. Marquis, I’m very grateful,” Jian Wushuang said solemnly.","Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master looked at each other and smiled.","They had long received orders from Star Palace Master to help Jian Wushuang with all their strength, so they would do their best.","As for Elder Dark Bone, he just smiled faintly. “Little guy, don’t be too polite. I’m not helping you for free. You have to remember that you owe me a favor this time. You have to pay me back in the future.”","“Of course. In the future, no matter what your orders are, as long as I can do it, I won’t refuse,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Don’t worry. You’ll definitely help me soon,” Elder Dark Bone said with a strange smile.","“Well, since we’re done here, I’ll leave with Life Fall King. This is my message token. I’ll use it to contact you when I ask for your help in the future.” Elder Dark Bone handed a message token to Jian Wushuang, then he left with Life Fall King.","Jian Wushuang looked at Xiao’er. “Miss Xiao’er, Da Ying is dead. There will be no more trouble in the Nine-tailed Clan. You can control the Nine-tailed Clan without any worries. Now that the Blood Master is dead, the Blood Clan will be in chaos. If you are ambitious, you can take the opportunity to attack the Blood Clan and continue to strengthen your strength.”","“Blood Clan...” Xiao’er narrowed her eyes and shook her head. “During this period of time, the demon realm has changed too much. Because of my previous actions, the Nine-tailed Clan has become the focus of attention. The various races in the demon realm, including the other two great divine clans, the ancient clan and the Dark World Clan have already been on guard against the Nine-tailed Clan. If our clan continues to attack the Blood Clan at this time, it will be very easy for us to become the target of everyone in the demon realm. It’s better not to act rashly for the time being.”","“Besides, although the Blood Master is dead, the overall strength and foundation of the Blood Clan are still there. It’s not easy for the Nine-tailed Clan to swallow the Blood Clan.”","“It’s up to you to decide. As for me, I’ve done my best to help you. Now That the troubles of the Nine-tailed Clan have been solved, I can leave,” Jian Wushuang said.","“You’re leaving in such a hurry?” Xiao’er was surprised.","“Yes, I’ve killed the Blood Master and fulfilled the agreement with the Spirit Ancestor. I’ll go back to the second heaven immediately to finish the thing that’s important to me. I’ve been waiting for that for too long, so I don’t want to delay it,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Okay, but your parents...” Xiao’er looked at him and asked.","“They’ve been in the demon realm for a long time, so they’re used to it. Besides, my second brother has just married princess ying of the Blood Marten Clan, so he hasn’t thought about leaving yet. In that case, let them stay in the demon realm for now. After a while, I’ll personally pick them up and bring them back to the endless territory,” Jian Wushuang said.","Jian Wushuang had asked Zhuo Yunfeng, Luo Xinqin, and the others when they came to the demon realm. They had been in the demon realm for thousands of years and were used to it, although they were looking forward to returning to their hometown, they were not in a hurry.","Moreover, Zhuo Peng and Princess Ying had just married, so they were not in a hurry to go back.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang had decided not to take them back to the Sorcerer God’s Realm for the time being. He would personally escort them back to the Sorcerer God’s Realm after his business was over. “Miss Xiao’er, I’ll get rid of you for the time being and continue to take care of them for a while,” Jian Wushuang said.","“Don’t worry. As long as the Nine-tailed Clan is still around, no one can touch them,” Xiao’er said.","“Thank you,” Jian Wushuang said with a smile. Then he looked at Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, and Star Saint Master and asked, “What are your plans?”","“We’ve already said that we’ll listen to your arrangements for the time being. However, our identities are a little sensitive, so it’s not suitable for us to move around in the primordial divine realm. Therefore, we’ll return to Star Palace first. If you have any instructions, you can send us a message at any time. We’ll be there immediately,” Axe One Master said.","“In that case, I’ll have to trouble the three of you,” Jian Wushuang said.","Axe One Master smiled and the three of them turned to leave.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief when he saw Axe One Master and the other two leave.","“Axe One Master, Marquis Duan Yu, Star Saint Master...these three are experts from Star Palace, which was created by Daoist Xuan Shen and has a very delicate relationship with the Seven Stars Mysterious Sect. The reason why they did their best to help me and even said that they were willing to follow my orders was because of my identity.”","“However, from their actions, I can tell that I am very important to the Seven Star Mysterious Sect and the Star Palace. However, Axe One Master just said that their identities are very sensitive and that it is not suitable for them to move around in the Divine Beginning Realm. It seems like the three great saint domains also know about the existence of the star palace and are extremely against it...however, the three great Saint Realms clearly know about the existence of the Star Palace, yet they are unable to do anything to it. This also shows that the power of the Star Palace is definitely not weak!”","The Star Palace’s strength was not weak. This point could be seen from Axe One Master and the other two.","To send out three six void realm Principles Masters at once, how many people in the Divine Beginning Realm could achieve such an ability?","“It seems that if I have the chance in the future, I will have to personally go to the star palace to take a look.”"]},{"number":3499,"title":"Chapter 3499","paragraphs":["Chapter 3499 20,000 Years","The dust had settled in the Blood Clan.","Jian Wushuang and the others had also left the Blood Clan. After greeting Zhuo Yunfeng and the others, Jian Wushuang planned to leave the demon realm and go to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","When he left, Jian Wushuang glanced at Demon Master Chenhuo and asked, “Chenhuo, are you really going to leave your disciple alone in the demon realm?”","“Of course.” Demon Master Chenhuo nodded. “I’ve taught him many things and given him many opportunities over the years. His strength has improved a lot, so it’s time for him to go on his own. After all, the level of our contact is too high for him. If he continues to follow us, he won’t get any experience on the way. It’s better for him to go on his own. It’ll be more effective.”","“That’s true, but he’s still weak. The demon realm is too chaotic, and the experts are too weak. Isn’t it too dangerous for him to travel alone?” Jian Wushuang said.","“Humph, so what if it’s dangerous? If you want to become a real expert, which one of you didn’t come through a mountain of knives and a sea of fire? I was like that in the past. Aren’t you the same?” Demon Master Chenhuo glanced at Jian Wushuang.","“You’re right.” Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile.","After explaining, Jian Wushuang, Demon Master Chenhuo, and Spirit Ancestor went directly to the Second Heaven.","When Jian Wushuang entered the Third Heaven, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao immediately sensed it. Now that he left the Third Heaven, the power of the will of the Heavenly Dao also knew about it, it was transmitted to the few masters of the Saint Realm.","In the vast chaotic void, four hazy figures gathered together.","These four people were naturally the three masters of the Saint Realm and the Sorcerer God.","“We just received the news from the power of the will of heaven. Heavenly Sword Marquis has returned to the Second Heaven,” Flame Saint Master said.","“Has he finally left?” Life and Death Saint Master asked in a low voice, “Although Heavenly Sword Marquis didn’t stay for long in the Third Heaven, he created huge waves in the demon realm within a short period of time. The Nine-tailed Clan and the Blood Clan underwent drastic changes one after another. The situation in the demon realm now is completely different from before.”","“These changes in the demon realm are nothing. I was worried that Heavenly Sword Marquis would think of ways to take revenge on the three great saint regions after he came to the Third Heaven. But now, it seems that he still has a trace of rationality and didn’t attack the three great Saint Realms,” Destruction Saint Master said.","“Hmph, that’s because he isn’t stupid. Even though the three great Saint Realms can not do anything to him, with his strength, even if he has Demon Master Chenhuo by his side, he is still far from posing a threat to the three great Saint Realms.” Flame Saint Realm said coldly.","“Just him alone and Demon Master Chenhuo are naturally not enough. But what if we add Star Palace?” Life and Death Saint Master suddenly spoke.","“Star Palace...”","The moment the two words star palace were mentioned, the entire Primal Chaos Void went silent.","After a long while... Life and Death Saint Master continued, “Star Palace, the greatest threat to us has already begun to contact Heavenly Sword Marquis. According to the information we have received, the reason why Heavenly Sword Marquis was able to create such a huge wave in the demon realm was because of the three Principles Masters of Star Palace giving their all to help. As for the three Principles Masters of Star Palace, even though we do not know their names for the time being, we can be certain that these three have already reached the sixth level of the void!”","“The six realms of the void, even our three great Saint Realms can be counted with one’s fingers. But this Star Palace casually sent out three of them. What does this mean?”","Flame Saint Realm and Destruction Saint Master’s eyes immediately turned cold.","The six realms of the void might not have many Principles Masters in the entire Divine Beginning Realm, yet the Star Palace could send out three of them at once. This made them apprehensive.","“Hmph, back then, when I found out about the existence of this Star Palace, I had a bad premonition. Unfortunately, that mysterious god is extremely cunning. He placed the base of the Star Palace in that place, making it impossible for the powers of the three great Saint Realms to reach that place. We can only try our best to suppress the growth of this Star Palace.”","“I did not expect that after so many years of suppression, the growth rate of this star palace would still be so astonishing. Until now, the power of this star palace is probably not much weaker than any of our Saint Realms. It might even be stronger!” Destruction Saint Master snorted coldly.","The Star Palace was indeed a huge threat to them.","However, this huge threat had existed for many years, but the three Saint Realms could not do anything about it.","“It’s useless to talk about this now. However, the Star Palace and Heavenly Sword Marquis aren’t able to do anything about it. There’s no need to be anxious. The three Saint Realms have already received the exact news,” Flame Saint Realm said.","“The news?” The others immediately looked over.","“What do you mean?” Destruction Saint Master asked.","“Twenty thousand years, at most twenty thousand years. The people there will arrive at the Divine Beginning Realm. At that time, both Heavenly Sword Marquis and the Star Palace will be eradicated,” Flame Saint Realm said.","“That’s great.” Destruction Saint Master’s eyes brightened.","“20,000 years, isn’t that a bit too long?” Life and Death Saint Master frowned. “That Heavenly Sword Marquis is improving at an astonishing speed. 20,000 years, he has a lot of room to grow.”","CU","“Hmph, life and death, aren’t you overestimating that Heavenly Sword Marquis too much? Even if he is a perfect-grade life-form with extraordinary talent, given his current strength, given 20,000 years, how much can he grow to?” Flame Saint Realm sneered. “It’s already very good that he can match up to a ruler like his deceased master. Don’t forget that mystic one took a very long time to reach the ruler-level.” Flame Saint Realm Snickered.","“That’s true.” Life and Death Saint Master nodded slightly.","“Alright, since that’s the case, we’ll just wait for another 20,000 years. During these 20,000 years, we’ll all be careful and try not to take the initiative to have any conflicts with Heavenly Sword Marquis, especially you, Sorcerer God.” Destruction Saint Master looked toward the Sorcerer God who had remained silent all this while. “Your Sorcerer God’s Sect has been a little restless all these years. And this time in the demon realm, I heard that your Sorcerer God’s Sect has also gotten involved.”","“It’s nothing.” The Sorcerer God laughed dryly, “It’s just that one of my subordinates, the Blood Clan, has some friendship and decided on his own accord.”","“Is that so?” Destruction Saint Master glanced coldly at the Sorcerer God.","“Of course. The three of you have already instructed US before. Naturally, our Sorcerer God’s Sect will not be blind. At this critical juncture, our relationship with Heavenly Sword Marquis has soared to the sky. However, this time in the Blood Clan’s matter, I’ve also obtained another piece of information. That is the Life Fall King from the Cang Heaven World, and Elder Dark Bone. It seems that they are also on Heavenly Sword Marquis’ side.” The Sorcerer God said."]},{"number":3500,"title":"Chapter 3500","paragraphs":["Chapter 3500 Lowest Risk","“Life Fall King? Elder Dark Bone?”","Hearing these two names, even the three Saint Realm Masters’ faces darkened.","“Life Fall King is an extremely powerful ruler from the outside world, and he also comes from the Cang Heaven World. However, he is an expert from the outside world after all, so he will be greatly suppressed by the Heavenly Dao in the Divine Beginning Realm. His strength will also be greatly weakened. To put it bluntly, even the three of us Saint Realm Masters can easily suppress him in the Divine Beginning Realm. If the three of us join hands, we can even kill him!”","“He should also know this, so he shouldn’t be so stupid as to stand on the side of Heavenly Sword Marquis,” Flame Saint Realm said.","“Yes, he is a mighty ruler who can call the wind and summon the rain in the Universe Battlefield. There is no need for him to come to the Divine Beginning Realm to take risks. As for the Cang Heaven World behind him, although it isn’t weak, it is too far away from the Divine Beginning Realm. It doesn’t have the right to meddle in the internal affairs of our Divine Beginning Realm,” Destruction Saint Master said.","“Sorcerer God, are you sure that Life Fall King is completely on Heavenly Sword Marquis’ side?” Life and Death Saint Master looked at Sorcerer God.","“Well...I can’t say for sure, because in the battle of the blood kindred, Life Fall King didn’t make a big move at first. But later, because one of my subordinates used the secret technique of the Fantasy Alliance, he decided that my subordinate had an inseparable relationship with the Fantasy Alliance, so he went all out,” Sorcerer God said.","“That’s it.” Life and Death Saint Master smiled. “The Fantasy Alliance and the Cang Heaven World are mortal enemies. If he sees someone related to the Fantasy Alliance, he will not let them go.”","“It seems like this Life Fall King doesn’t want to meddle in the internal affairs of the Divine Beginning Realm. He only acted because of your subordinate,” Destruction Saint Master said.","“Hmph, I knew it. A ruler shouldn’t be so stupid,” Flame Saint Realm snorted. “You don’t need to care about this Life Fall King, but that Elder Dark Bone is a little tricky,” Life and Death Saint Master said coldly. “When we were on Saha Island, our three great holy realms set up an inescapable net to kill Heavenly Sword Marquis. At that time, Elder Dark Bone helped Heavenly Sword Marquis get out of danger. Although at that time, he said it was just to return a favor for his disciple...but is it really worth him to offend our three great holy realms with just a favor for a disciple?”","“At that time, I felt that his actions were a little strange. This time, he appeared to help the Heavenly Sword Marquis. It seems that he is indeed on the Heavenly Sword Marquis’ side.”","“Hmph, it seems that this old thing is also restless.” Flame Saint Realm snorted coldly.","“That’s normal. He’s someone from the same era as Temporal Temple Master and Heaven-cleaving Alliance Master. He’s extremely old and has stayed in the Divine Beginning Realm for god knows how many years. Moreover, his strength has already reached the peak of the Principles Masters. With his strength reaching this level and being alone, he should have no qualms about going to the depths of the universe to explore. However, after so many years, he has been staying here. How could he not have other motives?” Destruction Saint Master narrowed his eyes.","“Now it seems that the old ghost bone has chosen to stay, it is likely to be related to the Star Palace.” “This old thing...”","The eyes of the three masters of the Saint Realm were cold, but at the same time, they were helpless.","Elder Dark Bone was famous for his tyrannical methods. Even if he was facing a true ruler-level expert in a cosmic battlefield, he could still survive. However, in the Divine Beginning Realm, just the three of them...it’s almost impossible to kill a ghoul.","Just as they could not do anything to Jian Wushuang, they could not do anything to Elder Dark Bone.","“Forget it, let them be proud for a while. After 20,000 years, when the people there arrive, they will uproot the Star Palace, the Heavenly Sword Marquis, and the Elder Dark Bone. This time, we must get rid of all the things left behind by the Seven Star Mysterious Sect. We must not leave any trouble behind!","The three masters of the Saint Realm had already made their decision, and they quickly disappeared into the chaotic void.","As for the Sorcerer God, after the three masters of the Saint Realm disappeared, he also gave a strange smile and disappeared with them.","Second Heaven, Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley.","After leaving the Third Heaven, Jian Wushuang, Demon Master Chenhuo, and Spirit Ancestor came straight here.","After they arrived, Jian Wushuang directly sent a message to the old Valley Master, Ma Yi, who led them into the hinterland of the valley.","“My young friend, I heard that you have caused a lot of trouble in the demon realm recently?” Ma Yi asked casually.","“Yes, senior, do you know about it?” Jian Wushuang glanced at Ma Yi.","“Of course, although I have long ignored the matters in the valley, once something big happens in the Divine Beginning Realm, someone will inform me immediately, especially you. Of course, I, the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley, also care about it.” Ma Yi smiled. “I heard that you went to the Blood Clan and killed the clan leader of the Blood Clan? If I’m not wrong, you went to kill the clan leader because of Spirit Ancestor, right?”","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded. “Killing the clan leader was a condition set by Spirit Ancestor. Now that the condition has been met, Spirit Ancestor will follow me to the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. Senior Hemp Yi, with Spirit Ancestor’s knowledge of the soul, you should be able to minimize the risk by stripping Shuang ‘Er’s soul, right?”","“Of course, although I have stayed in the valley all year round, I have heard of the great name of the Spirit Ancestor. In the Divine Beginning Realm, in terms of the attainments in the soul, the previous clan leader of the Nine-tailed Clan, Da Ying, and the Spirit Ancestor of the Heavenly Ancestor Daoist Sect were the two strongest. However, now that Da Ying is dead, the Spirit Ancestor has the highest attainments in the soul in the absolute beginning divine tribulation. If she were to take action personally, the risk would naturally be the lowest.” Ma Yi smiled.","In fact, Da Ying had a good relationship with the Supreme Emotion-forgetting Valley. He was also good friends with Ma Yi.","When he first decided to strip Leng Rushuang’s soul, Ma Yi wanted to ask Da Ying for help. However, because of Jian Wushuang, he had to give up. He did not expect that the world was unpredictable and that Da Ying was already dead, moreover, her death was largely caused by Jian Wushuang.","However, Da Ying’s death was closely related to Jian Wushuang. However, Ma Yi and the supreme emotion-forgetting valley would not have any prejudice or resentment toward Jian Wushuang","After all, their relationship with Da Ying was not good enough to avenge Da Ying.","“My young friend, have you prepared the hundred-million-year star-moon agarwood?” Ma Yi asked."]}]);
